window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2301,"title":"Chapter 2301: Unblockable","paragraphs":["Chapter 2301: Unblockable","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Was a Supreme Youth very precious?","It was just that!","To Chu Yunfan, Supreme Youths were nothing. There were many people who were easily killed by him on the roadside like ants, and there were also a few Supreme Youths who followed him.","To other sects, it was almost a treasure, but to Chu Yunfan, it was nothing. Although it wasn’t like weeds on the roadside, it was almost the same.","He didn’t cherish it like others did.","There was even a feeling that it was nothing more than this!","Chu Yunfan’s strength was becoming more and more unfathomable to the Sea Dragon. He was like a huge black hole that could devour everything.","Compared to the beginning, it was many times stronger.","It made him feel as if Chu Yunfan had become an invincible existence in an instant.","“He’s unstoppable. He’s simply unstoppable. At the very least, there aren’t many people on the ancient battlefield who are his match anymore!”","“Even if there are some old Domainians who can suppress him with their profound cultivation, it’s impossible to kill him. Unless some old monsters who are in seclusion come out personally, it’s impossible!” someone said.","Everyone was well aware that no matter if it was the Divine Treasures or the Domainians on the ancient battlefield, they weren’t the cream of the crop.","They might even be the losers of this level. Who among the true experts would have the time to waste on the ancient battlefield?","It was precisely because they felt that there was no hope of advancing in their original cultivation and wanted to try their luck that they came to the ancient battlefield.","The other Domainians in the ancient battlefield were mostly at the level of two to three thousand laws. They were not considered too powerful.","Truly powerful experts would not come to the ancient battlefield personally. Furthermore, once such experts arrived, they would monopolize all the resources and become the target of everyone’s hostility.","They did not need the domains left behind by these ancient experts to improve themselves, so they naturally would not do such a boring thing.","Thinking about it, even if Chu Yunfan was not invincible, no one could do anything to him.","Every step he took was a step to the heavens. When Chu Yunfan stepped into the Domain Stage, no Domainian would be his match.","“A powerful figure... Such a figure would be considered a powerful figure in the outside world. I didn’t expect that the first person among the younger generation to become a powerful figure would be Chu Yunfan!” someone said in surprise.","At the same time, some people who hated Chu Yunfan felt threatened.","“This isn’t good. If Chu Yunfan continues to grow like this, what will happen?” someone said worriedly.","“He is already far ahead of us. Unless it’s those people, I’m afraid that no one can do anything to him!”","“We must find a way to invite those old seniors to come out. Only they can kill","Chu Yunfan, even if we have to use our resources!”","Many people gritted their teeth in hatred of Chu Yunfan.","However, there was only one path to becoming a god in the end. Only one person could become a god. Once someone walked it, everyone else would be blocked.","Cutting off one’s future was naturally irreconcilable!","Chu Yunfan didn’t seem to care about everyone’s surprise, because he knew that he could no longer keep a low profile.","Although he wasn’t considered low-key, he wasn’t as well-known as everyone","After today’s battle, regardless of whether he was willing or not, he would become the first bird to stand out. The tree that stood out in the forest would be destroyed by the wind.","However, Chu Yunfan was not afraid. If he did not experience the wind and rain, how would he see the rainbow? After experiencing the baptism of the wind and rain, Chu Yunfan could grow into the strongest tree in the sky.","Chu Yunfan looked at the Sea Dragon and said, “Do you know who gave you the information? If you don’t know this, then you’re really trash!”","“You’re right...” The Sea Dragon looked at Chu Yunfan with a depressed expression. “Although I lost to you, I’m not a fool!”","The Sea Dragon was very depressed. Chu Yunfan had taken him for a fool. Although he had lost to Chu Yunfan, it did not mean that he was a fool.","How could he not investigate this kind of obvious information? Although he could not completely investigate it, as long as it existed, there would definitely be traces left behind. He still managed to find some clues.","He knew that the other party treated him as a knife, but he did not care at first. He had absolute confidence in his strength. Having cultivated 1,000 laws, he was invincible among his peers.","Even the famous Chu Yunfan was only on par with him.","Although someone wanted to use him, he did not mind being used this time. After all, it was still difficult to say who would be the one holding the knife in the end.","In the end, just as he had expected, it was hard to say who the person holding the knife was. However, what he never expected was that the person holding the knife was not him, but Chu Yunfan.","This existence that should have been prey to him had become a hunter.","It caught everyone off guard.","“It was Gongsun Hong of the Destiny Sect!” the Sea Dragon said through gritted teeth.","If Gongsun Hong hadn’t spread the news to lure him into the trap, he might still be able to roam freely on the ancient battlefield.","Now, because of Gongsun Hong, he was controlled by Chu Yunfan.","“What? It was him?”","The Sea Dragon’s voice was not soft. Many people on the ancient battlefield heard it and were instantly shocked. However, some smart people immediately reacted.","The feud between the Destiny Sect and Chu Yunfan was no longer a secret. As long as someone asked, they would know.","The Destiny Sect had long suspected that Chu Yunfan had killed the two Supreme Youths and had long been eager to deal with him.","Thinking of this, many people couldn’t help but be speechless. Any Supreme Youth could lead a sect to dominate an era. Now, two of them died in one breath. No wonder the Destiny Sect was so angry that they wanted to deal with","Chu Yunfan.","If it were them, they would not be any better.","“Gongsun Hong is also a Supreme Youth from the Destiny Sect. I’ve heard of his name for a long time, but 1 didn’t expect that he was the one who set up all of this!”","“What a big deal. Only a behemoth like the Destiny Sect can have such influence!”","The crowd discussed animatedly and turned their eyes to Chu Yunfan.","What would he do when he found out that the mastermind was a Supreme Youth of the Destiny Sect?","“So it’s him!” Chu Yunfan thought of the young man who asked him to give him face.."]},{"number":2302,"title":"Chapter 2302: The Exploding Ancient Battlefield","paragraphs":["Chapter 2302: The Exploding Ancient Battlefield","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan thought of Gongsun Hongs face and sneered. He had too many enemies, so many that he didn’t even know how many he had.","Perhaps a casual sentence could make an enemy.","However, among his many enemies, there were not many who wanted him dead so badly and had the strength and influence to do so.","Among them, the Destiny Sect was ranked first.","Therefore, when Chu Yunfan heard that the disciples of the Destiny Sect had plotted everything in secret, he wasn’t surprised. In fact, he even felt that it was only natural.","“So it’s that guy!” Chu Yunfan sneered and said,” Let’s go!’","“Where are you going?” the Sea Dragon asked in confusion.","“To kill my way into the Destiny Sect’s base and demand an explanation from them,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","“But you don’t have any evidence!” the Sea Dragon said hesitantly.","Although he was a ferocious beast from the sea, he knew how powerful and terrifying the current Destiny Sect was. They had just acknowledged a master and had to offend such a terrifying existence.","Just thinking about it made the Sea Dragon feel like fainting.","“Evidence? Is there any need for that?” Chu Yunfan said with a cold smile.","When the Destiny Sect suspected him, did they need evidence? Of course not, because the power of the Destiny Sect allowed them to act according to their guesses.","Previously, Chu Yunfan was only in the Divine Treasure Stage, so he needed to be careful. But now that he had entered the Domain Stage, his strength had undergone a tremendous change. In this ancient battlefield, even if he wasn’t invincible, he was pretty much untouchable.","Even if there were existences stronger than him, they would not be able to kill him!","This was his greatest trump card.","“What if they don’t answer us?” the Sea Dragon asked.","“Then let’s beat them until they give a satisfactory answer. I want to see how many heads they have!” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","Even if his opponent was the powerful Destiny Sect, Chu Yunfan didn’t feel dejected at all.","In any case, he had already completely fallen out with the Destiny Sect, and when he used the Disaster Star Eyes, the Destiny Sect’s suspicion of him had been confirmed.","Since that was the case, he had no scruples about turning the world upside down!","What could the Destiny Sect do to him?","Chu Yunfan realized that ever since he stepped into the Domain Stage, his state of mind had undergone a complete transformation. He did not need to worry about things that he had to be careful about before.","Those rules and regulations could not restrain him. He could do whatever he wanted.","Powerful strength was the source of all confidence.","With his strength, he could be called a giant in the outside world. Even if he established his own sect, he could pull out the scale of a first-rate sect in a very short time.","No matter where he went, he would be treated with respect!","Other than the legendary emperors who didn’t even know if they still existed, these the Domain Stage masters controlled almost everything in the world.","One had to know that the sect master of the Flying Celestials was only at the Domain Stage.","Chu Yunfan could be considered as a giant on equal footing with the sect master of the Flying Celestials.","Hearing this, the Sea Dragon staggered in fear. Even someone as arrogant as him knew how terrifying the Destiny Sect was. Normally, he wouldn’t provoke such a terrifying colossus alone. That would be courting death.","If he succeeded in his cultivation and became an Emperor like his ancestors, he might be qualified to look down on the Destiny Sect.","Otherwise, even an Emperor wouldn’t have the right to look down on the Destiny Sect, but Chu Yunfan did it.","“What is it? Is he going to attack them? He must be crazy!’","“Is the Destiny Sect’s base that easy to fight?”","“That’s crazy, but I like it. I’ll go right away and occupy a favorable position!”","“Heavens, is this a head-on battle? Chu Yunfan and the Destiny Sect?”","Many people felt that they had gone completely crazy, especially when Chu Yunfan wanted to start a war with the Destiny Sect.","If this was in the outside world, they would definitely fail this challenge. No one knew how powerful the Destiny Sect was and how terrifying they were.","Who knew how many old monsters were hidden among them, and their strength was earth- shattering.","However, if it was on the ancient battlefield, everything would be different. Although the Destiny Sect was strong in the ancient battlefield, it was only one of the many factions. It did not have the ability to cover the sky with one hand.","In other words, many people realized that Chu Yunfan really had the ability to topple the Destiny Sect.","This made them all boil with excitement.","Chu Yunfan stepped on the back of the Sea Dragon and disappeared in a flash of light.","It was as if everyone had exploded. Everyone instantly made a decision and followed him. They also stepped on the escaping light and flew toward the Destiny Sect’s base in the ancient battlefield.","This news was spread by everyone present at the fastest speed.","With the speed at which these experts spread the news, it only took a moment for everyone in the ancient battlefield to know the whole story except for those who were in seclusion.","“What? Chu Yunfan killed a Supreme Youth who cultivated 1,000 laws?”","“Chu Yunfan actually cultivated 2,000 laws? How did he cultivate them? Is he a demon?”","“What? The Domain Stage? Chu Yunfan broke through to the Domain Stage in battle? How is this possible? How can someone do that?”","Everyone was dumbfounded. Not everyone had joined in the fun. Many people only knew now that Chu Yunfan had killed two Supreme Youths who had cultivated 1,000 laws and subdued another Supreme Youth at the same time.","Furthermore, he managed to break through to the Domain Stage after battling against Domainians.","A stone stirred up a thousand ripples.","While many Supreme Youths were thinking hard and trying to achieve a breakthrough, Chu Yunfan completed the breakthrough in front of everyone and once again threw them for a loop.","Many of the top prodigies felt despair. The speed of Chu Yunfan’s improvement was too fast. It was so fast that even if they hurried, they still could not catch up.","Before they even knew how to condense 1,000 laws, Chu Yunfan had already condensed 2,000 laws and successfully advanced to the Domain Stage.","This was simply bad news for them.","At first, they didn’t believe it, but then many people had recorded it. They saw Chu Yunfan’s destructive strength, so even if they didn’t believe it, they had to believe it.."]},{"number":2303,"title":"Chapter 2303: Going up to the Doorstep","paragraphs":["Chapter 2303: Going up to the Doorstep","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","For a moment, the entire ancient battlefield was in an uproar.","Chu Yunfan’s astonishing strength and cultivation speed, which had completely left everyone behind, made everyone unable to help but look at him.","Many Supreme Youths who learned of this news had gloomy expressions because only they truly understood how big the difference between a domain constructed with 1,000 laws and a domain constructed with 2,000 laws was.","This was why these Supreme Youths would think of ways to break through to 1,000 laws after reaching the original limit of 500 laws.","This was because there was a huge difference between breaking through to the Domain Stage with 500 laws and breaking through to the Domain Stage with 1,000 laws.","However, when they thought of ways to break through their limits and catch up to Chu Yunfan, they did not expect Chu Yunfan to break through again.","It was a breakthrough that made them despair!","They almost did not dare to imagine how to break through from 1,000 laws to 2,000 laws.","Ever since they cultivated to 1,000 laws, even adding one more was something that they could not do.","Not to mention that many of them were still hovering around 800 or 900 laws, not even reaching 1,000 laws.","Chu Yunfan had already broken through the limits that they had never reached, reaching a level that they did not dare to imagine.","To these Supreme Youths, it was also a huge setback.","However, soon, everyone’s eyes focused on the Destiny Sect’s base.","One by one, powerful existences rushed to the Destiny Sect’s base from their seclusion places.","In front of a dilapidated ancient city in the Destiny Sect’s base, a streak of light flew over from the horizon. It was a figure stepping on a huge beast, and its might covered the entire city.","It was Chu Yunfan and the Sea Dragon.","“Who is it?”","Chu Yunfan had just arrived in front of the ancient city. Before he could observe the situation in the ancient city, an angry shout erupted from the city.","“Gongsun Hong! Get out here!”","Chu Yunfan’s shout shook the entire city.","On the huge ancient wall, scattered fragments kept falling, and the seal in the city was shaken.","“Who is it?”","Dozens of figures flew out of the city.","Most of them were the top geniuses of the Destiny Sect who had come to the ancient battlefield. There was even a Supreme Youth among them.","It had to be said that the foundation of the Destiny Sect was indeed terrifying.","Even though Chu Yunfan had killed two of them, there were still a few left.","Therefore, no matter how much the other forces chased after them, the","Destiny Sect was still the top of the ten great sects. It had never changed.","They had enjoyed the best resources over the years, and no one knew how much they had accumulated.","Even though this was only a small portion of their strength, it was still much more powerful than the Flying Celestials, which was one of the ten great sects.","No wonder the Destiny Sect didn’t care about the Flying Celestials when they were enraged by Jun Tianci’s ambush on Chu Yunfan.","With such a foundation, their strength was probably far above the Flying Celestials.","And that Supreme Youth was Gongsun Hong, whom Chu Yunfan had met once before.","“What do you want, Chu Yunfan?”","Gongsun Hong was stunned. He had not expected to see Chu Yunfan here.","He was even a little shocked. According to his estimation, Chu Yunfan should have been besieged to death by now. Now, not only did Chu Yunfan not die, but he also came straight to his doorstep.","He looked at the Sea Dragon beside him. Wasn’t this dragon the knife he used to deal with Chu Yunfan?","Now, not only did he not deal with Chu Yunfan, but the dragon was also on","Chu Yunfan’s side.","This was beyond his expectations.","“l came to kill!” Chu Yunfan said coldly, “What gave you the courage to plot to kill me in secret?”","Gongsun Hongs expression changed slightly. At this moment, he finally understood why Chu Yunfan had come to his doorstep aggressively.","It was because his scheme had been exposed.","“D*mned human! How dare you scheme against me! I’m going to swallow you whole! ”","Before Chu Yunfan could speak again, the Sea Dragon beside him roared.","If it weren’t for Gongsun Hong, he wouldn’t have been subdued by Chu Yunfan. What made him even more unhappy was that the other party had been playing him like a fool from the beginning to the end.","The Sea Dragon was a Supreme Youth, an existence that could suppress everything in any era. Now, he had actually become a laughable pawn, used by others.","The expressions of the many top geniuses behind Gongsun Hong also changed. They could feel the terrifying aura of the Sea Dragon.","Just like Chu Yunfan, who had cultivated more than 1,000 laws, it was enough to crush other top-notch geniuses who only had a few hundred laws.","Although the Sea Dragon was no match for Chu Yunfan and was suppressed by a single hand, it was not because he was too weak, but because Chu Yunfan was too strong.","Now, facing these ordinary and top-notch geniuses, the terrifying might of the Sea Dragon was vividly displayed.","The Sea Dragon suppressed everyone except Gongsun Hong with his strength.","Gongsun Hong snorted coldly and released his aura, breaking through the terrifying aura emitted by the Sea Dragon.","He fought back against the Sea Dragon!","At this moment, the other prodigies of the Destiny Sect realized that there was actually such a reason behind this.","However, they understood why Gongsun Hong had plotted against so many","Supreme Youths and Chu Yunfan.","Whether it was Chu Yunfan or a Supreme Youth like the Sea Dragon, they would be their future enemies.","If it was possible, one less was better than one more,","It would be best if both sides suffered heavy losses. That way, it would be the most beneficial for them!","However, Gongsun Hongs plan had failed. Not only did he fail to eliminate Chu Yunfan, but he had also allowed Chu Yunfan and the Sea Dragon to attack him together.","“Chu Yunfan, you said that I plotted against you. Do you have any evidence?” Gongsun Hongs eyes flashed with fear. If he had absolute confidence that he could resist Chu Yunfan, he wouldn’t have to scheme against Chu Yunfan behind his back.","“Do I need evidence? If I want to kill you, I’ll kill you,” Chu Yunfan said flatly.","“You want to kill me? You?” Gongsun Hong said coldly.","Chu Yunfan had arrived too quickly. Gongsun Hong hadn’t received the news yet, so he didn’t know that Chu Yunfan had already entered the Domain Stage. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have said that.","Although Gongsun Hong was afraid of Chu Yunfan, he was not terrified. After all, Chu Yunfan had cultivated 1,000 laws back then, and he needed to look up to him.","But now, he had also cultivated 1,000 laws. Both sides were on equal footing, so there was naturally nothing to be afraid of.."]},{"number":2304,"title":"Chapter 2304: Die in Peace","paragraphs":["Chapter 2304: Die in Peace","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Therefore, he was not afraid even when Chu Yunfan came to kill him.","“Even if I schemed against you, so what?” Gongsun Hong said coldly, “l thought that they would be able to kill you, but it seems that these few trash can’t kill you. However, this doesn’t matter. You will definitely die here today!’","Since Chu Yunfan had exposed him, there was no point in denying it. Gongsun Hong might as well go all out.","“You want to kill me? How confident are you?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Brothers and sisters, I’ve already sent a message to a few seniors. They’re on their way here. As long as we stall him, Chu Yunfan will definitely die today!’ Gongsun Hong said loudly.","The expressions of the Destiny Sect’s elites changed. The mana in their bodies surged out, and different phenomena appeared.","These prodigies were at least king physique possessors. Once they showed signs, they were naturally different from ordinary people.","“Very good. 1 originally only wanted to kill Gongsun Hong today. However, since all of you are here to die, I’ll send all of you to the afterlife!” Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes.","“Roar!”","Beside him, the Sea Dragon could no longer hold back, his eyes filled with hatred.","If not for this d*mned Gongsun Hong, he would not have ended up like this.","Although the Sea Dragon was obedient in front of Chu Yunfan, this was a true overlord of the sea from the immemorial era.","Endless water elements formed in the air and instantly formed a monstrous wave that swept down toward the dozens of powerful disciples of the Destiny Sect.","The disciples of the Destiny Sect were arrogant and unruly. Even when facing a Supreme Youth, they did not show any weakness. They formed a battle formation and attacked the Sea Dragon.","In just an instant, the Sea Dragon displayed the terror of a top-notch Supreme Youth.","The huge figure stepped on the waves and instantly killed the two prodigies who did not have time to dodge.","These two prodigies had painstakingly cultivated to the Divine Treasure","Stage, and they were the cream of the crop among those in the same level. However, under the assault of the Sea Dragon, they were shattered in just one move.","The Sea Dragon charged into the midst of these prodigies and top-notch prodigies like a tiger descending from a mountain or a tiger entering a flock of sheep.","“How dare you!’","Gongsun Hong was furious as he watched the Sea Dragon go on a killing spree.","There were even more prodigies in the Destiny Sect, but in front of such a top-notch Supreme Youth, numbers were nothing.","It was meaningless!","“We have to stop him!” Gongsun Hong immediately made a decision. He could not let the Sea Dragon continue to slaughter in all directions. Otherwise, these prodigies would probably suffer heavy losses very soon.","The geniuses and top-tier geniuses who followed him in this ancient city were all willing to follow him. If he lost too much, he would no longer have any footing in the Destiny Sect.","One had to know that there was more than one Supreme Youth in the Destiny Sect. They were competitors.","Just as Gongsun Hong was about to intercept the Sea Dragon, he suddenly realized that Chu Yunfan’s aura had locked onto him.","“l have to defeat Chu Yunfan first!” Gongsun Hong immediately realized that if he couldn’t defeat Chu Yunfan first, all his plans would be for naught.","For the first time, Gongsun Hong truly felt a little powerless. He had always liked to use schemes to sweep away his opponents. Now, he felt that in the face of open and aboveboard strength, his little tricks were meaningless.","“Hah!”","Gongsun Hong shouted loudly. In an instant, the world turned dark. Behind Gongsun Hong, a bright moon slowly rose.","This was Gongsun Hongs divine physique, the Extreme Yin Saint Physique.","There was once a supreme figure with this physique, the Extreme Yin Saint Physique. He rose to power in the early ancient times and was invincible. He was one of the early Emperors.","Chu Yunfan, who possessed the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, naturally recognized this Extreme Yin Saint Physique at a glance.","It was a well-known constitution among the Emperors.","At this moment, nothing else could be seen in the world. Only Gongsun Hong was like a bright moon hanging in the sky, illuminating the earth. In the next moment, Chu Yunfan saw the moon smashing down at an","astonishing speed.","That was the manifestation of the martial intent realm. In that instant, Gongsun Hong attacked.","He was fast, accurate, and ruthless. He wanted to force Chu Yunfan back with one strike!","He just wanted to stall for time. When the seniors related to the Destiny Sect arrived, they would kill Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan looked at the moon indifferently, then stretched out a finger and gently touched the moon.","Boom!","In an instant, the moon shattered and turned into a rain of light that filled the sky.","Even the night sky seemed to have been torn apart, and the ancient city reappeared.","Spurt!","Gongsun Hong spat out a mouthful of blood and retreated.","It was only one attack, but he was already severely injured. His eyes were filled with disbelief. His full-strength attack was actually broken by Chu Yunfan so easily.","How could there be such a huge difference in strength between the two sides?","This was completely different from what he had gathered.","According to the information, Chu Yunfan only had 1,000 laws. Even if there was a difference in combat strength, it could not be to this extent.","“Do you find it strange? Why are you still not my match even after cultivating 1,000 laws?” Chu Yunfan grinned. He saw the disbelief in Gongsun Hongs eyes.","“Then I’ll show you my true strength. You can die in peace now!” As Chu Yunfan spoke, a mysterious domain spread out around him. In just a moment, it had already wrapped Gongsun Hong up.","Gongsun Hong immediately experienced what Chu Yunfan felt before. It was as if he was trapped in a quagmire. It was extremely difficult for him to speak or move. Even breathing was extremely difficult.","“The Domain Stage...” Gongsun Hongs eyes widened. He finally understood why his plan had failed.","His plan could not be said to be exquisite. He had taken into account all aspects of the situation. It could not be said that he underestimated Chu Yunfan’s strength. In fact, he had overestimated it.","In the end, he even arranged for Sanjue to end Chu Yunfan.","With such an arrangement, even if Chu Yunfan had wings, it would be difficult for him to escape.","However, Chu Yunfan had come to him unscathed. He had not understood it at first, but now he understood that Chu Yunfan had already entered the Domain Stage.","It would be strange if all his previous plans had succeeded.","There was no chance of success!"]},{"number":2305,"title":"Chapter 2305: Killing Gongsun Hong","paragraphs":["Chapter 2305: Killing Gongsun Hong","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In front of an absolute Domainian, all schemes were meaningless.","This was the power of one to defeat ten!","No wonder Chu Yunfan didn’t care about them at all. He didn’t care about Gongsun Hongs plan either. Chu Yunfan was too strong.","Chu Yunfan was so strong that no matter how Gongsun Hong schemed, it was useless.","A hint of regret flashed through Gongsun Hongs eyes. However, it was not that he regretted scheming against Chu Yunfan, but that the information he received was not accurate enough and he had underestimated Chu Yunfan.","If he had known that Chu Yunfan was so terrifying, he would have returned to the Central Plains and found an even stronger expert to kill Chu Yunfan.","The more Chu Yunfan showed that he was difficult to kill, the more fearful Gongsun Hong was. It was not wrong to want to kill Chu Yunfan, but he did not have the ability to do so.","“You won’t die in vain by my hands!” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“You can’t kill me! Otherwise, the Destiny Sect won’t let you off!” the shocked Gongsun Hong roared.","Chu Yunfan looked at Gongsun Hong coldly. He was just another bully. When he plotted against him, he didn’t think about the anger of the Flying Celestials. He thought that Gongsun Hong was just relying on the powerful strength of the Destiny Sect.","If it was before, Chu Yunfan might have been a little afraid. However, now that he had stepped into the Domain Stage, his strength had undergone an earth- shattering change.","He was at the peak of the world, and even the Destiny Sect could not do anything to him!","“Now you want to admit defeat? It’s too late!”","Chu Yunfan reached out with one hand and formed a huge hand made of energy. It was a terrifying hand that looked like it could destroy the world. The runes formed by the laws on the hand flickered with a shocking light. In an instant, he grabbed Gongsun Hong in his hand.","Gongsun Hong did not even have the chance to resist. The difference between having a domain and not was just that big.","Not everyone was like Chu Yunfan, who could take on Domainians while in the Divine Treasure Stage. If it was an ordinary Domainian with only 1,000 laws, Gongsun Hong might be able to defend himself.","However, whether it was in terms of cultivation level or the divine power he cultivated, Chu Yunfan was far superior to Gongsun Hong. Gongsun Hong had no way of fighting back at all.","“You can’t kill me! You can’t kill me!”","Only now did Gongsun Hong realize that death was coming. He thought that","Chu Yunfan would be scared of was his biggest backer and trump card, but Chu Yunfan didn’t care at all.","Boom!","In the next moment, Gongsun Hong exploded and was turned into a pool of blood by Chu Yunfan. In the next moment, it was absorbed by Chu Yunfan’s Disaster Star Eyes.","A moment later, a bright moon slowly rose from the Disaster Star Eyes. This was a special ability that had evolved after fusing with Gongsun Hongs Extreme Yin Saint Physique.","The specialty of the Disaster Star Eyes was that they could continuously fuse with various special physiques to evolve their advantages.","Just by fusing with the Extreme Yin Saint Physique, Chu Yunfan felt that there were another 100 laws in his body. This was the understanding of the yin-yang great path evolved by the Extreme Yin Saint Physique.","The yin-yang great path was the fundamental law of heaven and earth. Chaos evolved into Yin and Yang, Yin and Yang evolved into the five elements, and the five elements evolved into all things. This was the law comprehension that involved the origin of the Great Path.","It was not something that cultivators at the current stage could comprehend. Only a cultivator with the Extreme Yin Saint Physique could comprehend it in advance by relying on their special physique.","This was the reason why ordinary people were powerless against those divine physique possessors. Before they could come into contact with the laws, these physique possessors could already freely use the divine arts derived from the laws.","The difference in combat strength between the two sides was like the difference between heaven and earth!","These physique possessors were the hot shots favored by the heavens and the earth. Ordinary people could not compare to them at all.","“What? Even Gongsun Hong was killed?”","Just as Chu Yunfan had killed Gongsun Hong, the experts who had followed Chu Yunfan finally arrived.","They had just arrived when they saw this shocking scene.","Everyone was shocked, but it was also within their expectations.","This was within their expectations because they all knew that Chu Yunfan had already stepped into the Domain Stage before everyone else.","What was unexpected was that no one expected Chu Yunfan to actually dare to make a move.","Unlike the Supreme Youths who were killed by Chu Yunfan, the Destiny Sect was still in the middle of the sky. Without a doubt, this was a complete fall out with the Destiny Sect.","“Is he not afraid of the Destiny Sect at all?” someone said in disbelief.","“The Destiny Sect will definitely not let this matter rest. So what if Chu Yunfan can dominate the ancient battlefield? Doesn’t he intend to return to the Central Plains?”","“If he returns to the Central Plains, only death awaits him!”","Everyone discussed animatedly, but everyone realized that the Destiny Sect would definitely not let this matter rest.","Many people even revealed a hint of joy on their faces. Previously, many people were still thinking about how to kill Chu Yunfan, but now he had courted death and completely shed all pretense of cordiality with the Destiny Sect.","They knew that the Destiny Sect would not attack Chu Yunfan secretly in the future. They would chase him openly.","“However, with Chu Yunfan’s current strength, I’m afraid the Destiny Sect might not be able to do anything to him!”","“Chu Yunfan might be strong, but the foundation of the Destiny Sect is so deep that it’s unimaginable. Even if he has entered the Domain Stage, he still has no chance of winning against the Destiny Sect! ”","Everyone had their own opinions. On the battlefield, when the disciples of the Destiny Sect saw Gongsun Hong being killed, they were instantly shocked and furious.","Chu Yunfan actually dared to make a move. He simply didn’t put the Destiny Sect in his eyes at all.","However, they could not even protect themselves at this moment. The anger in the Sea Dragon’s heart was completely vented as it continuously pounced on these prodigies and top-notch prodigies.","Although they were also in the Domain Stage, their strength was on a completely different level compared to the Sea Dragon.","Even if they joined forces to form a battle formation, they would be quickly scattered by the Sea Dragon. In just a moment, they fled in all directions. However, Chu Yunfan was watching from the side and easily stopped these people. He casually set up a barrier to block their escape path.","When these people saw that their escape route was cut off, they glared angrily and roared, launching suicidal attacks at the Sea Dragon.","The combined strength of these prodigies and top-notch prodigies was not bad, especially when they risked their lives. When the time came, they would cause some trouble for the Sea Dragon.","However, they were soon killed by the Sea Dragon again. Not long after, they were killed by the Sea Dragon one by one.","Chu Yunfan crushed their bodies into flesh and blood, and half of it entered the Disater Star Eyes. The other half was absorbed by the Brahma Tree and turned into nourishment for the Brahma Fruits.","At this point, the experts in the Destiny Sect’s base were all wiped out. They couldn’t even achieve their initial goal of stalling for time.."]},{"number":2306,"title":"Chapter 2306: Confronting a Domainian and Heavily Injuring Him","paragraphs":["Chapter 2306: Confronting a Domainian and Heavily Injuring Him","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The speed was simply too fast. It was so fast that even the experts who had come to watch the battle were a little dumbfounded.","The speed was too fast, not giving them any time to react!","Chu Yunfan easily killed Gongsun Hong with one strike. Then, the Sea Dragon went on a killing spree and killed all the other disciples of the Destiny Sect.","This kind of strength suppressed many people who had other thoughts.","Chu Yunfan’s current strength was not something they could compete with.","“You guys are courting death!”","Suddenly, an angry roar came from afar. Then, a big hand broke through the sky and grabbed in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","Chu Yunfan didn’t move or look at the hand, but every pore on his body was spewing out sword energy. The sword energy turned into a terrifying torrent and gathered above Chu Yunfan’s head, turning into a huge sword of light.","Boom!","This incomparably huge sword of light slashed down horizontally, cutting through the large hand on the spot and turning it into nothingness.","Immediately after, a figure in black arrived in front of everyone.","Everyone focused their eyes and saw that it was an old man in black. He had white hair and a youthful face.","The old man was hunched, but the terrifying power contained in his body made people shudder.","“Another Domainian has arrived!”","Many people instantly reacted. The Destiny Sect had finally produced a Domainian.","With the strength of the Destiny Sect, it was impossible for them to only have one Domainian in the ancient battlefield.","Now, another one had finally appeared.","When he saw the situation, the old man immediately realized what had happened. His face turned ashen. The Destiny Sect’s base had actually been slaughtered from top to bottom.","One could imagine that once the Destiny Sect learned of this news, they would immediately explode.","“How dare you! Even the sect master of your Flying Celestials doesn’t have the guts to kill so many prodigies of our sect!” The old man pointed at Chu Yunfan with a furious expression, wishing he could tear him into pieces.","He was a Destiny Sect grand elder and held a high position in the sect. However, his talent had reached the limit after he cultivated to the Domain Stage. He came to the ancient battlefield in order to break through.","There were such people in all sects and races. Not everyone could be like these top geniuses and Supreme Youths, who treated cultivation as simple as eating and drinking.","Even though he was once a prodigy, he was now just an old man. Time had not shown him any mercy.","For any cultivator, time was never enough.","“So what if I kill him?” Chu Yunfan said coldly, “I don’t need you to interfere in my matters!”","“Then use your life to pay for it!” the grand elder said coldly.","“If you want my life, then come and try!” Chu Yunfan didn’t say much.","Wisps of energy seeped out of the pores of the Destiny Sect grand elder, forming a terrifying storm.","This aura was clearly far stronger than those elites of the Divine Treasure Stage. Even Sanjue, who had been killed by Chu Yunfan, was slightly weaker than this Destiny Sect grand elder.","2,500 laws!","The Destiny Sect grand elder had cultivated at least 2,500 laws. Just the number of laws alone far exceeded Sanjue’s. In addition, he had learned the ultimate technique of a righteous sect like the Destiny Sect. In terms of strength, he was at least 50% stronger than Sanjue.","Many people’s hearts skipped a beat. The pressure that the Destiny Sect grand elder gave them was too great. After all, he was a grand elder of a famous sect. Even if he weren’t outstanding in the Destiny Sect, he was at least an unimaginably powerful existence in the outside world.","Such a person would be an unrivaled existence in an ordinary era. He would be high and mighty all his life and would not have to worry about being knocked down from his pedestal.","It was also because there were too many experts in this golden era, so many that it was unimaginable. There were all kinds of rare geniuses that were as numerous as the stars. That was why they could possibly be defeated.","That was why he could be knocked down from his pedestal by those geniuses, and now, there was already such a trend.","Chu Yunfan was only the first person to display such strength.","The Destiny Sect grand elder was covered in crimson light and rose like fog. His entire body emitted an extraordinary aura as he stepped on flames.","His entire body was like a burning man.","“Kill them!”","“Die!” the Destiny Sect grand elder shouted. He was like a tiger that could swallow mountains and rivers. The entire sky trembled with him. As he shouted, an incomparably huge domain was released in an instant and enveloped Chu Yunfan.","This was a must-have technique for Domainians. Whoever had a stronger domain would have the complete advantage.","Chu Yunfan remained calm. His body emitted an even more dazzling light. The brilliant golden light made him look like an ancient god cast in gold.","In an instant, it was in an uproar!","The laws on Chu Yunfan’s body surged out and met the attack. Looking from the sky, it was as if two stormy waves had collided in the air.","They devoured each other and tore everything apart!","This was a collision between two completely different Great Daos. It was direct, pure, and without any fancy tricks. Whoever’s Great Dao was stronger would immediately gain the upper hand.","Obviously, Chu Yunfan’s Great Dao was stronger. Although he was slightly inferior in terms of quantity, in terms of quality, he was much stronger.","They were not on the same level at all.","In just a moment, the domain of the Destiny Sect grand elder was torn open by Chu Yunfan’s domain. It was like a huge wound.","In the next moment, the Destiny Sect grand elder and Chu Yunfan collided in the air like two huge stars colliding.","Boom!","The sky trembled violently, and huge cracks appeared. They looked extremely ferocious, like wounds in the sky.","The two of them passed by each other, and the sound of metal filled the sky as blood sprayed down.","Although the Destiny Sect grand elder was hunched, he was invincible.","Chu Yunfan was invincible.","Everyone focused their eyes and saw that there was a ferocious wound on the abdomen of the Destiny Sect grand elder, and blood sprayed out from it.","However, Chu Yunfan was completely unharmed. Clearly, the Destiny Sect grand elder had suffered a huge loss in his clash with Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":2307,"title":"Chapter 2307: Using a Domainian as a Whetstone","paragraphs":["Chapter 2307: Using a Domainian as a Whetstone","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Chu Yunfan actually has the upper hand?” Many people were in disbelief. Under the situation where the number of laws he cultivated had the upper hand, the Destiny Sect grand elder was at a disadvantage in the first confrontation.","“No wonder he’s the number one person among the Supreme Youths. He’s too strong!”","Many people were shocked. Chu Yunfan had only made one move, but he had already displayed astonishing strength.","The Destiny Sect grand elder had a shocking wound on his abdomen that was so deep that his bones could be seen.","Chu Yunfan’s hand was holding a lightning sword energy that was shining with a dazzling light. Blood dripped down from the sword energy drop by drop.","His body carried a peerless aura!","“What’s there to be surprised about? This is just a basic operation for a Supreme Youth. For him, his level and cultivation are about the same. It would be a huge joke if he couldn’t blow up the opponent!” At this moment, a top genius sneered. In his opinion, the Destiny Sect grand elder was at most an ordinary genius. To cultivate to this extent was basically the limit.","Even if it was him, if his cultivation was about the same, he could easily defeat this Grand Elder.","A difference of one level in talent meant a huge difference in battle prowess!","Many of the top geniuses around them had normal expressions on their faces. Didn’t they see that they were all in the Divine Treasure Stage? However, those top geniuses of the Destiny Sect were all killed by the Sea Dragon?","This was the difference in aptitude that turned into a natural difference in battle prowess.","The Destiny Sect grand elder was also in disbelief. He was actually injured. With just one attack, he was severely injured by Chu Yunfan. If he continued to fight like this, the consequences would be unimaginable.","His expression was extremely ugly. He had never thought that the Supreme Youth would be so terrifying. If it wasn’t for the fact that his laws were much more than Chu Yunfan’s, it was very likely that he would be pierced and killed by Chu Yunfan in one blow.","In his era, top-notch prodigies were things that could only be seen but could not be reached. He was almost the best among his peers. There were very few people in his generation who were stronger than him, and many of them even fell on the road of cultivation.","Therefore, he did not have much feelings toward the so-called top-notch prodigies and the so-called Supreme Youth.","However, this exchange had truly made him understand why the Supreme Youths had suppressed several eras and shone above the entire river of time for so many years.","The wounds that Chu Yunfan had torn open couldn’t even heal.","Opposite him, Chu Yunfan stood in the air like an ancient god made of gold. He didn’t seem to be in a hurry to attack.","“Are you underestimating me?” The Destiny Sect grand elder immediately understood what Chu Yunfan meant. Chu Yunfan didn’t put him in his eyes at all.","Immediately, he felt embarrassed and angry, unable to contain his anger!","“Chu Yunfan, how dare you underestimate me. I’ll make you pay the price with blood today!” the Destiny Sect grand elder said loudly. He chanted an ancient scripture that made his blood boil in an instant, expelling Chu Yunfan’s sword light from his body.","The blood energy turned into mist and rose. The wound on his abdomen was healing at an astonishing speed. There was actually the light of scriptures around his body.","It was an ancient scripture that was left behind by an unknown person. It was as if someone was treating him.","However, the Destiny Sect grand elder did not stop. The aura on his body was constantly getting stronger. It was as if his strength had doubled in an instant.","Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes. He could clearly see that the Destiny Sect grand elder had used some kind of secret technique to increase his strength.","The elder’s hair withered in an instant. Although his hair was originally white, one could clearly see the luster. Hair was the first embodiment of vitality. When vitality was exuberant, his hair would be smooth and shiny.","It was obvious that the Destiny Sect grand elder had consumed too much blood essence in an instant.","Even Chu Yunfan could feel the immense pressure brought by the Destiny Sect grand elder.","“You forced me to use my secret technique. You have to pay the price!”","At this moment, the Destiny Sect grand elder moved. With a slight shake of his palm, a green bronze saber covered in moss appeared in his hand.","Boom!","The saber light instantly crushed the void. In an instant, a terrifying aura raged and the sky shook.","The experts in the distance were shocked. The secret technique that the Destiny Sect grand elder had mastered was too terrifying. His combat strength had at least doubled.","“Destiny Saber, one slash to cut destiny! Die!” the Destiny Sect grand elder roared. He held the ancient bronze saber and pounced forward. A saber light that was like a galaxy descended and enveloped Chu Yunfan, wanting to kill him instantly.","In the sky, the saber light flickered with a terrifying light that was comparable to the sun. From afar, it was as if a god was suppressing them.","Chu Yunfan truly felt the existence of the will of heaven, and this was the true mystery of the Destiny Saber. However, this was the first time Chu Yunfan had encountered an expert from the Destiny Sect who could cultivate the Destiny Saber to this extent.","Even Jun Tianci did not have such a cultivation base, let alone Gongsun Hong. He was killed instantly by Jun Tianci and did not even have the chance to use it.","As the ultimate technique of the Destiny Sect, the power of the Destiny Saber was unquestionable.","Chu Yunfan was fearless. He clenched his fist and turned it into a terrifying fist.","Boom!","This punch shattered a huge black hole in the sky.","Bam!","The astonishing attacks from both sides collided fiercely. In an instant, the world trembled as a dazzling light bloomed, turning into dense mist that scattered in all directions.","Everyone was surprised to find that the Destiny Sect grand elder, who was heavily injured by Chu Yunfan in one strike, was able to fight evenly with Chu Yunfan.","What shocked everyone even more was that Chu Yunfan had clearly cultivated even fewer laws. Under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was actually more than twice that of the Destiny Sect grand elder.","Such a leap in combat strength was comparable to a leap in life level.","Even though the Destiny Sect grand elder’s strength had undergone an earth-shattering change, he still couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan.","What a terrifying thing!","It could even be said that this was unprecedented.","“Interesting!”","Chu Yunfan laughed out loud, as if he wasn’t intimidated by the grand elder’s aura at all. On the contrary, his fighting spirit soared crazily, and he treated the grand elder as a whetstone and a target to temper himself."]},{"number":2308,"title":"Chapter 2308: Killing the Destiny Sect Grand Elder","paragraphs":["Chapter 2308: Killing the Destiny Sect Grand Elder","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was a fierce battle, more like a needle against a wheat!","The Destiny Sect grand elder wanted nothing more than to kill Chu Yunfan immediately. He erupted with all the blood in his body and every move he made was fatal. He wanted to kill Chu Yunfan at any moment.","Chu Yunfan even treated the Destiny Sect grand elder as a whetstone to help him adapt to the Domain Stage.","“Die!”","“Die!”","“Die!”","The Destiny Sect grand elder had gone crazy from killing. His entire body was bathed in blood. Yes, it was his own blood.","Soon, everyone realized that even though the Destiny Sect grand elder had already activated all of his potential and doubled his combat strength, he was weak.","When he faced Chu Yunfan, he was still no match for the latter and was still at a disadvantage.","Every time they collided, it seemed like there was no winner, but Chu Yunfan was as steady as Mount Tai and was not moved at all. However, this Destiny Sect grand elder was covered in blood every time.","Everyone could see that this was the difference in their physical cultivation.","The Destiny Sect grand elder, who had cultivated for a longer time, was inferior to Chu Yunfan in terms of physical cultivation. No, to be precise, he was far inferior.","Chu Yunfan, who could not be hurt even if he used all his strength.","This was like a person who had developed iron flesh. No matter how the other party attacked, they would not be able to hurt him.","This was what truly made people despair.","This was because they could not see any hope of defeating the other party.","“How terrifying. What level has Chu Yunfan’s physical cultivation reached? What kind of physique does he have? Why is he so terrifying?” someone said in disbelief.","This was the first time many people had seen Chu Yunfan display such a shocking physical cultivation. The reason was simple. Chu Yunfan had easily killed his previous enemies, so he could not attack at all, let alone display such a shocking physical cultivation.","It wasn’t until this Destiny Sect grand elder was used as a whetstone by Chu Yunfan that he had the ability to attack so many times.","Chu Yunfan’s astonishing physical cultivation finally gave everyone a chance to understand.","“Die! Die, die, die!” the Destiny Sect grand elder roared over and over. His entire body emitted a terrifying energy and blood that shook the entire universe. He was like a god of death that had descended into the world. He was terrifying beyond compare and there was no way to resist.","At this point in the battle, he had no chance of backing down. Only by killing the person in front of him could he leave alive.","Otherwise, he would not have been able to leave this place alive.","Opposite him, Chu Yunfan was also mobilizing his blood and energy to fight against him, constantly colliding with the ancient bronze saber in the air.","Although Chu Yunfan didn’t use magic tools, his physical strength was comparable to these magic tools.","In a short time, the two sides had exchanged at least a thousand moves. The battle had caused black cracks in the sky one after another. It was the appearance of shattering the world.","Finally, after being hit by Chu Yunfan countless times, the bronze saber could no longer bear the weight and cracks appeared. After the first crack appeared, it quickly spread out in all directions like a spider web.","In the next moment, the ancient bronze saber disintegrated in the air, turning into bronze fragments that filled the sky and scattered in all directions.","A few unlucky Divine Treasures who couldn’t dodge in time were directly hit. In an instant, they were pierced and killed.","When everyone saw this, they were shocked and quickly retreated. The battle between Domainians was too shocking.","Even if it was just the aftershock of the battle, it had such terrifying power. If they were to stand in the core area, even the aftershock of the battle would be enough to easily kill them.","Spurt!","The Destiny Sect grand elder spat out a mouthful of blood. He suffered a backlash and couldn’t believe it. “How is this possible?”","He couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan had destroyed his ancient bronze saber with his bare hands. Chu Yunfan was simply a monster.","This didn’t seem like a human’s physique. It was the physique of a monster or a ferocious sea beast.","Those were all innate. Humans did not have an advantage in this aspect!","Not to mention that Chu Yunfan could blow up a magic tool with his bare hands. He was simply a monster.","This pulled the grand elder out of his frenzied state from the battle just now, allowing him to wake up all of a sudden.","In the series of exchanges just now, he did not seem to be at a disadvantage, but in fact, his entire body was covered in wounds and cracks.","Blood soaked his entire body. From afar, he looked like a bloody man who had just crawled out of a pool of blood.","His condition was constantly being beaten down by Chu Yunfan, and the more he fought, the weaker he became. However, Chu Yunfan was different. He could actually feel that Chu Yunfan’s strength was steadily increasing.","Even though Chu Yunfan’s laws did not increase, as he continued to master Domain Stage laws and became more familiar with the Domain Stage, his combat strength continued to increase as time passed.","This was the most terrifying thing. He was constantly weakening while the enemy was constantly strengthening. It was simply despairing.","“Impossible, how are you doing this?!” the Destiny Sect grand elder roared like an injured beast.","“You think it’s impossible? That’s because you’re too inexperienced. Earlier, I was just using you as a whetstone to help me adapt to my Domain Stage strength as soon as possible. Now, I’ll let you know the true difference between us!” Chu Yunfan said loudly.","As Chu Yunfan spoke, his entire body emitted a shocking light. Then, he clenched his five fingers into a fist, and endless light was released from the gaps between his fingers. Behind Chu Yunfan, it transformed into eight dragons.","Deva, Ryu, Asura, Gandharva, Garuda, Jinnara, Mahoraga.","The eight heavenly dragons behind Chu Yunfan turned into eight gods and instantly charged at the Destiny Sect grand elder.","“What kind of fist technique is this?!”","The Destiny Sect grand elder was scared to death. He could feel that the power of this punch was unlimited. It was even higher than the Destiny Saber.","He hurriedly slashed out in an attempt to block Chu Yunfan’s punch, but it was useless. Chu Yunfan’s punch easily shattered them.","However, Chu Yunfan’s momentum did not decrease. He punched the Grand Elder.","Spurt!","The Grand Elder spat out a mouthful of blood and his entire body was sent flying. He was almost smashed into pieces in the air.","However, it was not much better. Blood spurted out from his body, and his bones and blood flew everywhere.","In the next moment, a lightning sword light descended from the sky and cut off the head of this Grand Elder.","The Destiny Sect grand elder was dead!"]},{"number":2309,"title":"Chapter 2309: The Tide of Seclusion","paragraphs":["Chapter 2309: The Tide of Seclusion","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When the Destiny Sect grand elder faced Chu Yunfan, he couldn’t withstand a single blow and was easily killed.","This scene stunned the surrounding experts who had rushed over to watch.","It was as if they had seen a ghost!","“I didn’t expect him to be this strong. Even if we construct our domains and reach the Domain Stage, the difference between us would still be as huge as the difference between heaven and earth,” an ancient prodigy muttered to himself.","They only felt that all of this was too difficult. Chu Yunfan was much stronger than them. Even if they caught up to Chu Yunfan’s level, they were probably not his match at all.","“I’m afraid the Destiny Sect will explode. They won’t let this go so easily, right?”","“However, as long as Chu Yunfan is careful, he won’t be an existence that the Destiny Sect can easily control!”","“Hahaha, there’s going to be a real dogfight. Anyway, I’m quite happy to see them bite each other!”","Each expert had their own thoughts. However, most of them were shocked, but they still felt that this was not bad. Whether it was the Destiny Sect or Chu Yunfan, they were all their enemies.","Now that the two sides were fighting, it was a good thing for them no matter who won or lost.","Chu Yunfan collected the corpse of the Destiny Sect grand elder and crushed it into a pile of flesh and blood that he poured into the Brahma Tree.","There were fruits on the Brahma Tree ripened further.","In the cultivation of the Domain Stage, the number of law insights one had was naturally the most crucial. However, the density of one’s mana was also the most crucial.","If one’s divine power was not dense enough, there was no way to construct a powerful domain.","In a situation where one’s law comprehension was about the same, the denser the mana, the stronger one’s strength would naturally be.","Chu Yunfan stayed for a while, plundering all the wealth left behind by the young geniuses of the Destiny Sect in the base. Then, he slowly left the ancient city with the Sea Dragon.","At this moment, the battle situation in the ancient city had already spread throughout the entire ancient battlefield. For a moment, the entire ancient battlefield could not help but be stunned. Everyone was completely dumbfounded and speechless.","It was because of Chu Yunfan’s audacity and his astonishing strength!","There were probably many people who had the idea of falling out with the Destiny Sect, but those who had such strength were undoubtedly rare.","There were not many of them in the current world.","And Chu Yunfan had such strength now.","The Divine Treasure Supreme Youths who had helped Gongsun Hong stop Chu Hongcai and the others fled immediately after receiving the news. They did not dare to stop Chu Yunfan’s backup any longer.","Without a doubt, they were afraid that Chu Yunfan would find them and start a massacre.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even put the Destiny Sect in his eyes. If he wanted to kill the experts of the Destiny Sect, he would do so, let alone them.","Of course, they wouldn’t be stupid enough to find trouble with Chu Yunfan.","Chu Hongcai, who had been blocked, waited for the Flying Celestial experts to find out what had happened.","“F*ck, this is too fierce!” When Huangfu Longhao heard the news, he thought that he had heard wrongly.","They wanted to support Chu Yunfan and not let him face the world alone. Who knew that Chu Yunfan could kill the strong enemies so easily?","Even Gongsun Hong, who had schemed against them, had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","“Junior Chu is indeed impressive. The Domain Stage! Even in our Flying Celestials, this is the strength that can be used to take over as the sect leader!” Huangfu Longhao said exaggeratedly.","Not to mention the other elites of the Flying Celestials. In their era, they had never heard of anyone who could be so fierce.","He killed everyone in his path.","Any schemes were meaningless in the face of true strength.","This was what they truly yearned for, to be fearless and invincible.","If they were in their respective eras, they might have been able to achieve this level. However, in this golden era where heroes rose up together, geniuses were as numerous as dogs, and Supreme Youths were everywhere, they might be able to become an overlord with their aptitude. However, it was impossible for them to dominate the world.","When the news spread, after a short silence, it immediately became noisy, and Chu Yunfan became the focus of everyone.","He was the first person in his generation to step into the Domain Stage. At the same time, he had also let many people witness how shocking and terrifying a Supreme Youth would be after stepping into the Domain Stage.","Ordinary prodigies who had stepped into the Domain Stage were no match for these Supreme Youths. Even if their cultivation level was lower and the number of laws was lower, their combat strength was even more shocking.","This made many Supreme Youths feel a sense of urgency. Those who had already cultivated 1,000 laws began to try to construct their own domain.","Those who had yet to cultivate 1,000 laws would desperately cultivate to 1,000 laws.","Even though they knew that Chu Yunfan had reached the Domain Stage with 2,000 laws, they didn’t think about it anymore.","If they were to dwell on this, they might never be able to step into the Domain Stage in their entire lives.","Cultivating to 1,000 laws had practically exhausted all of their talent and resources. It was simply impossible for them to advance any further.","They did not think about how Chu Yunfan did it. It was not something that ordinary people could do.","The most important thing right now was to reach the Domain Stage first.","Not only them, but even the elites and top-notch elites also began to try to construct their domains.","Chu Yunfan had started the era of the Domain Stage. If they didn’t reach the Domain Stage as soon as possible, they would forever lag behind others.","This was a world of great competition. It was fine if they lost to Chu Yunfan as he was a monstrous monster and could not be compared.","However, if they couldn’t compare to the others, then all their previous efforts would be wasted.","In the midst of this craze of seclusion, the battle between the remaining experts of the Destiny Sect and Chu Yunfan that many people were looking forward to didn’t happen.","Even the remaining Supreme Youths of the Destiny Sect swore that they would not let Chu Yunfan off and would make him pay the price in blood for provoking the Destiny Sect.","However, no one took any action. After all, they understood that they were only in the Divine Treasure Stage. If they wanted to target Chu Yunfan, they would be courting death. It was impossible for them to succeed.","Even if the Destiny Sect had Domainians in the ancient battlefield, as low-level Domainians, they could not do anything to Chu Yunfan.","Therefore, for a moment, the entire battlefield fell into a frenzy of seclusion because of Chu Yunfan’s breakthrough. Everyone was scrambling to break through.","No one cared about Chu Yunfan anymore."]},{"number":2310,"title":"Chapter 2310: Dao Lectures, Old Friends Come","paragraphs":["Chapter 2310: Dao Lectures, Old Friends Come","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At this moment, no one dared to bother with Chu Yunfan’s matters. After breaking through to the Domain Stage, he had killed two peak Domainians in a row. Chu Yunfan had now become the top big shot in the entire ancient battlefield.","Even if he was not the strongest, he was one of the strongest!","After leaving the base where the Destiny Sect was located, Chu Yunfan occupied an ancient city and gathered with Huangfu Longhao, Chu Hongcai, and the others.","The group quickly gathered together. Huangfu Longhao, Chu Hongcai, Tang Siyu, and the others arrived one after another. When they saw the Sea Dragon beside Chu Yunfan, they were slightly shocked.","However, they quickly accepted it. After all, Chu Yunfan had subdued a Golden Roc before, which was even more legendary than the Sea Dragon.","The Sea Dragon was one of the many ferocious beasts in the immemorial era, but the Golden Roc was different. It was one of the Ten Ferocities in the immemorial era, the king of many ferocious beasts, and a top-notch expert.","“Brother Fan, you’re really amazing! Hahahaha! I really want to see the faces of those people from the Destiny Sect! I want to see if they still dare to be so arrogant!” Chu Hongcai laughed.","“Junior Chu, you’ve really caused a big mess this time. With the personality of the Destiny Sect, they definitely won’t let it go. You have to be careful. When that time comes, I’m afraid they’ll attack you,” Huangfu Longhao said. He knew the Destiny Sect too well and knew their habits very well.","If the Destiny Sect would let this matter go so easily, then they wouldn’t be the number one sect in the world.","Not to mention the Destiny Sect, even the Flying Celestials would not let this matter go easily if they encountered such a thing.","Otherwise, everyone would think that they were easy to bully, and that the geniuses in their sect could be easily killed and had to pay the price.","This was why the entire Flying Celestials was furious after Jun Tianci ambushed and killed Chu Yunfan. Even the Flying Celestials surely would not let such a matter rest.","If they let this matter go and did not make a fuss, anyone be able to easily ambush and kill the geniuses of their Flying Celestials in the future. The consequences would be too terrifying.","“I understand, but they can’t do anything to me in the ancient battlefield!” Chu Yunfan nodded. “As for those Supreme Youths of the Destiny Sect, if they dare to come knocking on my door, I don’t mind killing them as well!”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with a sharp light. To him, those Supreme Youths of the Destiny Sect were a huge threat.","When these Supreme Youths grew up, they would at least be Kings, or even Emperors.","Chu Yunfan naturally wouldn’t underestimate these people. Even if he wasn’t afraid of them, the people around him weren’t afraid of them.","“As for leaving the ancient battlefield, the Destiny Sect might not be able to do anything to me after I leave the ancient battlefield!” Chu Yunfan knew that what he needed the most now was time.","As long as he had enough time, he would be able to grow to the point where he could resist the pressure of the Destiny Sect.","He didn’t need the Flying Celestials as his backing. As long as he was strong enough, what could the Destiny Sect do?","“I’ve already informed my master. When the time comes, she will also appear. She won’t let the Destiny Sect easily attack you!” Tang Siyu said from the side. She looked at Chu Yunfan with a bit of worry, but more of it was pride.","Chu Yunfan was her man, and what he was doing now naturally made her feel proud.","“However, Junior Chu, since you’ve already stepped into the Domain Stage, I wonder if you have any experience you can share with us?” Huangfu Longhao asked a question that many elites of the Flying Celestials were very concerned about.","Without a doubt, Chu Yunfan was the only one among them who had entered the Domain Stage. His experience was naturally very important.","“That’s the reason why I asked everyone to come here. I can share my experience with everyone so that everyone can break through to the Domain Stage in the shortest time possible. When we all break through to the Domain Stage, the Destiny Sect won’t be able to do anything to us!”","Chu Yunfan nodded. He was also willing to share his experience with everyone. This experience was far from just his own experience. Many of them also had the experience of breaking through to Alchemy Emperor.","Although Alchemy Emperors relied on medicinal pills to break through, his comprehension of the Great Dao was shocking. Otherwise, it was simply impossible to vindicate Dao and become an Emperor just by relying on the accumulation of medicinal pills.","With the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, Chu Yunfan’s understanding of various levels naturally had a unique side. There was no need to consider how to break through at all. There were ready-made examples.","“I have a premonition that something big will happen in the future!” Chu Yunfan said seriously.","Ever since he broke through to the Domain Stage, he had been having this feeling. Although it was just a premonition, he didn’t think that it was just overthinking.","For many experts, gut feeling was often very important, and it was more accurate than many calculations.","Everyone nodded in agreement when they heard Chu Yunfan’s serious tone.","Soon, Chu Yunfan began to preach in the ancient city. Many of the elites and experts of the Flying Celestials, as well as the experts of the forces that were closer to the Flying Celestials, were allowed to come and listen.","The moment this piece of news was released, many people instantly became envious and jealous. After all, that was a Domainian Supreme Youth personally preaching to them.","This kind of opportunity was hard to come by. After all, experts of this level were usually high and mighty, the rulers of the world. How could they have so much time to explain their own Dao to them?","Such an opportunity was hard to come by!","With such a powerful expert’s explanation, it would be much easier for them to break through to the Domain Stage.","However, it was obvious that envy was useless!","What Chu Yunfan didn’t expect was that a month after he started preaching, a group of old friends came.","These people were none other than the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow that he had tamed before, as well as his followers, the Dragon-Headed Crocodile, and the others.","It had been a very long time since they had parted on the Prodigy Battlefield. These people had also made great progress after leaving Chu Yunfan.","Apart from the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, which had already cultivated 900 laws, the Dragon-Headed Crocodile and the others had also cultivated 700 to 800 laws.","After cultivating the cultivation technique left behind by Chu Yunfan, they continued to refine their bloodlines and transform. The Dragon-Headed Crocodile and the other ten people had transformed into Acquired Supreme Youths.","Moreover, they all had extraordinary cultivation!","Now that they had received news of Chu Yunfan, they all rushed over to meet up with him."]},{"number":2311,"title":"Chapter 2311: Sudden Change, the Ancient Battlefield Is Sealed","paragraphs":["Chapter 2311: Sudden Change, the Ancient Battlefield Is Sealed","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan was touched. Back then, the Dragon-Headed Crocodile and the others were only pseudo-Supreme Youths. Now, they had completely tempered their bloodlines and transformed into true Supreme Youths.","Compared to those innate Supreme Youths, they were not much worse!","Especially the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, it was much more powerful than the average Supreme Youth. It was also the leader among these followers.","After asking, Chu Yunfan finally understood why these people had rushed over to meet up with him.","At this moment, the fact that Chu Yunfan was Jian Wuchen on the battlefield of the prodigies could no longer be hidden.","In fact, the Destiny Sect had already suspected this, which was why they had targeted Chu Yunfan several times. Not only did they want to kill a genius like Chu Yunfan, but they also guessed that Chu Yunfan was Jian Wuchen.","After Chu Yunfan used the Disaster Star Eyes without any restraint, there was no need to guess anymore.","Almost everyone had guessed that Chu Yunfan was Jian Wuchen, and there was no doubt that he had gotten his Disaster Star Eyes from Jun Tianci.","It couldn’t be that their physiques were the same!","Although he didn’t know how Chu Yunfan did it, the cause and effect were very obvious.","Jun Tianci had ambushed and killed Chu Yunfan, and Chu Yunfan had escaped the calamity. After his strength had increased greatly, how could he not take revenge?","The Destiny Sect naturally didn’t care that Jun Tianci was the one who took the initiative to attack Chu Yunfan. They only saw Chu Yunfan constantly going against the Destiny Sect, causing the Destiny Sect to suffer heavy losses.","The value of any one of the Supreme Youths killed by Chu Yunfan was hard to estimate.","Now that they had suffered such a huge loss, how could the entire Destiny Sect not go crazy?","Back then, Chu Yunfan had also been high-profile on the Prodigy Battlefield. He had killed many Supreme Youths and had a huge reputation among the ancient prodigies.","When the two completely different identities merged together, it immediately attracted everyone’s attention.","When this guess was confirmed in many people’s hearts, it could be said to be a stone that caused a thousand ripples.","“Chu Yunfan is Jian Wuchen? How did he do it? Could it be some divine power? He actually made it so that none of us could see through his flaws?”","“Now I understand why Jian Wuchen targeted the Destiny Sect right away. Jun Tianci ambushed him and almost killed him. How could he let it go after he came out of seclusion? If I were him, I would take revenge too!”","“How audacious! I thought that Chu Yunfan only dared to deal with the Destiny Sect after his cultivation had reached a certain level. I didn’t expect him to have been targeting the Destiny Sect for a long time!”","“What? Chu Yunfan is Jian Wuchen? We haven’t settled the score with him for killing our clan’s Supreme Youth. Now’s the time to kill him!”","The entire battlefield was in an uproar because of the fact that Chu Yunfan was actually Jian Wuchen. Many forces who had originally only been onlookers and wanted to see Chu Yunfan and the Destiny Sect suffer heavy losses had joined in.","This was because Chu Yunfan had killed many top-notch geniuses and Supreme Youths on the battlefield.","Among them, there were even ancient prodigies of the demons, the marine folks, and other behemoths. The Supreme Youths had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","However, when they wanted to find Jian Wuchen, they found that he was nowhere to be found.","No matter how they investigated, they could not find Jian Wuchen’s whereabouts. Even now, they were still investigating in secret.","Who would have thought that they would suddenly be informed that Chu Yunfan was Jian Wuchen? For a moment, new and old grudges surged up. For a moment, the entire ancient battlefield was in an uproar, and many people were shouting to kill Chu Yunfan.","Many people who had originally disliked Chu Yunfan were secretly surprised. Just as the two sides were about to erupt into a huge conflict, they suddenly realized that no matter how much they shouted, no one went to find trouble with Chu Yunfan.","It seemed that their shouts of killing were only limited to words.","This made many people disappointed, but more people understood that Chu Yunfan was in the limelight at the moment. With his strength, even if he was alone, who dared to say that he could kill him?","If they went to find trouble with Chu Yunfan before reaching the Domain Stage, they would be courting death. Even those big shots who had already reached the Domain Stage were silent.","Even though they were at the Domain Stage, they understood the difference between Chu Yunfan and an ordinary Domainian from the fates of Sanjue and the Destiny Sect grand elder.","Only the best Domainians could suppress Chu Yunfan.","However, such experts would never come to the ancient battlefield.","Those in the ancient battlefield were the weakest among Domainians.","“We have to hire some old monsters to deal with Chu Yunfan. Otherwise, it’s impossible to kill him!”","Someone thought of this.","However, many people were hesitant. After all, this would destroy the common understanding of the various factions.","The ancient battlefield did not have any stronger experts roaming about. Apart from the fact that they did not need them, the most important reason was the collective tacit understanding of the various factions.","If those top-notch experts joined the battlefield, there was no doubt that it would immediately disrupt the balance of the entire battlefield.","Even their prodigies and Supreme Youth would become the targets of those top experts.","However, in the eyes of many people, even if the balance was broken and the tacit understanding was broken, Chu Yunfan could not continue to grow.","“The ancient battlefield has been sealed!”","Just as many people were about to get restless and secretly find top experts to sneak into the ancient battlefield to deal with Chu Yunfan, they suddenly realized that the entire ancient battlefield had been sealed off.","The moment this news was released, it immediately caused an uproar in the entire ancient battlefield. Everyone was completely dumbfounded. Soon, everyone tried to contact the outside world, but they discovered that no matter what methods they used to contact the outside world, they could not contact the outside world.","Even the teleportation portals that covered the entire battlefield were completely sealed. There was no way to teleport out at all.","“There’s a conspiracy!”","Many people immediately thought of this possibility. There was no doubt that someone was planning to attack the ancient battlefield, or even everyone on the ancient battlefield.","“How audacious!” a Supreme Youth said in a furious manner.","This was no longer targeting a certain force or a certain race, but the entire world.","On this battlefield, there were countless geniuses from several powerful clans and countless factions. There was no doubt that they were targeting all of them and making enemies of the world."]},{"number":2312,"title":"Chapter 2312: One Year, Strength Gushes Out","paragraphs":["Chapter 2312: One Year, Strength Gushes Out","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Since ancient times, no one had ever had the guts to go against one of the great forces. Some people were extremely bold, but they still had the guts to do so.","For example, in the eyes of many people, Chu Yunfan was such a daring person.","However, even Chu Yunfan didn’t have the thought of making enemies with all the forces in the world. If he really dared to do so, then there was no doubt that he would be cutting himself off from the world.","Many people were keenly aware that something was wrong. The ancient battlefield had existed for countless years, and nothing like this had ever happened before.","Even if there were a large number of Divine Treasures and Domainians in the ancient battlefield, they were not enough to shake the foundation of the Central Plains.","However, it was completely different in the ancient battlefield at this moment. This was because there were a large number of ancient prodigies and Supreme Youths on the ancient battlefield.","Each of these people was the hope of a sect or a faction. If they were all destroyed here, all the factions of the Central Plains would go crazy.","Clearly, the person behind the scenes was here for this.","Otherwise, there was no other possibility for them to not know about such a shocking move.","Many people began to panic. They felt that a storm was brewing. The other party had sealed off the entire ancient battlefield, but they did not know which faction had done it.","Even these Supreme Youths and ancient geniuses began to guard against each other.","Before the final enemy appeared, everyone was a suspect.","Under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan’s limelight was instantly suppressed. No one paid attention to Chu Yunfan’s matter anymore. Everyone was concerned about who was so daring.","Many top-notch prodigies and Supreme Youths tried to fly out of the ancient battlefield, but they discovered that there was an incomparably huge barrier at the periphery of the ancient battlefield.","The barrier sealed all of them in the ancient battlefield. Many people tried to break the barrier, but it was useless.","Instantly, everyone panicked. Even Domainians were unable to break through this barrier. One could imagine how shocking this barrier was.","This wave also affected Chu Yunfan and the others who were in an ancient city.","Huangfu Longhao and the others also flew out of the ancient battlefield, wanting to break through the barrier before returning in a hurry.","“There’s no way to break it. That barrier is too strong. With our strength, there’s no way to break it!” Huangfu Longhao said gloomily, “Even with our strength, we can’t break it!”","This time, there were Domainians who were on good terms with the Flying Celestials. However, the result was the same. They were unable to break through the barrier.","At this moment, in the conference room, Chu Hongcai and the others had solemn expressions.","Other than the experts of the Flying Celestials, there were also Chu Yunfan’s followers, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, the Golden Roc, the Sea Dragon, the Dragon-Headed Crocodile, and Tang Siyu.","Chu Yunfan alone had more followers and resources than the entire Flying Celestials.","Under such circumstances, even the many experts in the Flying Celestials naturally looked to Chu Yunfan as their leader.","Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes and didn’t say anything. He had a bad premonition when he sensed that a storm was coming.","He had thought that his guess was correct, that someone had secretly returned to the Central Plains and invited a top-notch expert to deal with him.","However, he did not expect the situation to be even worse. The entire ancient battlefield was sealed by a barrier.","There was no doubt that the person who set up this barrier had an unprecedented appetite. He wanted to swallow all of them in one gulp.","“We still don’t know who’s behind the scenes. There aren’t many people in the world who have such courage and ability!” Chu Hongcai said, looking anxious.","“We’re in the open now, while the enemy is in the dark. I think we can only respond to all the changes by staying the same. We shouldn’t leave the city unless we have to. Since the enemy wants to do something, they will do it no matter what their purpose is. By then, we will know what it is!” Tang Siyu said.","Chu Yunfan nodded. “The various factions in the Central Plains will soon realize that they can no longer contact the ancient battlefield. At that time, there will be experts coming to support them. We can just wait patiently for reinforcements!”","Everyone nodded in agreement with Chu Yunfan’s judgment.","However, Chu Yunfan felt a little uneasy in his heart. Could it be that the forces that dared to do such a thing had not thought it through?","What was the purpose behind this? He definitely wouldn’t let it go!","“No matter what, we must remain unchanged to deal with all changes. The most important thing is to increase our strength. If all of you can enter the Domain Stage, then no matter what changes there are in the future, we will be able to deal with them easily!” Chu Yunfan said.","Everyone nodded. There was nothing else they could do.","The other forces also adopted similar methods to the Flying Celestials at about the same time.","Since there was no way to break this barrier, there was no point in trying.","They might as well take advantage of this time to cultivate and break through to the Domain Stage.","Once they could break through to the Domain Stage, they would be able to face any situation with ease.","For a moment, the entire ancient battlefield fell silent. There was no longer any shouting and killing. Everyone was waiting for the moment when the person behind the scenes made a move.","In this nervous wait, another year passed in the blink of an eye.","Contrary to what many people thought, the person behind the scenes who had sealed off the entire ancient battlefield was not in a hurry to make a move. For an entire year, as everyone waited, they did not see the person behind the scenes appear.","No one knew who had set up such a formation.","However, in this one year, everyone’s strength had made astonishing progress in seclusion.","Just two months after the barrier sealed the battlefield, a Supreme Youth had constructed his domain and stepped into the Domain Stage.","With this as an opportunity, many Supreme Youths and top geniuses broke through one after another as if they had made an agreement. They constructed their own domains and stepped into the Domain Stage.","For a time, the entire ancient battlefield could sense the aura of someone breaking through from time to time.","The strength of the ancient prodigies and Supreme Youths had undergone an earth-shattering change!"]},{"number":2313,"title":"Chapter 2313: Dao Lectures, Soaring Strength","paragraphs":["Chapter 2313: Dao Lectures, Soaring Strength","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In just a short year, the strength of all the elites had undergone earth-shattering changes. They had all entered the Domain Stage.","The Domainians who were leading the battle retreated to the back lines.","An ordinary person would at most need 1,000 laws to construct a domain and enter the Domain Stage.","However, these ancient prodigies were extraordinary. Even ordinary top prodigies could cultivate 2,000 laws very quickly after stepping into the Domain Stage. A Supreme Youth was even more terrifying. They had 2,000 laws the moment they stepped into the Domain Stage. In a short time, they could break through to 3,000 or even 4,000 laws.","To them, the problem of having a domain was solved. Once this problem was solved, they would be able to continuously break through in a very short time.","To these ancient geniuses, this was not a problem. Even if their aptitudes were different, they were essentially extraordinary. To ordinary people, this was the limit, but to them, it was nothing.","It was as easy as eating and drinking.","Their potential was simply shocking, especially for top geniuses. The Domain Stage wasn’t their limit. Only when they reached the King Stage would their potential be exhausted.","How far they could go after that would depend on their fate.","As for the Supreme Youths, they were even more shocking. The King Stage wasn’t the limit. They even had the chance to become an existence at the Emperor Stage.","These people had just broken through, and they had already replaced the Domainians who were originally roaming the ancient battlefield. Those Domainians could only retreat and avoid them. They were no match for them at all.","Those with similar strength would be easily beaten up by these prodigies, and they would have no chance of winning against the Supreme Youths.","Not to mention those ordinary Divine Treasures, who had basically submitted to these ancient prodigies and became their slaves. Otherwise, they would be killed.","Their dignity and pride were all shattered.","In front of these ancient prodigies and geniuses, there was no chance of winning at all.","It was said that the best among them, among the Supreme Youths, had already cultivated 3,000 laws, and they were incomparably powerful.","In an ancient city, Chu Yunfan sat cross-legged on podium. In front of the podium, a group of people sat upright and listened to his lecture.","Just like the scenes in ancient myths and legends, with Chu Yunfan’s cultivation, he could naturally be the teacher of everyone.","In a short span of a little over a year, everyone had listened to Chu Yunfan’s lecture more than ten times. Basically, Chu Yunfan would hold a lecture for three days a month to answer their questions.","In the beginning, the people of the Flying Celestials didn’t take this matter to heart. After all, although Chu Yunfan was one step ahead of them, it was only one step. In their opinion, what could Chu Yunfan say?","After all, the Flying Celestials was a behemoth of the top ten sects. There were countless books in the sect regarding how to break through to the Domain Stage and how to cultivate in the Domain Stage.","They did not lack these techniques!","In reality, there was no shortage of prodigies on the entire Prodigy Battlefield. They just lacked time and wanted to break through to a higher limit before constructing a domain and breaking through to the Domain Stage.","Under such circumstances, they did not take Chu Yunfan seriously.","They all seized the time to cultivate on their own and did not listen to Chu Yunfan’s lecture.","However, after the first lecture, those who listened to Chu Yunfan’s lecture all had great gains. Their strength had increased greatly, just like the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow condensing 1,000 laws from 900.","Originally, he needed to fumble around for some time on his own. However, with Chu Yunfan’s guidance, he easily cultivated 1,000 laws.","After all, this was an inheritance that even his bloodline inheritance did not have.","The dharmic formulations passed down in the bloodline inheritance could only allow the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow to cultivate 500 laws. At this point, he had no guiding significance at all.","Every step he took was to create a brand new history.","Everyone else’s strength had also improved greatly. The Dragon-Headed Crocodile and the others had cultivated 800 laws.","As for the others, Chu Hongcai had successfully cultivated 1,000 laws. The Golden Roc had also cultivated 1,000 laws and was constructing a domain.","And the Sea Dragon was almost about to form his own domain!","However, they did not improve the most. The one who improved the most was Tang Siyu. She had already cultivated 1,000 laws. With Chu Yunfan’s guidance, she had constructed her domain not long after her first lecture and stepped into the Domain Stage in one go.","She became one of the first Supreme Youths to step into the Domain Stage other than Chu Yunfan.","After the Flying Celestials learned of their cultivation results, they immediately forgot the fact that they were still Chu Yunfan’s seniors. When Chu Yunfan gave his second lecture, they all came to listen. As expected, they had a huge harvest.","Especially Huangfu Longhao, the veteran Supreme Youth, who brokethrough to the Domain Stage on the spot.","Chu Hongcai, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, the Golden Roc, the Sea Dragon, and the others all broke through at the same time.","Basically, among the Supreme Youths, they were all relatively early, and being one step earlier often represented a great advantage.","As for the Dragon-Headed Crocodile and the others, they had condensed 1,000 laws after listening to Chu Yunfan’s lecture three times. After listening for the fifth time, they stepped into the Domain Stage and become Supreme Youths in the Domain Stage.","As for the other members of the Flying Celestials, they also broke through to the Domain Stage on the sixth or seventh lecture. Of course, there was still a huge gap between them and the Supreme Youths.","They were not on the same level.","Everyone thought that Chu Yunfan wouldn’t be able to teach them after breaking through to the Domain Stage. After all, Chu Yunfan was only at the Domain Stage, so what right did he have to lecture to them?","Who would have thought that even at the Domain Stage, Chu Yunfan could still teach them?","This was very scary.","No matter what problems they encountered in their cultivation, Chu Yunfan could easily point them out and give them solutions.","It could be said that they could all feel that Chu Yunfan’s cultivation base aside, his comprehension of the Great Dao had reached a shocking level.","The Domain Stage wasn’t his limit. It was like he had already reached the King Stage. All the problems they encountered were child’s play to Chu Yunfan.","All kinds of methods and angles to solve problems could be said to be incredible. Many of them were very simple but very useful."]},{"number":2314,"title":"Chapter 2314: Invincible","paragraphs":["Chapter 2314: Invincible","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone knew what this meant. This meant that Chu Yunfan’s understanding of the Great Dao was at least at the Domain Stage.","Stripping away all the gorgeous outer shell, what was left was the true insight.","Chu Yunfan seemed to have reached the point of returning to the original. Even if everyone’s cultivation method was different, Chu Yunfan could still find a way to solve the problems in their cultivation.","This made them speculate about Chu Yunfan’s strength. No wonder his cultivation was like eating and drinking water.","From being completely behind them, to now, he had completely surpassed everyone.","It wasn’t just what many people thought—that he was just lucky.","On the contrary, Chu Yunfan’s understanding of the Great Dao was shocking. It was not something they could compare to.","They did not know how rare this opportunity was for them.","In addition to possessing the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, Chu Yunfan also had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor. It was equivalent to having an Emperor standing at the top of the Great Dao, giving him guidance on cultivation from a strategic position.","What a shocking fortuitous encounter.","In the ancient times, even the personal disciples of the emperors rarely had such an opportunity.","Only Chu Yunfan could give them such a luxurious opportunity.","Their cultivation was already shocking in the current world, but in the eyes of the Emperors, they were still very young.","Even though Alchemy Emperors weren’t famous for their combat skills, their cultivation were much stronger than theirs. Chu Yunfan could find the problems with just a glance and give his answers based on the Alchemy Emperor’s memories.","Chu Yunfan was happy to do so, because for him, this was also an opportunity to rapidly improve himself.","He didn’t completely merge the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, because once it was merged, the vast amount of information in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories would take over him. At that time, after the merger was completed, it would be hard to say whether that person was him or the Alchemy Emperor.","It was as if he had been possessed. Be it emotions or memories, they would be completely overwhelmed by the Alchemy Emperor’s memories.","It was equivalent to the Alchemy Emperor being reborn in another way.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan would never do that. To him, the many memories of the Alchemy Emperor were like a database in a computer. He could pull them out when he needed them, but he would never integrate all the memories of the Alchemy Emperor.","And although he could understand the information, it was ultimately separated by a layer. It wasn’t his, but the Alchemy Emperor’s.","Unless he chose to completely fuse with it, he would be lacking.","Furthermore, those memories were all Alchemy Emperor’s comprehensions and not his own comprehensions. They were all different after all.","Therefore, he liked to use the method of teaching. It seemed like he was helping everyone solve their problems, but at the same time, he was also continuously comprehending the Alchemy Emperor’s memories.","Transforming the Alchemy Emperor’s comprehension into his own comprehension.","This was the true reason why he was willing to teach. When he taught, everyone gained a lot, but he was the one who had truly gained the most.","It could be said that everyone’s gains combined were not as much as his.","Under his careful guidance, everyone’s strength was growing at an astonishing speed.","Especially Tang Siyu. She was one of the earliest Supreme Youths to break through to the Domain Stage. Now, she was even more impressive. In just a year, she had broken through to the level of 5,000 laws. Her strength was enough to suppress the entire ancient battlefield. It was difficult to find a match for her.","Even the original experts in the ancient battlefield were no match for her. Such strength was considered tyrannical even among Domainians.","Of course, Chu Yunfan had also secretly given her special treatment. After all, she was his woman. It was easy for Chu Yunfan to give her some extra pointers.","As for Huangfu Longhao, Chu Hongcai, the Sea Dragon, the Golden Roc, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, and the others, their strength had also undergone a tremendous change. After breaking through to the Domain Stage, they had already accumulated 4,000 laws in a very short period.","The remaining Dragon-Headed Crocodile and the others also had a cultivation base of more than 3,000 laws. The ones at the bottom were naturally the top-notch geniuses of the Flying Celestials. Up until now, they only had a cultivation base of in between 2,000 laws and 3,000 laws.","Other than that, there were also some experts who were on good terms with the Flying Celestials who later received the news from some unknown source. They all came over to hear about it, although they did not receive as many benefits as these people.","However, they also gained quite a lot. Many people broke through on the spot and were extremely excited.","After all, they had cultivated for many years and their foundations were far deeper than others. They only lacked some techniques and guidance from others.","With Chu Yunfan’s guidance, they all made huge breakthroughs in a short time.","He was naturally grateful to Chu Yunfan!","However, when everyone achieved a huge breakthrough, they were very curious about how far Chu Yunfan, who could guide everyone’s cultivation, had gotten.","However, no one knew that Chu Yunfan had only acted once in the past year.","Some of the top prodigies and Supreme Youths had broken through to the Domain Stage, and their cultivation had reached 2,000 or even 3,000 laws. They thought that they could stand on equal footing with Chu Yunfan or even kill him.","They went up to his doorstep, wanting to force out Chu Yunfan’s secret.","After all, many people were now certain that Chu Yunfan must have a shocking secret that allowed him to easily stand above everyone else.","Even the Supreme Youths were no match for him. If they could find out his secrets, their battle prowess would naturally soar together.","There were too many people with such thoughts. They even banded together and attacked the Flying Celestials’ ancient city.","It was at that time that Chu Yunfan’s attack shocked everyone. These top-notch geniuses and Supreme Youths were smashed into pieces by a huge palm that fell from the sky, turning into a bloody rain that filled the sky.","With just one move, he killed everyone!","For a moment, it stunned everyone!","The entire ancient battlefield was in an uproar once again.","Chu Yunfan did not make a move, but once he made a move, he once again displayed his invincible might. Even though everyone had already entered the Domain Stage, there was no doubt that there was still a huge gap compared to Chu Yunfan.","Even now, no one knew how far Chu Yunfan had cultivated.","Some people said that he had already cultivated to 5,000 laws, while others said that he had already cultivated to the extent of 6,000 laws.","There were many different opinions, but no one had an accurate explanation. After all, no one could force him to use his full strength.","Under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan was even more unfathomable in everyone’s eyes."]},{"number":2315,"title":"Chapter 2315: Chaotic Situation","paragraphs":["Chapter 2315: Chaotic Situation","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Until now, no one knew what kind of strength Chu Yunfan had. No one even knew what level he had reached.","They only knew that Chu Yunfan was very, very strong!","After this incident, there were some experts who did not believe in evil. However, they were all dealt with by Tang Siyu and the others.","With Chu Yunfan’s careful guidance, Tang Siyu and the others, who were originally considered to be in middle level Supreme Youths, had now suddenly become top-notch experts among the Supreme Youths.","Their hands were stained with the blood of the Supreme Youths!","Chu Yunfan had many powerful enemies, but they had all been through the ancient battlefield, so they had plenty of opponents.","They had killed their opponents before.","At this moment, they truly displayed the tyrannical combat strength that they had gained from cultivating with Chu Yunfan.","Originally, they had a 50 – 50 chance of winning against their opponents. In fact, their strength was even weaker. Otherwise, they would have killed their opponents long ago.","But now, the speed of their improvement had surpassed their opponents, and they had killed the strong enemy in a one-on-one battle.","These powerful enemies were all Supreme Youths, outstanding figures among countless ancient prodigies.","For a time, the entire ancient battlefield was in utter chaos.","In fact, it was not only Tang Siyu and the others who attacked. The others were not idle either. They also attacked one after another.","This was because everyone realized that even though a year had passed, their cultivation had undergone an earth-shattering change. They had stepped into the Domain Stage from the Divine Treasure Stage, but they still could not break the barrier.","There was no way to contact the outside world. For a moment, everyone panicked.","One had to know that it had already been a year, and they had not been able to contact the mainland for more than a year. Moreover, there had been no reinforcements from the mainland until now. This could not help but make people feel a little afraid.","Either something had happened to the mainland, or someone had stopped them in the endless starry sky.","The ancient battlefield was in the endless starry sky. It was treacherous and was impossible for ordinary people to cross.","However, the large factions behind them were not among the ranks of ordinary people. They had the strength to cross the starry sky.","However, they did not receive any reinforcements. This was already very clear.","No matter what, it was not a good thing for everyone now.","Now, they were more like meat on a chopping board. Others could cut them whenever they wanted. They had no choice and no room to fight back.","Under such circumstances, many people could not help but attack each other. The tacit understanding and silence from before disappeared.","Many of the ancient prodigies had a lot of grudges against each other. It was fine for a short time, but as time passed, the grudges between them erupted.","In the past month, hundreds of battles had taken place. Without being able to get out or get any support, many people had gone crazy.","Everyone was not surprised by this. This was a golden era, and many ancient geniuses were alive at the same time. How crazy was this situation?","At the same time, this was like raising a bug. Only by constantly fighting and killing, and finally killing a bug king, only the last person could become a god.","All kinds of killings were inevitable. In the past, the number of geniuses who had been killed on the prodigy battlefield was not small.","In terms of the total number of prodigies, it might be about ten times that of the remaining prodigies.","In fact, these prodigies were the final winners after going through layers of killing and selection.","Now, this kind of struggle and competition had never ended. On the contrary, it was intensifying.","This was a chaotic situation!","Everyone was seizing the time and forcing themselves to improve through intense battles.","Ordinary bitter cultivation was useless.","They had advanced from the Divine Treasure Stage to the Domain Stage, so there was no point in continuing their closed-door cultivation. On the contrary, only through life-and-death battles could they force out all of their potential.","In just over a month of battle, the strength of these Supreme Youths and ancient prodigies had made great progress. However, the price was that many ancient prodigies of the same realm had been killed.","Even among the ancient prodigies, many Supreme Youths were killed.","In the past, any one of them could shine for an entire era. They were enough to shine for a while in the river of time and would not be unknown.","Yet now, they had died so silently in the ancient battlefield. Their reputation was unknown.","In the ancient city, Chu Hongcai and the Golden Roc were engaged in the most intense battle on a martial arts arena.","The arena was surrounded by a strong barrier. At the same time, the arena looked small, but it was actually extremely huge. There was a huge folded space inside.","Around the arena, Chu Yunfan, Tang Siyu, the Sea Dragon, Huangfu Longhao, the Flaming Heaven Swallowing Sparrow, the Dragon-Headed Crocodile, and many disciples of the Flying Celestials were staring at the intense battle in the arena.","Chu Hongcai’s body was full of sword bones, and his cultivation was earth-shattering. The sword domain he cultivated was incomparably sharp. It turned into an extremely sharp sword light around his body. Wherever it passed, it tore apart the Golden Roc’s golden domain.","Chu Hongcai held a sword in his hand as he shuttled through the golden domain. He was invincible. It was only a simple sword move, but it displayed earth-shattering power in his hands.","Any casual strike had the flavor of a legend.","Opposite him, the Golden Roc kept chirping, and his body kept exploding with golden booms. He easily blocked the sword light that flew over.","The domains of the two sides kept colliding, and at the same time, the close combat between the two sides was also going on.","Chu Hongcai had trained his body. He was extremely good at close combat and had an unparalleled physical body.","The Golden Roc was equally astonishing. He had awakened a bloodline divine power. Every feather was like a sword light that swept out, forming a sword rain that filled the sky. Compared to the Unparalleled Sword Physique, he was not the slightest bit inferior.","At this moment, the battle between the two sides had reached a white hot stage. Both sides used their full strength.","Neither side gave in.","The shockwaves from the battle between the Domainian Supreme Youths were so terrifying that they could easily destroy this ancient city.","If Chu Yunfan had not set up such a barrier outside the arena, the entire ancient city would have been reduced to nothingness.","“Their strengths are about the same. I reckon that even if they fight for another three days and three nights, they won’t be able to determine the victor!” Huangfu Longhao said.","He was extremely shocked. One of these two was his junior. Chu Hongcai’s strength was originally far inferior to his, but now, Chu Hongcai had caught up to him.","As for the other one, he thought that it was nothing special. He had shown little regard for the Golden Roc’s bloodline. Who knew that once the Golden Roc erupted, he would be so terrifying?","Chapter 2314: Invincible","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone knew what this meant. This meant that Chu Yunfan’s understanding of the Great Dao was at least at the Domain Stage.","Stripping away all the gorgeous outer shell, what was left was the true insight.","Chu Yunfan seemed to have reached the point of returning to the original. Even if everyone’s cultivation method was different, Chu Yunfan could still find a way to solve the problems in their cultivation.","This made them speculate about Chu Yunfan’s strength. No wonder his cultivation was like eating and drinking water.","From being completely behind them, to now, he had completely surpassed everyone.","It wasn’t just what many people thought—that he was just lucky.","On the contrary, Chu Yunfan’s understanding of the Great Dao was shocking. It was not something they could compare to.","They did not know how rare this opportunity was for them.","In addition to possessing the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, Chu Yunfan also had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor. It was equivalent to having an Emperor standing at the top of the Great Dao, giving him guidance on cultivation from a strategic position.","What a shocking fortuitous encounter.","In the ancient times, even the personal disciples of the emperors rarely had such an opportunity.","Only Chu Yunfan could give them such a luxurious opportunity.","Their cultivation was already shocking in the current world, but in the eyes of the Emperors, they were still very young.","Even though Alchemy Emperors weren’t famous for their combat skills, their cultivation were much stronger than theirs. Chu Yunfan could find the problems with just a glance and give his answers based on the Alchemy Emperor’s memories.","Chu Yunfan was happy to do so, because for him, this was also an opportunity to rapidly improve himself.","He didn’t completely merge the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, because once it was merged, the vast amount of information in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories would take over him. At that time, after the merger was completed, it would be hard to say whether that person was him or the Alchemy Emperor.","It was as if he had been possessed. Be it emotions or memories, they would be completely overwhelmed by the Alchemy Emperor’s memories.","It was equivalent to the Alchemy Emperor being reborn in another way.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan would never do that. To him, the many memories of the Alchemy Emperor were like a database in a computer. He could pull them out when he needed them, but he would never integrate all the memories of the Alchemy Emperor.","And although he could understand the information, it was ultimately separated by a layer. It wasn’t his, but the Alchemy Emperor’s.","Unless he chose to completely fuse with it, he would be lacking.","Furthermore, those memories were all Alchemy Emperor’s comprehensions and not his own comprehensions. They were all different after all.","Therefore, he liked to use the method of teaching. It seemed like he was helping everyone solve their problems, but at the same time, he was also continuously comprehending the Alchemy Emperor’s memories.","Transforming the Alchemy Emperor’s comprehension into his own comprehension.","This was the true reason why he was willing to teach. When he taught, everyone gained a lot, but he was the one who had truly gained the most.","It could be said that everyone’s gains combined were not as much as his.","Under his careful guidance, everyone’s strength was growing at an astonishing speed.","Especially Tang Siyu. She was one of the earliest Supreme Youths to break through to the Domain Stage. Now, she was even more impressive. In just a year, she had broken through to the level of 5,000 laws. Her strength was enough to suppress the entire ancient battlefield. It was difficult to find a match for her.","Even the original experts in the ancient battlefield were no match for her. Such strength was considered tyrannical even among Domainians.","Of course, Chu Yunfan had also secretly given her special treatment. After all, she was his woman. It was easy for Chu Yunfan to give her some extra pointers.","As for Huangfu Longhao, Chu Hongcai, the Sea Dragon, the Golden Roc, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, and the others, their strength had also undergone a tremendous change. After breaking through to the Domain Stage, they had already accumulated 4,000 laws in a very short period.","The remaining Dragon-Headed Crocodile and the others also had a cultivation base of more than 3,000 laws. The ones at the bottom were naturally the top-notch geniuses of the Flying Celestials. Up until now, they only had a cultivation base of in between 2,000 laws and 3,000 laws.","Other than that, there were also some experts who were on good terms with the Flying Celestials who later received the news from some unknown source. They all came over to hear about it, although they did not receive as many benefits as these people.","However, they also gained quite a lot. Many people broke through on the spot and were extremely excited.","After all, they had cultivated for many years and their foundations were far deeper than others. They only lacked some techniques and guidance from others.","With Chu Yunfan’s guidance, they all made huge breakthroughs in a short time.","He was naturally grateful to Chu Yunfan!","However, when everyone achieved a huge breakthrough, they were very curious about how far Chu Yunfan, who could guide everyone’s cultivation, had gotten.","However, no one knew that Chu Yunfan had only acted once in the past year.","Some of the top prodigies and Supreme Youths had broken through to the Domain Stage, and their cultivation had reached 2,000 or even 3,000 laws. They thought that they could stand on equal footing with Chu Yunfan or even kill him.","They went up to his doorstep, wanting to force out Chu Yunfan’s secret.","After all, many people were now certain that Chu Yunfan must have a shocking secret that allowed him to easily stand above everyone else.","Even the Supreme Youths were no match for him. If they could find out his secrets, their battle prowess would naturally soar together.","There were too many people with such thoughts. They even banded together and attacked the Flying Celestials’ ancient city.","It was at that time that Chu Yunfan’s attack shocked everyone. These top-notch geniuses and Supreme Youths were smashed into pieces by a huge palm that fell from the sky, turning into a bloody rain that filled the sky.","With just one move, he killed everyone!","For a moment, it stunned everyone!","The entire ancient battlefield was in an uproar once again.","Chu Yunfan did not make a move, but once he made a move, he once again displayed his invincible might. Even though everyone had already entered the Domain Stage, there was no doubt that there was still a huge gap compared to Chu Yunfan.","Even now, no one knew how far Chu Yunfan had cultivated.","Some people said that he had already cultivated to 5,000 laws, while others said that he had already cultivated to the extent of 6,000 laws.","There were many different opinions, but no one had an accurate explanation. After all, no one could force him to use his full strength.","Under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan was even more unfathomable in everyone’s eyes."]},{"number":2316,"title":"Chapter 2316: All of You Should Attack Together","paragraphs":["Chapter 2316: All of You Should Attack Together","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This made Huangfu Longhao sigh with emotion. The speed of these young people was too shocking.","Even in terms of age, he could be classified as one of the young people. He was a very young Supreme Youth.","He was a supreme figure who could contend with the emperors when they were young.","In fact, many emperors were the strongest among the Supreme Youths when they were young.","It wasn’t just the Golden Roc and Chu Hongcai. As far as he knew, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow and the others were not weaker than him. They were even stronger than him.","Tang Siyu was even more capable of defeating him.","The only ones he could compare to were probably the Dragon-Headed Crocodile and the other Supreme Youths who had transformed from the Aquired Stage.","In fact, it was not that the Supreme Youths who had been transformed from the Aquired Stage were not strong. Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai were both Supreme Youths who had been transformed from the Aquired Stage.","As long as one was a Supreme Youth, there was only a difference in strength, and it was not calculated according to the Innate or Acquired.","The Aquired Stage might not be weaker. It was just that the Dragon-Headed Crocodile and the others had wasted too much time and foundation just to transform into Aquired Supreme Youths. For the time being, they could not catch up to Huangfu Longhao and the others.","However, compared to the Supreme Youths who did not have Chu Yunfan teachings on the Dao, he was already not much worse.","As for Chu Yunfan, he would completely crush Huangfu Longhao. Otherwise, he would have died of anger sooner or later.","It was not an existence that he could compare to.","During this period, such battles were happening almost every day.","However, it was probably only here that so many Supreme Youths gathered together and could spar together every day.","Although the other forces also had many Supreme Youths, they rarely gathered together. Basically, they all separated and did their own things.","Just like the ancient city where the Destiny Sect was located, Gongsun Hong was alone.","This was because these Supreme Youths were competitive with each other, and they were not friendly with each other.","Even if they were in the same sect and were seniors and juniors, they were still competitors on the path of cultivation.","They would only cooperate under limited circumstances, or they would be like Chu Yunfan, who was a vicious enemy of the entire sect.","Only here was it very different. Under Chu Yunfan’s cohesion, although there was competition, it was not like other places where the king did not see the king.","Not only would they be able to fight directly, but they would also be able to learn a lot from just watching.","Everyone’s Dao was unique. It was precisely because of this that they could learn more things that they did not understand before.","This was the so-called saying that stones from other mountains could be used to polish jade.","After a long battle, it was difficult to determine the victor. Wounds had even begun to appear on both sides. Whether it was Chu Hongcai or the Golden Roc, they were both known for their offense. Under such circumstances, they had left numerous wounds on each other’s bodies.","In the end, they could not do anything to each other, so they gave up.","Both sides stopped fighting. This was a rare experience. In a big battle, they would show no mercy, but at the critical moment, they would still hold back.","Huangfu Longhao stood up and said to Chu Yunfan, “Junior Chu, I want to challenge you. Although I know that I may not be your match now, I want to see how big the gap between us is!”","Everyone else’s eyes lit up because this was also the question they wanted to know. They could sense that Chu Yunfan was very strong, even to a shocking extent. However, no one knew how strong he was.","“You alone will not be enough. How about all of you come at me together? It’s just nice. I would like to see how strong I am too!” Chu Yunfan said directly.","When the crowd heard Chu Yunfan’s words, they didn’t look angry because they didn’t feel insulted by him. He was indeed qualified to say such words.","“Alright, we won’t stand on ceremony then!”","Chu Hongcai was very excited. He had never fought with Chu Yunfan before. Firstly, he respected Chu Yunfan and could not fight with him. Secondly, he was no match for Chu Yunfan.","Previously, his cultivation level was miles away from Chu Yunfan’s, so it was impossible for him to compete with him.","Chu Yunfan’s figure flashed and appeared in the arena.","At this time, Tang Siyu and the others also followed. For a time, more than a dozen Supreme Youths occupied the huge folded space of the arena.","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan with a serious expression.","“Do it!” Chu Yunfan said.","As soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, someone made a move.","This person was none other than Tang Siyu.","The sword in Tang Siyu’s hand flashed with a stormy wave. In an instant, it was as if a long white dragon had been slashed out and enveloped Chu Yunfan.","The long white dragon transformed into a white swordsmanship domain in midair.","Tang Siyu was also using the way of the sword, but she was different from Chu Hongcai. Chu Hongcai was a complete sword cultivator. He abandoned all other offensive techniques and swept the world purely with his sword path, contending with the heroes of the world.","Tang Siyu was different. She cultivated sword arts, and sword arts were one of the important parts of her martial arts. However, the power of the sword path she displayed was equally astonishing.","When the terrifying sword light landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, Chu Yunfan’s eyes suddenly exploded with a disastrous aura.","In an instant, volcanic eruptions, tsunamis, earthquakes, meteorite collisions, and all kinds of natural and man-made disasters appeared.","The strange phenomenon caused by the disaster exploded with earth-shattering power, instantly shattering the sword light and preventing it from approaching Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s Disaster Star Eyes formed a huge domain around him to resist Tang Siyu’s domain.","Tang Siyu’s domain could not break through Chu Yunfan’s domain. Instead, it was shattered layer by layer by Chu Yunfan’s domain.","At this moment, Huangfu Longhao and the Sea Dragon had already pounced over from the left and right.","Huangfu Longhao dominated the world. Every move he made had the demeanor of a king. A Flying Celestial Palm Strike slammed down, shattering the sky.","On the other side, the Sea Dragon’s countless water-type laws turned into terrifying waves that swept toward Chu Yunfan.","Even a Supreme Youth would not dare to receive such an attack head-on.","After these two attacks, a terrifying flame turned into a flood and swept toward Chu Yunfan.","At the same time, the Golden Roc, Chu Hongcai, the Dragon-Headed Crocodile, and the others also attacked crazily at the same time, flying toward Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":2317,"title":"Chapter 2317: Seven Thousand Laws","paragraphs":["Chapter 2317: Seven Thousand Laws","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","For a moment, the entire arena was in a state of chaos.","These were all Domainians, and they were all Domainian Supreme Youths.","Any one of them could suppress a region and become an ancestor.","Now, they were all attacking Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, did not move at all. No matter how their domains swept over, they could not break through Chu Yunfan’s domain.","This was the difference in nature, and it could not be made up by quantity alone.","Chu Yunfan simply kept swinging his fists, and he was able to destroy everyone’s attacks. It was terrifying to defend without attacking.","As the saying went, one could only be a thief for a thousand days, but there was no reason to guard against thieves for a thousand days.","It was the same in battle. Just defense alone was enough to easily find flaws and defeat him sooner or later.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. The more he fought, the more stable he became. He had no flaws at all, and no one could find any flaws in him.","After fighting for half a day, everyone finally stopped!","Huangfu Longhao and the others looked at each other with bitter smiles on their faces. Chu Yunfan’s strength was too strong, to the extreme. It was not something they could compare to.","“Junior Chu, how many laws have you cultivated?” Huangfu Longhao asked.","The others also turned to look.","“Seven thousand,” Chu Yunfan answered.","“What?! 7,000?!” Huangfu Longhao cried out in shock because he knew what 7,000 streaks meant.","Even if ordinary elites were lucky enough to enter the Domain Stage, they would at most cultivate 3,000 laws. That was their limit.","There were more top-notch geniuses who could cultivate 5,000 laws, and 7,000 laws was the limit that only a Supreme Youth could cultivate to.","In other words, Chu Yunfan had already reached the peak of the Domain Stage.","Different aptitudes and different potentials would result in different laws being cultivated. Hence, their peak Domain Stage would be different as well.","Currently, Chu Yunfan was equivalent to a Supreme Youth at the peak Domain Stage.","Generally speaking, this was the peak that ordinary Domainians could reach.","Thinking about them, they were still far from 5,000 laws, let alone 7,000.","According to their original estimates, it would take at least a few years to cultivate 7,000.","However, that was only possible if there were sufficient resources and they did their best. They would only be able to achieve it if they did not encounter any unsolvable difficulties.","It might even be normal for someone to cultivate 7,000 laws in ten to twenty years.","If it was an ordinary person, they might not be able to cultivate 7,000 laws in their lifetime.","One could imagine how much shock Chu Yunfan had given them.","“Brother Fan, your progress is way too fast. How did you get to this point? Didn’t you cultivate with us?” Chu Hongcai couldn’t believe it either. They were both Supreme Youths, but not only were they a few streets ahead of Chu Yunfan in terms of strength, but even their speed of comprehending the Dao was far inferior to Chu Yunfan’s.","Chu Yunfan left them behind.","“Just cultivate normally, and then we’ll all get there!”","Chu Yunfan didn’t comment much, because he couldn’t reveal the secret.","To him, such progress was only natural. After all, he had a godhead and was unparalleled in comprehending the Dao.","The previous cultivation focused on the accumulation of energy, which was the transformation of the essence of life.","The higher one’s cultivation was, the more one would pay attention to one’s understanding of the Great Dao. The degree of one’s understanding of the Great Dao determined whether one’s strength was strong or not.","This was the reason why many people in the Divine Treasure Stage were unable to step into the Domain Stage even after cultivating for their entire lives. It was not that their foundation was not deep enough, but that comprehending the Dao was something that happened in an instant. If they comprehended it, they comprehended it. If they did not, they did not comprehend it.","The better one’s aptitude, the more advantageous it would be in the later stages of cultivation.","This was the reason why the Supreme Youths had a greater advantage than ordinary prodigies.","This was because the talent of a Supreme Youth was often the best. They were much stronger than ordinary top-notch geniuses.","However, their talents were incomparable to Chu Yunfan’s.","Chu Yunfan’s innate talent was not inferior to theirs. He had four different emperor-level physiques.","Most importantly, he had the help of the godhead. His speed of analyzing and comprehending the Great Dao was astonishing.","The key to cultivating the Domain Stage was one’s comprehension of laws. The more laws one could condense, the more powerful one would be.","This was exactly what Chu Yunfan wanted.","The other Supreme Youths had just entered the Domain Stage not long ago. They still needed some time to stabilize and push their cultivation to the limit.","And Chu Yunfan had already cultivated it to perfection.","Of course, that was the perfection of an ordinary Supreme Youth. Chu Yunfan did not feel that his Great Dao was about to be perfected.","Before he cultivated to the Domain Stage, he already had twice as many laws as ordinary Supreme Youths. His foundation was much stronger than theirs.","Therefore, he could go further.","Although he could charge to a higher stage now, he was unwilling to do so. This was because the stronger his foundation was, the more powerful he would be when he broke through in the future.","However, he could only stop because all his cultivation resources had been used up. He had been trapped here for so long and had not been replenished.","Just by absorbing the spirit energy between heaven and earth, just maintaining one’s strength and not declining was already the limit. To advance further was simply wishful thinking.","After all, he was too strong. The amount of spirit energy needed for each step forward was an astronomical figure. It was simply not something that ordinary people could imagine.","But whether he was willing or not, there was nothing he could do.","Previously, he had attacked once, but he was still unable to break through the barrier.","That barrier was too strong, and the person behind it was astonishingly generous.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan could only lay low and wait for an opportunity.","No matter what the other party wanted to do, he had to make a move. And now, Chu Yunfan was waiting for such an opportunity.","Because he still had a trump card, he could hide in the Mountain River Diagram, so he was not afraid of the mastermind behind the scenes.","Chu Yunfan’s words made Huangfu Longhao and the others roll their eyes. They were speechless. Why did these words sound so infuriating?","Speaking of which, they had used such words to anger others in the past.","The others were curious about how they cultivated and how the Supreme Youths were so much stronger than the others.","However, they also replied that they would cultivate normally and then break through. Then, they would be stronger than them. There was no reason.","Now that they thought about it, their expressions at that time must have been very annoying in the eyes of others."]},{"number":2318,"title":"Chapter 2318: The Demon Invasion","paragraphs":["Chapter 2318: The Demon Invasion","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Thinking about it, it was detestable!","They realized that they must have been asking for a beating back then. Chu Yunfan was like this now. If it wasn’t for the fact that they couldn’t defeat him, they might have rushed forward.","However, they couldn’t find anything wrong. During this period, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was almost at the same time as theirs.","They saw it too.","Chu Yunfan was only cultivating normally, but he was already so much stronger than them.","This was the most depressing part. If Chu Yunfan had all sorts of fortuitous encounters, it wouldn’t be enough to make them so depressed.","This was because fortuitous encounters were something that could be desired but not coveted. However, normal cultivation could leave them so far behind. How could they accept this?","“If that’s the case, do you plan to advance to the King Stage?” Tang Siyu asked.","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan. If Chu Yunfan could really break through to the King Stage, then he would definitely be able to shake the world.","One had to know that even the sect master of the Flying Celestials had only cultivated 5,000 laws. He was a Domainian at his limit.","However, he had yet to advance to the King Stage. One could imagine how difficult it was to reach the King Stage.","Such a terrifying existence might not even exist in the world today.","However, any one of them could establish a behemoth like the ten great sects.","According to rumors, the founder of the ten great sects was such an existence. This was the biggest difference between the ten great sects and others.","That was because they had once given birth to a King Stage existence.","That was why they were able to sit firmly among the strongest in the world. If no King had been born, they would not be qualified to be compared to them.","In the past, the person most likely to advance to the King Stage was naturally Huangfu Longhao. If it was in an ordinary era, it could be said that Huangfu Longhao would sooner or later become a King.","It was just that the time needed was relatively long. After all, although the golden era was cruel, countless geniuses fought fiercely. In the end, only one victor could walk out alive.","However, at the same time, fighting with geniuses of the same level or even stronger than them could also promote their strength to increase rapidly.","After leaving the battlefield, the strength of many prodigies had undergone earth-shattering changes. This was the reason why they were so brave.","“I don’t think so.” Chu Yunfan shook his head. “I feel that I haven’t reached my limit yet. If I try to break through now, the gains won’t make up for the losses!”","When everyone heard this, they almost fainted. Chu Yunfan, who had already cultivated to 7,000 laws, had not reached his limit. Then wouldn’t his limit be 8,000, 9,000, or even 10,000?","If that was really the case, then it would be too terrifying. Perhaps the entire history of cultivation would be overturned by him.","However, when everyone thought about it, wasn’t the current history of cultivation overturned by Chu Yunfan alone?","In the past, when he was in the Divine Treasure Stage, he had hit the limit for an ordinary Supreme Youth in cultivating 500 laws.","Almost all the Supreme Youths had cultivated 1,000 laws. This was the effect brought about by Chu Yunfan.","Even the top prodigies who cultivated 500 laws were not in the minority. In the past, this was the precedent of the Supreme Youths.","Every step Chu Yunfan took was overturning the history of cultivation.","When everyone thought of this, they were relieved. He was too strong and was destined to be different.","“Since there is such an opportunity, of course, I have to wait until I reach perfection before breaking through. Otherwise, there will be a flaw left behind.” Tang Siyu nodded. “However, none of us have your potential. I can feel that 7,000 is our limit. It won’t be easy to break through!”","Everyone nodded. Having cultivated to their level, they could naturally sense their individual cultivation paths. 7,000 laws might really be the limit. It was easier said than done to break through.","And Chu Yunfan might be the only one who had a chance to break through!","At this moment, everyone had no other thoughts. They only wanted to see a miracle. Perhaps Chu Yunfan could create an unprecedented future.","“But that’s in the future. My cultivation resources are almost depleted. If I can’t replenish them, I’ll have to grind away with time if I want to improve further!” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","Everyone looked at each other in dismay. They were not much different from each other. In the three years they had been in the ancient battlefield, their strength had improved by leaps and bounds. Of course, it was impossible for them to do so just by absorbing the wandering spirit energy in the world.","“However, the person behind the scenes hasn’t made a move yet. What is he thinking?” Chu Hongcai said impatiently.","No matter what the person behind the scenes wanted to do, they had not made a move for more than a year, which had exhausted everyone’s patience.","Recently, more and more people had begun to work together to break the array. The feeling of being locked inside like an ant was unacceptable to these geniuses.","“He’s here!”","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan opened his mouth and said something. Everyone was still a little puzzled and didn’t know what he had said.","Suddenly, a huge hole was torn open in the sky. It was thousands of kilometers long and could be seen in the entire ancient battlefield.","It was pitch-black inside the crack. No one knew what was inside the crack. It was extremely terrifying.","For a moment, countless experts from the ancient cities flew up from the ancient battlefield.","Regardless of whether they were ordinary people or ancient prodigies, the weakest among them were experts in the Divine Treasure Stage. Most of them were already in the Domain Stage.","At this moment, they all looked at the crack.","Because everyone knew that no matter what the mastermind wanted to do, it was time for the final battle.","After that huge crack was torn open, suddenly, countless black shadows swept down at an extremely fast speed.","“Demons! It’s the demons!” someone cried out in surprise.","They finally saw what they were. They were either human-shaped or beast-shaped creatures, but their bodies were covered in black scales and emitted shocking demonic energy.","Many people were unfamiliar with the demons. Although they had heard of the legends of the demons, in the Central Plains, many of the inheritances of the demons ultimately came from the demons.","Although the methods of obtaining it were different, they all came from the demons.","Therefore, they knew about the demons, but they had never interacted with them.","The demons were in a special world in the outer reaches of the cosmos. They were completely different from the Central Plains. They did not absorb spirit energy, but instead fed on demonic energy.","But everyone knew that their mortal enemy had appeared. The demons were the greatest enemy of all living creatures in the Central Plains. Wherever they went, they not only killed people like flies, but also transformed the world into an environment suitable for the demons to live in. Even cultivators could not survive in such an environment.","It was either the living beings or the demons would die and perish. There was no third possibility!"]},{"number":2319,"title":"Chapter 2319: Fighting the Demons","paragraphs":["Chapter 2319: Fighting the Demons","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was a life-and-death war between two different ecological systems. There was no possibility of reconciliation at all.","And the struggle between the demons and the various races of the Central Plains was a struggle within this ecological system.","It was impossible for them to coexist peacefully!","Only by destroying the other party would it be considered over.","This kind of war had been going on since ancient times.","Chu Yunfan had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor in his mind. He had once seen records that the primordial era was very likely to have been destroyed by the invasion of the demons.","That was the heyday of the berserk beasts!","Since then, the ancient Emperors had officially risen. It could be said that they were a terrifying race that had once destroyed an era.","Everyone understood that the mastermind were actually the demons. No wonder they were able to be so generous and surround the entire ancient battlefield with a barrier for more than a year.","Just the resources needed to spend here were astronomical. If it was not for a behemoth like the demons, no other faction could easily afford it.","At the same time, only the demons had the guts to start a war with the other major forces and races.","This was because the demons were not afraid of others knowing. The relationship between the two sides was one that would not rest until one of them died, and there was no possibility of reconciliation.","“Now the problem is really big. I didn’t expect it to be the demons!” Huangfu Longhao’s expression was extremely grave.","This was because the demons had been living in peace for many, many years. Although they had destroyed the glorious primordial era, they had also been severely injured by many ferocious beasts from the primordial era.","After all, although there were no emperors in the immemorial era, there were still many fierce beasts whose strength was not inferior to the emperors. Among them, there were even fierce beasts like the Ten Ferocities that could destroy the world.","After that series of great wars, the immemorial era was destroyed, and at the same time, those demons were heavily injured.","The ancient Emperors who had risen during the immemorial era constantly led their troops to conquer the starry sky, constantly attacking the demons’ forces.","After all, regardless of race or faction, the demons were their common enemy. Once they entered the Central Plains, it would be a disaster for everyone.","Many Emperors had made outstanding contributions in the war against the demons, and their names were known throughout the heavens.","Under these circumstances, the power of the demons was constantly being attacked. Even if the ancient era had collapsed because of the War of the Emperors, the demons did not have the strength to attack the Central Plains again.","Even after the extremely chaotic modern times, there had been no invasion of the demon army. Although there were occasionally small forces of the demons invading, they were not significant.","And after coming to this dynasty, they didn’t even know what the demons were.","Even though everyone knew that the demons were their mortal enemies, many people had never seen a demon in their lives, so they naturally did not take it to heart.","It was only now that they had been caught off guard by the demons, and everyone had finally realized that the demons had never been far away. They had only been recuperating in the depths of the starry sky, watching the Central Plains like a tiger watching its prey.","They were waiting for the real invasion.","And now, it was probably the time they had chosen to invade.","“If it really are demons, then things will be troublesome!” Chu Yunfan said, “The demons must have come prepared. A great battle is inevitable. Follow me and don’t stray too far. I’m afraid this battle will be very difficult!”","Even though Chu Yunfan had absolute confidence and his cultivation was at the peak of the Domain Stage, condensing 7,000 laws was shocking.","However, there were too many of them. Chu Yunfan could see them with his naked eye, and they covered the void.","“Let’s kill our way out. Our ancestors once fought against the demons. Now it’s our turn. Let’s drain their blood!”","Not everyone was afraid. On the contrary, some people were extremely hot-blooded.","Especially on the battlefield, other than some veteran Divine Treasures and Domainians, most of them were ancient prodigies.","Any one of these people could suppress an era and be one of the outstanding figures of that era.","Once they grew up, their future would be limitless!","Such a person would be scared of the demons, but he would definitely not back down from them.","Otherwise, with their magnanimity, they would not have been able to cultivate to their current level.","“We have no other way out. We have to fight with our backs to the wall!”","“Kill all the demons. Let them know that we have defeated them once, and this time will be the same!”","“Kill to vindicate the Dao!”","During this year, these geniuses could be said to be on tenterhooks, worried that the mastermind would appear at any time. They cultivated bitterly and were worried at the same time.","Now, they were relieved. They wanted to vent their anger.","For a moment, in the ancient cities, dazzling lights covered the sky, and terrifying blood energy pillars shot into the sky.","There weren’t any ordinary people here. The weakest among them were Divine Treasures, and they were all experts who had the chance to enter the Domain Stage.","They were not an ordinary people.","Furthermore, most of them were Domainians!","Any one of them appearing in the Central Plains was enough to cause a huge commotion, let alone so many of them attacking together. The entire ancient battlefield was shaken.","The sky was trembling faintly, showing signs of collapsing.","“Let’s go! Let’s meet the demon experts!” Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes.","The biggest mistake the demons made was giving them more than a year.","Over the past year, many prodigies on the ancient battlefield had broken through one after another. Their strength was more than ten times stronger than a year ago.","In the distance, in the sky, black clouds rolled and covered the entire ancient battlefield. At the same time, they were releasing demonic energy.","The demonic energy was a great supplement to the demons, but it was poison to the many ancient prodigies on the ancient battlefield.","Many geniuses understood that at this point, they had to end the battle quickly. Otherwise, once the demonic energy expelled the spirit energy, this place would become the demons’ home ground.","There would be no chance of winning this battle.","“The demons are courting death!”","With a loud shout, huge hands grabbed out from the sky. Every time they grabbed out, they could kill countless demons.","The great battle began.","Chu Yunfan and the others arrived in the sky. With Chu Yunfan as the arrow, they formed an attack formation.","Chu Yunfan looked around and saw countless demons swarming over, covering the sky and earth.","Chu Yunfan could see that the elite demon army was approaching."]},{"number":2320,"title":"Chapter 2320: Defeating the Demon Army","paragraphs":["Chapter 2320: Defeating the Demon Army","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","These demons were wrapped in black scales as if they were wearing black armor. They held long spears and had a pair of bat-like wings on their backs. They had green faces and fangs, looking extremely ferocious.","Every single one of them was extremely powerful and elite. Each army had at least tens of thousands of people.","From afar, they came from all directions.","Behind this army, an enormous black warship tore through the sky.","On the black warship, countless array muzzles were opened and aimed at Chu Yunfan and the others.","“Everyone, be careful. That is the demons’ Void Warship!”","Chu Yunfan recognized this black warship at a glance because it was originally products of the Central Plains.","In ancient times, there was a Weapon Emperor who developed these great killing weapons to kill the demons.","He formed a powerful fleet to go on an expedition against the demons. Later, some broken Void Warships fell into the hands of the demons and were cracked by them. Then, they were transformed into their own Void Warships.","Even without Chu Yunfan’s reminder, everyone’s expressions were equally ferocious.","Facing so many ferocious demons, even the bravest the Sea Dragon became nervous. He had awakened the genes of his ancestors and had seen these demons in his bloodline inheritance memory. He had seen the scene of his ancestors fighting these demons in the deep sea.","The reason why the Sea Dragons were almost exterminated in the immemorial era was because they were killed by these demons. It could be said that there was a deep hatred between the Sea Dragons and the demons.","Not only the Sea Dragon, but also the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, the Golden Roc, and other Supreme Youths who had awakened their ancestral bloodline had all awakened their ancestor’s hatred for the demons.","Boom!","With a loud explosion, a terrifying demonic energy torrent swept toward Chu Yunfan and the others from the Void Warship.","Above Chu Yunfan’s head, a medicinal cauldron suddenly flew out and spun around. Layers of light curtains hung down and blocked the torrent.","Rumble!","Terrifying explosions could be heard everywhere.","What followed was the sound of countless sharp arrows piercing through the air. Terrifying arrows turned into a rain of arrows that covered the sky and covered the earth as they flew toward Chu Yunfan and the others.","A random arrow could blow up a mountain. The rain of arrows shot by these devil experts was very shocking.","“Break!” Chu Yunfan roared and spat out a nether flame from his mouth. Wherever the flame passed, the arrow rain disappeared without a trace in an instant and was burned to ashes.","The flames did not slow down and swept toward the demon army.","In the next moment, a huge shadow appeared above the demon army. It was the army soul condensed by the demon army.","This army spirit was extremely terrifying. It instantly turned the netherworld flames spat out by Chu Yunfan into nothingness.","At the same time, from afar, the warships continued to shoot out terrifying beams of light. Each beam of light was equivalent to the full-powered attack of a Domainian.","Just one attack was enough to severely injure everyone. Fortunately, the Mountain River Cauldron could block these attacks.","After all, it was the Dao artifact that the Alchemy Emperor had carried with him back then.","“We have to think of a way to destroy that warship first!” Chu Hongcai became more and more anxious. From time to time, he would slash out a shocking sword light. The ten thousand feet sword light would slash into the demon army’s formation.","“That’s right. If we can’t destroy that warship, we will be destroyed sooner or later!” Tang Siyu nodded. Although the Mountain River Cauldron was impressive, it couldn’t withstand all kinds of attacks like this.","“I’ll break it!” Chu Yunfan said.","In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan released the Mountain River Diagram as a defense. As a Dao Artifact after the Alchemy Emperor achieved Dao, the defensive effect of the Mountain River Diagram was only stronger than the Mountain River Cauldron.","All the attacks landed on the Mountain River Diagram and were blocked by the famous mountains and rivers that appeared on the Mountain River Diagram.","The Mountain River Diagram kept spinning. On the Mountain River Diagram, endless famous mountains and great rivers appeared. These famous mountains and great rivers ground all the attacks into nothingness.","Chu Yunfan raised the Mountain River Cauldron in his hand, and his terrifying strength was vividly displayed at this moment.","He knew that at this moment, he was the only one who could be the assaulter. No one else had the ability to do so.","There were more demons rushing over from afar. If they were trapped here, they would probably all die here.","The demon army was endless, and Chu Yunfan and the others would be exhausted to death sooner or later.","At that moment, Chu Yunfan released the endless power of lightning around him, forming a terrifying domain. Countless arrows fell into the domain and were shot down by the power of lightning.","Chu Yunfan couldn’t be hurt.","A pair of lightning wings grew on Chu Yunfan’s back, and he unleashed his maximum speed. It had been a long time since he had unleashed his top speed.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan appeared above the battle formation. The Mountain River Cauldron in his hand swelled up with the wind, and in an instant, it was like a huge mountain.","“Shoot him to death! Kill him!”","At that moment, the commander of the demons finally noticed Chu Yunfan’s movements. All kinds of attacks swept toward Chu Yunfan.","But there was still time. Chu Yunfan smashed the Mountain River Cauldron down on the battle formation.","Boom!","A huge mushroom cloud slowly rose up. The dazzling white light covered all the light, and even the demon cloud in the sky was torn open.","Spurt! Ack!","In the battle formation of the demon army, countless demon soldiers were smashed until they spat out blood. The army spirit they condensed were shattered by Chu Yunfan’s Mountain River Cauldron. Of course, they suffered a strong backlash.","They were heavily injured by a single blow.","The entire battle formation was broken by Chu Yunfan.","“Now!” A ball of lightning energy appeared in Chu Yunfan’s hand out of thin air. It turned into a big bow. The big bow was opened, and in an instant, hundreds of arrows were shot.","These hundreds of arrows were aimed at the commander of the demons in the battle formation, who Chu Yunfan had already noticed.","In this entire demon army, there were only two Domainians. The other commanders were all in the Divine Treasure Stage.","After all, Domainians were top-notch experts. They were not cabbages that could be found on the streets.","In this life, the Central Plains had countless years of accumulated resources, which was why so many young geniuses had transformed from cocoons into butterflies and broken through to the Domain Stage.","Moreover, even Domainians were no match for Chu Yunfan. How could they possibly block this arrow? They all screamed in pain as they were blasted apart, turning into a bloody mist that filled the sky.","Without the protection of the battle formation, the army was unimaginably weak against an expert like Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":2321,"title":"Chapter 2321: The Demon Prince","paragraphs":["Chapter 2321: The Demon Prince","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Without a doubt, the demon army was the elite of the elite. However, no matter how elite the army was, there was a huge gap between them and these Divine Treasures and Domainians.","In fact, they were not on the same level. Without the protection of the military formation, the demon army was no different from the armies of the myriad worlds.","After the leader was killed, the demon army immediately fell into chaos. Some small leaders went forward and tried to command the army, but arrows immediately fell from the sky and shot them down.","Following that, Tang Siyu and the others charged out. Without the support of the army formation, even if the arrows rained down, they could not hurt these Domainians.","Tang Siyu and the others were like tigers entering a flock of sheep, crazily slaughtering the demon army.","In the distance, the demons’ Void Warship continued to blast out terrifying energy torrents at Chu Yufan, wishing that Chu Yunfan would be blown to pieces on the spot.","Chu Yunfan naturally wouldn’t let go of the Void Warship. His body rushed to the Void Warship like a meteor. The Mountain River Cauldron in his hand grew with the wind, and soon it was like a huge divine mountain.","Boom!","The Mountain River Cauldron crashed down hard, creating a huge hole in the Void Warship. Violent explosions were happening everywhere on the Void Warship.","The Void Warship that could have fought against a top-notch Domainian was shattered into pieces by Chu Yunfan’s attack.","Although Chu Yunfan only had 7,000 laws, he was undoubtedly one of the top Domainians in the world.","It was not an exaggeration to say that he was invincible.","At the very least, there was no one in the Domain Stage who could contend with him, let alone a Void Warship.","After the Mountain River Cauldron shattered the defensive barrier around the Void Warship, the Void Warship had no advantage over Chu Yunfan.","“Hmph!” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly and crushed the warship with his hand.","Then, Chu Yunfan turned around and joined in on the slaughtering of the demon army.","The lightning energy in Chu Yunfan’s hand turned into a huge bow, constantly shooting out shocking arrows. Each arrow could shatter the world, and every arrow killed a large number of demons.","This was the deterrence of a top-notch expert. On the battlefield, only such an expert could dominate the battlefield and be invincible.","No one else would be able to fight against such an existence. Only a Domainian could do so.","However, ordinary Domainian demons would not be able to withstand Chu Yunfan’s punches and kicks. They would be easily killed.","Chu Yunfan had killed the experts of the demon army, so they naturally allowed the slaughter to continue.","In just a moment, they were all slaughtered.","“You guys are courting death!”","Suddenly, a huge explosion sounded from afar. A terrifying figure stepped through the void and arrived before everyone.","It was a demon clad in iron armor. Different from ordinary demons, this demon was clad in iron armor and looked majestic. In his hand was a long black halberd. It was unknown what material it was made of.","The horse beneath him was covered in black flames. With a snort, the horse caused the entire sky to collapse.","This black horse was at the Domain Stage as well. The armored demon sitting on it was even more impressive. It was at the peak of the Domain Stage.","“You must be Chu Yunfan!” The demon looked at Chu Yunfan. He spoke in the common language of the Central Plains, not the demon language. Clearly, he had carefully prepared for this and was even familiar with the common language of the Central Plains.","In contrast, although these ancient prodigies were the cream of the crop in the Central Plains, none of them were proficient in the demon language.","There was already an earth-shattering gap in the level of preparation between the two sides.","“We’ve been observing you for quite some time now. Among the natives of the Central Plains, you’re considered pretty good. I’ll give you a chance. I am a demon prince, and if you’re willing to switch to magic and pledge your allegiance to me, I will give you a chance to become my servant. Otherwise, you’ll end up like them!” the demon said as he threw out a few heads, which rolled across the ground.","Everyone could see it clearly. Huangfu Longhao and the others sucked in a breath of cold air. He knew these people. They were all Supreme Youths. Some of them had even fought with him before. They were famous for being difficult to deal with.","In other words, this demon prince had killed several ancient Supreme Youths.","The strength of this demon prince was naturally unquestionable.","“D*mn it!”","At this moment, Huangfu Longhao could not help but feel a little sad because he was also a Supreme Youth. Now that he saw other Supreme Youths being killed so easily by the other party and having their heads chopped off, he could not help but feel angry.","What made him feel even more indignant was that it was not that these Supreme Youths were inferior.","These Supreme Youths were the cream of the crop among those in the same level. In a one-on-one fight, they were not afraid of anything other than encountering a monster like Chu Yunfan.","And the reason why these Supreme Youths were defeated and died was because their cultivation time was too short.","This demon prince obviously had a special physique that was comparable to Supreme Youths. He was not inferior to Supreme Youths.","Moreover, he had cultivated for a longer period of time than these Supreme Youths. His cultivation base was at least 5,000 or more, or even 6,000 or 7,000.","If these Supreme Youths were given the same amount of time, it would be impossible for them to be defeated so easily, let alone being killed so easily.","“This is an unfair battle. If they were of the same cultivation level, you would be the one to lose!” Huangfu Longhao roared as he suppressed the anger in his heart.","“A defeat is a defeat. What else is there to say? It’s just a defeated opponent!” the prince of the demons glanced at Huangfu Longhao and said, “You’re a little stronger than them, but not by much. If you’re willing to surrender, I can give you a way out. Otherwise, don’t blame me for being merciless!” The demon prince grinned, revealing a mouth full of sharp teeth. He was a true demon from the myths and legends.","“You want us to join you? Our ancestors once defeated you. In the ancient times, they constantly attacked the demons and severely injured you. Now, you want us to join you? What wishful thinking!” Huangfu Longhao shouted."]},{"number":2322,"title":"Chapter 2322: Dao Comprehension, Everyone Attacks","paragraphs":["Chapter 2322: Dao Comprehension, Everyone Attacks","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Since you refuse to surrender, then you might as well die!” The demon prince laughed sinisterly. “I originally wanted to give you a chance to be dogs. Since you don’t know how to cherish it, then go to hell!”","A terrifying silent demonic aura rose from the demon prince’s body and pierced through the entire starry sky like a heavenly pillar. It was overwhelming and surging.","7,000!","This demon prince was a terrifying existence who had cultivated at least 7,000 laws. As soon as he appeared, the sky collapsed.","No wonder he was so confident. Unless he encountered a legendary King martial arts expert, how could he be a match for any Supreme Youth when he had cultivated 7,000 laws?","Under him, the burning horse trod across the sky and charged at Chu Yunfan and the others.","This was a demon horse unique to the demons, named Nightmare Beast.","Nightmare Beasts were born in the depths of the demons. Even among the demons, they were top-grade mounts. Only a few of the best among the demons were qualified to ride them.","Swoosh!","The speed of this Nightmare Beast was too fast. It tore through the sky like a bolt of lightning and arrived before Chu Yunfan in an instant.","A peerless fighting spirit emanated from the demon prince. He swung the halberd in his hand fiercely, and there was actually an imposing manner that could swallow mountains and rivers like a tiger.","In front of him, the Mountain River Cauldron above Chu Yunfan’s head spun and blocked this terrifying attack.","However, the collision between the two sides still erupted into a huge mushroom cloud.","The terrifying attack shook the sky.","The attack failed to penetrate the defense of the Mountain River Cauldron, but everyone was shocked to find that Chu Yunfan did not move at all. At this critical moment, his soul actually wandered out of the sky.","“Oh no! Junior Chu has entered a state of enlightenment!” At this moment, Huangfu Longhao finally realized that something was wrong.","In this state, Chu Yunfan had already entered a state of enlightenment. He was instantly shocked.","He didn’t understand why Chu Yunfan could enter the state of enlightenment on the battlefield.","One had to know that no matter how hard an ordinary person tried, it was very difficult for them to enter this state of enlightenment. This was because every state of enlightenment was a rare opportunity for any cultivator.","Many ordinary people rarely had such an opportunity in their entire lives, and the legend of cultivators comprehending the Dao overnight and ascending in the day still inspired many people.","Under such circumstances, everyone knew what enlightenment meant.","Almost every time one finished comprehending the Dao, there would be an astonishing improvement.","However, what made them depressed was that Chu Yunfan had entered a state of enlightenment while the battle was intense.","This was too fatal.","“Forget it. No matter how Brother Fan entered the state of enlightenment, all we can do now is to stop the demon prince. We’ll only have a chance of survival when Brother Fan comes out of the state of enlightenment!” Chu Hongcai shouted.","Everyone quickly made up their minds. It was simply too difficult for them to escape from the hands of the demon prince with their strength.","The difference in strength between the two sides was just a little bit, but it was already like the difference between heaven and earth. Although they would not be defeated immediately, they would not be able to gain an advantage either.","“Hahaha, the heavens are really helping me!” At this time, the demon prince noted Chu Yunfan’s state and immediately laughed out loud. He immediately urged the Nightmare Beast under him to charge at Chu Yunfan. He wanted to kill Chu Yunfan while he was in the state of enlightenment.","“Myriad Swords Return!” Chu Hongcai shouted, and the sword in his hand shot out. In mid-air, the sword shook violently and turned into thousands of sword rays, almost covering the entire sky.","“Petty trick. You dare to be impudent in front of me?!” The demon prince laughed loudly and struck out with his halberd. The terrifying demonic flames surged into the sky and swept away the thousands of sword lights into nothingness. Then, the attack landed directly on Chu Hongcai.","Spurt!","Chu Hongcai spat out a mouthful of blood. He suffered a backlash and was sent flying backward.","“So strong!”","Chu Hongcai finally realized how powerful the demon prince was. No wonder those Supreme Youths had died in his hands.","The demon prince indeed had tyrannical strength, which was extraordinary.","The Myriad Swords Return was Chu Hongcai’s trump card, but it was easily broken.","Indeed, for Domainians, the more laws they cultivated, the more powerful they would be.","Chu Hongcai didn’t stop the demon prince’s attack. On the contrary, he slashed out an earth-shattering halberd light, wanting to split Chu Yunfan in half.","“Roar!”","At this moment, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, the Sea Dragon, and the Golden Roc roared and attacked.","The Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow spat out a mountain of flames. The mountain of flames burned fiercely, wanting to suppress everything as it welcomed the halberd light.","On the other side, the Sea Dragon set up a blue barrier in front of Chu Yunfan. This barrier seemed to be a simple layer, but in fact, it had infinite power. Even an ordinary Domainian’s full-powered attack would not be able to shake it off.","Under such circumstances, the Golden Roc on the other side flapped his wings, producing countless golden sword rain that swept toward the demon prince in an overwhelming manner.","Facing the joint attack of the three Supreme Youths, the demon prince was not afraid.","Instead, he kept waving the halberd in his hand, trying to destroy everything.","Boom!","In the next moment, all kinds of terrifying attacks exploded in the air. Four terrifying forces collided with each other, but before the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow and the other two could react, they were sent flying.","Even if they worked very hard and their talents and bloodlines were not inferior to the demon prince’s, the gap between their cultivation bases was enough to flatten all of this, making their efforts useless.","Spurt!","The three of them spat out blood and retreated at the same time.","At this moment, Tang Siyu, Huangfu Longhao, and the Dragon-Headed Crocodile attacked.","This time, even the other ancient prodigies of the Flying Celestials also attacked. Even though their effects might be small, they were doing their best.","Because they were all too clear that once these Supreme Youths were defeated, it would be their turn next. They had no possibility of escaping.","For a moment, a dazzling light covered everything. The sky shook violently as terrifying divine light shot into the sky."]},{"number":2323,"title":"Chapter 2323: Battle to Madness, Danger!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2323: Battle to Madness, Danger!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A terrifying collision erupted. The light that soared into the sky was extremely dazzling even in the ancient battlefield that had completely turned into an Asura battlefield.","The entire starry sky seemed to be about to collapse. The terrifying scene made people tremble in fear.","The light dissipated and everyone dispersed!","Everyone’s faces were pale. In the collision just now, they had suffered a huge loss. Blood flowed from the corners of Tang Siyu and the others’ mouths, and they looked miserable.","However, the demon prince was no longer as calm as before. A huge hole was torn in his armor, and blood flowed out.","His expression was incomparably ashen. Although he had the upper hand in that attack just now, the desperate counterattack of the crowd had injured him.","This was unprecedented.","He had underestimated the strength of the united humans.","Although their cultivation was still inferior to the demon prince, they were Supreme Youths after all. There was a difference in quantity, but there was no essential difference.","Under such circumstances, how terrifying would it be for everyone to attack with their full strength? If it was an ordinary Supreme Youth who had cultivated 5,000 or even 6,000 laws, one strike would probably be enough to heavily injure the other party, or even kill him.","Only after the demon prince cultivated 7,000 laws could he barely block it.","“You dare to hurt my noble body. Not only will I chop off your heads, but I will also grind your bones and scatter your ashes. I will extract your souls and torture them day and night to vent my hatred!” the demon prince thundered. His voice was even sharper in his anger, making it sound even colder and more terrifying.","“Stop him and drag him out until Junior Brother Chu leaves the state of enlightenment!” Huangfu Longhao said. He forcefully suppressed the surging blood essence that had been struck by this attack. This demon prince could be said to be an unprecedented powerful enemy.","It just so happened that they had yet to cultivate to the extreme at this time. Otherwise, he would not be weaker than this demon prince.","If their cultivation levels were the same, this demon prince would probably die in their hands in minutes if he dared to appear in front of them.","“Just like our ancestors, kill the devil and vindicate dao!” Chu Hongcai shouted. His entire body was emitting bursts of golden light. It was his Indestructible Sword Physique that was flashing. A terrifying sword light gushed out from his body and transformed into a huge sword that soared into the sky.","This was a terrifying power. At this moment, he had used all his strength. There was no possibility of retreating.","He cultivated the Sword Dao, so he could only advance without retreating. Even if the enemy was the most terrifying expert, he could not retreat.","Swoosh!","Chu Hongcai roared and disappeared from where he was. When he reappeared, he was already in front of the demon prince. A huge sword made of sword light had descended from the sky.","He pointed at the demon prince’s head.","“You’re courting death!” The demon prince roared and struck Chu Hongcai’s chest with his demonic claw.","Chu Hongcai spat out a mouthful of blood, but at the same time, the giant sword landed on the demon prince’s head.","Crack, crack, crack!","The giant sword cracked inch by inch, and every inch that cracked turned into a rain of light that filled the sky.","At the same time, the helmet on the demon prince’s head was cut off inch by inch.","Boom!","In the next moment, the helmet on the demon prince’s head shattered with a loud bang. The demon prince was in an extremely sorry state.","At the same time, the other attacks from the crowd arrived. The demon prince didn’t have time to chase after Chu Hongcai and was immediately drowned by the attacks from the others.","The demon prince wouldn’t care about any one of them, but they were enough to pose a fundamental threat to him.","He was in a sorry state.","“You guys are courting death!” the demon prince roared, and his angry roars shook the entire ancient city. He was badly beaten by the crowd. Although it was mostly superficial wounds, these people had injured him.","Even if these people were Supreme Youths of the same level as him, he was unwilling to admit it. He felt that this was an incomparably embarrassing matter.","Boom, boom, boom!","Loud explosions rang out, and the void trembled. In a short time, everyone had exchanged more than a hundred moves with the demon prince.","Every attack would explode into a huge mushroom cloud, shining brightly.","Very soon, those young prodigies of the Flying Celestials had already withdrawn from the battle. They were ordinary top-notch prodigies. In this kind of collision between Supreme Youths, it was already not easy for them to hold out until now.","The difference between king and emperor physiques was clearly shown at this moment.","Before them, some of the other experts of the current generation and some of the experts who were on good terms with the Flying Celestials had already withdrawn from the battle.","They were all heavily injured. The demon prince had fought to the point of madness. They were hit by the aftershock and were seriously injured. They all retreated to the side to heal their injuries. Looking at the demon prince who was being beaten up like a horse watching a lamp, they felt extremely shocked.","No wonder this demon prince had killed the other Supreme Youths so quickly.","Those Supreme Youths were scattered in different places. If they encountered such a terrifying demon prince one-on-one, wouldn’t they be easily killed and defeated one by one?","The further one cultivated, the greater the gap would be. One step at a time, one would reach the heavens!","After the ancient prodigies of the Flying Celestials withdrew from the battle, the Dragon-Headed Crocodile and the others quickly could not hold out any longer. Although they had already turned from Acquired to Innate and become Supreme Youths, they were still far from Huangfu Longhao and the others. Their cultivation levels were far apart.","At this time, they became the first batch of Supreme Youths to be eliminated.","The intense battle had left them with all kinds of wounds all over their bodies. Some of the wounds were so deep that their bones could be seen. One could imagine how shocking the attack of this demon prince was.","If they weren’t fearless and didn’t deal damage to the demon prince, they would have been killed by the demon prince.","After a while, another group had retreated. Chu Hongcai, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, Huangfu Longhao, and the Golden Roc also retreated from the battle.","They had fought to the point of madness. Their bodies were covered in blood and they had already reached their limits.","At this moment, only the strongest Tang Siyu and the Sea Dragon were left on the battlefield. After a while, even the Sea Dragon was heavily injured and was knocked out of the battlefield by the Nightmare Beast.","On the battlefield, only Tang Siyu, who was holding a green oak sword and wearing a white robe dyed red with blood, was left confronting the demon prince."]},{"number":2324,"title":"Chapter 2324: The Demon Prince’s Rage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2324: The Demon Prince’s Rage","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“D*mn it! How dare you hurt me!” the demon prince roared, unable to contain his anger.","He had thought that he had this in the bag, but who would have thought that he would be hurt by these people?","At the beginning, he had been cautious and had viewed these Supreme Youths of the Central Plains in a new light.","But now, after slaughtering several Supreme Youths of the Central Plains, he no longer held them in his eyes.","Although they were all Supreme Youths, these Supreme Youths of the Central Plains were simply too weak.","He had already instinctively forgotten that these Supreme Youths of the Central Plains had only cultivated for a short time. If they had cultivated for the same amount of time as him, they would indeed be able to compete with him.","However, the pride in his heart had already been planted and bore fruit. Now that he was suddenly stopped, it was as if he had been slapped. How could he accept it?","His eyes were fixed on Tang Siyu, who was covered in blood and in a sorry state. However, her eyes were wide open and her will was unyielding. Even when facing the demon prince, who was far stronger than her, she was not afraid at all.","“Very well. Since you want to die, I’ll fulfill your wish!” the demon prince roared, and the Nightmare Beast beneath him roared. Terrifying flames spread out. Even the Nightmare Beast’s strength was no weaker than an ordinary Domainian.","Boom!","The Nightmare Beast charged forward like a bolt of lightning. In an instant, it arrived in front of Tang Siyu from afar. The demon prince waved his halberd, wanting to split Tang Siyu in half.","At the same time, Tang Siyu burned the divine power in her body and formed a huge domain. Above her head, the phantom of a jade girl appeared. The phantom held a long sword and suddenly slashed at the demon prince.","Rumble!","The two sides exploded into the most terrifying collision, setting off endless airwaves.","Tang Siyu suddenly fell and flew backward. She kept coughing up blood. She had suffered a huge loss from the collision.","On the other side, another huge wound appeared on the demon prince’s body. His armor was opened by Tang Siyu’s sword, leaving behind a huge wound.","Although Tang Siyu’s strength was far inferior to the demon prince, there was no qualitative difference between the two sides. There was only a difference in quantity.","It was like a child holding a weapon could hurt an adult holding a weapon.","They were essentially the same. One was a divine dragon and the other was an ant.","The demon prince’s eyes were filled with anger. He had never suffered such a big loss since he started his cultivation.","Right now, there was only endless killing intent in his eyes.","He had to kill all these people in front of him before he could calm the anger in his heart.","“Demons’ Extermination!” the demon prince roared in anger and struck out with his halberd.","In an instant, the world changed color. Everyone could feel that in an instant, that strike seemed to have sucked out all the light in the world and gathered on that terrifying halberd.","This attack turned into a huge shadow of the devil. This shadow had wings on its back and its eyes were cold. Although its expression could not be seen clearly, one could feel that it had an extremely cold expression.","He looked at Tang Siyu coldly and the halberd in his hand suddenly fell down, wanting to kill Tang Siyu with a single strike.","The demon prince was truly enraged, so he did not hold back at all. His goal was to kill Tang Siyu.","Boom!","As this attack landed, the burst of light turned into a rain of light that covered the sky and covered all the light.","Just as everyone was thinking that Tang Siyu could not hold out any longer, a golden figure appeared on Tang Siyu at the critical moment and wrapped her up.","It transformed into an energy armor.","Tang Siyu had just crushed a scroll in her hand, and this golden figure was the product of the scroll.","This was the trump card that the Elder Princess had left for Tang Siyu to use for self-defense. It was just that Tang Siyu had never used it before, but now, she had no choice but to use it.","“Die!” The demon prince let out a sharp howl. His eyes were bloodshot, and he looked like a terrifying monster.","Tang Siyu stood up. With the protection of the phantom, her aura soared and she was now on par with the demon prince.","Tang Siyu held her sword and charged at the demon prince.","Kaboom!","Everyone heard a huge explosion. The sky was shattered by such a confrontation, especially in the place where the two sides were fighting. The sky was dark.","In the distance, Huangfu Longhao and the others wanted to help, but they couldn’t because they were heavily injured. They could only choose to hide in the ancient city and activate the ancient city’s defensive barrier.","Although there was no way to block an attack of this level head-on, it could still block the aftershock of the battle.","Tang Siyu took one step at a time. She kept swinging the sword in her hand. Her sword technique kept on being displayed. Every time she displayed it, it became more and more exquisite.","Everyone could see that Tang Siyu had broken through on the battlefield!","The demon prince opposite her naturally noticed that Tang Siyu seemed to have comprehended something in the battle.","Therefore, at this moment, her strength was rising. If she did not die today, Tang Siyu’s strength would advance by leaps and bounds in a short time.","The more he thought about it, the angrier the demon prince got. First, there was Chu Yunfan, and then there was Tang Siyu. They all treated him as a whetstone—as if he was a stepping stone. They actually dared to fight on the battlefield so casually while comprehending.","Chu Yunfan, in particular, had entered a state of enlightenment.","Just thinking about it was depressing enough. Even if it was him, if he wanted to enter this state of enlightenment, it was something that could only be encountered by chance and not sought after. It was considered a fortuitous encounter.","Thinking of this, the killing intent in his heart grew stronger. He absolutely could not let these two survive. Otherwise, they would be a huge threat.","Thinking of this, the demon prince put down his killing intent toward Chu Yunfan. Instead, he crazily pursued and attacked Tang Siyu, using all kinds of terrifying methods.","Divine powers, martial arts, he had a perfect experience. He was simply invincible.","Spurt!","After a long battle, Tang Siyu spat out a mouthful of blood and was forced to retreat once again. Her phantom was reduced to a rain of light after a collision.","The trump card that the Elder Princess had left her had a time limit. Without a doubt, the time was up, and it was the most critical moment."]},{"number":2325,"title":"Chapter 2325: Breakthrough, One Hit, Heavy Injury","paragraphs":["Chapter 2325: Breakthrough, One Hit, Heavy Injury","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Hahaha, let’s see what other tricks you have. In front of absolute strength, all tricks are meaningless!” The demon prince burst into laughter as if he could already see the scene of killing his opponent.","He had been fighting all the way until now, and he had been forced to use all his trump cards. If he could not kill the other party now, he would really lose face.","“Die!” The demon prince cackled and the halberd in his hand shot toward Tang Siyu like a long dragon.","However, just as the halberd was about to hit Tang Siyu, a large hand grabbed the halberd at the critical moment. The air wave wrapped around the halberd disappeared without a trace in an instant.","Everyone took a closer look. The owner of this hand was actually Chu Yunfan.","At the critical moment, Chu Yunfan finally broke free from the state of enlightenment.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan looked extremely mysterious. He didn’t look any different from before, but there seemed to be a fundamental difference.","Everyone knew that Chu Yunfan had changed, but no one knew what it was.","However, there was no doubt that Chu Yunfan had come out of seclusion and escaped from the state of enlightenment at the right time.","Everyone could see how terrifying the demon prince was. Even if they joined forces, they were no match for him.","Their aptitude was not inferior to the demon prince, but they were one step slower in cultivation. That was completely one step slower.","Just this step alone had made the difference between their combat strength and the demon prince’s as big as the difference between heaven and earth.","Chu Yunfan, who had also cultivated 7,000 laws, could compete with him.","They finally had hope!","“You dare to stop me?” the demon prince said coldly. He was clearly just a little bit away from killing Tang Siyu, but now he was stopped by someone. His heart was filled with anger.","“So what if I stop you? I want to kill you!” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","Although he had been in a state of enlightenment, he had a trace of his primordial spirit outside. However, he was unwilling to make a move unless it was the most critical moment.","Because just now, when the battle was at its most intense, it was also the most critical time for him to comprehend the Dao.","He couldn’t control this state of enlightenment in the past, but his current cultivation and level couldn’t be mentioned in the same breath as before. Even if he suddenly fell into enlightenment on the battlefield, he could forcefully break out of the state of enlightenment.","This proved that his cultivation level had advanced by leaps and bounds.","He didn’t gain much from the series of comprehension. He only managed to deduce the 7000th domain concept from the original 7000th to the 7001st.","However, for Chu Yunfan, it was like breaking through a barrier that had troubled him for a long time.","Even if he had only broken through by one law, even if he had only taken that one step forward, the difference was still different. A breakthrough was a breakthrough, and no breakthrough was no breakthrough.","There was a world of difference between a breakthrough and not breaking through.","The difference of one path was the difference between existence and non-existence.","This was what Chu Yunfan had always been pursuing. With his current cultivation, he could naturally try to advance to the King Stage.","However, that was not Chu Yunfan’s goal. Not only did he want to break through to the King Stage, but his future goal was to become an Emperor or even a God. Therefore, the stronger his foundation was, the higher the probability of becoming a God in the future.","However, he had never been able to find the opportunity to take that step. This opportunity came too suddenly. Even he did not expect it to come on the battlefield.","That was why he suddenly entered the state of enlightenment and asked Tang Siyu and the others to stall for time for him.","Tang Siyu and the others understood Chu Yunfan’s intention and risked their lives to stop the demon prince for him, buying him the most critical time.","And now, after completing the breakthrough, although it was not perfect, this rare state of enlightenment was interrupted.","However, after solving the problem of having or not having, the remaining problem was time and accumulation.","“Kill me? You?” The demon prince’s eyes were bloodshot. His eyes had already turned red from killing, so he did not notice anything different about Chu Yunfan.","“Demons’ Extermination!” the demon prince roared, and an overwhelming demonic aura condensed on his body. In the air, it condensed into a demon phantom. This demon phantom suppressed the heavens and was invincible.","This was the Supreme Demon God that the demons worshipped, the legendary demon god.","Everyone in the demons believed in the Supreme Demon God. The cultivation techniques they cultivated also came from the Supreme Demon God. It was even rumored that this race was created by the Supreme Demon God.","And many of the demons’ martial arts divine arts could condense into a Supreme Demon God when cultivated to the extreme.","The Supreme Demon God looked at Chu Yunfan coldly and then slapped down.","Chu Yunfan looked at the scene in front of him expressionlessly. If it was the real legendary Supreme Demon God, Chu Yunfan would have turned around and left without saying a word.","However, this was only a phantom. How could it make him afraid?","Chu Yunfan allowed the palm to land. The sky cracked inch by inch as if it was the end of the world.","Suddenly, at that critical moment, a terrifying aura was released from his body. Endless black flames were formed around his body and burned the Supreme Demon God phantom.","In just a few moments, the Supreme Demon God phantom was burned into nothingness.","“What is it? What flame is this?” The demon prince was a little stunned. Ever since his martial arts conception was able to summon the Supreme Demon God phantom, he had never encountered such a situation.","Metal, wood, water, fire, and earth. No matter what kind of divine arts or martial arts, they were unable to harm the Supreme Demon God phantom.","This was the first time he had encountered such a situation!","“It’s your turn to die!” Chu Yunfan shouted and immediately arrived in front of the demon prince. Then, he simply slapped out with his palm. In an instant, the sky was filled with lightning.","The lightning turned into a long sword that pierced through everything.","Spurt!","The demon prince was unable to block this terrifying sword at all. He was pierced through on the spot and blood sprayed out.","The demon prince’s lower abdomen disappeared, looking extremely ferocious.","This was because he had managed to dodge the attack at the critical moment. Otherwise, this attack would have pierced through his heart and caused him to die."]},{"number":2326,"title":"Chapter 2326: Reborn From Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 2326: Reborn From Death","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan’s simple attack had severely injured the demon prince.","The demon prince frantically retreated. The Nightmare Beast under him was also shocked and could not help but cry out. Although the Nightmare Beast was in beast form, in reality, its intelligence was very high, not inferior to humans.","It was only used as a mount by the demon prince.","If not for this, he could also become a big shot among the demons.","Now that he had seen Chu Yunfan’s terrifying attack, he felt extremely uneasy.","Things were not as simple as he had imagined. The demon prince gritted his teeth and tried to recover from his injuries. The physique of the demons was much stronger than ordinary creatures. He was a Supreme Youth of the demons and might become the Demon Emperor in the future.","A normal injury would have healed in an instant, but the part of his lower abdomen that Chu Yunfan had blasted away showed no signs of recovery.","This was the most terrifying part.","Opposite him, Chu Yunfan’s expression was indifferent, but his eyes were filled with killing intent as if he could kill the demon prince on the spot in the next second.","“Run!” The demon prince had finally made up his mind. The Nightmare Beast under him was telepathically connected, and it instantly turned around to escape.","“It’s a little too late to leave now.” In the blink of an eye, a terrifying aura swept out from Chu Yunfan like a gale. In the next moment, a huge domain appeared in the air and enveloped the demon prince in an instant.","Under such circumstances, it was impossible for the demon prince to escape even if he wanted to. In this domain, Chu Yufnan was the master of the laws, and he was the god of the world.","The demon prince’s speed had dropped to an astonishing speed. Even though the Nightmare Beast was struggling, it could not escape. It was as if it had fallen into a swamp.","“You’re going too far!”","The demon prince finally realized that Chu Yunfan would never let him escape. He was shocked and furious.","At the critical moment, all his courage surged out. He turned around and released his domain to resist Chu Yunfan’s domain.","The only thing that could resist a domain was a domain. There was no other possibility.","Without a domain, even Chu Yunfan, who was invincible in the Divine Treasure Stage, would find it difficult to defeat Sanjue, who was at the bottom of the Domain Stage.","A Domainian without a Domain was at most similar to a Divine Treasure. Even if they were stronger than a Divine Treasure, there was no difference in essence.","But soon, something that terrified the demon prince happened. The domain around the demon prince cracked inch by inch, turning into a rain of light that filled the sky.","“How can there be such a huge difference?!” the demon prince shouted in fear.","They both had 7,000 laws, but why was his domain so weak in front of Chu Yunfan’s domain?","The demon prince collapsed.","The difference in strength between the two sides was clear at a glance.","“Do you still not understand? The difference between you and me is just this big!” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","Even the original him was much stronger than the current demon prince, not to mention that after he took that step, even if it was only an additional law, the essence was completely different.","“Impossible!” the demon prince roared, and his demonic voice filled Chu Yunfan’s ears. Demonic energy was released from the demon prince’s entire body, and demonic power surged.","But in the next second, Chu Yunfan’s sword light swept across the sky and pierced through the demon prince’s head.","Boom!","The demon prince’s head exploded and he died a tragic death.","The difference in strength between the two sides had reached a certain level. Even if the demon prince wanted to struggle, there was nothing he could do.","Chu Yunfan collected the demon prince’s corpse and watered it on the Brahma Tree as nourishment.","Soon, everyone’s injuries recovered. However, compared to the beginning, they were undoubtedly in a sorry state.","Seeing Chu Yunfan kill the demon prince, everyone heaved a sigh of relief. However, their expressions continued to be solemn.","Because in the distance, the demon army was surrounding them.","This time, in order to encircle and annihilate these ancient prodigies of the Central Plains, the demons had sent one army after another, and it was unknown how many terrifying experts they had sent.","In the distance, one could see the great battles erupting. The demon army was very terrifying, and it could attack cities, but these ancient prodigies of the Central Plains were not completely helpless.","The weakest among them were in the Divine Treasure Stage. In fact, the ancient prodigies were basically Domainians. Any one of them could easily sweep through an army, and every single one of them could run amok on a huge battlefield.","Even though they had yet to reach their peak, these ancient prodigies had already displayed their terrifying side.","As far as Chu Yunfan could see, many ancient prodigies were surrounded and killed by the demon army, but there were also some ancient prodigies who were led by the Supreme Youths and charged all the way.","Even among the demons, there were only a few experts like the demon prince. Most of the demon experts, even if they had already entered the Domain Stage, would find it difficult to stop those ancient prodigies. Even if their cultivation was higher than the young prodigies, they would still find it difficult to be their match.","The demons had to rely on an army to encircle and annihilate these terrifying monsters.","Faced with the sudden encirclement of the demon army, these ancient prodigies soon began to gather. They were no longer fighting alone.","Everyone could see that this demon army was going to divide and kill them.","The combined strength of these ancient prodigies was naturally far greater than one plus one equals two.","A group of ancient prodigies working together could kill a demon army.","However, as time passed, more and more demons gathered. Even with the Supreme Youths overseeing the situation, the situation began to become more and more difficult.","“The only thing we can do now is to kill our way out from that crack. Otherwise, we will be trapped here sooner or later!” Huangfu Longhao pointed at the huge crack in the distance.","The crack tore apart the entire ancient battlefield’s sky.","The demon army was pouring into the ancient battlefield continuously. It could be said to be a land of death.","However, even if it was a dead end, it had become the only place for everyone to escape.","Because the other places were sealed by the barrier, there was no possibility of escape.","The crack was the only place where they could escape to.","Chu Yunfan looked at the huge crack and shouted, “Fight to the death! Charge!”"]},{"number":2327,"title":"Chapter 2327: Covering the Rear","paragraphs":["Chapter 2327: Covering the Rear","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the sky, thousands of streams of light flew toward the crack in the void.","Obviously, Chu Yunfan and the others weren’t the only ones who had thought of this. The other ancient prodigies and many experts of the present age had also thought of this.","Staying on the ancient battlefield might seem safe, but it was actually even more dangerous. That was because they would be killed by the endless fiend army.","Everyone could see that the demons intended to kill them here. Staying here would only lead to death.","In the depths of the crack, the demon army was preparing to charge into the ancient battlefield under the leadership of many demon experts.","They did not expect these ancient prodigies to be so bold that they would charge out through the black rift.","Almost instinctively, these demon armies attacked one after another, blocking these ancient prodigies.","A great battle instantly erupted!","Chu Yunfan and the others rushed toward the demon army.","In fact, the demon army was everywhere in this black crack, and it was impossible to distinguish between front and back.","In order to kill these ancient prodigies, the demons had gathered too many elite troops this time.","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","At the same time as they charged into the demon army, a few lightning arrows swept across the sky, aiming straight at the Domainians in the demon army.","The domains of the few Domainians from the demons were pierced through by the arrow. Their bodies were sent flying and landed on the ancient battlefield, stirring up a huge wave of dust.","After the Domainian was killed by the arrow, Tang Siyu and the others also unleashed their domains.","In the domain of a Domainian, unless one was a Domainian, they would only be slaughtered.","Even if the Divine Treasures wanted to organize a strong resistance, they would still be quickly beaten up by Chu Yunfan. There was no way to organize a decent resistance.","In just a moment, the entire demon army was killed by Chu Yunfan and the others.","Everyone and everything was in chaos.","They couldn’t catch up at all!","Tang Siyu and the others were panting heavily. It was only a short time, but it had consumed one-third of their divine power.","Countless arrows were being shot at them almost every second. They could ignore one or two arrows, but each arrow could pierce through a mountain. The accumulated power was shocking.","This was a battlefield, and they were in danger of dying.","On a real battlefield, Domainians could roam freely, but they could also be surrounded and killed by an army.","However, before everyone could catch their breath, another demon army charged over.","“Kill them!” Chu Yunfan shouted and charged forward. In an instant, he had already killed his way into the army.","They used the same trick, killing the most threatening demon experts first. Although the remaining demon army was terrifying, it could not stop Chu Yunfan and the others from breakthrough.","In the black crack, Chu Yunfan had pierced through countless demon armies. Whenever he saw the demon army, Chu Yunfan would attack immediately, causing chaos everywhere.","Behind Chu Yunfan and the others, many of the ancient prodigies saw the battle. Their eyes lit up and they chose to follow Chu Yunfan and escape.","Although there was a demon army in front of them, without the obstruction and command of top-notch experts, the threat of the demon army was reduced by several levels.","Soon, with Chu Yunfan and the others as the arrowheads, a huge charging battle formation was formed.","The members of this charging formation were simply too terrifying. If it wasn’t for the fact that they were in a dead land without any reinforcements, they would have been able to obtain an endless supply of protection and reinforcements on an ordinary battlefield.","It was enough to pierce through the entire battlefield and turn it upside down.","After successfully defeating another demon army, Chu Yunfan and the others quickly fled to the edge of the crack. They could already see the boundless universe behind the crack.","This was the periphery of the ancient battlefield. They were about to break out of the ancient battlefield.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan felt a terrifying aura lock onto him.","This feeling was like when he was still an ordinary person and encountered a ferocious beast. It instantly made his hair stand on end.","“A King!”","Chu Yunfan immediately reacted. Ordinary Domainians were no match for him. Even a Supreme Youth who had cultivated 7,000 laws could not withstand a single blow from him, just like the demon prince.","It was not enough to pose such a terrifying threat to him.","It could only be a King Stage expert!","“No, it’s not a King. A King is much more terrifying than this!”","Chu Yunfan immediately denied this possibility. If it was a King, even a finger could easily injure him.","As for the others, they would probably be killed instantly.","The difference in strength between the King Stage and the Domain Stage was simply heaven and earth.","It was even greater than the difference between the Domain Stage and the Divine Treasure Stage.","Even in ancient times, Kings were the giants of a region, vassals under the command of the Emperors.","In the long era after the ancient era, as long as a King appeared, they would definitely be able to suppress an era.","At most, this person who just arrived could only be considered a half-King!","This person had one foot in the King Stage, but he still had one foot in the Domain Stage.","However, even though he was only at the half-King, his strength far exceeded that of an ordinary Domainian. At the very least, he was not someone that Chu Yunfan and the others could compare to.","“We’re being targeted!” Chu Yunfan’s expression was solemn. The terrifying aura was getting closer and closer at an astonishing speed.","Soon, even Tang Siyu and the others sensed that the terrifying aura was approaching.","Everyone’s expression changed drastically. They had finally escaped with great difficulty. Could it be that they were going to be assassinated here?","“I’ll stay behind to cover the rear. You guys leave quickly!” Chu Yunfan said solemnly.","“Junior Chu, I’ll stay behind to cover the rear. You’re the future hope of our sect, and we can’t lose you here!” Huangfu Longhao stood up.","Chu Yunfan was touched. Huangfu Longhao’s magnanimity was truly displayed at this moment.","However, he shook his head and said, “Other than me, no one can stay behind to cover the rear. The person chasing after us is a half-King. With your strength, you can’t even stop him. Therefore, no matter who stays behind to cover the rear, it’s the same as no one covering the rear!”"]},{"number":2328,"title":"Chapter 2328: Fighting the Demon Dragon King","paragraphs":["Chapter 2328: Fighting the Demon Dragon King","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan was very clear that behind that terrifying aura was a powerful half-King.","With Tang Siyu and the others’ strength, it was almost impossible for them to contend against such an existence.","They would even be killed in one move. Even if they stayed behind to cover the rear, they would not be able to do so.","Tang Siyu looked at Chu Yunfan and said, “I won’t leave you alone to cover the rear. If you want to cover the rear, we’ll stay together!”","“Alright, then we’ll stay behind to cover the rear. You guys hurry up and leave!”","Chu Yunfan immediately made a decision. He didn’t have time to argue with Tang Siyu.","The rest of the people immediately made a decision. If what Chu Yunfan said was true, then it was indeed not something that could be solved by staying behind to cover the rear.","Almost instantly, everyone began to rush toward the distance.","Not long after the others left, a terrifying figure covered the sky and the sun. It was a thousand-meter-long demonic dragon, and its huge figure covered the starry sky.","The demonic dragon glanced coldly at the two tiny humans standing in front of him.","“Humans, aren’t you afraid of death? You’re quite brave to stay behind to cover the rear!” the demonic dragon said as he looked at Chu Yunfan coldly.","“And who are you?” Chu Yunfan looked at the demonic dragon in front of him.","The demonic dragon slowly opened its mouth and answered, “I am the great Demon Dragon King!”","At this time, the Demon Dragon King looked at Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu with a faint smile on his face. “This will give them time to regroup, but do you think that would be useful? Outside is the boundless starry sky. There are many troops searching for them. They can’t escape!”","Demon Dragon King seemed to see through Chu Yunfan’s thoughts at a glance, but he didn’t care at all. In his eyes, these people were just meat on the chopping board.","Even if Chu Yunfan delayed him for a while, he could easily catch up to Huangfu Longhao and the others who had already escaped.","“Demon Dragon King?” Chu Yunfan’s expression was calm. The other party already knew his plan, so there was no need for him to hide it. Moreover, this was not a conspiracy, but an open one.","Both sides knew about the conspiracy, but neither side took it seriously.","“I remember that there was once an ancestor of the demon dragons that wreaked havoc in the starry skies. Later, when he invaded the Central Plains, he was killed by the roc. It should be your race, right?” Chu Yunfan grinned.","At the mention of this, Demon Dragon King’s huge dragon face instantly turned cold.","That was a disgrace to the Demon Dragons. Their race was known as a powerful race among the demons, but in the end, when they invaded the Central Plains, they were killed one-on-one by the roc.","It was simply a great humiliation.","Since then, the Demon Dragons’ reputation was not as great as before, and they were no longer as powerful as before.","Since then, the Demon Dragons had endured hardships for generations, but they still had no way to recover to the strength of the immemorial era.","After all, the difference between an emperor and a force was like the difference between heaven and earth.","“Human, you have successfully angered me. Very well, I will kill you and this woman beside you, and tear your corpses into pieces!” the Demon Dragon King roared angrily as if it was provoked by two ants.","In fact, in his heart, Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu were no different from ants.","But these ants dared to provoke him. This was simply intolerable.","As he spoke, the Demon Dragon King turned into a middle-aged man in black.","The man’s eyes were cold as he stared at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu felt as if they had fallen into an ice cave. The terrifying pressure of the Demon Dragon King swept over them.","In an instant, it enveloped the two of them.","They understood that this was a sign that Demon Dragon King was about to make a move.","Suddenly, the Demon Dragon King made his move. He did not make any unnecessary movements, but simply grabbed out with his large hand.","The hand turned into a huge dragon claw in the air and fell fiercely in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","Boom!","As the huge dragon claw descended, every inch of the sky was crushed as if the sky was being torn apart.","In a fragile space like the ancient battlefield, even a Divine Treasure could easily shatter the void with a punch, let alone this terrifying Demonic Dragon King who was a half-King.","Chu Yunfan formed a seal, and the Mountain River Cauldron instantly appeared above his head, blocking the demonic claw.","Clang!","With a loud sound of metal clashing, this huge dragon claw was blocked.","The dragon claw did not even scratch the Mountain River Cauldron. Instead, it only created sparks that filled the sky.","“Hmm? What cauldron is this?” The Demon Dragon King’s interest was piqued. He knew how terrifying his attacks were. Even a Domainian’s life-bound magical treasure would be easily torn apart if he were to grab it.","However, this cauldron easily blocked his attack.","Just this alone was already very extraordinary.","Greed flashed in his eyes.","“Hahaha, the Heavens have blessed me. He sent me a good treasure!” The Demon Dragon King drooled. Clearly, he already regarded the Mountain River Cauldron as his own.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was solemn. The Demon Dragon King’s casual attack just now had made him feel a huge pressure.","Without the protection of the Mountain River Cauldron, even he would have suffered a great loss.","“Hahahaha!” Demon Dragon King laughed loudly. With a loud roar, he clawed down again.","Bam!","The strike landed on the Mountain River Cauldron, almost breaking the light curtain around it.","Chu Yunfan grunted and felt that all the divine power in his body had stopped for a moment.","The power of this attack could be seen from this.","However, Chu Yunfan did not retreat because he knew that this was not the time to retreat. Otherwise, with the speed of the Demon Dragon King, he would soon catch up to Huangfu Longhao and the others.","Then there would be no point for him to stay behind to cover the rear.","Seeing that his attack failed to break through the Mountain River Cauldron’s defense, the Demon Dragon King was instantly enraged. He immediately transformed back into his original form, the terrifying beast that was 1,000 meters long.","The Demon Dragon King opened his bloody mouth and spat out terrifying flames, turning into a terrifying sea of fire that swept toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan immediately pulled Tang Siyu and began to flee frantically. The wings of lightning on his back displayed astonishing speed. Every time his body swayed, it was as if he had teleported far away."]},{"number":2329,"title":"Chapter 2329: Escape","paragraphs":["Chapter 2329: Escape","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan’s speed soared to the extreme, but the Demon Dragon King behind him was not slow either. Although Chu Yunfan’s lightning wings and the speed his Prismatic Traveller were amazing, the speed of the Demon Dragon King was even more amazing.","His cultivation was much stronger than Chu Yunfan’s, and he was able to catch up to Chu Yunfan with his profound cultivation.","“Roar!” The Demon Dragon King let out a huge roar, and kept spitting out flames or pitch-black lightning power from his mouth.","He also controlled the law divine power of fire and lightning, and at this moment, he used it alternately.","Any one of them could severely injure an ordinary Domainian, or even kill them.","However, Chu Yunfan had the Mountain River Cauldron above his head.","The Demon Dragon King was unable to break through the defense of the Mountain River Cauldron and seriously injure Chu Yunfan.","The furious Demon Dragon King kept roaring and chasing after him.","Both parties rushed into the starry sky.","As expected, just as Demon Dragon King had said, the demon army was still rushing over from afar. To the ancient prodigies, even if they managed to kill their way out of the ancient battlefield, they would still have to face the demon army’s pursuit and interception.","The demon army also saw Chu Yunfan and wanted to stop him, but before they could form their formation, Chu Yunfan had already passed by.","In the vast starry sky, they were unable to seal off everything like they did in the ancient battlefield.","“Go inside the Mountain River Diagram and wait for me!”","Chu Yunfan immediately put Tang Siyu into the Mountain River Diagram, while he frantically used the lightning wings and the Prismatic Traveller.","Without Tang Siyu, Chu Yunfan’s speed increased by another level.","However, he still did not shake off the Demon Dragon King. Or rather, he did not intend to shake off the Demon Dragon King at all. This was the only way to stall the Demon Dragon King and prevent him from chasing after Huangfu Longhao and the others.","“Time, time, just a little more time is enough!” Chu Yunfan said.","Boom!","The Demon Dragon King’s terrifying lightning bolt fell, but it was blocked by the Mountain River Cauldron above his head. However, at the same time, Chu Yunfan’s divine power was consumed by one-tenth.","In order to maintain the barrier of the Mountain River Cauldron, Chu Yunfan had done his best.","However, the Demon Dragon King was still chasing after him. Not only was it because Chu Yunfan had embarrassed him and even dared to provoke him, but it was also because the Mountain River Cauldron that Chu Yunfan had revealed made him envious.","Even his full-strength attack could not break through the magic artifact. It could be said to be a defensive treasure. If he obtained this treasure, he would probably even dare to arm-wrestle with a King.","At the very least, he would be invincible.","Just like Chu Yunfan now, he was very troublesome and had no way to break the barrier of the Mountain River Cauldron.","He was determined to obtain the Mountain River Cauldron, and he would definitely not let it go.","As for where Tang Siyu went, he didn’t care. His only target was Chu Yunfan.","The two parties flew across through space, and no one knew where they had flown to. The commotion caused by the two parties even alarmed this part of the universe.","It had been a long time since this part of the universe had been so lively. Usually, it was deathly quiet here.","Before the creatures in this area could appear, both sides had already crossed the entire meteorite fragment belt. Both sides were equally fast.","Suddenly, Demon Dragon King burst into laughter. “Hahaha, let’s see where you can run to!”","Chu Yunfan saw a huge military camp in the distance.","The endless demonic energy formed a huge demonic dragon that was entrenched in the military camp. However, ordinary people could not see it. Only people with profound cultivation like Chu Yunfan could see it.","It was the demon army spirit.","The Demon Dragon King was overjoyed. Chu Yunfan walking in this direction was equivalent to walking into a trap and walking into a dead end.","With his speed, coupled with the encirclement of the experts in the demon army camp, even if Chu Yunfan had the ability to reach the heavens, he could forget about getting out of here.","‘D*mn it!’ Chu Yunfan immediately realized that something was wrong. ‘However, the delay should be long enough. Even if the Demon Dragon King wants to chase after them, it’s too late!’","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan disappeared from where he was in the next moment.","“Where is he?” In the next moment, the huge Demon Dragon King appeared at the place where Chu Yunfan had disappeared. He did not react in time. He was about to surround Chu Yunfan, but why was he still gone?","However, the Demon Dragon King was the king of the Demon Dragons after all. It was naturally impossible for him to be ignorant.","He immediately understood that Chu Yunfan had entered a portable space. Tang Siyu had not disappeared just like that.","However, he thought of a countermeasure almost immediately.","“I don’t care if you’re hiding in an alternate dimension. I want you to show yourself!”","The Demon Dragon King roared and took a deep breath. He turned into devil flames that engulfed everything.","In an instant, the area within a radius of a thousand miles had been turned into a sea of fire.","A sinister smile appeared on the Demon Dragon King’s face. He knew how to deal with this situation.","Although Chu Yunfan had entered an alternate dimension, it was impossible for the spatial artifact he carried with him to enter the alternate dimension as well.","It was definitely still here. It was just that he did not know how small it had become, so there was no way to find it.","However, under his indiscriminately burning flames, even if Chu Yunfan had a spatial magic tool, it would still be burned by the endless flames. At that time, it would still explode.","He relied on this method to deal with those who had adopted this strategy, and it had worked every time.","“Using this move in front of me is simply showing off in front of an expert!” the Demonic Dragon said coldly. His divine sense covered this space. As long as Chu Yunfan revealed a trace, he would be discovered.","However, what he never expected was that Chu Yunfan, who he thought would be burned to ashes by his flames, did not show up.","“How is that possible? Where did he go?!” the Demon Dragon King roared angrily, especially when he thought he had already won, but Chu Yunfan had escaped.","He couldn’t even capture Chu Yunfan’s companion. It was a great humiliation.","“I don’t believe you won’t come out!” the Demon Dragon King roared in anger. Endless lightning erupted from his body, turning into a sea of lightning that drowned this area."]},{"number":2330,"title":"Chapter 2330: Three Years, Secluded Cultivation","paragraphs":["Chapter 2330: Three Years, Secluded Cultivation","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Demon Dragon King’s fury erupted. All kinds of lightning and flames turned into an ocean that flooded the nearby space. Even if Chu Yunfan hid in a spatial artifact, he would not be able to withstand it and would explode in the void.","This was a common method used by many people to deal with spatial artifacts. Generally speaking, the grade of spatial artifacts was not very high, and it was easy to be destroyed by this method.","An indiscriminate attack!","However, Chu Yunfan’s Mountain River Diagram far surpassed the Demon Dragon King’s knowledge. It was a portable dao artifact refined by an Emperor, so it was not something the Demon Dragon King could easily break.","Even if he had already stepped into the King Stage with one foot, it would be useless even if both of his feet stepped in, let alone one foot.","“Roar!”","The Demon Dragon King waited for a day and a night, but Chu Yunfan still didn’t come out. He was furious.","Inside the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu were each holding a bowl of shaved ice as they watched the Demon Dragon King roar outside. His terrifying divine power drowned everything.","He stared at the starry sky in front of him. At this point, he had no reason to retreat.","“Forget it, don’t bother about him. It looks like he’s going to stay nearby for a long time!”","Chu Yunfan smiled faintly, not putting the Demon Dragon King in his eyes. If the Demon Dragon King managed to break the Mountain River Diagram, it would be a big joke.","“Let’s seize the time to cultivate. I feel that this matter is really serious. A storm is about to come!” Chu Yunfan said.","Tang Siyu nodded in agreement. With a solemn expression on her face, she said, “I don’t think the demons are just targeting the ancient battlefield. Otherwise, the reinforcements from the Central Plains would have arrived long ago. But we haven’t seen any reinforcements yet. This is enough to explain the problem!”","Chu Yunfan nodded. There was no doubt about the importance of these ancient prodigies to the various factions of the Central Plains.","It was not only Grand Xia. The demi-humans, the marine folks, the Hus, and the barbarians all had ancient prodigies in the ancient battlefield.","Even if the reinforcements of the Grand Xia had been stopped, and the demi-humans, marine folks, the Hus, and barbarians hadn’t arrived, it was most likely that something had happened in the Central Plains.","However, he was currently in the cosmos, and there was no way to contact the Central Plains.","Even now, although he was safe in the Mountain River Diagram, he had lost contact with the outside world.","“It’s useless to worry about these things now. The most important thing is to increase our strength!”","Chu Yunfan finished the shaved ice in big mouthfuls and then immediately began to cultivate and comprehend.","He had already taken this step and reached 7,001 laws. Now was the time for him to advance by leaps and bounds.","The two of them did not say anything and went back to their cultivation. Chu Yunfan was charging toward 10,000 laws while Tang Siyu was charging toward 5,000 laws, reaching the peak of the Domain Stage that belonged to the Supreme Youths.","Time passed in the blink of an eye in this intense cultivation.","In the blink of an eye, three years had passed silently.","The Demon Dragon King, who was guarding outside, had left. He had left two years ago.","Although he did return halfway, seemingly wanting to catch Chu Yunfan off guard.","Unexpectedly, Chu Yunfan had no intention of coming out. Instead, he fell into seclusion.","After several attempts, the Demon Dragon King had no choice but to give up. It had been a full year since he had appeared.","Even though it was burning with anger, the Demon Dragon King could only admit defeat. It thought that it could easily kill Chu Yunfan, but who would have thought that it would be played by Chu Yunfan.","In the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan suddenly opened his eyes. At this moment, Chu Yunfan looked pale and emaciated. He no longer had his original handsome appearance.","Opposite him, Tang Siyu also looked sallow and emaciated.","This was the result of the two of them cultivating for three years. They were constantly constructing new domains, and these new domains were constantly absorbing their vitality.","It made the two of them look sallow and emaciated as if they would be blown down by a gust of wind in the next moment.","The two of them looked at each other and could not help but laugh out loud.","Especially Tang Siyu, who was smiling happily, completely ignoring the fact that she was already skin and bones.","“Hahaha, if the people outside see us like this, I’m afraid they’ll be shocked!” Chu Yunfan laughed out loud.","The life force in his body had been sucked out too much.","Even a powerhouse like him could not create something out of thin air. If the energy he needed for cultivation could not be supplemented by the outside world, he could only obtain it from his own body.","This was the reason why many people would have an epiphany overnight and their bodies would collapse when they ascended.","It was because too much vitality had been consumed.","Taking one step at a time was much safer than a sudden epiphany.","“We need to find a place to replenish our life force. Otherwise, we won’t be able to meet anyone in this state!”","Tang Siyu finally remembered that she looked unsightly at the moment.","“There’s a demon camp nearby. Watch me blend in!”","Chu Yunfan sneered. He formed a seal and his entire person changed instantly. He was no longer as weak and emaciated as before.","Instead, he had turned into a tall demon with scales all over his body and wings on his ribs.","“Wait for me here. Don’t come out!”","After Chu Yunfan finished his instructions, he disappeared from the Mountain River Diagram.","When he reappeared, he was in the boundless starry sky of the universe.","This was a deathly silence in the starry sky of this universe. There was nothing that was strangled. The meteorite fragments and other things that floated here before had completely turned into nothingness under the Demon Dragon King’s anger.","In the distance, a huge demon camp appeared in front of Chu Yunfan.","Above the demon camp, terrifying demonic energy faintly formed a shadow, guarding this military camp.","When Chu Yunfan’s demon form passed through the military gate, the terrifying phantom looked down, but did not find anything unusual.","Chu Yunfan knew that this was the spirit of this military camp. Only an elite army could form an army spirit.","An army with or without an army spirit could be said to have a world of difference in combat strength. They were simply not on the same level.","Even if it was the original team, they might display two completely different strengths.","The entire demon camp was noisy. From time to time, elite troops would come to patrol, but they could not find anything different about Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan easily approached the treasure vault of the demon camp.a"]},{"number":2331,"title":"Chapter 2331: Blasting Open the Treasure Vault","paragraphs":["Chapter 2331: Blasting Open the Treasure Vault","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Rather than calling this camp a stronghold, it would be better to say that it had already become an incomparably huge city because of the many years it had been stationed.","And now, in front of Chu Yunfan was the treasure vault of this demon city.","As soon as Chu Yunfan approached, a powerful aura locked onto him. A demon expert flew out and blocked Chu Yunfan. He shouted, “Who are you? This is an important place in the military camp. You can’t get close!”","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at him. He flipped his palm, and a terrifying sword light was formed. In an instant, it turned into a shocking sword light and slashed at the demon.","This demon was a Divine Treasure, but who would have thought that he would be so vulnerable when facing Chu Yunfan and be killed with a single sword strike?","Splatter!","Blood splattered everywhere.","This demon died without a burial place.","“How dare you! Let’s capture him first and ask him what his purpose is!”","“Kill him!”","“Catch him!”","For a moment, a series of terrifying screeches came from the surroundings of the treasure vault. The demons who were cultivating in the void appeared one after another.","There were actually dozens of terrifying demons.","The strongest among them was a Domainian who had already condensed 5,000 laws, while the weakest was at the peak of the Divine Treasure Stage.","It could be said that more than half of the demons in this military camp had gathered here.","It was obvious how much the demons cared about this treasure vault.","“There are so many demons. Could it be that there’s something good among them that I don’t know about?” Chu Yunfan’s face revealed a puzzled expression.","This was because he knew very well that one or two Divine Treasures would be enough for an ordinary treasure vault. In fact, having a Domainian guarding it was more important than anything else.","The demons advocated attack and destruction. To them, if they wanted to improve themselves in a short time, they could only do so through endless battles.","Very few were willing to guard a treasure vault.","However, there were so many masters around this treasure vault. This obviously violated common sense and soon attracted Chu Yunfan’s opponent.","“Hahahaha, die! Today’s credit is mine!” At this time, a demon expert had already arrived in front of Chu Yunfan. His figure was too tall, looking like a small mountain.","This wasn’t his disguise, but his original appearance.","Some people even speculated that if he cultivated the divine power, he might be ten times larger than he was now. How majestic and terrifying would that be?","This was the effect of talent. Ordinary people would not have such talent and opportunities in their lifetime.","Opposite him, Chu Yunfan was simply a representation of weakness. He slapped down, wanting to slap Chu Yunfan to death.","This was a Domainian, and he was much stronger than the demons from before.","However, in the next second, a sword light pierced through him and soared into the sky.","“What?” The giant femon couldn’t believe that his attack was so weak in front of Chu Yunfan.","He was killed by Chu Yunfan with a single strike.","After this giant demon, Chu Yunfan seemed to have gone crazy. The demons all flew toward him, but Chu Yunfan simply relied on his hands and sword to start the slaughter.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan finally displayed his exquisite swordsmanship to the fullest.","Experts at the Domain Stage would compete in Dao. However, at this moment, Chu Yunfan’s technique had reached the peak, relying on his sword technique.","Chu Yunfan was simply invincible. No matter what kind of move he used, he could easily kill them.","No matter what kind of demonic energy or domain it was, Chu Yunfan could easily cut it in half.","It was as if the sword in his hand had eyes, and he could hit the vital points of these experts every time.","Once or twice was luck, but after a few times, it was not luck but strength.","Especially those demons in front of him who truly had a deep understanding of it.","In just a short moment, these dozens of super terrifying teams, which included Domainians and Divine Treasures, were all killed by Chu Yunfan.","All of this happened too fast, so fast that the other demons in the military camp did not even have time to react.","This treasure vault was located in an alternate dimension in the military camp.","Therefore, the news spread very slowly. Even the demon army outside did not expect that such an existence would actually sneak into their midst.","They didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to be so terrifying that he could kill dozens of demons so easily.","Everything happened too fast, so fast that no one could react in time.","No one was allowed to approach this treasure vault on normal days. There was not even anyone nearby. Everything happened quietly.","Chu Yunfan looked at the huge door in front of him. He knew that it was not difficult to push open this door, but this door had been surrounded by layers of barriers and arrays. Ordinary attacks could not break through this huge door.","“In that case, I’ll give it my all!”","Chu Yunfan stood there quietly, and the divine power in his body was raised to the extreme. At this moment, in his extremely pale and weak body, all the divine power was raised together. Above his head, an earth-shattering sword light rushed into the sky.","The last remaining terrifying sword light he had was suddenly released.","Boom!","The terrifying sword light tore everything apart, even the air was cut in half.","In the next moment, this sword light ruthlessly landed on the door of the treasure vault. For a moment, the entire treasure vault shook violently. In the violent collision, the door of the treasure vault was slashed into a huge pit that was several meters long.","In an instant, a shocking demonic aura surged out from within.","It was like a flood that had been suppressed for a long time and suddenly erupted.","It surged toward Chu Yunfan.","If it was an ordinary person, they would not be able to withstand this kind of demonic energy, but Chu Yunfan was different. He cultivated the Celestial Devouring Art and could easily absorb this energy.","Chu Yunfan absorbed the demonic energy into his abdomen and turned it into energy.","Chu Yunfan’s skin visibly tightened, and he looked at least ten years younger.","This was absorbing the energy from the outside world to replenish his consumption.","“Hahaha, this treasure vault is mine now!” Chu Yunfan laughed loudly. He turned into a streak of light and disappeared into the treasure vault."]},{"number":2332,"title":"Chapter 2332: Destroying the Demon Camp With a Single Sword","paragraphs":["Chapter 2332: Destroying the Demon Camp With a Single Sword","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The huge treasure vault was blasted open, and neatly arranged demonic crystals could be seen everywhere. They were piled up like a small mountain.","These demonic crystals were a type of heavenly resource unique to the Demon Realm, something similar to the spirit stones of the Central Plains.","However, spirit stones were formed by absorbing the spirit energy of heaven and earth, while demonic crystals were treasures formed by absorbing the demonic energy of the Demon Realm.","They both contained enormous energy, but the energy inside was completely different.","If it was someone else, they wouldn’t be interested even if they saw the demonic crystals, because they couldn’t use them at all.","This was the same as how the demons of the Demon Realm could not directly use the spirit energy between heaven and earth. They had to transform heaven and earth into an environment suitable for the production of demonic energy.","Even if experts of the Central Plains obtained a demonic crystal, they wouldn’t be able to use it. If they absorbed it into their bodies, it might clash with their divine power and cause an explosion.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He had the Celestial Devouring Art, so he could even devour and use demonic crystals.","Chu Yunfan’s hand reached out, and endless demonic crystals formed a long river that surged into his Mountain River Diagram.","In the Mountain River Diagram, Tang Siyu saw so many demonic crystals pouring in. She immediately sat down cross-legged and began to absorb the energy in these demonic crystals. She had been taught the Celestial Devouring Art by Chu Yunfan, so she could also use these demonic crystals.","After absorbing the demonic energy in these demonic crystals and turning them into divine power, Tang Siyu’s originally skinny body visibly became plump.","Outside, Chu Yunfan kept countless demonic crystals into the Mountain River Diagram while he crazily absorbed the demonic energy in these demonic crystals.","Compared to Chu Yunfan’s absorption speed, Tang Siyu’s absorption speed was simply insignificant.","Chu Yunfan could swallow a mountain of demonic crystals in one gulp.","These demonic crystals turned into dust and disappeared in the air. The demonic energy within had been completely absorbed by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s body was black and golden. This was the process of the demonic energy absorbed by Chu Yunfan being converted into his divine power.","In just a moment, Chu Yunfan’s face which was sallow and thin because he had overdrawn his vitality gradually returned to his original filled appearance, and he looked even more extraordinary.","The clothes on his body were no longer hanging off him.","In addition to countless demonic crystals, there were also many natural treasures that were only produced in the Demon Realm. This treasure vault was originally meant to supply the 100,000 elite demon soldiers in this camp for cultivation.","But now, they were all taken away by Chu Yunfan and added to his own wealth.","Originally, Chu Yunfan’s wealth was almost depleted after a series of consumption, but now he was rich again.","Just those demonic crystals alone were equivalent to tens of billions of high-grade spirit stones, not to mention those heavenly treasures and the like. Together, they were equivalent to at least 20 billion high-grade spirit stones.","Although many heavenly resources were tainted with demonic energy, making it impossible for ordinary experts of the Central Plains to use them, there were many experts of the demonic path in the Central Plains.","They were very eager for these heavenly treasures that were contaminated with demonic energy. Some demonic path experts even did not hesitate to sneak into the Demon Realm in search of these heavenly treasures.","Although they cultivated improved demonic cultivation methods, they were still demonic cultivation methods in the end. They naturally needed these heavenly treasures of the Demon Realm.","In just a moment, this treasure had been plundered by Chu Yunfan.","“Exterminate all evil. Just in time to uproot this demon camp!” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","Now, more than half of the demons in the treasure vault had been killed by him. The remaining demons were less than half, and they were not enough to pose a threat to him.","In the next moment, an earth-shattering sword light, wrapped in the light of lightning, rushed into the sky. It was a terrifying sword light that was at least 10,000 feet long. Just like that, it swept up from the demon’s camp.","Boom!","The sword light that was over ten thousand feet long slashed down from the sky and split this huge demon army camp into two halves.","For a moment, the entire demon camp was in turmoil. Just this sword alone had cut tens of thousands of demon soldiers who could not dodge in time into two halves.","Countless demon soldiers screamed, and tens of thousands of them were heavily injured by the terrifying aftershock of the lightning.","This sword severely injured this elite demon army.","Countless demon soldiers flew up one after another. Among them, there were many experts. Divine Treasures and even Domainians flew up.","Everyone had a dumbfounded expression. This was the rear of the Demon Realm. In the starry sky of the universe, there was no possibility of being invaded by external enemies.","Therefore, even the most vigilant person did not expect that the attack would come from the inside, and it would be so terrifying.","Even dealing with the experts of the various races of the Central Plains in the ancient battlefield was something that had happened three years ago.","In the past three years, even if there were some remaining enemies, they should have been hiding here and there, not daring to appear.","“Who are you?”","A terrifying aura rose from the demon camp. A terrifying existence with a human head but a demon body flew out and went straight in the direction of the sword light.","This was a Domainian demon, and he was also one of the strongest existences in this demon camp.","However, before he could react, a sword light pierced through his chest.","The Domainian demon did not even have the time to react. Before he could even say a word, his body exploded as he was minced into pieces by the sword light.","Before the demon died, his eyes were wide open as if he could not believe that he was so vulnerable.","“Enemy attack! Form up!”","Countless demon army officers were shouting. The entire camp was in chaos. Many soldiers tried to gather together. After all, this was an elite army, not a mob.","However, at this moment, another shocking lightning sword light condensed in midair.","At this moment, everyone finally saw what it was. A human raised his hand high with a cold expression. That terrifying sword light that was over 10,000 feet tall formed in his hand.","Then, as he suddenly landed, this sword light slashed onto the military camp.","Boom!","The entire military camp was shaking. Countless barriers were shattered by the sword. More than ten thousand demons were killed and turned into a cloud of blood mist.","More demon soldiers were sent flying by the aftershock and were heavily injured."]},{"number":2333,"title":"Chapter 2333: The Changing Situation Outside","paragraphs":["Chapter 2333: The Changing Situation Outside","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After Chu Yunfan killed many of the demon officers, the remaining demon army was in a state of utter defeat. How could they resist Chu Yunfan’s pursuit?","In addition, Tang Siyu joined in the fight. It was another peak Domainian.","The two of them joined hands, and the entire demon army camp was turned upside down.","In a short while, the entire military camp had been massacred.","After wiping out this military camp, Chu Yunfan finally knew what was happening in the outside world.","It was recorded in the military documents in the military camp. Although it was written in the demon language of the Demon Realm, both Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu did not lack understanding of the demon language.","Only then did he know what had happened in the outside world.","Just as Chu Yunfan had guessed, the worst case scenario was that the demons had invaded the Central Plains.","The demons besieging the ancient battlefield previously was only a part of this great battle.","The demons had schemed to invade the Central Plains, and these future prodigies of the Central Plains had undoubtedly become targets that the demons had to eliminate.","If this group of young prodigies were allowed to mature, the Central Plains would probably usher in an unprecedented golden age.","Not to mention all of them, even if only one-tenth of the young prodigies grew up, it would still be a terrifying golden age.","After all, this was a prodigy that had been accumulated throughout the Central Plains for countless years.","They should have blossomed in the long river of history, but now they were all growing up in the same era. What a terrifying scene.","After the demons learned of this situation, they began to worry.","However, the young prodigies had been in the Central Plains the entire time, so the demons had no chance to act even if they wanted to.","However, when most of the young prodigies came to the ancient battlefield, the demons felt that the opportunity they had been waiting for had finally arrived.","In the end, they split up into two groups. One of them sealed off the ancient battlefield, then mobilized their army to engage in battle with the reinforcements from the Central Plains.","When the young prodigies were trapped in the ancient battlefield, the Central Plains naturally knew about it.","Their reactions were not slow to this extent.","Not long after the incident, everyone reached a consensus. After confirming that it was not them who attacked each other, a cross-race reinforcement formed an army and went to the starry sky to support these young prodigies.","It was rare for the various races and forces to put aside their prejudices and hatred and advance toward the same goal.","It was because these young prodigies were too important.","They were responsible for the future of their respective races!","However, such reinforcements were blocked in the starry sky of the universe and were unable to support the ancient battlefield.","And just as the various major powers were about to mobilize their armies to organize a second cosmic expedition, the second army of the demons appeared and invaded the Central Plains. They surrounded the capitals of the various major races, and a great war between the demons and the Central Plains erupted.","This was the reason why the demons had delayed for a full year before they came to exterminate these young prodigies.","It was because they had been delayed by the reinforcements from the Central Plains that they only came to the ancient battlefield a year later.","After forcing the various factions to return to help, the demon army finally attacked the young prodigies in the ancient battlefield.","That battle was a bloodbath. The heroic souls of all kinds of powerful prodigies echoed in the universe. They had fallen in the starry sky of the universe before they could grow to their peak.","This was cultivation, and cultivation was incomparably cruel.","It wasn’t that one could reach the end just because they were talented. Luck also determined everything to a large extent. Luck was also a part of one’s strength.","According to the final statistics of the demons, almost half of the young prodigies had come to an end in the ancient battlefield forever. As for the experts who were active in the ancient battlefield, they were almost wiped out. Less than one-fifth of them could escape.","This was because even if their cultivation levels were the same, the young prodigies had many more methods than these current experts. All kinds of life-saving methods were endless.","Therefore, half of these young prodigies had escaped, while the other experts were almost wiped out.","This was originally a battlefield that they could dominate, but now it had become a hell that wanted their lives.","The conflict between the two races was already very cruel. All kinds of talents were consumed on the battlefield like cannon fodder, and only one in a hundred could grow.","The collision between the two worlds was a hundred times crueler. All kinds of prodigies died on the battlefield of the two worlds like meaningless weeds.","Up until now, there were still some remaining young prodigies and current experts in the starry sky of the universe. There were not many of them, but they had caused quite a bit of trouble for the demons.","This was because there were very few of them and it was extremely difficult to find them. However, they were extremely powerful and were basically at the Domain Stage. They could cause great trouble for them.","Even if they sent experts and armies to exterminate these people, there was nothing they could do.","Because these people were far too cunning, with the road to the Central Plains blocked, they decided to engage in guerrilla warfare in outer space.","This was the purpose of this army guarding this place. It was to suppress the young prodigies in the nearby area.","Who knew that they would provoke a super killer like Chu Yunfan? Not only did they fail to wipe out the guerrillas, but they were all destroyed by Chu Yunfan.","“I didn’t expect the demons to make such a big move!” Tang Siyu said, “I wonder if they managed to escape!”","Tang Siyu was obviously referring to the Golden Roc, Huangfu Longhao, Chu Hongcai, and the others.","Even after escaping the ancient battlefield and escaping into outer space, they were still surrounded.","Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu’s eyebrows twitched when they saw the casualty rate of more than half.","They were afraid that their companions would also appear in the mortality list.","“There shouldn’t be any problems. They were the first batch to escape. At that time, the demon army hadn’t even reacted!” Chu Yunfan said. He had seen from the document that the possibility of encountering an interception was lower if they were to escape in front. In addition, Chu Yunfan was acting as an arrow and destroying everything along the way.","On the way there, he had killed the demon army by himself. His strength could not be compared to the peak.","The further they went, the more tenacious the sealing barrier by the demon army became. By the time they reached the end, almost the majority of the young prodigies and experts of the present age had been wiped out."]},{"number":2334,"title":"Chapter 2334: The Hero and the Heroine","paragraphs":["Chapter 2334: The Hero and the Heroine","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The further they went, the lower the chance of escape.","The data shocked Chu Yunfan.","This was especially so since these young prodigies all had rare divine physiques in the Central Plains. At the very least, they all had king physiques, and there were even emperors physique possessors among them.","In the long river of history, these kinds of people would be the protagonist of any era. They could be written into a novel.","Every single one of them was the protagonist that the world loved.","The bodies of these people contained the mysteries of the world. If the demons snatched their corpses and brought them back, they would be able to study many of the secrets of the Central Plains.","Therefore, even though the demons had suffered great losses in this battle, in general, the gains far outweighed the losses. It was extremely cost-effective.","This first exchange ended with the demons’ complete victory.","Now that the demons had invaded the Central Plains, countless lives had been plunged into misery. The demons didn’t even need to do anything. As long as they transformed the world into an environment similar to the Demon Realm, it would be a disaster for the living beings of the Central Plains.","Cultivators could use their own cultivation to resist and minimize the influence of the demonic energy, but ordinary living beings did not have such an ability.","Over time, no living creature in the Central Plains would be able to survive. Whether it was animals or plants, all would die.","“From the documents we received, it won’t be so easy for us to return to the Central Plains!” Chu Yunfan said, “On their way back to the Central Plains, they’ve arranged for powerful barracks to seal off the surrounding areas.”","“Even ordinary prodigies would need wings to fly over these barracks.” Tang Siyu glanced at Chu Yunfan. In fact, if it wasn’t for Chu Yunfan’s strength being so strong that he swept through the entire military camp by himself, their outcome would probably be no different from those young prodigies.","The closer they were to the Central Plains, the more these camps there were, and the greater the chances of them being exposed.","“Then let’s kill them one by one!” Chu Yunfan said, “It just so happens that we are behind the demons and will turn them upside down!”","“I’m afraid that this will provoke the Demon Dragon King!” Tang Siyu said worriedly. She still had a deep impression of the Demon Dragon King’s terror.","If Chu Yunfan didn’t have a life-saving trump card, they wouldn’t have been able to escape.","The difference in strength between the two sides was too great.","That was a half-King who had surpassed peak Domainians.","He was just a step away from the King Stage. Any such of these people would be able to cause great waves in the Central Plains.","“It’s fine. Actually, I want to test my hand on him to see what level my current cultivation has reached!” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","If he had been afraid of that Demon Dragon King before, then now, he no longer cared about that Demon Dragon King at all.","The Demon Dragon King was at the half-King Stage, but Chu Yunfan was not bad either. His cultivation was also earth-shattering.","He had long surpassed the 7,000 laws of ordinary Supreme Youths.","He had condensed at least 8,000 or even 9,000 laws. If an ordinary Domainian encountered the Demon Dragon King, they would die without a burial ground.","There was no possibility of resisting.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He had already expanded his domain from 7,000 to 10,000.","He was not like the Demon Dragon King who failed to advance to the King Stage and fell, turning into a half-King.","He did not even care about a half-King. In terms of combat strength, he was not bad.","Therefore, not only was he not afraid, but he was also eager to try.","“With my current cultivation, unless I suddenly encounter a King, no one can be compared to me!” Chu Yunfan said, “I’ll pass on my experience of breaking through to you. This will be an excellent opportunity for you. If you can break through to 7,001 laws, the impact on your future will be subversive. Every step you take forward will be unprecedented. At that time, once you break through to the King Stage, you will become even stronger than before!”","After three years of cultivation, Tang Siyu’s strength had naturally advanced by leaps and bounds. Compared to when she was writing, it was simply incomparable.","She had already reached the peak of the Supreme Youth’s 7,000 laws.","To an ordinary Supreme Youth, this was already an unimaginable degree, but there was still potential to continue digging.","Tang Siyu could still take another step forward. Once she could break through to 7,001 laws and break through her own restraints, then she would be like Chu Yunfan of three years ago, obtaining an unprecedented opportunity to break through.","“That sounds good.” Tang Siyu looked at Chu Yunfan’s side profile as if she was thinking of the mediocre and unremarkable person in the school classroom many years ago.","At that time, the person in her memories was too mediocre. He didn’t even dare to talk to her. However, one day in the second year of high school, he suddenly became a top prodigy.","It was as if he had a fortuitous encounter overnight, causing the relationship and status of both parties to undergo earth-shaking changes.","Ever since then, he had become completely different. Originally, he was chasing after her, but now she had to catch up to him almost every day.","Even if she did his best, even adding on her talent and the Supreme Youth Physique, she still could not catch up to him.","Unknowingly, there was only one wish left in her heart, and that was to catch up to him, stand side by side with him, and tell everyone that she was qualified to stand side by side with him.","Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu decided to go to the Central Plains while destroying the demon camps they saw along the way.","For a time, the demons camps along the way were in great trouble.","Originally, this place was considered the rear of the demon army. Other than the occasional crusade against the remaining remnants, there were almost no enemies.","Who would have thought that a man and a woman would suddenly appear. They had a valiant style. Regardless whether of these demons’ level, there was no way to stop the two from looting them.","One by one, the barracks were attacked by Chu Yunfan, and they were penetrated at an astonishing speed.","Even though these were the elites of the demons, there was still a huge gap between the elites.","How could they block Chu Yunfan’s attack when they were in a berserk state?","The demon invasion was about to completely destroy the Central Plains, the enemy that had resisted them for tens of thousands of years, but it had been plundered, one camp after another being uprooted and the treasury ransacked.","The closer they got to the Central Plains, the more demon camps would be attacked.","For a time, the name of the male and female duo resounded throughout the demon army."]},{"number":2335,"title":"Chapter 2335: Fighting the Demon Dragon King","paragraphs":["Chapter 2335: Fighting the Demon Dragon King","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan uprooted the demon army one by one, and finally, the demon army felt a heart-wrenching pain.","Compared to the other ancient prodigies and even Supreme Youths who were still in the starry sky of the universe, Chu Yunfan was much more terrifying.","Even if an ordinary ancient prodigy had already become a Domainian or even cultivated to the peak, they would not dare to charge into a military camp so easily.","This was because these demon armies were all very elite and had formed an army spirit.","Alone, or even two or three of them barging into the military camp together, that would be a dead end. Supreme Youths could only protect themselves.","Their individual strength was very strong, but in front of an elite force of this level, it seemed to be insufficient.","Therefore, they often ambushed the demon armies that were moving outside.","Although it caused some trouble for the demons, it was a small matter that was not enough to make the demons look askance.","They even used the characteristics of these ancient prodigies and Supreme Youths to set up an ambush and kill many of them.","But Chu Yunfan was different. He was ruthless, and even the entire military camp’s experts could not stop him. The army spirit was defeated by him alone.","He had already surpassed the peak of the Domain Stage.","With Tang Siyu’s assistance, the two of them were able to tear down a demons’ sanctuary and plunder all its wealth.","As for Chu Yunfan, he plundered the wealth and strengthened himself while trying to break through to the King Stage.","He was already at the peak Domain Stage. Once he broke through to the King Stage, that would be the beginning of his true invincibility.","The more Chu Yunfan massacred, the closer he got to the Central Plains and the more demons he encountered.","Even though Chu Yunfan’s killing speed was extremely fast, it was inevitable that he felt as if he had fallen into a swamp. His movement speed was reduced to a very terrifying level.","Originally, Chu Yunfan would not encounter a single demon army in a day, but now, Chu Yunfan could encounter several elite demon troops in a day.","Gradually, it was as if a large net was slowly opening up and coming toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan acted as if he hadn’t noticed anything. He continued to slaughter as he headed toward the Central Plains.","On this day, he finally arrived at the edge of the Central Plains. He was less than 100,000 kilometers away from the Central Plains. To Domainians, this distance was something that could be reached in a matter of days.","However, there was a group of people blocking his way.","The leading dragon that blotted out the sky was Demon Dragon King who had chased after Chu Yunfan.","Beside Demon Dragon King stood seven extremely cold-looking experts. They stared at Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu as if they were dead.","Anyone who saw such a lineup would suck in a breath of cold air. Other than Demon Dragon King who was already a half-King, the remaining seven extremely cold demons were all peak Domain Stage existences without exception.","Even if one cultivated to the peak of the Supreme Youth, one might not be inferior.","“Human, we meet again!” Demon Dragon King looked at Chu Yunfan and grinned as if he was looking at a dead man.","“Indeed, I haven’t seen you for a few years. I didn’t expect you to still be alive!”","Chu Yunfan looked at Demon Dragon King and a smile flashed across his face. He looked eager to try.","“Hahahaha, who in the world can kill me?!”","Demon Dragon King laughed.","“As for you, not only did you escape from my hands and not die, but you also caused such a huge incident and caused me to be punished by the lord!” When Demon Dragon King mentioned this, he could not help but grit his teeth.","Chu Yunfan had escaped from his hands, and because he had chased after Chu Yunfan, many of the Supreme Youths of the Central Plains had taken the opportunity to expand their influence.","There were more people than originally planned.","Any one of these people growing to the peak was enough to give the demons a headache. So many people got away, it was very depressing for the demons.","And all of this was Chu Yunfan’s fault.","This made Demon Dragon King lose face in front of the other Kings.","One could imagine how much Demon Dragon King hated Chu Yunfan.","“If I remember correctly, the Demon Dragons should be famous in the Demon Realm. Why are you still being a dog for others now? If your ancestor was still alive, would he be angered to death by you?” Chu Yunfan grinned.","“Shut up, it’s not your turn to teach me a lesson!” Demon Dragon King was furious. This was the deepest scar in his heart.","The current Demon Dragons seemed to be awe-inspiring, but compared to when the Demon Dragon Ancestor was still around, the awe-inspiring aura was still far from being the overlord of the Demon Realm. No one dared to provoke them.","“A clown like you, how could you escape from my hands if not for luck? It’s just nice that I can kill you now to make up for my previous mistake!” Demon Dragon King said coldly.","In the blink of an eye, a terrifying aura swept over. It was Demon Dragon King who had made his move.","That terrifying attack tore through the starry sky and grabbed at Chu Yunfan.","“Great!” Chu Yunfan shouted, “I was worried that I wouldn’t be able to find a worthy opponent after my breakthrough. Siyu, stop them and buy me some time. I’ll kill this Demon Dragon!”","“No problem, leave it to me!” Tang Siyu brandished her sword and charged at the seven terrifying figures behind Demon Dragon King without saying a word. The Mountain River Cauldron was faintly visible above her head as it spun.","Layers of light screens were constantly hanging down, protecting her.","The seven terrifying experts attacked at the same time, wanting to kill her at the first moment.","For a moment, the battlefield was divided into two parts. The battle between Chu Yunfan and Demon Dragon King was the main battlefield that decided everything.","Chu Yunfan let out a long roar. Countless lightning bolts transformed into a terrifying sword from his body and instantly slashed down on the huge demonic claw.","Bam!","The demonic claw was defeated in the blink of an eye.","“Hmm?” Demon Dragon King was a little surprised. His attack was defeated by Chu Yunfan in an instant. One had to know that Chu Yunfan had no way to resist his attack before.","Chu Yunfan had merely relied on the defense of the Mountain River Cauldron to escape. In just a few years, his cultivation had actually become so powerful.","At the thought of this, the killing intent in Demon Dragon King’s huge eyes became even more piercingly cold.","“Aarrgh! I’ll send you to hell!” Demon Dragon King roared, and his huge body crashed over like a spark hitting the earth."]},{"number":2336,"title":"Chapter 2336: The Battle of Two Emperors","paragraphs":["Chapter 2336: The Battle of Two Emperors","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Roar!” Demon Dragon King roared angrily, and the entire sky shook violently. His terrifying body rampaged like a huge star sweeping across.","Demon Dragon King’s most terrifying weapon was his body. Even among the many demons in the Demon Realm, the bodies of Demon Dragons were one of the best.","He could even fight against magic artifacts of the same level without falling into a disadvantage.","However, Chu Yunfan did not panic. He clenched his fist and punched out.","Boom!","The world trembled violently, and the sound of destruction sounded. Cracks appeared in the void of the universe.","The strength of both sides had surpassed the ordinary peak Domain Stage. Even compared to the King Stage, there was still a gap.","However, these differences were not obvious at this time. They were already enough to shake the void of the universe.","“How is your body doing this?” Demon Dragon King was in disbelief. His body was not at an advantage when he collided with Chu Yunfan. He was even cracked by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","Cracks appeared on the scales of his huge claws.","In contrast, Chu Yunfan did not have any injuries on his hands. Even his expression did not change.","“My body is stronger than yours. This is reality. The legendary Demon Dragons are only so-so!”","Chu Yunfan took a step forward. He didn’t retreat. Instead, he chased after Demon Dragon King.","There was endless power of disaster surging in his eyes. Countless amounts of disaster energy formed a phantom behind him.","This phantom was called the Disaster Emperor!","It was said that he was a terrifying existence who had become an emperor through the disaster path. Ever since he became an emperor, all disasters in the world were under his control.","At this moment, the Disaster Emperor threw a punch at Demon Dragon King.","Pow!","Demon Dragon King was sent flying, and he was beaten silly.","This punch had severely injured him.","He simply could not imagine that when he collided with the Disaster Emperor, he did not have any advantage. Instead, he only had a disadvantage.","Chu Yunfan’s attacks were like a storm. He did not hold back. Not only was the Disaster Emperor phantom behind him constantly attacking, but he was also constantly blasting out the Eight Astonishing Punches. Every punch pierced through the sky and exploded with shocking power as if it wanted to pierce through the entire void.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan was as terrifying as a god.","Demon Dragon King was bombarded like a sandbag. For a moment, he was beaten silly.","Spurt!","Demon Dragon King spat out a huge mouthful of blood. It was from Chu Yunfan’s punch, and his internal organs were trembling.","“Aaargh! I don’t believe this! I want to kill all my enemies! I want to be invincible!”","Demon Dragon King kept roaring. His blood was burning. In an instant, the phantom of a Demon Dragon appeared behind him. That Demon Dragon was much stronger than Demon Dragon King. Its aura was so strong that it seemed to be a huge dragon that could cross the entire universe.","The Demon Dragon phantom slowly opened its eyes, and in an instant, the universe and the starry sky changed color.","This was the awakening of a wisp of the Demon Dragon Ancestor’s primordial spirit after Demon Dragon King burned his blood.","This was his trump card.","Even if it was just a wisp of the Demon Dragon Ancestor’s soul, Demon Dragon King became like an Emperor when it possessed his body. Compared to the original half-King Stage, Demon Dragon King was now many times stronger.","“Human!”","A shout that seemed to come from a distant era sounded.","Demon Dragon King spoke slowly, causing the entire space to tremble.","Even Tang Siyu and the seven demons who were fighting on the other side were shocked by this scene. That terrifying power enveloped the entire void.","“This is the power of an Emperor. Even if it’s just a wisp of essence spirit, it can reach such a level!” a demon said.","Their era was too far away from the peak of the demon territories. Kings were already legends, and Emperors were even rarer.","Under such circumstances, their guesses about Emperors could only be based on Kings.","But now, all their previous guesses seemed laughable. A wisp of an Emperor’s primordial spirit could temporarily heighten the strength of a King.","A drop of blood could probably kill a King.","Furthermore, Kings could easily kill them all. From this, it could be deduced that for an Emperor, a yawn would probably be enough to kill them all.","Chu Yunfan also felt a huge pressure. He didn’t expect Demon Dragon King to have such a trump card.","“It won’t be that easy to kill me!”","Chu Yunfan’s Disaster Star Eyes were constantly revolving. He could feel a surge of power being released from his eyes.","As if it had been stimulated by something, the Disaster Emperor phantom behind him, who was originally only in his form, suddenly opened his eyes. A terrifying light flickered in his eyes.","This phantom seemed to go out of Chu Yunfan’s control in an instant.","“The will of the Disaster Emperor has awakened!”","Chu Yunfan immediately understood. The bloodline of the Disaster Emperor hidden in his eyes had been stimulated by the awakening of the Demon Dragon Ancestor.","This was a battle between two bloodlines.","The ancestor of the Demon Dragons was a supreme ruler of the primordial Demon Realm. He had once led a supreme army of Demon Dragons to invade the Central Plains.","The Disaster Emperor was a supreme existence who cultivated the disaster path in ancient times. In their respective eras, they were once invincible in the world and were Emperors.","At this moment, they were stimulated to recover a trace of their original primordial soul bloodline.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know who was stronger between the Demon Dragon Ancestor and the Disaster Emperor, but at this moment, the Disaster Emperor was stronger than the Demon Dragon Ancestor.","The phantoms formed by the wills of the two supreme Emperors collided continuously in the void. All kinds of unimaginable and wonderful techniques appeared in their hands.","The power of lightning and the fire of the Demon Dragon that had appeared on Demon Dragon King previously was unleashed by the Demon Dragon Ancestor, which had far surpassed Demon Dragon King’s strength. It had completely ignited the nearby battlefield.","This forced Tang Siyu and the others to flee tens of thousands of miles away to avoid the demonic flames.","The Disaster Emperor’s aura was even more terrifying. All kinds of disasters gave it unimaginable power, and it suppressed the Demon Dragon Ancestor.","The Demon Dragon Ancestor kept roaring, unwilling to admit defeat. It was not that it was weaker than the Disaster Emperor, but that Demon Dragon King it was attached to was inferior to Chu Yunfan. The Demon Dragon Ancestor was at a disadvantage in every clash.","Boom!","After a shocking collision, the Disaster Emperor’s fist pierced through the body of the Demon Dragon Ancestor. The Demon Dragon Ancestor’s body turned into a rain of light that filled the sky and dissipated."]},{"number":2337,"title":"Chapter 2337: Extermination","paragraphs":["Chapter 2337: Extermination","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The battle between the two emperors came to an end. The Disaster Emperor phantom shattered the Demon Dragon Ancestor phantom with a punch.","The terrifying scene caused a huge commotion. Two supreme Emperors fought in the sky. Even if only a wisp of their primordial soul was left, it was far from what such a half-King could compare to.","Spurt!","Demon Dragon King spat out a mouthful of blood and he flew backward. The moment the Demon Dragon Ancestor phantom was blown up, he was also severely injured.","The Disaster Emperor phantom took a deep look at Chu Yunfan below, and it seemed to have recovered some of its will. Then, it also turned into a rain of light and dissipated.","Chu Yunfan heaved a sigh of relief. He had not expected Demon Dragon King to have such a trump card. He could burn his blood to summon the Demon Dragon Ancestor.","If it wasn’t for the awakening of the will of the Disaster Emperor in his Disaster Star Eyes, Chu Yunfan would have been in big trouble.","Although Chu Yunfan was confident of protecting himself, the Demon Dragon Ancestor had awakened a wisp of the Disaster Emperor’s consciousness. In terms of combat, the Disaster Emperor could only last for a very short time and could not continue fighting.","As long as it persisted, victory would be Chu Yunfan’s. However, it was impossible for him to be as calm as he was now.","Chu Yunfan felt that in the short time that the Disaster Emperor had come out, his blood essence had been completely exhausted. After the Disaster Emperor was summoned, every move he made consumed endless energy.","Of course, the energy consumed came from Chu Yunfan.","Even Chu Yunfan, who had reached the peak of his vitality, felt as if he had been sucked dry.","Even though the various special physiques in his body were accelerating his recovery speed, it still made him feel empty.","Demon Dragon King opposite him was obviously in an even worse state. His entire body had shrunk to only half of his original size.","Although it was still huge and covered the sky, he looked extremely dispirited.","Chu Yunfan’s consumption was already too much, let alone Demon Dragon King. His losses would only be above Chu Yunfan’s, not below him.","“I’ll send you on your way now!” Chu Yunfan raised his hand, and a terrifying power of lightning condensed in his hand. It turned into a terrifying giant sword and slashed down at Demon Dragon King.","This ball of lightning power condensed into a huge sword. It contained Chu Yunfan’s understanding of the sword, which had reached a peak.","His understanding of the Great Dao was fed back to the divine powers he knew.","Demon Dragon King was shocked and frantically retreated. The demonic energy on his body collapsed and turned into a black light rain that filled the sky.","“Rrraagh!” Demon Dragon King let out a roar. His body was boiling with powerful lightning power. However, this time, he was clearly much weaker than before.","This ball of lightning power transformed into a long black dragon that roared as it welcomed the huge sword that was slashing down.","Slice!","The giant sword cut the black dragon formed by the power of lightning into two halves as if it were made of butter.","The sword light’s momentum did not decrease, and it chased after Demon Dragon King.","Slice!","As the sword slashed down, one of Demon Dragon King’s wings was hit, and the entire wing was cut off.","Demon Dragon King was shocked. He never thought that his attack would be so weak in front of Chu Yunfan.","He couldn’t even stop Chu Yunfan.","He could not help but sigh. What kind of monster was this?","One had to know that with his cultivation, he was an invincible existence even among lesser Kings.","Three years ago, when he was chasing after Chu Yunfan, he single-handedly chased Chu Yunfan to the end.","However, after just three years, the gap between the two sides had not been further widened. Instead, Chu Yunfan had surpassed him.","Thinking of this, Demon Dragon King simply wanted to die. If he had known earlier, he would never have given up and would have killed Chu Yunfan earlier.","It wouldn’t be to the extent of becoming a threat.","If he hadn’t dodged the sword quickly, he would have died in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","But even so, such a battle was enough for him to recognize the gap between him and Chu Yunfan.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t have any intention of stopping. He clenched his fist and punched out.","In an instant, Chu Yunfan rushed forward and punched out. The punch pierced through everything.","In an instant, it blasted into Demon Dragon King in the chest.","Demon Dragon King screamed in pain. His huge body was pierced through by Chu Yunfan. The scales he used to protect his body were useless under Chu Yunfan’s punch.","Fresh blood splattered out and formed a river.","This was not an exaggeration, but a fact. The blood of an expert of this level could flow into a small lake.","Demon Dragon King tried to retreat to stop Chu Yunfan, but what followed was a world-shaking sword light. The sword light pierced through the void and cut off Demon Dragon King’s head.","Demon Dragon King’s body floated in the void of the universe, motionless. He died a tragic death.","Chu Yunfan immediately stowed away Demon Dragon King’s corpse. At this moment, on another battlefield, the battle between Tang Siyu and the seven peak Domainians had also come to an end.","Tang Siyu’s strength was above those seven demons, not to mention that she had the Mountain River Cauldron protecting her. No matter what kind of attack the seven demons had, they could not do anything to her. They could not break through the defense of the Mountain River Cauldron, but Tang Siyu could attack without any fear.","Such a battle was naturally unfair.","Not long after, three people had already been defeated by Tang Siyu.","When the remaining four demons saw that Demon Dragon King had been defeated by Chu Yunfan, they did not dare to stay any longer and fled.","Tang Siyu could only hold back one of them, and the remaining three fled in all directions.","“None of you are leaving!” Chu Yunfan stepped into the void and formed a seal. In the sky, countless lightning bolts were gathering and turning into countless lightning dragons.","It swept out in an instant.","These lightning dragons chased after the three fleeing demons.","In just a moment, these demons were killed, and their flesh and blood scattered in through the cosmos.","Soon, Chu Yunfan took them all away.","The remaining demon expert did not last long before he was easily killed by Tang Siyu.","After following Chu Yunfan for a long time and with his teachings, Tang Siyu’s combat strength far exceeded that of ordinary peak Domainians. She could even advance to the King Stage.","Chu Yunfan cleaned up the battlefield and sensed that many more demons were rushing over. He immediately took Tang Siyu and disappeared into the cosmos."]},{"number":2338,"title":"Chapter 2338: Chaos Descends on the World","paragraphs":["Chapter 2338: Chaos Descends on the World","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu returned to the Central Plains, they discovered that the entire Central Plains had fallen into the flames of war.","The invasion of the demons ignited the flames of war in the Central Plains.","There was endless slaughter everywhere.","From afar, Chu Yunfan could see the demonic clouds rolling in the direction of the Imperial Capital, covering the sky and the sun.","The entire Imperial City was surrounded. The originally majestic Imperial City was now completely enveloped.","One could vaguely see a golden dragon roaring at the sky in the endless demonic clouds, protecting the Imperial Capital.","Compared to the golden dragon Chu Yunfan had seen before, it was undoubtedly smaller and duller.","This was very normal because this golden dragon was the dragon of providence. Now that Grand Xia had been invaded, the hearts of the people had changed. If the hearts of the people changed, the providence would decline.","This was a very normal situation.","Other than the Imperial Capital, there were countless demons wreaking havoc in the 3,000 provinces of Grand Xia.","Other than demons, there were also all kinds of demonic path, evil path, blood path, and other evil path experts that did not dare to come out previously to cause trouble.","Chu Yunfan even saw the Hus, barbarian, monster, and marine folks taking advantage of the situation in the border areas.","Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu looked at each other. This was undoubtedly the worst situation.","It was the worst situation they could imagine.","Originally, Chu Yunfan had thought that this was the Central Plains fighting against the demons, but now he discovered that this was not the case at all. The demons seemed to be in a confrontation with the other races, either intentionally or unintentionally, and could only pursue and attack the humans.","In fact, the other races were taking advantage of the situation. These were all factions that were usually suppressed by Grand Xia in various places on the border and could not cause trouble.","Now that all of them had appeared, it was simply a group of demons dancing and the world was in chaos.","Chu Yunfan could even see countless demons rushing down from the sky like raindrops.","It was completely the same. The two of them were naturally worried. With their strength, they were not enough to dominate the world. They still needed to protect the humans.","Once the Imperial Capital was breached and the humans were destroyed, they would probably not be able to escape the fate of destruction unless they left immediately and hid in the endless void.","However, if that was the case, it would not be much better. Other than the resources on the surface being cut off, the fate of the entire race would go up in flames.","The more powerful a race was, the more prodigies there would be. On the other hand, if the race was destroyed, the fate of all the prodigies belonging to the race would be weakened.","At that time, all kinds of bottlenecks in cultivation would appear. Usually, when the pillars of a group was around, no one would feel it. However, once these pillars were gone, all kinds of ghosts and monsters would appear.","This was just like after the battle of the prodigies, many of the previous dynasty’s nobles and even the previous dynasty’s imperial family had countless ancient prodigies, even Supreme Youths, but Grand Xia did not take them to heart.","This was because their dynasty had already been destroyed. Without the blessing of the dynasty’s luck, how could they compare to the local prodigies of Grand Xia?","“I didn’t expect the situation to be so bad. It looks like there’s going to be a tough battle!” Chu Yunfan said.","Suddenly, at this moment, a tyrannical aura extended from the endless void. It was a demonic claw of the demons that grabbed the golden dragon in the Imperial Capital.","It was the Luck Dragon!","“How dare you!”","Suddenly, a loud shout came from the Imperial Capital. Immediately after, a burst of virtuous energy rolled out from the Imperial Capital and went up to the demonic claw.","Boom!","A terrifying scene erupted. The terrifying explosion shook the entire void.","Immediately after, a figure wearing a Confucian robe appeared in Chu Yunfan’s line of sight. It was an old man with white hair and a youthful face. His body was straight and he held a brush in one hand. It was he who had used this Season Brush to push away the demonic claw.","“That should be the dean of the Virtuous Academy!”","Chu Yunfan looked at the old man and thought of his identity. In the current Grand Xia, there was probably no one other than the dean of the Virtuous Academy who had such an amazing Confucian cultivation.","The dean of the Virtuous Academy had been sitting in the dean’s seat for a long time.","After several generations, he had never fallen. In the Imperial Court, countless kings and generals had to bow and greet him when they saw him, calling him the dean.","It could be said that his students were all over the world, and many of his students were high officials in the Imperial Court. Even the current Human King was taught by the dean.","The Virtuous Academy had always been ranked second among the top ten sects, firmly behind the Destiny Sect. This was largely due to the existence of the dean.","“A King. The dean is actually at the King Stage!” Tang Siyu was shocked.","The demon who had attacked was definitely at the King Stage. Otherwise, it was impossible for him to pose such a great threat.","However, the dean could easily block the attack. This meant that the dean was definitely at the King Stage.","Chu Yunfan somewhat understood why the Flying Celestials was ranked at the bottom among the top ten forces.","Looking at the Flying Celestials’ sect master, Situ Xuan, who was only at peak Domain Stage, and the dean who was at King Stage, it was obvious.","Whether or not there was a King holding down the fort, to a large extent, it divided the ten great factions into two completely different levels.","For a long time, many people had divided the top ten forces into two levels. The top three were the Destiny Sect, the the Virtuous Academy, and Great Change Faith. This was the upper circle, and the rest were all lower circles.","Originally, Chu Yunfan had some doubts. They were all top ten forces, but the difference between them was so great?","Now, Chu Yunfan no longer doubted that the Destiny Sect and Great Change Faith most likely had Kings guarding them.","This was the only way to explain that no matter how things changed, the top three would always be these three forces.","With the dean overseeing the situation, it would not be so easy for the demons to break into the Imperial Capital.","Originally, Chu Yunfan thought that the Grand Xia Grand Commandant would be the one guarding the city. However, from afar, Chu Yunfan could sense that Grand Xia Grand Commandant’s aura was not in the Imperial Capital. On the contrary, it was in Zhenyao City.","It was precisely because of Grand Xia Grand Commandant that the demi-humans were so quiet until now. They did not launch a large-scale invasion to take advantage of the situation. Only a small number of troops were burning, killing, and looting.","But even so, it still posed a great threat to the Central Plains."]},{"number":2339,"title":"Chapter 2339: The Contest for Power Among the Kings","paragraphs":["Chapter 2339: The Contest for Power Among the Kings","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A truly chaotic situation had descended over the world!","However, Chu Yunfan was a little curious. Since the Grand Commandant was in Zhenyao, then who was the master of the marine folks, Hus, and barbarians in the south to suppress these restless foreign tribes and prevent them from taking advantage of the situation?","“Chaos ?This is a chaotic world where all lives are in misery. However, it might not be bad for us!” Chu Yunfan said. Only in troubled times was the best opportunity to rise. The Destiny Sect should know by now that Jun Tianci and the others died in my hands, but they probably don’t have time to find trouble with me now. It’s enough time for me to grow!”","In such chaotic times, many people did not have the time to free themselves. Instead, they became his protective umbrella.","“Let’s return to the Flying Celestials first!” Chu Yunfan suggested.","Although Tang Siyu was worried about the situation at Serene Immortal Mountain, it was not safe for her to run around alone. Even though she was at the peak Domain Stage, she was still not safe in this chaotic world.","The two of them moved quickly, and soon, the Flying Celestials was in front of them.","However, just like in the Imperial City, the endless demon army surrounded the Flying Celestials, and all kinds of battles raged on. The elite army of the Flying Celestials was fighting with the demon army, but more troops were sent to various places.","The various armies of the demons burned, killed, and plundered the continent where the Flying Celestials was located. They did all kinds of evil, killing countless living beings and causing countless lives to be plunged into misery.","These were the roots of the Flying Celestials’ strength, and they were also the roots of the Flying Celestials’ continuous strength.","How could they allow these demons to wantonly kill and destroy?","Thus, the Flying Celestials sent out troops to confront the demons.","However, compared to the battle in the Imperial Capital, it was undoubtedly insignificant.","Chu Yunfan didn’t care about these small and big matters. Instead, he went straight back to the Flying Celestials.","At this moment, a group of people was having a meeting in the Flying Celestials. They were all the true rulers of the Flying Celestials.","Other than Sect Master Situ Xuan, there was also a large group of Domainian Grand Elders. Divine Treasurez did not have the qualifications to enter this battle. Even though they were all Grand Elders, there was a huge difference in status between them.","At this moment, the Flying Celestials’s foundation was fully displayed. They usually didn’t reveal their strength, but now, they could casually gather over a hundred Domainians. Among them, nearly ten of them were powerful peak Domainians.","The leader was Situ Xuan.","Other than Situ Xuan, Huangfu Longhao, Chu Hongcai, and the others who had displayed astonishing talent among the younger generation were also present.","Other than that, the Golden Roc, the Sea Dragon, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, and the Dragon-Headed Crocodile were all present.","Although they were not originally from the Flying Celestials, they followed Chu Yunfan. Many of them had been subdued by Chu Yunfan, so there was no problem with their loyalty.","Moreover, these were all Supreme Youths. Joining the Flying Celestials would allow the Flying Celestials’ foundation to rise to the top of the various large factions in an instant.","Once these people all advanced to the King Stage, the Flying Celestials would also become the most powerful sect in a single leap.","If one of them could break through to the King Stage, that would be even more amazing.","Facing these Supreme Youths, the Flying Celestials naturally had no reason to push them away.","Other than that, there were also many ancient prodigies that the Flying Celestials had accumulated over the years. At this moment, they had all stepped into Domain Stage or even the peak Domain Stage.","It was just that compared to these Supreme Youths, they weren’t that outstanding.","“I called everyone here today for one thing, and that is to discuss how to repel the attack of the demons!” Situ Xuan said, “However, we didn’t expect that there would be such a chaotic situation. The demons descended from the sky, and the foreign tribes in all directions are also restless. We can’t let them continue to kill. The commoners are the foundation of our sect. If we let the demons continue to kill, our foundation will be seriously shaken!”","“There’s nothing we can do. The Central Plains has entered a state of emergency, and we can’t find any reinforcements even if we want to. We’re still doing fine, but some of the weaker factions have already been destroyed by the demons. Otherwise, we’ve already become their hatchet men and minions!” a Grand Elder replied gloomily.","Now, let alone looking for reinforcements, they had even become the target of many factions. However, if they could find someone, they would definitely do so. It was just that they could not find anyone to ask for help.","“The most important thing now is to stop the demons from destroying the whole land. Except for a part of our forces who need to stay in the Flying Celestials, the rest of you should lead your troops to pacify all the demons in the nearby provinces!” Situ Xuan said, “However, if you can’t win, don’t force yourself. Retreat immediately. What we lack the most now is time!”","Everyone naturally understood Situ Xuan’s words. This made them sigh. If the Flying Celestials had a King guarding it, they would not be in such a sorry state.","A single King could easily defeat these demon armies. At that level, ordinary armies were useless. They could only serve as food for such experts.","For example, the Destiny Sect, the the Virtuous Academy, and the Great Change Faith all had Kings guarding them. Even if such masters were not around, they could leave enough backup.","Of course, the Flying Celestials had some backup plans left behind by the founder of the sect. However, unless it was a life-and-death battle, they wouldn’t use those methods.","This was the difference between having a King guarding the place and not.","Situ Xuan’s meaning was obvious. He wanted to stall for time until Huangfu Longhao and the others could advance to the King Stage. That would be the time for them to truly counterattack.","Although it was very, very difficult to advance to the King Stage, the advancement of these Supreme Youths was much easier than for others.","Moreover, the Supreme Youths were all people with the emperor physiques. Advancing to the King Stage was only a matter of time.","What they lacked was time.","In fact, the entire Grand Xia was thinking the same thing. Now, with the appearance of various ancient prodigies, the humans had welcomed countless years of foundation in one go. All of them would shine in this era.","Originally, many people were worried that the competition between the kings might collapse the world. However, at this time, they all turned into expectations. They did not know if the competition between the kings would collapse the world, but if these Supreme Youths did not break through, the humans would be destroyed. This was something that was close at hand."]},{"number":2340,"title":"Chapter 2340: Pushing the Demon Army","paragraphs":["Chapter 2340: Pushing the Demon Army","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","All of humanity was waiting. Only when these Supreme Youths grew up and advanced to the King Stage could they survive the crisis of extermination.","In the future, when these Supreme Youths broke through to the King Stage, the humans would not be afraid of the challenges of other races.","To the entire humans, it was a precarious situation!","Suddenly, everyone in the meeting raised their heads. They felt a powerful and vigorous force surging.","They all activated their Divine Eyes and looked over. Even though they were separated by the Flying Celestials’ mountain gate, it could not block their sight.","In the void, two figures charged into the demon army that surrounded the Flying Celestials.","This was especially true for the man among them. Countless bolts of lightning revolved around his body and transformed into a huge domain.","Wherever the domain passed, the demon army was blasted into ashes. At the same time, that person formed a seal and condensed an incomparably huge bird in the air. It was the Immemorial Dark Phoenix.","The Immemorial Dark Phoenix was covered in flames, covering a radius of a hundred miles. With a flap of its wings, it swept through the demon army.","Wherever it passed, the demon army turned into ashes.","The phoenix alone was like an elite army.","The demon army shot out countless arrows, forming a terrifying rain of arrows. However, none of them could get close to that person before they were turned to ashes by the power of lightning.","Beside him, a woman held a sword in her hand. The sword light pierced through the sky, creating a huge sword curtain. Wherever it passed, the demons were shattered on the spot.","The two could not be stopped. They killed as they advanced, sweeping through the enemies.","“That’s Junior Chu!” Huangfu Longhao was the first to react. His face revealed a surprised and happy expression.","Although he knew that Chu Yunfan should be fine, after all, the Golden Roc and the others who had signed a life and death contract with Chu Yunfan were all fine, which meant that Chu Yunfan should be fine as well.","However, he was still overjoyed to see Chu Yunfan return unscathed.","The others had the same reaction.","“Not only is Brother Fan fine, but his cultivation has also improved greatly!” Chu Hongcai said in surprise.","Only then did everyone realize that Chu Yunfan’s cultivation seemed to be many times stronger than when he went to the ancient battlefield.","If Chu Yunfan was originally at the peak of the Divine Treasure Stage, then now, he was at the peak of the Domain Stage. Just by looking at how easily he charged into the demon army, one could tell how shocking his cultivation had improved.","Suddenly, Situ Xuan shouted, “Oh no!”","In their eyes, a huge beast had appeared in the sky. It was a monster of the demons and was extremely terrifying. Its cultivation had already reached peak Domain Stage.","Due to its enormous size, its strength was unimaginably dense. Even if Situ Xuan fought with the other party, it would be difficult for him to gain an advantage.","This monster was one of the demons who had besieged the Flying Celestials.","If they were held back by the demon army’s formation, they would probably be followed by an endless demon army.","At that time, even ten lives would not be enough.","“Let’s attack together. Don’t let Junior Chu be trapped!” Huangfu Longhao said.","However, what they saw next left them dumbstruck. They were facing a terrifying existence that even Situ Xuan, the sect master of the Flying Celestials, had a headache over.","They saw Chu Yunfan rushed to the top of the beast. The monster let out a loud roar and opened its mouth. A terrifying fluctuation was formed, and endless energy turned into a heavenly pillar that blasted toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan stomped on the energy tide and crushed it.","“Nine Netherworld Stomps!” Chu Yunfan stomped down, and endless water from the netherworld spread out under his feet, slamming into the body of the monster.","The monster was crushed into pieces on the spot, letting out a miserable cry.","A peak Domainian monster that could make the entire Flying Celestials feel as if they were facing a great enemy was crushed into pieces by a single stomp.","Then, Chu Yunfan’s eyes moved slightly, and a wave of disaster energy appeared. In an instant, the monster was twisted into a sky full of essence energy that surged into his eyes.","Only then did everyone finally stop and not rush out to help.","At the same time, they were also scared out of their wits.","Judging from this performance, Chu Yunfan’s strength was not just a little stronger.","It was simply powerful to the heavens!","Three to five peak Domainians would not be enough to kill him.","Tang Siyu, who was beside him, wasn’t weak either. She was even stronger than Situ Xuan. She was even stronger than the Supreme Youths who were at the peak Domain Stage.","The two of them had swept through countless demon camps and killed countless demon elites along the way. Even though the number of demons besieging the Flying Celestials was far greater than any other army camp, it could not stop them.","It was a sweep!","Soon, the demons jumped out one after another. However, they were not a match for Chu Yunfan, who had already cultivated to the extreme. He killed a group of Divine Treasures with a single sword strike, and the demon officers below the Divine Treasure could not stop him.","Even an ordinary Domainian would be killed with a single strike!","At Chu Yunfan’s level of cultivation, quantity was meaningless.","Even peak Domainians could only struggle for a little longer before they were killed. They could only last for two to three moves.","The Flying Celestials were dumbfounded as they watched Chu Yunfan crush all the demon armies in his path with lightning speed.","“This is This is too strong!”","“Is this still the demon army that has been giving us a headache?”","“It’s as if they were swept away by a King!”","The group of experts all talked at once. These demon armies were defeated in one fell swoop. They did not look like a valiant demon army at all.","After all, even if the Flying Celestials was ranked at the bottom of the ten great forces, it was still one of the ten great forces. Its foundation was so strong that other forces could not compare to it. To be able to surround the Flying Celestials’ base and make the Flying Celestials helpless, one could imagine how powerful this demon army was. However, such a powerful demons army had collapsed under the attacks of the duo. This could not help but make them wonder if they had seen wrongly. Or could it be that this was not the same demons army?","“How dare you, human! You have angered me!”","Finally, a terrifying aura swept out from the demon army."]},{"number":2341,"title":"Chapter 2341: Killing Another Half-King","paragraphs":["Chapter 2341: Killing Another Half-King","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A terrifying aura rushed out of the demon army.","A demon that was dozens of meters tall rushed out. This was a giant demon among demons. His body was much taller than ordinary demons, and the aura he gave off was even more terrifying. It far surpassed a Domainian demon.","It was not inferior to the Demon Dragon King in the slightest, maybe even more terrifying.","The demon rushed out, causing layers of ripples to appear in the world.","He almost shattered the space.","A terrifying hand broke through the void and slapped down in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","The demon was a half-step King.","This time, the demon army besieging the Flying Celestials was under his command.","It was this terrifying existence that gave the Flying Celestials a headache.","Even though the Flying Celestials had Huangfu Longhao and other Supreme Youths, they were still unable to ease up the situation.","This half-step King singlehandedly suppressed the Flying Celestials.","“Oh no, it’s that Giant Demon King again!” Many people frowned.","In everyone’s eyes, the strength of this Giant Demon King was simply terrifying. Unless it was a King, it was impossible to deal with an existence of this level.","Terrifying demonic energy was boiling everywhere. Countless demonic laws were condensing, transforming into a terrifying hand that shattered everything.","However, Chu Yunfan was not afraid. He let out a long roar, and in an instant, the surrounding laws boiled and turned into a huge domain. When the big hand smashed into Chu Yunfan’s domain, it was crushed into powder by the domain.","“Petty tricks. If that’s all you can do, then you can die in peace!” Chu Yunfan laughed, and the pair of lightning wings spread out on his back.","In an instant, he arrived in front of the Giant Demon King.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!” Chu Yunfan clenched his fist, and a terrifying fist force boiled between his fingers. Then, he threw it out the punch.","The eight phantoms appeared around Chu Yunfan, and then suddenly pressed down on the Giant Demon King.","“Rrraaggh!”","The Giant Demon King continued to roar, and his body emitted boundless demonic energy. His body grew larger and larger, and in an instant, he was as huge as a mountain.","The Giant Demon King kept unleashing terrifying demonic divine arts, turning into a flood that wanted to drown Chu Yunfan.","Rumble!","The collision between the two sides caused the entire world to tremble. In the distance, the demon army did not dare to approach at all. In fact, many of the army did not even have time to escape before they were swept into ashes by the aftershocks of the battle.","Even the Flying Celestials’ barrier was activated to resist the terrifying aftershocks.","The entire mountain gate barrier was shaking violently.","Boom!","After a series of terrifying collisions, just as everyone widened their eyes to see what had happened, they saw the Giant Demon King being sent flying.","“Rrraaagh!” Although the Giant Demon King was sent flying, the demonic energy in his entire body burned even more intensely into demonic flames.","His eyes were even redder then before. It had been a long time since he had encountered such an opponent.","The Giant Demon clan had one of the best physiques among the demons, and their strength was incomparably great. This Giant Demon King was also one of the best among the Giant Demon clan.","But now, he was sent flying by Chu Yunfan’s punch. He had lost completely in terms of strength.","The Giant Demon King roared and struggled to get up. Around him, countless power laws condensed into an incomparably huge domain, protecting him within.","Chu Yunfan didn’t stop and threw another punch.","Bam!","The Giant Demon King let out a miserable cry. When he collided with Chu Yunfan, his entire arm was shattered.","His flesh and blood shattered.","“You want to kill me? I’m afraid this strength is not enough!” Chu Yunfan smiled coldly. The lightning wings on his back flapped, and he flew above the Giant Demon King and stomped down.","“Nine Netherworld Stomps!” Chu Yunfan shouted and stomped down with his mountain-like foot.","Bam!","The Giant Demon King was stepped on, and the power domain around him was shattered. Then, his chest was stepped on.","The Giant Demon King screamed as his body was trampled into pieces.","He painstakingly managed to rebuild his body in the distance, panting heavily.","It was just a simple attack, but the crushing power alone was enough to severely injure him.","This time, he was severely injured. The demonic energy on his body dimmed all of a sudden, and it was not even half of its peak.","“How can humans be so strong?!” The Giant Demon King simply could not believe it. He was already an existence at the half-King Stage. Unless he encountered a real King, how could he be so miserable?","Even if he really encountered a King, it would probably be just like that.","There was actually such a terrifying existence among the humans. It was not just the few Kings that the demons had paid attention to at the beginning.","During this period of time, he had no opponents in the Flying Celestials. Even the sect master of the Flying Celestials was not his match. Situ Xuan could only be trapped in the Flying Celestials and use the foundation of the Kings in the Flying Celestials to encircle and annihilate the demon army.","The Giant Demon King had no idea that such a terrifying existence existed.","If he knew, he would probably turn around and run on the spot. Although this was not a King, what was the difference between them?","If he hadn’t experienced it personally today, he probably wouldn’t have believed it even if someone told him.","However, before he could react, Chu Yunfan appeared in front of him in a flash. Chu Yunfan’s fist pierced through the sky, and a terrifying rainbow shattered everything. In an instant, it pierced through the Giant Demon King’s domain and shattered his body.","This time, the Giant Demon King wanted to struggle to reassemble his body, but Chu Yunfan would not give him such a chance. Chu Yunfan stomped on him, and he exploded.","This was the terror and dominance of cultivating 10,000 laws.","Even an ordinary Supreme Youth could only cultivate to the limit of 5,000 at the Domain Stage. An ordinary half-King would only have 5,000 laws. When a Supreme Youth reached the half-King Stage, they would have 7,000 to 8,000 laws. That was their limit.","This was still a shocking understanding of the King Stage, but it was not enough to completely advance to the King Stage.","Once one broke through, one would have 10,000 laws!","Chu Yunfan now had 10,000 laws. In terms of the number of laws, he was no longer inferior to a King. Of course, if they really fought, Chu Yunfan might not be a match for a King, but at least he had the power to protect himself. He was no longer powerless to fight back."]},{"number":2342,"title":"Chapter 2342: Defeating the Demon Army","paragraphs":["Chapter 2342: Defeating the Demon Army","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Giant Demon King died just like that?","The higher-ups of the Flying Celestials still couldn’t accept the fact that the Giant Demon King, who had given them a headache, had died so easily at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","This made them feel like it was unreal. It simply subverted their worldview.","It made them feel as if the Giant Demon King was nothing more than this.","Of course, they all knew that this feeling was just an illusion. If it was really just that, how could he have singlehandedly suppressed the Flying Celestials so much that they did not dare to attack?","There was only one possibility, and that was that Chu Yunfan was too strong. He was so strong that he could easily beat and kill the Giant Demon King. This was the only possible truth.","“Kill our way out and defeat the demon army in one fell swoop!” Situ Xuan immediately seized this opportunity.","The Flying Celestials’ foundation could not be underestimated. If it wasn’t for the fear of the Giant Demon King, they would have long organized an army to kill their way out.","Now that the Giant Demon King had been killed by Chu Yunfan, it was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.","Soon, the elite army of the Flying Celestials came out one after another and began to attack the demon army.","After Chu Yunfan killed all the Domainians in the demon army, the remaining demon army was completely vulnerable.","Huangfu Longhao, Situ Xuan, and the others had been holding it in for a long time. At this point, they finally could not hold it in anymore and led their troops out.","The demon army was defeated in an instant. In less than two hours, the entire demon army had been forced back and suffered heavy losses. They were chased by the Flying Celestial army and suffered heavy losses.","Apart from chasing after the army surrounding the Flying Celestials, the elite army of the Flying Celestials also went to various places to clean up the places that had been invaded by the demon army.","At the same time, the Grand Elders came out of seclusion one after another. They held their magic tools and went to various places to clean up the places contaminated by the demons.","The first thing they did after the invasion of the demon army was to transform the world into an environment suitable for the demons to live in.","Now, these Grand Elders of the Flying Celestials wanted to restore the places that had been contaminated by demonic energy.","For a time, the entire Flying Celestials was mobilized to restore the places that had been contaminated by the demons.","At the same time, Situ Xuan and the others, who were the real higher-ups of the Flying Celestials, were waiting for Chu Yunfan’s return.","This time, the crisis of the Flying Celestials was resolved largely because of Chu Yunfan’s strength.","Chu Yunfan’s move made everyone understand how important a top-notch expert was to a sect.","When Chu Yunfan wasn’t around, the Giant Demon King had suppressed the Flying Celestials single-handedly. Situ Xuan even had to be careful when sending out support troops.","They could only watch the demons wreak havoc. The only way was to wait for Huangfu Longhao and the others to advance further and reach the half-step King Stage before they could chase the demons out.","Now that Chu Yunfan had returned, he had easily broken through their predicament.","When Chu Yunfan returned to the Flying Celestials after he had finished hunting down the demon army, he found Situ Xuan and the others waiting for him.","“Greetings, Sect Master!” Chu Yunfan said as he cupped his hands. Beside him, Tang Siyu also bowed.","“No need to be so polite!” Situ Xuan quickly said. If he could suppress Chu Yunfan with his cultivation and status previously, it was completely impossible now.","“Junior Chu, I didn’t expect that not only did your strength increase greatly in the past three years, but even the half-step King Giant Demon King was not your match. Your strength has increased too quickly!” Huangfu Longhao said.","He was feeling a little helpless. With the full support of the Flying Celestials’ resources and foundation, his cultivation base had increased by leaps and bounds. However, he had only condensed 5,000 laws and reached the peak Domain Stage.","This cultivation was already considered fast enough. In order to support the rapid growth of these Supreme Youths, the foundation of the Flying Celestials was being consumed at an astonishing speed.","This was the foundation that the Flying Celestials had accumulated for countless years, and it would be used up in this life.","Even so, it was still far from Chu Yunfan’s progress.","Not to mention compared to Chu Yunfan, even compared to Tang Siyu, he seemed to be a lot weaker.","It was unknown what kind of fortuitous encounter Chu Yunfan had obtained outside that could be compared to the foundation that the Flying Celestials had accumulated over the years.","However, he didn’t know that Chu Yunfan had overturned countless demon camps along the way. He had swept through and plundered along the way. The foundation that the demons had accumulated over the years was naturally much greater than that of the Flying Celestials.","“It’s nothing. It’s just a Giant Demon King. Just now, I just killed a Demon Dragon King, who was also at the half-King Stage!” Chu Yunfan said indifferently as he waved.","Everyone was shocked. From Chu Yunfan’s words, it was as if a half-step King was like an ordinary Domainian. He could kill them as he wished.","Killing two was only because there were only two in front of him. If there were more, he would kill more.","“Brother Fan, how did you escape?” Chu Hongcai asked.","Only then did Chu Yunfan tell him everything that had happened in the past few years. Other than a portion that he couldn’t say, he didn’t hide most of it.","Everyone cried out in surprise. They didn’t expect Chu Yunfan and the others to kill their way back here. Along the way, they overturned countless demon camps and looted their treasuries. They became stronger and stronger along the way, even alarming the higher-ups of the demons.","In the end, they even sent a top expert like the Demon Dragon King to stop him.","However, the higher-ups of the demons probably did not expect Chu Yunfan’s strength to grow so quickly. He had already surpassed the half-King Stage with lightning speed.","Unless a true king was sent out, they were no match for Chu Yunfan.","At this time, it was too late even if they sent out their true Kings. Chu Yunfan had returned.","“Brother Fan, you’re really amazing! Hahahaha! All the demons must be fuming with anger!” Chu Hongcai danced and laughed.","“However, you must have also entered the sights of the higher-ups of the demons. Once there’s a chance, I’m afraid that a King will come out to deal with you. It’s possible!” Situ Xuan said worriedly.","In this chaotic world, all the original rules had been broken. Chu Yunfan’s display of power was not necessarily a good thing.","This was because such a person would probably arouse the fear of many. Even the internal forces of the humans would be wary when they saw him.","No one knew what the Destiny Sect, which had a deep hatred for Chu Yunfan, would do after learning that Chu Yunfan was still alive."]},{"number":2343,"title":"Chapter 2343: Relieving Zhenyuan City","paragraphs":["Chapter 2343: Relieving Zhenyuan City","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“It’s fine. With the power of the Destiny Sect, how could they not know that I’m back? Therefore, it doesn’t matter whether I keep a high profile or a low profile. The only way is to take advantage of the fact that they haven’t reacted and try my best to increase my strength so that I can advance to the King Stage. At that time, what can they do to me?” Chu Yunfan waved. He didn’t care about being discovered by the Destiny Sect. Now, he had the confidence to do so.","An ordinary half-King was not his match at all. Even if he encountered a King, he could escape. Naturally, there was nothing to be afraid of.","“What do you need us to help you with?” Situ Xuan thought for a moment. It seemed that there was really no other way at this time. The only way was to help Chu Yunfan break through to the King Stage as soon as possible.","At that time, the Flying Celestials would also have a King to oversee them. Their status would be comparable to the Destiny Sect, the the Virtuous Academy, and Great Change Faith.","Although they were among the top ten factions, it was clear that they were divided into different levels. In fact, whether there was a King guarding them or not, they were divided into the upper and lower circle of the top ten factions.","The upper circle was the truly unbreakable existence. As for the lower circle, it seemed to be stable, but it was useless.","The Holy Puppets, the Divine Talisman Sect, and Medicinal Kings Valley had been eliminated.","Their Flying Celestials had only just happened to have Chu Yunfan, who had single-handedly pulled back the declining Flying Celestials. Otherwise, the Flying Celestials would not be any different from the other factions.","“I don’t need any help!” Chu Yunfan said. With his current cultivation, the Flying Celestials could not provide him with much help.","Even the founder of the Flying Celestials was only at the King Stage. Chu Yunfan was no stranger to the King Stage. With the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, Chu Yunfan’s understanding of the King Stage might be even higher than the founder of the Flying Celestials.","What he lacked now was enough resources to help him advance to the King Stage in one fell swoop.","The normal method of accumulation was too slow to break through to the King Stage in one fell swoop. However, it was obvious that the current situation would not give him that much time to break through.","Therefore, he only had one method left, which was to forcefully devour the foundation of others to increase his strength.","That was to use the Celestial Devouring Art to devour enough energy to increase his cultivation in an extremely short time.","“In that case, I won’t say anything more. If you need my help, you can come to me!” Situ Xuan said.","The Flying Celestials’ operation to wipe out the demons was ongoing. However, without a leader, the demons’ siege was quickly repelled, and the demon army was also constantly being defeated.","For a time, it shook the entire world.","With the demons invading the Central Plains on a large scale, primarily attacking the humans, the Flying Celestials was the first faction to repel the demons within its territory.","All of humanity was greatly encouraged!","At the same time, all kinds of requests for help were sent to the Flying Celestials.","Even the Imperial Capital had issued an edict for the Flying Celestials to lead troops to wipe out nearby demon armies.","There was a problem in front of the Flying Celestials. Even though the Flying Celestials had just escaped its fate of destruction, there were still many forces under the Flying Celestials that were still being invaded by the demons. They urgently needed their help.","But once they left, it was very likely that they would be caught off guard by the demons.","At this time, Chu Yunfan stood up without hesitation.","The first thing Chu Yunfan did was to return to Zhenyuan City. This was his fief, and at the same time, his army, the External Army, was here.","At this moment, Zhenyuan City was also facing the harassment of the demons. Because it was located at the border of the monsters, the Hus, and the barbarians, there were many monster, barbarian, and Hu armies harassing it.","Even with the elites of the External Army, they couldn’t manage so many things at the same time.","They could only guard Zhenyuan City. However, even so, the huge city was surrounded by the demon army.","At this moment, above Zhenyuan, a vague figure stood in the air, looking down at the city with a cold and indifferent gaze.","“I’m Shadowless Flood Dragon, the prince of the Flood Dragon royal family of the monsters. I’m here to save you. As long as your city submits to me, I can save you from danger!","“Right now, your Grand Xia Empire can’t even take care of itself. I will care for you. Without my help, you will all die!” Shadowless Flood Dragon said loudly, not even afraid of being heard by the demons below.","He had absolute confidence in his strength.","So what if the demon army knew?","“Shadowless Flood Dragon, don’t even think about it. Kill us all if you have the ability. We will never surrender!” A loud shout came from the city.","“Stubborn!” Shadowless Flood Dragon said coldly. An extremely cold expression flashed across his eyes.","Suddenly, at this moment, a large hand descended from the sky and grabbed at the demon army.","Hundreds of thousands of demons who were besieging Zhenyuan were turned into a bloody mist.","“Who is it?” Dozens of powerful auras flew out from the demons. They were all existences above the Divine Treasure Stage. The huge energy hand had failed to kill all of them, allowing them to escape death.","However, before they could react, dozens of terrifying sword lights swept across the sky in the void, piercing through them one after another and blasting them into pieces in the air.","For a time, the demonic energy in the sky disappeared without a trace.","The demon army, which had left Zhenyuan helpless, was easily killed.","They couldn’t even resist for a moment!","Shadowless Flood Dragon, who was originally extremely arrogant, seemed to have seen the most terrifying thing. His heart instantly tightened.","His vision blurred, and a figure appeared in front of him.","He saw a young man in a black robe standing with his hands behind his back.","The man stood tall in the sky like a towering pillar.","“It’s the Marquis!”","At this moment, many people in Zhenyuan suddenly shouted. Many people were pleasantly surprised to find that the person who saved the city from the crisis was Marquis Zhenyuan, Chu Yunfan.","You Chuyun immediately rushed out from the crowd and came to Chu Yunfan’s side.","“Marquis, it’s great that you’ve returned!” You Chuyun said in surprise and joy.","Chu Yunfan looked at You Chuyun and smiled. “You’ve done a good job. Now, just stand back and watch me!”"]},{"number":2344,"title":"Chapter 2344: With Me Here, None of You Can Turn the Heavens Upside Down!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2344: With Me Here, None of You Can Turn the Heavens Upside Down!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Are you Chu Yunfan?” Shadowless Flood Dragon looked at the person in front of him and had already guessed the identity of the person.","After all, the lord of Zhenyuan City was Chu Yunfan. It was not difficult to guess.","Shadowless Flood Dragon originally wanted to occupy Zhenyuan City first and use it as a springboard to enter the human race’s hinterland.","Now, the human race could barely protect themselves. Although the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia was guarding Zhenyao City and suppressing the demons, the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia was also tied down by a greater demon of the demons and could not split up.","If it was during normal times, it would be fine because there was more than one King among the human race. They could come over to support at any time.","They usually cleared the grass valley and robbed the border people. Those big shots could not control them at all.","However, if they wanted to occupy a human city, they would immediately face the counterattack of the powerful figures of the human race.","Just one of those terrifying existences among the human race was enough to tear him into pieces.","Therefore, under normal circumstances, he would not dare to do anything.","However, things were different now. This was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity. Not only was the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia restrained, but the other experts were also restrained by their respective opponents.","Kings could not attack at all. This was also a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity for him.","Zhenyuan City was at the border of the four races. It could be said to be the transportation hub connecting the four races. Its location was very important.","If he took Zhenyuan City, he could not only invade the human territory but also block the entrance of the Hus and barbarians.","Thus, this was a battleground for military strategists.","It was not just one or two people who had their eyes on Zhenyuan City. There were also people from the Hus and barbarian tribes who had their eyes on Zhenyuan City.","There were even more than one or two demons who had their eyes on Zhenyuan City.","Among these people, he did not have the advantage, so he wanted to strike first and gain the upper hand.","However, now that the lord of Zhenyuan City had returned, things seemed to be a little tricky.","“That’s right. I’m a marquis of Grand Xia, Chu Yunfan!” Chu Yunfan glanced at the man in front of him.","In front of his Disaster Star Eyes, any disguise was meaningless. He could see the other party’s true form. It was a terrifying flood dragon that was tens of thousands of feet long. It was completely black and covered in barbed scales. It was extremely terrifying.","This was a flood dragon king. Once it broke through to the King Stage, it might transform into a True Dragon.","“Do you know that the human race can’t even protect themselves now? They are on the verge of collapse under the attack of the demons. Do you think it would be useful for you to announce the marquis title of Grand Xia?” Shadowless Flood Dragon sneered.","Normally, in the territory of the human race, with the title of marquis of Grand Xia, they would naturally be protected by the Luck Dragon of Grand Xia. If they really fought, even if their strength was about the same, the enemy would still be inexplicably defeated.","This was the reason why the other races were afraid of the experts of the human race.","“Do you think I want the protection of the Luck Dragon of Grand Xia?” Chu Yunfan grinned. “I just want to say that the sky is still the sky of Grand Xia, and the earth is still the earth of Grand Xia. With me here, none of you can overturn the sky!”","“What a great Marquis Zhenyuan of Grand Xia!” Shadowless Flood Dragon’s expression gradually turned cold as he looked at Chu Yunfan coldly.","“How arrogant!” Shadowless Flood Dragon shouted. Demonic energy surrounded his body and his body was flowing. He was extremely extraordinary.","His body emitted a rolling demonic light, and his eyes seemed to burst with dazzling light. A demonic flag appeared in his hand. As the demonic flag waved, countless demonic energy rolled over, forming a terrifying force that rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","In the air, the rolling demonic energy actually took shape. It was the endless monsters in the world. Under his command, they covered the sky and covered the earth.","This was his trump card. He could practically wipe out an army by himself.","“This is? A counterfeit version of the Myriad Demon Banner?” Chu Yunfan frowned because he remembered a magic weapon that had once appeared in the memory of the Alchemy Emperor. It was a magic weapon refined by a demon emperor in ancient times.","Countless great demons had sent a portion of their primordial spirits into the Myriad Demon Banner to express their allegiance and were willing to be controlled by him.","That magic treasure could be said to be world-famous. It had defeated countless powerful enemies and was also the symbol of commanding the demons in the world.","This demonic banner was obviously the counterfeit Myriad Demon Banner, but its power could not be compared to the legendary Myriad Demon Banner.","They were existences on completely different levels.","“If it’s the real Myriad Demon Banner, its power is unquestionable. However, it’s just a counterfeit. How can it do anything to me?” Chu Yunfan laughed and spread his arms. The golden light in the sky surged and turned into two big golden hands, tearing in the direction of the demonic banner.","“You want to tear my Myriad Demon Banner apart? How is that possible?!”","Shadowless Flood Dragon roared in anger. He had spent a lot of effort to refine this Myriad Demon Banner. Although it could not be compared to the legendary Myriad Demon Banner, it was not something that ordinary people could compare to.","However, in the next moment, Chu Yunfan’s two golden hands went deep into the endless monsters and tore them into pieces.","Immediately after, a loud tearing sound was heard. The Myriad Demon Banner was torn apart on the spot.","“How is that possible?” Shadowless Flood Dragon had never expected Chu Yunfan to be so terrifying. He had easily torn apart the Myriad Demon Banner he had refined.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan had already charged in front of Shadowless Flood Dragon. He clenched his fist and punched out.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!”","Eight powerful gods formed behind Chu Yunfan and suppressed Shadowless Flood Dragon.","Shadowless Flood Dragon roared angrily and repeatedly. He kept blasting out terrifying fist shadows, trying to shatter the eight gods behind Chu Yunfan.","However, it was useless. All his attacks were easily resolved.","At most, he had only cultivated 7,000 laws. Facing Chu Yunfan, who had already cultivated 10,000 laws, the difference between the two was as big as heaven and earth.","He was no match for Chu Yunfan at all.","He was easily suppressed.","Bam!","Shadowless Flood Dragon’s body was distorted by the terrifying fist force. His originally incomparably powerful body was instantly twisted, and a large hole was blasted out.","“Roar!”","Shadowless Flood Dragon cried out in pain and finally revealed his true form, a huge flood dragon that was tens of thousands of feet long.","A huge hole was blasted in his chest.","At this point, how could he not understand that this person in front of him was not someone he could afford to provoke? He was not a match at all.","He just wanted to turn around and run, but he couldn’t. A shocking sword light swept out from Chu Yunfan’s hand.","With a single slash, Shadowless Flood Dragon’s head was chopped off."]},{"number":2345,"title":"Chapter 2345: Prospective Kings List","paragraphs":["Chapter 2345: Prospective Kings List","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Boom!","Shadowless Flood Dragon’s head fell like a small mountain, kicking up a thousand feet of dust on the ground.","The blood flowed against the current and formed a lake. This blood lake was shining with the radiance of divinity.","Although Shadowless Flood Dragon was not Chu Yunfan’s match, he was still a powerful demon who had cultivated well. The blood in his body was a great tonic for ordinary people.","Chu Yunfan did not take Shadowless Flood Dragon’s body away.","Instead, he said, “Get the soldiers to move out. From today onwards, they will eat dragon meat every meal!”","Chu Yunfan’s words immediately made the entire military camp below cheer.","This was the meat of a flood dragon at the half-King Stage. It was not ordinary flood dragon meat. For ordinary soldiers, just one bite was equivalent to cultivating for at least half a month.","If one ate flood dragon meat for every meal, one’s cultivation would probably soar in a very short period of time.","Not to mention ordinary soldiers, even people like You Chuyun, who had achieved cultivation, could reach a shocking level in a very short period of time.","In fact, it was normal for them to break through to the Major Arcana Stage in a very short period of time.","You Chuyun was very excited. He immediately called out to the generals in the army to start thinking of ways to cut up the flood dragon. However, he was soon at a loss. Even if it was a dead flood dragon, they could not hurt the corpse at all.","In the end, it was Chu Yunfan who personally took care of Shadowless Flood Dragon’s corpse. For a moment, the army was filled with laughter.","The flood dragon meat that was tens of thousands of feet long could occupy the entire city. Not only the soldiers in the army, but even the residents of the city would get a share according to their cultivation.","After all, this was Chu Yunfan’s fief. Not only were the soldiers his subordinates, but the residents of the city were also his people.","If there were benefits, they would naturally be included.","In an instant, the news of Chu Yunfan returning to the Central Plains spread throughout the world.","In fact, a few years ago, Chu Yunfan’s display of divine might in the ancient battlefield had already caused a huge sensation in the entire world.","Especially when Chu Yunfan didn’t care about the face of the Destiny Sect at all. He directly attacked and killed several Supreme Youths of the Destiny Sect. It could be said that it caused a sensation.","Even the Destiny Sect had sent people to the Flying Celestials to ask them to pay the price.","No one thought about why Chu Yunfan would come to their doorstep. The Destiny Sect’s status was far above the Flying Celestials. Even if the Destiny Sect targeted Chu Yunfan, it didn’t matter to many people.","Moreover, the Destiny Sect had failed and was killed. There was no need to pursue the matter.","However, later on, it was said that Chu Yunfan was chased to the depths of the starry sky by the Demon Dragon King.","Back then, the Supreme Youths were only ordinary Domainians. At most, they were at peak Domain Stage. How could they possibly withstand the pursuit of a half-King?","In the following years, Chu Yunfan did not appear again. Almost everyone had forgotten about this once famous top genius.","In the past few years, the world had been in turmoil, and chaotic times had descended. The halo of the Supreme Youths who could attract everyone’s attention in the past was gone. These future supreme martial artists who had not yet grown up were simply unable to attract everyone’s attention.","Only a truly powerful King could obtain the attention of the world.","In this chaotic world where the human race was in chaos and the other non-humankind beings were eyeing them covetously, everyone was waiting for the true King to descend into the world. Just like the rumors said, he would pacify the chaotic world and establish order.","Back then, the founding ancestor of Grand Xia was the founding ancestor of the eight great sects. They worked together to sweep away the chaos and created countless years of peace for Grand Xia.","In comparison, those Supreme Youths who had yet to grow up were weak and powerless in such chaotic times.","Just the chaos of the ancient battlefield alone had led to the loss of more than half of the ancient prodigies. In addition, the demons and many foreign races had invaded over the past few years, causing even more ancient prodigies to be lost.","These ancient prodigies were no longer the focus of everyone’s attention.","But this time, Chu Yunfan’s return caught everyone’s attention almost instantly. He had killed a terrifying half-King, pushing him to the forefront of the storm.","Other than a few Kings who guarded various places, only those half-Kings could stir up trouble everywhere.","After many Supreme Youths matured, peak Domainians didn’t even dare to run around. If they were not careful, they might run into an ancient prodigy or Supreme Youth who came out of nowhere and kill them.","Only the half-King Stage was a realm that many ancient prodigies and Supreme Youths could not reach for the time being. They could still shock a region.","However, Chu Yunfan’s powerful return now told everyone that even those in the half-Kings were not reliable in this domain.","“Chu Yunfan is too strong. His current cultivation must have already exceeded the range of 5,000 laws. He might even be on the Prospective Kings List!” someone exclaimed, shocked by Chu Yunfan’s astonishing cultivation speed.","“Prospective Kings List?” In the city lord’s estate of Zhenyuan City, Chu Yunfan looked at all kinds of information collected from all over the world. This was the first time he knew of the existence of such a Prospective Kings List.","“The Prospective Kings List is said to be a list released by the Mysteries Pavilion. It lists those half-Kings who have already surpassed the peak Domain Stage but have yet to reach the King Stage!” You Chuyun explained to Chu Yunfan, “It’s normal that you don’t know about it because this is a list that was just recently released. It didn’t exist before!”","In the past, not to mention the King Stage, there were very few half-Kings. They could be said to be as rare as phoenix feathers and qilin horns. Many of them were cultivating bitterly in order to advance to the King Stage.","Once one advanced to the King Stage, not only would one’s lifespan increase greatly, but one would also be able to become an influential figure who could influence the entire world.","These half-Kings would not move outside at all!","The King Stage was even more mysterious and unfathomable. The head and tail of the dragon could not be seen. The few people who were famous in the world were awe-inspiring and would not appear in front of ordinary people.","The peak Domainians of the various sects were already considered the top experts in the world. Basically, they were the ones who dominated the world.","However, with the chaos in the world, these half-Kings who had gone into seclusion appeared one after another.","In addition, those Supreme Youths and ancient geniuses were about to join this tide.","A list of upcoming Kings was released.","The higher the ranking, the greater the possibility of breaking through to the King Stage, and the stronger one’s strength.","“So that’s the case. There’s such a ranking!” Chu Yunfan nodded. “Hahaha, I wonder what rank I am at now?”","Chu Yunfan could not help but laugh when he thought about how the Mysteries Pavilion could not estimate his strength with the protection of the Mountain River Diagram."]},{"number":2346,"title":"Chapter 2346: Two Months","paragraphs":["Chapter 2346: Two Months","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan’s return stirred up the entire Central Plains. However, after Chu Yunfan had been quiet for two months, this storm gradually calmed down.","After all, in this chaotic world, there were all kinds of explosive news that spread almost every day.","With the emperors restraining each other, the ancient geniuses became more and more active.","With their astonishing talent and foundation, they could often create astonishing battle results.","Although not everyone was like Chu Yunfan, who could easily kill a half-King, there were still rumors of a Supreme Youth escaping from the hands of a half-King from time to time.","Just escaping was already a shocking achievement.","After all, although the half-King Stage was only the half-King Stage, it had touched the threshold of the King Stage and possessed some of the divine powers of the King Stage.","It was not something that ordinary people could resist.","Ordinary peak Domainians would not be able to withstand a single blow from a half-King. They were completely no match.","In these two months, all the flood dragon’s meat was finally eaten up by everyone in the city.","For a moment, the cultivation of all the men and women, old and young, in the city had improved greatly. At least, they had all crossed a small stage.","Many of them even surpassed a major stage.","For example, You Chuyun had broken through to the Divine Treasure Stage in one go under Chu Yunfan’s guidance and help.","Although it was only the most ordinary Divine Treasure Stage, it was already many times stronger than his original self.","At the very least, he could bring an army with him and not be afraid of being ambushed easily.","After stepping into the Divine Treasure Stage, he naturally became a big shot. Even if he didn’t rely on Chu Yunfan, he could still obtain power and authority in the Flying Celestials.","During this process, more and more half-Kings became known to people. Many people were surprised to discover that there were actually so many half-Kings in the world that no one knew about.","Chu Yunfan was not in a hurry to make a move. Instead, he was accumulating his own strength. Not only his own strength but also the strength of his army. Originally, the army was only a third-rate army. Now, with Chu Yunfan’s continuous training and continuous strengthening, it gradually approached a first-class army. Even so, it was still far from enough.","Compared to the elite army that the demons had accumulated over the years, the difference was truly too great.","Many demon armies had gone through decades, centuries, or even centuries of training before they could have such elite troops.","Chu Yunfan had only led the army for a short period of time, so the strength of the army was far inferior to the elite demon troops. Chu Yunfan could accept it.","Because of this, he had to find a way to let them take a shortcut and increase their combat strength as soon as possible. As for affecting their future achievements, it was not within Chu Yunfan’s consideration.","In fact, their current cultivation had already far exceeded the scope of their potential.","If it weren’t for Chu Yunfan, they wouldn’t have been able to reach their current state.","Therefore, they naturally had nothing to be dissatisfied with. Every step forward was a huge profit.","On this day, Chu Yunfan was guiding You Chuyun in his cultivation.","“Marquis Zhenyuan, please come to Zhenyao City!”","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan heard a deep voice.","The Grand Commandant of Grand Xia!","Chu Yunfan immediately recognized that the voice was none other than Grand Xia Grand Commandant.","If it was someone else, Chu Yunfan might not have cared, but the Grand Xia Grand Commandant had given him a lot of help and saved him when he was in trouble.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t the kind of person who didn’t know how to repay kindness.","“I’ll be back!” he immediately instructed You Chuyun, “You stay here and guard Zhenyuan City. If anything happens, crush this jade talisman immediately. I’ll be back!”","Chu Yunfan handed You Chuyun a jade talisman.","You Chuyun took the jade talisman and nodded heavily.","Chu Yunfan immediately turned into a streak of light and headed for Zhenyao City.","Zhenyao City was not far from Zhenyuan City. Soon, Chu Yunfan arrived in front of Zhenyao City.","In front of Zhenyuan City, countless demons surrounded the entire city. Like ants attacking a city, they flooded everything.","However, Zhenyao City was like a reef in the midst of raging waves. No matter how the demons attacked, they could not break through Zhenyao City.","Chu Yunfan nodded. He was not surprised. After all, Zhenyao City was built with the strength and foundation of the human race at that time.","Ever since it was built countless years ago, it had never been attacked by demons. One could imagine how shocking it was.","Although this group of demons was very strong, it was not that easy to take down Zhenyao City.","In the distance, about a million miles away, countless armies of demons were eyeing the armies of demons and humans at the same time. It seemed that they were planning to ambush the enemy.","Terrifying auras were hidden deep within the demon army. Moreover, reinforcements from all walks of life were constantly rushing over. More and more of them were coming. From afar, it was extremely terrifying.","As soon as Chu Yunfan arrived in front of Zhenyao City, a terrifying aura locked onto him. He had felt this before when he was being chased by a powerful figure of the demons.","However, at that time, his cultivation was too low. He could not tell what kind of cultivation that big shot of the demons had.","He only knew that the big shot of the demons was very strong.","However, it was different now. He already had the ability to distinguish and could determine that this was a King.","Even when compared to that big shot of the demons back then, he was not much weaker.","A huge hand appeared out of thin air as if it wanted to squeeze Chu Yunfan to death.","“How dare you be so impudent in front of me?” All of a sudden, there was an incomparably loud roar. Another huge hand made of energy appeared out of thin air and crushed the attack of the lord of the demons into nothingness. It turned into a sky full of demonic energy and dissipated.","Then, a figure approached from afar and arrived in front of Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan saw that this person was none other than Grand Xia Grand Commandant.","The Grand Commandant didn’t look any different from before, but his eyes looked a tired.","It was obvious that too many things had happened recently. One after another, he had no chance to catch his breath.","Although his appearance did not change much, he still looked like a middle-aged man, but his expression was undoubtedly much more haggard."]},{"number":2347,"title":"Chapter 2347: Lead the Army to Suppress the Chaos","paragraphs":["Chapter 2347: Lead the Army to Suppress the Chaos","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“You want to kill the heir of humanity?” The Grand Commandant of Grand Xia looked coldly at the demons in the opposite camp and said loudly, “That depends on whether I agree or not.”","Many people were shocked. Even many of the trusted aides of the Grand Xia Grand Commandant could not figure out why the Grand Xia Grand Commandant valued Chu Yunfan so much and even treated him as humanity’s heir.","However, since the Grand Xia Grand Commandant had said so, many people believed him.","Seeing that there was no chance, the king of the demon army couldn’t help but snort coldly. He was slightly afraid of the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia.","Although they were both in the King Stage, the Grand Xia Grand Commandant’s strength was terrifyingly powerful.","There were not many human kings in comparison, but every one of them was extremely terrifying. They had extremely powerful backgrounds and inheritances.","Even if he was the king of the demons, he was helpless when facing an expert of this level.","In the end, he could only give up resentfully.","A million miles away in the demon army, a middle-aged man also looked at Chu Yunfan with regret.","It was the Supreme King who had once attacked Chu Yunfan. He had already recognized Chu Yunfan, and because of this, he felt even more regretful. He had never thought that the small figure he had never taken seriously would have grown to such a level.","A peak Domainian was comparable to a Supreme King.","It was a good opportunity to kill Chu Yunfan, but he hadn’t cherished it.","While he was still in a daze, Chu Yunfan entered Zhenyao City with the Grand Xia Grand Commandant.","Chu Yunfan looked around and saw terrifying auras everywhere in the city. However, many of them were in the stage of hiding.","The demons had besieged Zhenyao City for so long, but they had not even forced out the city’s foundation.","But even so, Grand Xia was still extremely careful and serious. This was because behind these demon armies was a group of demon armies that were no less ferocious than the demon armies.","Everyone could see the demon army’s intentions. They were planning to take advantage of the situation.","Therefore, even though there was still a lot of combat power left, Zhenyao City had yet to unleash its full potential.","This was because their true enemy was the demon army. They had to keep an army. After defeating the demons, they could block the demon army’s counterattack.","He followed the Grand Xia Grand Commandant to the Grand Commandant’s Mansion in Zhenyao City. Many people were very curious about this person’s background.","He could actually make the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia personally welcome him.","It was because Chu Yunfan’s rise was too short. It was so short that before many people could fight back, he was already invincible.","Many of them were old antiques who had been guarding Zhenyao City for many years. They did not feel much about the changes in the outside world.","Therefore, many of them did not know who Chu Yunfan was.","“Please sit!” The Grand Commandant of Grand Xia took the lead and sat down.","“Thank you, Grand Commandant!” Chu Yunfan cupped his hands.","Chu Yunfan admired this pillar that had protected the human race for many years.","Even if you couldn’t do it, it didn’t stop you from admiring such a person.","The Grand Xia Grand Commandant looked at Chu Yunfan, who was neither servile nor overbearing. Many marquises and even dukes could not help but feel nervous and afraid when they saw him.","This was because they were facing a legend. In his lifetime, the Grand Commandant had done countless meritorious deeds and defended Grand Xia and the entire human race.","One or two marquises, after encountering someone like the Grand Xia Grand Commandant, all their achievements added up were simply not enough.","However, Chu Yunfan did not have such thoughts. He was neither servile nor overbearing.","This piqued the Grand Xia Grand Commandant’s curiosity. He already knew that Chu Yunfan was special.","If it wasn’t special, he wouldn’t have saved Chu Yunfan so many times.","However, he did not expect Chu Yunfan to be so special. From the first time he attacked Chu Yunfan, it had only been a few years, but he had already reached the peak Domain Stage or even stronger.","“You’re very strong. No wonder you can easily kill a half-King!” After a long time, he slowly opened his mouth and looked at Chu Yunfan.","“Thank you for your praise. However, I believe that you aren’t meeting me because I am very strong or special, Grand Commandant!” Chu Yunfan looked at the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia.","In Grand Xia, in theory, the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia was an existence second only to the ruler of Grand Xia.","He was the number two figure of Grand Xia.","Of course, the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia had been very low-key all these years. He didn’t speak easily and cooperated well with the king. There was no conflict between the king and his subjects as many people thought.","“That’s right. I didn’t call you here just to praise you!” The Grand Commandant nodded. “In fact, I only asked you to come here for one thing. I want you to lead your troops to quell the chaos!”","“Lead troops to quell the chaos? That is my duty. Even if you don’t say it, I will do it!” Chu Yunfan said righteously, “These people are doing all sorts of evil in the Central Plains, doing whatever they want. I must capture them and kill them!”","The Grand Commandant nodded and smiled in satisfaction. This was not a waste of Grand Xia’s nurturing.","Right now, they did not have many people they could rely on. Every family was competing with each other in terms of consumption. The consumption was really too great.","“But this alone is far from enough!” the Grand Commandant said, “If that’s the case, it’s meaningless. I know that you want to train the External Army into a first-class army, but that kind of hard work is useless because their foundation is too weak. They can usually suppress the enemy, but when the enemy is an army that has been trained by the Demon Realm for countless years, they must be careful.","“I want you to lead your troops and quell all the chaos. Kill all those half-Kings who trespassed into Grand Xia!” The Grand Commandant of Grand Xia said, “It’s not convenient for me and my fellow Daoists to leave because we’re being watched by a group of Kings. Although they don’t usually do anything, as long as we leave, I’m afraid that Zhenyao City will be captured immediately. And we can only rely on you!","“The more you kill, the more rewards you will receive. The human king and I will never forget your meritorious service!” the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia slowly said.","He spoke of his helplessness and difficulties. It wasn’t that they didn’t want to sweep away the armies and experts of the Central Plains.","However, they were all tied down by someone and could not leave. Once they left, the place they were guarding would probably immediately welcome a calamity."]},{"number":2348,"title":"Chapter 2348: Continuous Benefits, Law Crystals!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2348: Continuous Benefits, Law Crystals!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It could be said that these Kings were all restrained by their respective enemies and could not move at all. At this moment, the only ones they could rely on were probably those half-Kings.","Among these half-Kings, Chu Yunfan was undoubtedly the strongest.","Killing a half-King also made Chu Yunfan an existence at the center of the storm during this period of time. Naturally, he also entered the eyes of the Grand Xia Grand Commandant.","“If you want to advance to the King Stage, the various resources you need are undoubtedly astronomical. If you accumulate them normally, who knows how many years it will take? But now, with the full support of the Grand Xia Empire, you can advance to the King Stage in the shortest time possible!” the Grand Xia Grand Commandant looked at Chu Yunfan and said in a deep voice.","Chu Yunfan knew the Grand Xia Grand Commandant’s good intentions. The Grand Xia Grand Commandant’s attitude had already made everything clear. It was completely different from before. If it was before, Chu Yunfan was just an ordinary marquise in the eyes of the Grand Xia Grand Commandant and the human king.","But now, Chu Yunfan, who could already kill a half-King, had undoubtedly become a partner who could stand shoulder-to-shoulder with them.","Although Chu Yunfan was only at the half-King Stage for the time being, his future was limitless. He might even become a King.","It was precisely because of this that the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia did not directly send Chu Yunfan over with a military order. Instead, he asked Chu Yunfan to come over on an equal footing.","“I can give you enough benefits now. Here are 300,000 pills. You can give them to your army. They can improve their cultivation in the shortest time possible. They can fight against the elite army of the demons!” The Grand Commandant waved his hand, and a spatial bag appeared in his hand. He then handed it to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan scanned it with his divine will and immediately knew that it was indeed 300,000 pills. Although it was not useful to him at the moment, it was still very useful to the ordinary soldiers of the External Army.","“Thank you, Grand Commandant!” Chu Yunfan quickly said.","“No need to thank me. The External Army is also an army of Grand Xia. Helping you is also helping Grand Xia!” The Grand Commandant waved his hand. “This is an eventful and chaotic era. However, as the saying goes, heroes are born in troubled times. In such troubled times, it is the time for heroes to rise. You are the one that the human king and I think the most highly of!”","“But as the saying goes, the emperor doesn’t lack hungry soldiers. Now, it’s not impossible for you and the human king to let me lead the army to war, but can you advance some things so that I won’t encounter enemies I can’t deal with outside?” Chu Yunfan said with a smile, lowering himself. In any case, regardless of age or strength, he could only be considered the junior of the Grand Xia Grand Commandant. Naturally, he did not feel that there was anything to be embarrassed about.","“You... You’re very cunning!” The Grand Xia Grand Commandant laughed out loud. He had always thought highly of Chu Yunfan, or else he wouldn’t have saved him so many times. Now that he saw Chu Yunfan acting a little shamelessly, he didn’t get angry and just laughed out loud.","“This law crystal is for you. This is a law crystal that can only be condensed by an Emperor. With it, the difficulty of comprehending laws will be greatly reduced!” The Grand Commandant smiled.","As he spoke, the Grand Commandant flipped his palm, and a hexagonal crystal appeared in his hand. It flickered with the light of laws.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes immediately lit up. He knew too well what a law crystal was. This was a precious resource that only existed during the ancient times.","Because only Emperors could condense such law crystals.","That was because an Emperor’s comprehension of the laws had already reached an extremely shocking level. Only then could one compress their comprehension of the laws into crystals.","He had once seen this kind of law crystal in the memory of the Alchemy Emperor. Moreover, even for Emperors, this kind of law crystal might take decades or even hundreds of years to condense.","It could be said to be very precious. It was also usually used by Emperors to reward the best of their disciples or subordinates to help them advance to the King Stage.","After all, not everyone had the ability to become an Emperor.","To be able to advance to the King Stage was already the ambition of countless people.","However, after the fall of the Emperors in ancient times, this kind of law crystal had become less and less. In fact, it was basically only heard of in name now.","He didn’t expect the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia to have a law crystal.","However, when he thought of the foundation of Grand Xia, he was not surprised. If there was no such thing, how could Grand Xia guarantee the existence of Kings for generations?","How could it guarantee that Grand Xia would last for countless years?","“Hahaha, thank you, Grand Commandant. This is perfect!” Chu Yunfan quickly put away the law crystal.","With this law crystal, the difficulty of Chu Yunfan breaking through to the King Stage would be reduced by at least half. All that was left was to rely on the huge energy bar to complete the transformation that was similar to being reborn.","“I was optimistic about the others, but I didn’t expect you to be the first to stand out among so many ancient Supremes!” The Grand Commandant of Grand Xia sighed. “Although the others are already at peak Domain Stage, in this chaotic world, their cultivation is not enough to affect the world. They still need some time to grow before they can advance to the half-King Stage. As for the King Stage, it’s even further away!”","The Grand Xia Grand Commandant’s mindset had long transcended the difference between dynasties. Even if the ancient prodigies had broken through, he would still help them.","In this turbulent world, the stronger the human race was, the better. Every rising human expert could increase the foundation of the human race.","“That’s why this is an unprecedented opportunity for you. Because the others are not on par with you, the empire will pour all its strength and resources into you. Only then will you be able to advance to the King Stage in the shortest time possible. As for the others, I’m afraid they won’t be so lucky!”","Chu Yunfan nodded at the Grand Xia Grand Commandant’s words. This was indeed an unprecedented opportunity for him.","Becoming the first bird would allow him to enjoy all the benefits alone. Countless resources would come from all directions. Only then would it be possible for him to advance to the King Stage in the shortest time possible.","The pros and cons were mixed!","If he could endure it, it would become his foundation and an opportunity to completely surpass his peers.","“I believe that I don’t need to tell you anything about this. You understand. The rest is up to you. You can go now. I hope you can lead your troops to the battlefield as soon as possible!” At this moment, the Grand Commandant waved his hand.","“Then I’ll take my leave first!”"]},{"number":2349,"title":"Chapter 2349: Slaying a Prospective King","paragraphs":["Chapter 2349: Slaying a Prospective King","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After Chu Yunfan bid farewell to the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia, he immediately returned to Zhenyuan City.","This time, he obtained many benefits from meeting the Grand Xia Grand Commandant, especially the law crystal. This was something that could not be bought no matter how much money was spent.","This probably would not be so easily brought out on normal days. Otherwise, many half-Kings would have broken through to the King Stage.","However, in this chaotic world, not only did he have to rely on Grand Xia, but Grand Xia also needed to rely on experts like him. That was why they rewarded law crystals.","No matter what the Grand Xia Grand Commandant and the human king were thinking, there was no doubt that Chu Yunfan would benefit the most.","However, just as Chu Yunfan returned to Zhenyuan City, he saw a figure sitting cross-legged above Zhenyuan City. When he saw Chu Yunfan, his eyes lit up and he went straight to Chu Yunfan.","“You must be Chu Yunfan,” the figure slowly spoke.","Chu Yunfan looked at the person who had come. A monstrous demonic aura was released from his body. After seeing Chu Yunfan, he seemed to feel that there was no need to hide it.","It was a human, but he cultivated the cultivation method of the demonic path!","Originally, this type of person was the most suppressed in the Central Plains, and there were people of every race. After all, the cultivation systems of the demons and the Central Plains were completely different.","But now that the demons had invaded, these people suddenly became active.","Most of them had defected to the demons. These demonic cultivators were already cruel to begin with.","Not to mention that they were usually ostracized. Now that they finally had a chance, they naturally wanted to find a chance to take revenge.","“That’s right, I’m Chu Yunfan!” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“Great. My lord sent me to kill you. You are too arrogant. You killed two of my race’s Kings. This is your greatest sin. Even with all the water in the world, you won’t be able to wash yourself clean!” the figure said as he revealed his original appearance.","This was an old man with white hair and a youthful face. He was dressed in black and looked extremely terrifying.","“As a human, you should be killed for defecting to the demons! As a living being of the Central Plains, you defected to the astral demons. You deserve to be killed!” Chu Yunfan made two consecutive kills, and the entire world echoed him with an explosion, like a clap of thunder.","Opposite him, the old man’s expression did not change at all. A demonic cultivator like him did not care about these things.","“Hahahaha, well said. We are usually discriminated against in the Central Plains, and no one treats us as orthodox cultivators of the Central Plains. Now, you’re accusing us of siding with the demons? In your eyes, aren’t we pawns left behind by the demons?” The ruddy old man laughed.","What he was talking about was the current situation. Even if they cultivated modified demonic techniques that could adapt to the environment of the Central Plains, in the eyes of the vast majority of the living beings of the Central Plains, these people were basically spies left behind by the demons.","In fact, what they thought was right. Many demonic cultivators who cultivated demonic techniques were indeed spies of the astral demons.","It was just that they usually did not activate them. In fact, they were passed down from generation to generation until the demon invasion. Only then would these spies be activated one after another.","“Cut the crap. No matter how glib your tongue is, you will definitely die today!” Chu Yunfan said with a cold smile.","“Hahaha, you want to kill me? Such a person hasn’t been born yet!” The black-robed old man laughed. The demonic energy in his entire body materialized and transformed into a demonic domain in an instant.","Compared to the Demon Dragon King, the Giant Demon King, and the others who were killed by Chu Yunfan, this black-robed old man’s strength was obviously much stronger. He had already condensed more than 8,000 laws, completely surpassing the ordinary half-King Stage.","It was enough to be on the Prospective Kings List. Once he comprehended something, he could advance to the King Stage at any time.","However, compared to Chu Yunfan, it was nothing.","Chu Yunfan had already successfully cultivated 10,000 laws. The difference between them was like heaven and earth, unsurpassable.","Chu Yunfan took a step forward and rushed into the black-robed old man’s demonic domain.","The black-robed old man waved his hand. In an instant, boundless demonic energy sealed the space, transforming this place into a demon country.","Immediately after, a supreme demonic shadow appeared in the demonic domain. The demonic shadow erupted with a terrifying attack and attacked Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan took a step forward, clenched his fist, and threw a punch.","Boom!","A terrifying collision occurred in an instant. Chu Yunfan’s punch shattered the supreme demonic shadow formed in the demonic domain. The supreme demonic shadow could not do anything to Chu Yunfan.","They were blasted apart!","He couldn’t even make Chu Yunfan take a step back.","After the supreme demonic shadow was scattered, it turned into a gale that filled the sky. Chu Yunfan did not move at all. He was as motionless as a mountain, like a god.","“What is it? How can he be so powerful?” Before the black-robed old man could react, Chu Yunfan had already rushed in front of him.","Then, he punched the black-robed old man.","The black-robed old man was still a little stunned after being hit. He never expected that he would be so vulnerable when facing Chu Yunfan.","He was casually hit by a punch.","Spurt!","He spat out a mouthful of blood and was sent flying. His expression immediately became dispirited. He had cultivated for so many years, but this was the first time he had encountered such a monster.","Chu Yunfan completely ignored his domain and divine arts, directly charging at him and sending him flying.","“What is this?” The black-robed old man saw Chu Yunfan rushing in front of him with a huge medicinal cauldron in his hand and then throwing it at him.","Bam!","With a sound that sounded like metal clashing, the black-robed old man was sent flying and almost died.","Though he wasn’t smashed to death, he felt like all the bones in his body were about to fall apart. There was almost no bone left intact.","Chu Yunfan didn’t stop at all. He chased after him and used the Seven Violet Thunder Swords, the Nine Underworld Stomps, and various other martial arts techniques.","The black-robed old man had been sent flying many times. All his methods were useless in front of Chu Yunfan.","He was completely beaten up.","“I can’t accept this. This is impossible!”","The black-robed old man was furious. He was already on the Prospective Kings List. How could he be so vulnerable?","He should be a peerless figure in the world.","Stab!","A terrifying giant sword pierced through him and nailed him firmly to the ground."]},{"number":2350,"title":"Chapter 2350: One Year, Bold Words","paragraphs":["Chapter 2350: One Year, Bold Words","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Those who offend our human race will be killed no matter how far away they are!”","Chu Yunfan’s words spread throughout the world, and the price was the death of a powerful existence in the King Stage.","One after another, half-Kings were usually unimaginably powerful. Other than the King Stage, there was no one who could match them.","Now that another one had fallen at Chu Yunfan’s hands, it highlighted his terror.","“Among the many prodigies and Supreme Youths, he should be a top existence!” Someone sighed.","“Although I knew that the rise of the Supreme Youth was the general trend, I didn’t expect that he wouldn’t even give me this little bit of time!” a famous half-King said.","For a moment, the entire world seemed to be shocked by Chu Yunfan’s astonishing battle results.","Whether it was the demons, humans, or demons, half-Kings had all fallen at his hands. It seemed that as long as they stood in front of him, none of them would have a good ending.","“If he continues to slaughter half-Kings like this, he will definitely die in the hands of half-Kings in the future!” an unknown half-step King roared.","It seemed that Chu Yunfan’s existence had broken a tacit understanding between them.","A piece of news immediately spread out. Among the half-Kings, there seemed to be a tacit understanding. When the Kings were restrained by each other and had no time to care about them, they could seize territory and resources to their heart’s content to allow themselves to advance.","After all, they were only a step away from the top of the world. If they were to give up here, they would naturally not be willing.","Originally, they were suppressed by those Kings. It was impossible for them to cause trouble.","However, this time was different. It was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity, and it might also be their last chance to advance to the King Stage.","This was the fundamental reason why these Kings had appeared one after another and created a chaotic situation.","A half-King who wanted to break through to the King Stage would need an astronomical amount of resources. Moreover, they would need extremely shocking talent and opportunities.","These were all things they lacked. Not everyone was a Supreme Youth. As long as they accumulated, they would naturally become an emperor.","Many people were worried that this would be an unprecedented chaotic world.","“The harmonious men of the current era are already causing such a huge commotion if they want to advance to the King Stage. If we add in those Supreme Youths and the outstanding prodigies of the ancient times who are about to reach this stage, I’m afraid that there will be endless killings again and again in order to compete for resources!”","Many people were already a little afraid. Just the competition between these experts of the current era was already very brutal. In addition, those ancient prodigies had grown up one after another. The world was probably going to fall apart.","This was an unprecedented chaotic world. For the strong, it might be a golden age, but for the ordinary people, it was the end of the world.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan made another declaration.","“No matter if it’s the demons, humans, monsters, marine folks, Hus, or barbarians, any half-step King who dares to cause trouble will die!”","For a time, the entire world was in an uproar. Chu Yunfan had completely pushed himself to the opposite side of these half-step Kings. Other than a few half-step Kings that belonged to Grand Xia, Chu Yunfan pushed himself to the opposite side of the entire world.","“Is he crazy?” Many people found it unbelievable. Even if he was very strong, and in many people’s eyes, he would definitely become a King in the future, he had offended so many people in one go. It was probably difficult for him to escape death.","Even the Flying Celestials was in an uproar because of Chu Yunfan’s words.","“What is Junior Chu doing? Isn’t he afraid that everyone will become his enemy?” Huangfu Longhao was shocked by Chu Yunfan’s astonishing skill.","“I’m going to help Brother Fan!” After Chu Hongcai received the news, he immediately left the Flying Celestials and headed for Zhenyuan City.","At the same time, the Golden Roc, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, the Sea Dragon, and the Dragon-Headed Crocodile, who were related to Chu Yunfan, all rushed to Zhenyuan City.","For a time, the small Zhenyuan City had gathered a dozen Supreme Youths.","Only then did the Flying Celestials suddenly realize that although the Flying Celestials originally seemed to have more than a dozen Supreme Youths and an unprecedentedly prosperous lineup, it was only at the truly critical moment that they finally realized it.","These people were related to Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan and the Flying Celestials had the same stance, so they had the same stance as the Flying Celestials. Once Chu Yunfan broke off relations with the Flying Celestials, they would immediately break off relations with the Flying Celestials.","Huangfu Longhao was the only Supreme Youth who truly belonged to the Flying Celestials.","It seemed that the Flying Celestials had escaped from the tragic fate of being at the bottom during this period of time, but in fact, it was just a good thing that Chu Yunfan had brought.","After making this declaration, Chu Yunfan quickly welcomed Chu Hongcai and the others. With the addition of more than ten Supreme Youths, the strength of Zhenyuan City suddenly became extremely terrifying.","These Supreme Youths were no longer the same as before. Just having fame and strength was not enough. In fact, they had already reached the peak 5,000 laws of Supreme Youths.","If they had enough opportunities, they could even bypass the half-King Stage and directly rush into the King Stage.","From the peak of Domain Stage to the King Stage, one did not have to reach the half-King Stage before advancing to the King Stage.","Since ancient times, there had been many people who had directly bypassed it to reach the King Stage. However, many people later discovered that it was really too difficult to directly rush through.","That was why they were only at the half-King Stage.","Now, Chu Hongcai and the others could theoretically advance to the King Stage.","With the addition of these experts, it was much easier for Chu Yunfan to manage the army. Especially after Chu Yunfan distributed the pills given by the Grand Xia Grand Commandant to the ordinary soldiers of the army, the strength of the entire army increased at an astonishing rate.","However, Chu Yunfan was still waiting. He was waiting for the strength of the army to reach its limit. Before the army could digest this strength, Chu Yunfan chose to wait.","However, he continued to preach the Dao every day and then cultivate bitterly. This kind of time passed for more than a year.","During this process, Chu Yunfan didn’t even send the army out to train.","Originally, everyone was concerned about what Chu Yunfan, who had made such bold and ambitious remarks, would do.","However, as time passed, Chu Yunfan’s words had gradually become a laughing stock. In many people’s eyes, Chu Yunfan’s words were just to curry favor with the higher-ups of Grand Xia.","In fact, he did not have the courage to fight against all the half-Kings in the world."]},{"number":2351,"title":"Chapter 2351: Killing Into the Grassland","paragraphs":["Chapter 2351: Killing Into the Grassland","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Under such circumstances, the attention that Chu Yunfan’s bold words had attracted gradually dissipated. In the eyes of many people, Chu Yunfan had become an ordinary half-King Stage giant.","He was no longer special.","On this day, 300,000 soldiers stood in the cold wind on the drill ground in the camp of the distant army in Zhenyuan City. Countless figures even had to float in the sky to stand still.","This was the brand-new External Army. After a year of training, this army had undergone a complete transformation. All of them had entered the Arcana Stage, and most of the officers had reached the Middle or even Major Arcana Stage.","Such cultivation might not be enough in the current Great Era, but when 300,000 experts of this level formed an army, the terrifying army formed was enough to sweep away all powerful enemies.","Chu Yunfan looked at these people in front of him and nodded in satisfaction. This was his hard work over the years. Of course, the most important thing was the 300,000 pills given by the Grand Xia Grand Commandant. It could be said that it was with these pills that these mediocre soldiers were finally promoted to the top of the world.","Compared to any other army in the world, this army wasn’t weak at all.","“Army, move out!” Chu Yunfan shouted, and the army set off.","That terrifying aura immediately attracted the attention of all the factions at the border of the four clans.","Even though the various major factions had gradually shifted their attention away, they still placed spies here.","These scouts immediately spread the news of the External Army’s departure.","Although many people regarded Chu Yunfan as a laughingstock because he had not done anything for more than a year, no one dared to underestimate him.","After all, this was a fellow who had truly killed terrifying existences on the Prospective Kings List.","As soon as this army moved out, they immediately headed toward the Hus in the north.","At this moment, a group of Hu cavalry from the north was wreaking havoc. The Hus were riding on terrifying ferocious beasts and wreaking havoc in the borderland of the human race.","The army of Grand Xia had no way of resisting these cavalry because the true elite troops were all at the border.","Even the elite troops at the border could not stop such an elite force of ten thousand people.","There were many such troops at the borderland of the human race.","It was as if all the races had reached a tacit agreement to destroy the human race first.","However, while they were wreaking havoc, an even more terrifying and powerful cavalry had already appeared in front of them.","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","A rain of arrows covered the sky and the earth, destroying everything in its path. The ten thousand Hu cavalry did not even have time to react before they were killed by the arrows fired by the three hundred thousand soldiers of the External Army.","In the past year, they had not made a single move. Not only was Chu Yunfan ridiculed, but the External Army was also under great pressure.","However, they did not really become cowards. They were just trying to seize the time to improve themselves.","However, no outsider understood. Now, they could finally vent their anger.","In just one volley, this troop of ten thousand Hu cavalrymen was wiped out. Their bodies were pierced through by the rain of arrows and exploded.","Chu Yunfan was expressionless. He stood in the middle of the army and looked at everything in front of him coldly, sensing the Hu army one after another.","The External Army began their journey of sweeping away the enemy.","These Hu cavalry who had barged in were looting everywhere and committing all sorts of crimes. They did not even notice that the terrifying death god was descending.","Within ten days, the Hu army that had infiltrated Grand Xia had been completely wiped out. This shocking news quickly spread throughout the world, causing an uproar.","“A tiger is a tiger after all. Even if it dozed off for a while, it’s still a tiger!” Someone sighed.","Chu Yunfan’s astonishing performance made everyone admit that in this one year, Chu Yunfan had not become a coward, but had honed his basic skills.","As the saying went, sharpening a knife would not delay the woodcutter.","Just when everyone thought that Chu Yunfan would stop at the border, they did not expect him to lead 300,000 troops into the vast grassland.","In these ten days of conquest, the External Army suffered no casualties.","The Hu cavalrymen looked very powerful, but they could not even withstand a single volley of arrows before turning into ashes.","Boom, boom, boom!","In the depths of the grassland, the war horn sounded, and countless grassland cavalry began to gather.","Chu Yunfan’s army advanced at an incredible speed. In less than half a day, they had already rushed into the depths of the grassland.","The elite cavalry of the Hus was held back by the elites of Grand Xia’s border. They had no way of returning to help immediately.","But even so, the children of the Hus began to train as soldiers at a very young age. Even if they were not soldiers, they easily formed an army of millions and blocked Chu Yunfan.","“This battle is destined to be a river of blood and a mountain of corpses. We must let these barbaric Hus know the consequences of angering us humans. They must pay with blood!”","“A debt of blood must be repaid in blood!”","“A debt of blood must be repaid in blood!”","“A debt of blood must be repaid in blood!”","The army of the External Army roared. They had seen too many tragedies in the past ten days. Countless cavalry were rampaging and killing their fellow humans.","Now, it was time to seek justice from the Hus.","This battle would become a legendary battle.","An earth-shattering battle had begun. An army of more than a million covered the plains like two dark clouds, blotting out the sky and covering everything.","It was completely silent. Even the insects did not dare to make a sound under this terrifying killing intent.","It was like a deathly stillness.","“Kill them!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","The 300,000 soldiers of the External Army, led by Chu Hongcai, the Golden Roc, and the others, split up and attacked with their magic artifacts even though they were outnumbered.","At this time, Chu Yunfan finally moved. He flew out from the middle of the army.","He flew above the two armies.","“Nine Netherworld Stomps!” Chu Yunfan shouted and stomped down with one foot. It was as if he could destroy the world. The endless netherworld water drowned everything.","Boom!","Heaven and earth shook violently. Tens of thousands of Hu cavalry were trampled to death by Chu Yunfan, and they screamed as they turned into a rain of blood."]},{"number":2352,"title":"Chapter 2352: The Hus’ Trump Card","paragraphs":["Chapter 2352: The Hus’ Trump Card","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A huge battle between the millions of soldiers on both sides erupted in an instant!","Chu Yunfan’s attack completely broke the stalemate.","On the grassland, alarm bells were ringing everywhere, spreading for thousands of miles, even tens of thousands of miles.","It had been too long since Grand Xia’s army had been able to sweep this position.","As they continued to invade, the border troops of Grand Xia slowly focused on defense. Now, they were finally forced into the hinterland.","They tried to stop the surprise attack of the army, but it was all in vain. In terms of absolute strength, the army was definitely one of the top few armies in the world.","Even if they fought against the elite guards of the various races, they would not be inferior!","In the depths of the plains, behind the million-strong army, battleships were shooting out terrifying attacks.","Within the army, battle fortresses appeared one after another. At this point, it was no longer a small fight, but a clash between the two races.","But even so, those floating battleships were destroyed in a very short period of time. The Hus did not have the ability to develop all kinds of war weapons, even if they had captured the war weapons of Grand Xia.","Many of the models of the battleships were already very old, and they were no match for the latest model battle fortresses.","This was a massacre. The entire army of the External Army quickly slaughtered this grassland alliance army.","Among the millions of soldiers, there were also experts. Many Domainians rode on extremely terrifying war chariots and soared into the sky.","“Hahaha, it’s our turn!” At this moment, Chu Hongcai flew out from within, laughing loudly.","Commanding the army was left to the deputy. He wielded his sword and charged into the army like a terrifying sword aura, engaging the Domainians.","The Domainians had never seen such a scene before. They were all killed like they were ants.","Chu Hongcai was like a sharp sword. Anyone who stood in his way would die.","They couldn’t even withstand a single attack, and those Domainians were killed like ants.","Chu Yunfan crossed his arms and did not stop Chu Hongcai.","To him, all of this was natural. Chu Hongcai’s strength had broken through from peak Domain Stage to the half-King Stage in just a year under his guidance.","Although it was only an additional 1,000 laws, reaching 6,000 laws, this was already beyond the Domain Stage. He had already glimpsed a portion of the King Stage laws.","The strength of a half-King was naturally not something that ordinary Domainians could compete with. Not everyone was like Chu Yunfan, and not everyone could have that kind of strength.","Following closely behind were the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, Sea Dragon, Golden Roc, Dragon-Headed Crocodile, and the others. They all transformed into their original forms and began to slaughter.","These people’s aptitude was not inferior to Chu Hongcai’s. During this period of time, they had all become half-Kings.","Even the Dragon-Headed Crocodile and the others, who were slightly less talented, had already surpassed the limit of the Supreme Youths’ 5,000 laws. With 5,500 laws, each of them was more powerful than the other.","Although they were all at the bottom of the half-King Stage, a half-King was still a half-King. It was not something a Domainian could compete with.","It didn’t take long for the million-strong army to be killed. Whether it was the absolute strength of the army or the absolute strength of the experts, the External Army was completely capable of crushing them.","“Kill them!”","The entire army was roaring. This was a flood of steel that could crush any powerful enemy that tried to stop them.","The Hu battleships in the plains were destroyed one after another. Even if there were some new models that were stronger, they would still be destroyed.","However, it was not enough to stop the External Army. Chu Yunfan personally took care of the more powerful battleships.","At this moment, a mountain-like figure swept over from afar.","Everyone took a closer look. It was a terrifying lone wolf. This lone wolf was huge, like a huge mountain standing between heaven and earth. It was more than a thousand meters tall.","It seemed to reach the clouds and was extremely terrifying.","This lone wolf was emitting an extremely terrifying aura.","“The Sky Wolf God has appeared!”","The Hus members all shouted as if they had found a home for their souls. The situation of their initial defeat had also stabilized.","Chu Yunfan looked at the lone wolf coldly. This should be one of the most terrifying totems in the grassland.","The grassland Hus was originally a branch of the human race, but later on, they believed in the evil god and split into the Hus.","And those evil gods were the guardian totems of the tribes.","Clearly, this lone wolf was a totem.","These totems often lived for a very, very long time, even thousands of years, or even tens of thousands of years. They could protect a tribe for a very, very long time.","The aura of this lone wolf was increasing, and it was erupting with the terrifying strength of a half-step King.","5,000, 6,000, 7,000, 8,000. In the end, it broke through to 9,000 before finally stopping.","This was an experienced half-King!","It was almost in contact with the King Stage. It was one of the most ancient totems on the grasslands.","Chu Hongcai, who was at the front, immediately felt this terrifying aura.","Even though he was a half-King, he could sense how terrifying this lone wolf was. It was far above him.","“Roar!” The lone wolf let out a furious roar, and the huge grassland was shattered into countless pieces. A long blade shot out from its mouth, and the cold light on the blade was piercingly cold. Then, it suddenly turned into a terrifying blade light and slashed fiercely in Chu Hongcai’s direction.","“D*mned beast, do you think I would be afraid of you?” Chu Hongcai roared loudly. Every cell in his body was spitting out sword light, which turned into a huge sword above his head and fought against the long blade.","Boom!","The terrifying attacks from both sides collided fiercely. The terrifying energy tore apart and destroyed everything.","Chu Hongcai was the first to be unable to withstand it. Although he was also at the half-King Stage, he was only at the half-King Stage who had cultivated 6,000 laws.","The lone wolf opposite him was a terrifying existence that had already cultivated 9,000 laws. It was not surprising for such an existence to advance to the King Stage in the next moment.","Spurt!","Chu Hongcai spat out a mouthful of blood and flew backward. He was severely injured by the lone wolf."]},{"number":2353,"title":"Chapter 2353: Killing Lone Wolf King","paragraphs":["Chapter 2353: Killing Lone Wolf King","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Hongcai had suffered a huge loss when he fought the lone wolf.","“Go, kill this old wolf. We’ll have wolf meat hotpot tonight!”","At this moment, the Golden Roc roared. He had followed Chu Yunfan for the longest time and had picked up some of Chu Yunfan’s habits. He also knew what hotpot was.","For a moment, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow and the others even drooled. Especially after eating the flood dragon previously, the thought made them drool over the meat of a half-King.","It was just that such an opportunity was rare.","Now, they finally saw an opportunity!","Even though they knew that the lone wolf was very powerful, they were not willing to give up such an opportunity.","These experts roared one after another, and then a dozen people rushed toward Lone Wolf King.","When Lone Wolf King saw more than a dozen half-Kings charged at him greed in their eyes, he was so frightened that he almost turned around and ran.","Normally, it was already very shocking for a half-step King to appear. However, more than ten of them appeared in one go. Even if his strength was far above these half-Kings, he still had to be afraid.","What was going on?","Could there have been a mass production of half-Kings?","Especially when he saw how young they were, the lone wolf could not understand what was going on.","How could there be so many young half-Kings?","However, he almost immediately understood that this was probably the ancient young prodigies recorded in the information some time ago.","Only they could become existences at the half-King Stage at such a young age.","However, according to the information, under normal circumstances, it was only possible for such a Supreme Youth to break through within half a year.","However, who would have thought that only a short period of time had passed, and so many top-notch martial arts experts who had already become half-Kings had actually appeared in the world.","“They are just a motley crew!”","But soon, the lone wolf regained its arrogance and did not put Chu Yunfan and the others in its eyes at all.","Although the number of people was a little exaggerated, a mob was still a mob.","Soon, the lone wolf clashed with the dozen or so extremely terrifying Supreme Youths who wanted to turn him into a wolf meat hotpot.","Boom! Boom!","Lone Wolf King had the upper hand from the beginning, but it was only because he was very powerful, but there were more people on the other side.","For a moment, a strange balance was formed.","For a moment, both the grassland alliance army and the 300,000 strong army were shocked.","The main characters in the world were no longer them, but the terrifying existences that belonged to the dozen or so half-Kings who were attacking crazily in the sky.","Even the lone wolf felt a little flustered when he was stared at by the Golden Roc and the others. It was as if he was just food to them.","He didn’t know why he had such a feeling, but he trusted his intuition.","More than a dozen people fought hard!","All kinds of terrifying attacks pierced through the sky.","“It’s too terrifying. Is this the power of the half-King Stage?”","“However, no matter how powerful he is, it’s impossible for him to be as powerful as Marquis Zhenyuan behind us. Even that existence on the Prospective Kings List is not his match at all.","However, after a moment of shock, an even more brutal battle broke out. The entire External Army was in a frenzy, and the grassland alliance army was also inspired by the appearance of lone wolf. They actually picked up their weapons and returned to fighting the External Army.","They were all waiting for quality to triumph over quantity. They were waiting for their Heavenly Wolf Divine General to kill all those human brats!”","“No one has ever dared to venture so deep into the grass. But even so, you will still die. The dignity of the Hus cannot be trampled upon!”","At this moment, the lone wolf forced back the experts who were pouncing on him. It only stared coldly at Chu Hongcai.","He could sense that there was a powerful aura rushing over from afar.","As long as he could stall for some time, he would be able to tear these detestable humans into pieces.","Chu Yunfan suddenly stood up and rushed directly at the lone wolf.","Even though the lone wolf’s strength was monstrous, his aura was actually suppressed in front of Chu Yunfan.","The lone wolf’s heart skipped a beat. It had a bad feeling.","“Roar!”","However, the lone wolf reacted very quickly. It opened its bloody mouth and a torrent of energy swept toward Chu Yunfan.","He was waiting for Chu Yunfan to react, and then he would decide how to pursue him.","Such a method could be said to have been tried and tested. Using absolute tyrannical strength to force the other party to avoid the edge of the blade. If they wanted to leave, they would fall into his trap and die in the trap.","However, something he had never expected happened. Chu Yunfan waved his hand and crushed the terrifying energy torrent in front of him.","Then, Chu Yunfan slapped him.","Bam!","This slap landed on the face of the mountain-like lone wolf.","Boom!","The lone wolf screamed and flew backward. Even with his own strength, he was unable to withstand Chu Yunfan’s slap. One could imagine how shocking this slap was.","The lone wolf howled wildly, hoping that the reinforcements would arrive soon.","However, Chu Yunfan had already seen through his thoughts. He just looked at the lone wolf coldly.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan had already made his move. He directly pounced on the lone wolf and then with a left hook, he suddenly sent the lone wolf flying.","It was as if heaven and earth were trembling violently. The lone wolf let out a miserable cry. Its entire lower jaw had been smashed by Chu Yunfan’s punch, turning into a piece of broken bone.","This terrifying giant wolf, which had cultivated 9,000 laws, tried to trap Chu Yunfan with its domain so that he couldn’t attack it.","Who would have thought that just as he released his domain, it would be torn to pieces by Chu Yunfan with one hand. It could not protect him at all.","Chu Yunfan’s attacks continued to fall. In just a moment, the lone wolf was on the verge of death.","Whether it was his physical strength or his understanding of the Great Dao, he was far inferior to Chu Yunfan.","In front of Chu Yunfan, he was like a target that was easily defeated and killed.","Boom!","In the next moment, the wolf’s head was smashed by Chu Yunfan’s punch and it died a tragic death!"]},{"number":2354,"title":"Chapter 2354: The Hus’ Foundation, the Old Khan","paragraphs":["Chapter 2354: The Hus’ Foundation, the Old Khan","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When this Lone Wolf King encountered Chu Yunfan, it was like it had encountered its nemesis. It was easily beaten up by Chu Yunfan.","He was no match for Chu Yunfan.","He was very powerful, even among the half-King Stage, he was very experienced and very powerful. However, he just had to encounter a super monster like Chu Yunfan who had cultivated 10,000 laws.","Blood was splattering everywhere, and corpses were falling. The most tragic battlefield could be seen everywhere.","After Chu Yunfan killed Lone Wolf King, the entire grassland alliance army fell into a state of collapse.","In other words, they were already on the verge of collapse. It was only the Lone Wolf King’s existence that forcefully boosted their confidence. But now, before they could recover this little bit of confidence, it was shattered by Chu Yunfan.","In front of Chu Yunfan’s absolute strength, numbers were meaningless.","“Block them! We can’t let these humans advance any further!”","Many of the Hus’s mighty figures were roaring. Their eyes were bloodshot as they roared furiously.","Many of them had even turned into half-human and half-beast forms. This was the original form of the Hus, which had been fused with the bloodline of the demons.","However, Chu Yunfan was too strong. Coupled with Chu Hongcai and a large number of half-Kings, he almost defeated the grassland alliance army alone.","There was no way they could resist such a terrifying force of elites.","Every time Chu Yunfan attacked, he would be able to kill a Domainian. Many of them were at the peak Domain Stage.","Chu Yunfan was like a meat grinder. Wherever he passed, no one could resist him. He was invincible and easily killed by him.","The grassland alliance army finally collapsed. They were jumping around on the grassland, turning into a motley crew and being chased by the soldiers of Zhenyuan.","As long as the soldiers of the External Army kept shooting, they could kill countless grassland soldiers.","Chu Yunfan was at the back, and a ball of lightning power in his hand turned into a longbow. He continuously shot out terrifying arrows like meteors, sweeping across the sky and destroying everything.","“Those who block me will die!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","The grassland alliance army collapsed again and again. Everyone fled crazily.","There was only one thought in their mind. No matter what others did, as long as they ran faster than the other, he would not be killed by the External Army immediately.","With this thought in mind, the entire grassland alliance army collapsed.","“How dare you!”","In the depths of the grassland, another terrifying existence erupted with an astonishing aura.","In just a few moments, they had chased for more than a thousand miles. Finally, they had alarmed some existences in the depths of the grassland.","That terrifying fluctuation shook the entire grassland.","Everyone’s attention was drawn over. Another half-King had appeared.","Moreover, it was much more terrifying than the Lone Wolf King just now.","“Humph? How dare you play tricks in front of me!”","Chu Yunfan sneered and slapped down with a Flying Celestial Palm Strike, turning tens of thousands of people into a cloud of blood mist.","The entire grassland was covered in blood and mountains of corpses.","Lives were more worthless than grass!","At this moment, a figure descended from the sky. It was a terrifying old man dressed in beast skin who slowly walked over.","Although this old man was not young, the aura on his body was extremely terrifying. His eyes were fixed on Chu Yunfan.","“You’ve gone too far. You’ve slaughtered countless of my Grassland Wolf tribe. I’ll make you pay with blood!” the old man said slowly.","“It’s the old khan!”","Someone recognized him. This was the old khan of the grasslands.","There were many rumors that the old khan had fallen and died long ago. However, no one had expected that the old khan would reappear in the midst of absolute danger in the grasslands.","The old khan destroyed the vanguard of the army just as he attacked.","The External Army stopped in its tracks. This terrifying cultivation was extremely terrifying.","“No one has ever dared to kill their way into the grasslands and do whatever they want. You are the first!” the old khan said slowly, his gaze was incomparably cold. This was the first time the Hus of the grasslands had suffered such a huge loss.","It had always been them who went south to clear the grass valley, and Grand Xia was in a defensive position. They could come and go as they pleased.","Who knew that he would encounter a freak like Chu Yunfan? He didn’t care about the unspoken rules at all and directly killed his way into the grassland. He even erupted with such shocking strength.","“How can this be compared to you? You guys go south to dig grass valleys for no reason. Do you really think that we humans won’t be angry?” Chu Yunfan said coldly, “The heavens are watching. Whatever you have done, you have to pay the price. This is justice!”","“This is ridiculous. Young human descendant, do you think you can destroy our Hus? The foundation of us Hus is not something you can imagine!” The old khan stared at Chu Yunfan with incomparable confidence.","With a wave of his hand, he had the grassland alliance army behind him flee for their lives!","“You guys go and run for your lives. Leave the rest to me!”","The old khan waved his hand. The aura on his body continued to grow. In a short while, he had already transformed into an invincible half-step King.","Chu Yunfan could tell at a glance that this old khan’s lifespan was over. What was left was only to drag out his life.","Every time he attacked, he would shorten his lifespan. If he hadn’t been forced into a corner, if Chu Yunfan hadn’t led his troops into the bushes, he would have died.","He was afraid that the old khan would slowly die of old age somewhere without a sound.","No one would know. Everyone thought that the old khan was dead.","“What foundation? You have to give it all to me today!” Chu Yunfan said loudly, “You have to pay the price for your actions. Our dead human compatriots are watching us from the sky. Let us take revenge for them!”","“Kill the Hus!” Chu Yunfan shouted, and the entire army of the External Army was shouting to kill Hu.","The old khan’s expression changed, becoming extremely ugly.","“Since you want to die, I’ll fulfill your wish!” the old khan said coldly. Suddenly, he drew a heavy saber from his hand.","There was no awkwardness in the movements of his hands. This was still their era.","It was not up to a junior like Chu Yunfan to be impudent.","“I’ll kill you!” the old khan shouted loudly and moved. He held his saber in his hand, and with his own strength, he killed with the terrifying aura of thousands of soldiers.","The entire sky was instantly opened up by the saber, and it was slashed down at Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":2355,"title":"Chapter 2355: Slaying the Old Khan","paragraphs":["Chapter 2355: Slaying the Old Khan","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The old khan instantly launched an attack because he knew that Chu Yunfan could wait, but he could not afford to. The longer he delayed, the weaker he would be.","After all, he was already old. There was no way to compare him to his peak state back then.","A prolonged battle was too beneficial for Chu Yunfan. He didn’t have many choices left. Only by ending the battle quickly could he defeat Chu Yunfan and stop him from continuing to wreak havoc.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s entire body was emitting a faint golden light, making him look solemn, like a living god.","Boom!","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan’s eyes opened and transformed into the Disaster Star Eyes, revealing the unimaginable terrifying power of disaster.","Everything the power of disaster touched was reduced to nothingness. The old khan’s attack landed in the domain of the Disaster Star Eyes and disappeared without a trace.","Chu Yunfan stood still. He could be compared to the old khan with his Disaster Star Eyes.","“Kill them!”","“Kill!”","“Kill!”","Everyone, especially the External Army, was overjoyed.","In contrast, the grassland alliance army was in complete despair.","Both the Sky Wolf God and the old khan, who were the strongest, struggled against Chu Yunfan.","The next moment, Chu Yunfan moved.","Swoosh!","Chu Yunfan’s speed was too fast. In almost an instant, he had already disappeared in front of everyone. In the next moment, he had already appeared in front of the old khan. The terrifying power of lightning boiled on his palm, and then he slapped out.","Bang!","The attack pierced through the old khan’s domain and landed on his body.","In the next moment, the old khan was hit directly. He spat out a mouthful of blood, and his entire body was like a kite with a broken string.","Indeed, compared to the Lone Wolf King, the old khan was much more powerful. He was a terrifying existence that had broken through to 9,000 laws.","He could easily rank in the top 30 on the Prospective Kings List.","However, Chu Yunfan was too strong and had no chance of winning.","The old khan was sent flying, coughing up blood. His eyes flickered with a terrifying light.","“You forced me to do this. All of you will be buried in the plains and sacrifice your flesh to the evil gods. Only then can you wash away your sins!”","The old khan roared. At this moment, a huge magic formation was forming on the grassland around the External Army. Then, a terrifying aura was gradually forming.","In this situation where countless flesh and blood and countless living beings formed a blood sacrifice, a terrifying existence slowly appeared.","“Hahahaha, all of you will die!” the old khan shouted frantically.","This was one of the Hus’ secrets. Countless people who were killed on the plains, regardless of whether they were on their side or somewhere else, would be sacrificed to an evil god that ordinary people did not know about.","At this time, it was time to invite the evil god to appear!","Chu Yunfan saw a huge eye suddenly appear in the sky.","This huge eye was cold and merciless. It looked at the humans below as if it was looking at lambs.","In the next moment, a terrifying torrent of energy burst out from the huge eye and went straight for Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, the Mountain River Cauldron in Chu Yunfan’s body suddenly flew up and protected him.","Clang!","A loud sound of metal clashing rang out. The terrifying blood-colored energy torrent directly struck the Mountain River Cauldron, but it seemed to be absorbed and disappeared without a trace.","“So there’s such a trump card!”","Chu Yunfan could already feel that the power of this one eye was probably not much weaker than his.","They all had about 10,000 laws, but they had yet to become Kings.","It should be that a certain will had been awakened. However, it had just been awakened, and its strength still needed to be improved. However, if it was left alone, it would not be long before its strength rose to the King Stage.","This was also a useful method for the Hus. They worshipped the evil gods and believed in them, so the evil gods gave them something in return.","The Hus’ civilization was established under such circumstances.","“Human, wait for your death!” The old khan laughed loudly. At the same time, he was still circulating his internal energy in an attempt to heal himself.","But in the next moment, Chu Yunfan had already arrived in front of the old khan.","The old khan was shocked and furious. He did not expect Chu Yunfan to not follow the usual routine and deal with the evil god’s will first.","Instead, Chu Yunfan chose to deal with him first.","He was shocked and furious.","“I’ll kill you first, then deal with that eye!” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","Chu Yunfan’s speed was too fast. The lightning energy in his hand condensed into a long blade and slashed horizontally.","Slice!","The long saber slashed through the old khan’s neck, and the old khan let out a miserable cry. His head was cut off and sent flying. Blood surged, and the old khan turned into a headless corpse.","His head, which had been sent flying, was still filled with disbelief and unwillingness. He had actually been defeated by a human junior just like that.","He had been careless, too careless!","However, if Chu Yunfan knew what he was thinking, he would definitely disagree with him. Even if he was not careless, he would not have any chance of winning.","Chu Yunfan’s strength completely crushed him and was even above him. He was simply not someone he could compare to.","Whether he was careful or not, it could not change the fundamental outcome.","Chu Yunfan circulated his Disaster Star Eyes and absorbed the old khan’s corpse into his eyes, turning it into nourishment for his Disaster Star Eyes’ evolution.","Another extremely powerful half-King was in his hands, turning into nourishment for his advancement.","Then, Chu Yunfan looked up at the sky and saw a huge eye that had already opened.","The eye exuded an extremely evil energy, which made the entire External Army feel extremely uncomfortable.","They all circulated their energy and set up a battle formation to resist the evil aura that seeped out of the eye.","Boom!","In the next moment, that huge eye blinked again, and a terrifying aura came crashing down from all directions. Immediately after, countless bolts of lightning turned into countless blades, spears, swords, and halberds, smashing down on the grasslands.","To Chu Yunfan’s surprise, the power of the lightning was not a Yang power. Instead, it had an extremely evil aura. If an ordinary person was struck by the lightning, they would probably die a tragic death."]},{"number":2356,"title":"Chapter 2356: Sweeping the Grassland and Returning Successfully","paragraphs":["Chapter 2356: Sweeping the Grassland and Returning Successfully","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The terrifying lightning formed by the evil god’s will landed on Chu Yunfan in an instant.","Rumble!","Countless terrifying small mushroom clouds rose up. However, just as this energy tide was about to pour down on the distant army in all directions, a huge cauldron descended from the sky and forcefully collected the energy tide.","It didn’t pose any threat to the External Army.","The entire army cheered. In the midst of the cheers, a figure rushed into the sky with a huge cauldron, rushing toward the evil eye.","As Chu Yunfan soared into the sky, more evil lightning bolts fell on him.","The power of lightning was not ordinary. It was condensed from the resentment of the creatures who had been sacrificed for countless years.","Every bolt of lightning that struck down would not only destroy the physical body, but it would also seep into the soul and corrode it. This was the most terrifying part.","Every time it landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, it would make his protective divine light dim a little.","If it were an ordinary half-King, they would probably have been knocked down from the clouds long ago.","But Chu Yunfan managed to hold on!","“Evil god’s will? Suppress it!” Chu Yunfan roared.","As he roared, the Mountain River Diagram in his hand suddenly flew out. It grew bigger and bigger, and in an instant, it turned into countless mountains and rivers that suppressed the evil god’s will.","Countless blood-colored creatures roared and rushed out of the evil eye.","They wanted to corrode the Mountain River Diagram.","However, in the next moment, the Mountain River Diagram emitted a terrifying pressure. The pressure shook and the light was thousands of feet long. The moment those blood-colored creatures touched the light, they turned into nothingness.","It was as if they had been evaporated into thin air.","Compared to the Emperor’s might that erupted from the Mountain River Diagram, the blood-colored creature that the evil god’s will had evolved into couldn’t withstand a single blow.","In the next moment, the Mountain River Diagram swept out and sucked in the evil god’s will.","“You dare?!” A loud shout erupted from the Evil God’s will. “You dare?!”","However, it was useless. The mountains and rivers evolved from the Mountain River Diagram firmly suppressed the evil god’s will.","“Humph!” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly. Although this evil god’s will was powerful, ordinary half-Kings would definitely not be able to resist it. Even ordinary Kings might not be able to do anything to this evil god’s will.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. The Mountain River Diagram in his hand was a magic weapon that the Alchemy Emperor carried with him. Although the Alchemy Emperor was not good at fighting, he was still a ruler. It was very easy for him to suppress this evil god’s will.","As long as Chu Yunfan could exert some of its power, it would be enough to suppress this will. It would even be much easier for him to deal with it than facing an expert who had also cultivated 10,000 laws.","If the evil god’s will could not permeate this person’s will, then it would be useless.","After Chu Yunfan had suppressed the evil god’s will, the grassland alliance army had completely lost their last chance of turning the tables.","The million strong army fled in a sorry state on the plains.","The External Army swept across the plains, shaking the entire plains!","Chu Yunfan’s action had caused a great sensation in the world. It was not that the human race had not gone deep into the territory to sweep the plains, but over the years, as the situation worsened, they had gradually turned from offense to defense.","Moreover, it was already very difficult for the human race to resist the demons under the circumstances of the invasion of the demons. Therefore, they tried their best to endure the provocation of those other races.","However, Chu Yunfan’s existence broke this restriction as if he didn’t care about the balance that everyone was trying to maintain.","At this moment, everyone believed what he had said before. Anyone who dared to reach out would be his target.","There was no exception.","After all, not everyone dared to lead an army into the plains!","In many people’s eyes, Chu Yunfan’s actions were equivalent to courting death. There was no possibility of victory at all.","But as time passed, more and more news of victory spread from the plains.","The news of Chu Yunfan sweeping through the world also caused the entire world to boil.","With the fall of the famous powerhouses one by one, including the previous khan, countless people in the frontier wept bitterly.","For the Hus, the khan was the sky and a god, but for the soldiers and civilians on the border of Grand Xia, he was a murderous demon king.","Countless people had died because of him. Compared to the demons, these Hus were not any better off.","Previously, it was rumored that he had died of old age, so everyone gradually forgot about him.","They didn’t expect that he was still alive. Fortunately, he died in Chu Yunfan’s hands. Many people cried bitterly and wished that they build a memorial for Chu Yunfan and bless him with longevity.","For many hot-blooded youths who were already holding their breath, Chu Yunfan was like a beacon, illuminating their way forward.","Many people flocked to Zhenyuan City, wanting to join the External Army.","At this time, Chu Yunfan had completely left the ancient prodigies of his generation and the Supreme Youths behind. What was the meaning of outshining others?","This was outshining others.","No matter what kind of Supreme Youth it was, there was no way to compare to him.","Those Supreme Youths didn’t have Chu Yunfan’s strength. Even if they wanted to kill the thief, they couldn’t do anything about it.","If they followed Chu Yunfan’s example and led the army into the depths of the grassland, they would probably be devoured by the grassland’s foundation.","Even a half-King Supreme Youth would die if he went in alone.","For these foreign races to be able to contend against Grand Xia for so many years without being wiped out, how deep was the water? Many people felt that it was terrifying just by thinking about it.","“If he continues to go deeper, he might encounter a King of the Hus!” someone said worriedly.","There was no doubt that there was a King among the Hus.","After all, there was more than one King in Grand Xia. How could there not be a King among the Hus that could contend with Grand Xia for so many years?","If Chu Yunfan continued to lead the army deeper, the final result would be complete annihilation.","Fortunately, news came very quickly. Chu Yunfan stopped while he was ahead and led his army back. After defeating a few elite Hu cavalry who wanted to stop him, he successfully returned to the territory of Grand Xia.","In this battle, they had killed more than a million Hu soldiers, and one-third of them were elites. They had killed more than a thousand Hus, and the Hus had suffered over twenty million casualties.","Many of the Hus’ troops that had attacked Grand Xia had just received the news and returned. However, they could not catch up to Chu Yunfan in time and could only roar angrily outside the border."]},{"number":2357,"title":"Chapter 2357: The Evil Gods in the Depths of the Grassland","paragraphs":["Chapter 2357: The Evil Gods in the Depths of the Grassland","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan became famous in one battle!","Especially when the news that Chu Yunfan had killed the khan and destroyed the evil god’s will came out, it stunned all the heroes in the world.","Although many of the people Chu Yunfan had killed were on the Prospective Kings List, they were all ranked relatively low.","But the khan was different. His cultivation was unfathomable. Although he was old, he was not weak and easily bullied.","His strength was probably ranked very high on the Prospective Kings List. It was possible for him to be in the top few.","However, such a powerful expert had fallen at Chu Yunfan’s feet.","He was killed with absolute strength.","This news was like a bolt from the blue to many people.","“The heavens are about to change!”","Many people felt that a super terrifying supernova was rising.","Chu Yunfan’s rise was too fast. Not only did he defeat all the experts of his generation, but he also surpassed the ancient prodigies who had gathered their essence for countless years and became the number one person of the younger generation.","In fact, in the eyes of some people, Chu Yunfan was the number one person below the King Stage.","Other than Kings, he had no other opponents in the world.","The Flying Celestials was especially excited. The stronger Chu Yunfan was, the happier they were.","In this chaotic world, without a King to hold down the fort, the foundation that their Flying Celestials usually took pride in was only enough to cause them to be in a precarious situation.","It could turn into nothingness at any time in the turmoil of the world.","Usually, they did not have such a big feeling. However, in the real chaotic times, they truly understood how big the difference was between having and not having a King.","The few forces with Kings guarding them were as stable as Mount Tai in such chaotic times. The siege of the demons was quickly dispersed, and even the demons did not dare to attack too much.","And now, their Flying Celestials was about to have a King to guard it. Chu Yunfan was still so young, so he could guard their Flying Celestials for many years and protect their safety for at least thousands of years in the future.","Even if Chu Yunfan had not broken through to the King Stage, in the eyes of the Flying Celestials, he was already destined to become a King.","Chu Yunfan settled down the army, then let You Chuyun and the others deal with the hot-blooded young men who came to seek refuge with him, eliminating those who might be problematic and taking the rest into the army.","Although the strength of the External Army had undergone earth-shaking changes during this period and had become much stronger, their foundation was too poor. Compared to the elite disciples of the major forces, not only was there a gap in strength, but their future prospects were also incomparable.","With the addition of these hot-blooded young men, they could make up for the gap in officers in the External Army.","Then, Chu Yunfan returned to the Flying Celestials and met Situ Xuan.","“You’ve been an influential figure during this period of time. Hahahaha, you’ve done something big!”","Situ Xuan looked at Chu Yunfan with some emotion.","He still remembered the scene when Chu Yunfan had just entered the sect. It seemed to be not too long ago.","In fact, it was not that long ago.","Chu Yunfan rose like a comet, completely surpassing him and becoming the number one expert of the Flying Celestials.","In fact, Chu Yunfan himself was not interested. Otherwise, with his cultivation, it would be easy for him to become the sect master of the Flying Celestials.","However, this did not stop the Flying Celestials from viewing Chu Yunfan as their spiritual leader. In the hearts of many of the younger generation disciples, they worshipped Chu Yunfan with fanaticism and regarded him as a god.","“I just wiped out some bugs!” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly. “I hope that one day, I can sweep the plains and uproot those so-called evil gods!”","This was the first time Situ Xuan knew what Chu Yunfan was thinking, and he could not help but be shocked.","In fact, it had been a long time since anyone had such an idea.","The Hus had split off from the humans. In the early years, they were human beings who were taken away and brainwashed to believe in evil gods, which evolved into the current Hus.","In fact, even now, there were still many people who were kidnapped by the Hus every year and brainwashed into becoming part of the Hus.","Therefore, it could be said that compared to the monsters and the Hus, the Hus and the barbarians were the real threats to the humans.","When Grand Xia was just established, the Great Ancestor of Grand Xia and the founding ancestors of the ten major powers once charged into the grasslands in high spirits. However, they returned in defeat after encountering the legendary evil god of the grasslands in the depths of the grasslands.","Even with the current strength of Grand Xia, they were unable to defeat the evil gods. Instead, they were chased by the evil gods and were forced to retreat.","Only when they reached the borders of Grand Xia did they use the empire’s Luck Dragon to suppress those evil gods.","As time passed, and the Imperial Family and the ten great forces had intentionally wiped out this matter, not many people knew about it. However, as the sect master of the Flying Celestials, Situ Xuan still knew about this matter.","At the same time, he knew how terrifying those evil gods were.","At that time, more than ten Kings of Grand Xia joined forces and only killed one evil god in the end. Instead, they were heavily injured.","The founders of the Flying Celestials, the Holy Puppets, the Divine Talisman Sect, and the other founders were all severely injured in that battle. After returning, they died within a few hundred years.","They did not have the time to pass down some of the cultivation methods of the King Stage before they passed away.","This was also why the Flying Celestials and other sects had never produced a King after that, while the Destiny Sect and other factions had Kings guarding them for generations.","Slowly, the ten great forces, which were originally not much different in strength, were divided into different levels.","It could be said that it was those few evil gods who had single-handedly promoted the current situation of the ten great powers of Grand Xia.","Situ Xuan knew even more. Originally, Grand Xia wasn’t just the ten major powers. There were even more powers with Kings. However, they were in an even worse state. Their ancestors died tragically in the grasslands.","After that, the sects they founded gradually declined, and many of them had even disappeared in the long river of history.","It was because of this that Situ Xuan was shocked by Chu Yunfan’s ambition.","“You can’t be too hasty. Those evil gods are very powerful. I’m afraid even Kings aren’t their match!” Situ Xuan hurriedly advised.","With the strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed, he might have a chance to wipe out the evil gods in the future, but that was definitely not now.","Now, even if a King went, he would not have any chance of winning.","“I understand. I won’t be too hasty!” Chu Yunfan nodded. He hadn’t been blinded by victory, or else he wouldn’t have retreated when the situation was so good.","However, one day, he would kill his way into the grassland and uproot those evil gods."]},{"number":2358,"title":"Chapter 2358: Promotion to Duke of Zhenyuan","paragraphs":["Chapter 2358: Promotion to Duke of Zhenyuan","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He didn’t know how strong the evil gods in the grassland were. He didn’t know if they had reached the level of the previous Emperors, but at the very least, they were far above ordinary Kings.","If the records in the Flying Celestials were not wrong, these evil gods might have survived since the end of the ancient era.","At least in Chu Yunfan’s memory of the Alchemy Emperor, he had never seen these so-called evil gods. Presumably, in the era when the Emperors ruled the world, these evil gods were not even worth mentioning.","This was true. If there were emperors, how could these evil gods have the chance to develop a race like the Hus?","Any Emperor could kill these evil gods thousands of times.","Any one of them was a powerful existence that was once invincible in the world.","Countless Kings had died of old age, but these evil gods had survived through all sorts of secret techniques.","Someone was using living beings as blood sacrifices to increase the life force of the evil gods. These were secrets among ordinary people in the world, but for an expert like Chu Yunfan, it was not a secret.","This method was too evil. Every year, who knew how many living beings had to be sacrificed to keep them alive.","Therefore, the war between the Hus and the humans had never stopped. This was because the Hus needed to plunder enough people from Grand Xia for blood sacrifices.","It was far from just a lack of food and wealth.","This was also the fundamental reason why the Hus and the humans had slowly developed into mortal enemies. Grand Xia wanted to uproot the Hus.","The Hus also wanted to turn Grand Xia and all the humans in the world into animals, providing them with the lives they needed for the blood sacrifice.","Even if Grand Xia had more than one King guarding it, they currently had no way to challenge the evil gods.","Therefore, although Chu Yunfan had such great ambitions, he did not dare to be careless. Even if he reached the King Stage and was stronger than ordinary Kings, it was not enough to defeat the evil gods and reverse this trend.","He also knew that other than the evil gods of the Hus in the depths of the grassland, there was also a terrifying barbarian god lurking deep in the Hundred Thousand Mountains in the southern barbarians.","Similar to the Hus in the grassland, the barbarian god also plundered and brainwashed the human race, thus forming the barbarians—a behemoth that could fight against the humans.","The barbarians also had to sacrifice their blood to the barbarian god. They were no different from the evil gods of the Hus in the north.","They were the malignant tumors of the entire world. Those barbarian god and evil gods had survived until now through evil methods and had become the greatest threat to the world.","“It’s good that you know your limits!” Situ Xuan nodded slowly. He knew that Chu Yunfan was not a reckless person, so he nodded in satisfaction.","“But what do you plan to do next? The Destiny Sect will definitely think of a way to deal with you now, but we have no way to fight against the Destiny Sect!” Situ Xuan said worriedly.","If the world was at peace, then there was nothing to be afraid of.","Because the order was still there, it was impossible for the Destiny Sect to do as they pleased. After all, there was still the imperial family suppressing them.","But now, the imperial family had to fight against the overwhelming demons, so they had no time to care about the grudge between the Destiny Sect and the Flying Celestials.","If the old sect master of the Destiny Sect personally made a move, the entire Flying Celestials would be in danger.","After all, the founder of the Flying Celestials was only at the King Stage. The many methods he left behind were still fine against martial arts experts below the King Stage, but against a true King, there was no chance of victory at all.","“It’s fine. They can’t do anything to me!” Chu Yunfan said with a cold smile. “Even if they want to target me, we have to see if they have the ability!”","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s confidence, Situ Xuan didn’t say anything more.","Soon, all kinds of things about Chu Yunfan were circulating in the world, and he was called the number one expert below the King Stage.","An imperial edict came from the Imperial Capital. The human king summoned Chu Yunfan. This time, Chu Yunfan had swept through the depths of the grasslands and made a great contribution.","Chu Yunfan had been promoted to Duke Zhenyuan!","He was promoted from a marquis to a duke.","This was the highest title that a normal person could obtain.","After all, even the emperor of Grand Xia only held the title of king.","Under the urging of the Grand Commandant’s Office, Chu Yunfan quickly stepped onto the teleportation portal to the Imperial Capital.","Not long after, Chu Yunfan’s figure appeared in the Imperial Capital.","Although the demons outside had tried their best to seal the Imperial Capital, there were still ways to use the teleportation portal to teleport people in and out.","However, this price was much higher than before. It was almost ten times higher than before the demon invasion.","However, Chu Yunfan was going to the Imperial Capital under the orders of the human king, so he did not have to worry about the cost of teleportation.","Soon, the news of Chu Yunfan’s appearance in the Imperial Capital spread.","In the Imperial Capital, countless consciousnesses were communicating.","Toward Chu Yunfan’s appearance, some of them showed friendliness, while others showed extreme malice. Chu Yunfan could even feel that many of them had clear killing intent toward him.","His existence had offended too many people. There were countless people who wanted to kill him.","After waiting in the Imperial Capital for three days, Chu Yunfan finally met the current master of Grand Xia, the human king.","Compared to when he first met the human king, the human king’s expression was much more weathered. It was obvious that even with the human king’s talent, he was exhausted from dealing with this series of matters.","“You’ve done well,” the human king said as soon as he saw Chu Yunfan. “All this time, I’ve only heard bad news. You’re the only one who keeps bringing me good news!”","The human king looked at Chu Yunfan with satisfaction.","“Your Majesty, you flatter me. I only did as I should. I am also a member of the human race! It’s all part of my duty!” Chu Yunfan looked at the human king and said in a neither servile nor overbearing manner.","“Good job!” The human king laughed and said, “What’s funny is that some people don’t understand. They actually flirt with the demons, Hus, marine folks, barbarians, monsters, and other races.","“These people are already crazy for the sake of benefits. They don’t know that without the protection of the human race, they would probably have died long ago. How could they cultivate to this realm!”","“They’re all dead!” Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with killing intent. “They all deserve to die!”","Chu Yunfan hated traitors like them the most. At the same time, he felt that they were extremely stupid. The human race was the umbrella of protection for everyone. Once the human race fell apart, everyone, regardless of their strength, would be greatly threatened."]},{"number":2359,"title":"Chapter 2359: King Beast","paragraphs":["Chapter 2359: King Beast","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He didn’t know if these people were really stupid or had ulterior motives.","At this point, there were still many people who were colluding with the other races. Some even directly joined the other races. For example, many people from the demonic path had joined the demons. Now, they had become the claws and fangs of the demons, causing disaster to the world.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan’s heart was filled with endless killing intent. If he didn’t kill such a person, it would be enough to appease the anger of the people.","“If everyone could do their part, the world would not have become like this!” the human king said sadly. “Forget it, let’s not talk about this. You’re already a duke now. In terms of title, you’ve already surpassed your sect leader, Situ Xuan!”","Chu Yunfan nodded. Not only was he a noble, but his strength had also far surpassed Situ Xuan’s.","However, he was not interested in managing the sect, so he gave it to Situ Xuan.","“This time, I summoned you here not only because your strength has increased, but also because your battle achievements have increased very quickly. That’s why I conferred you the title of duke!” the human king said. “Also, I want you to be a role model for the people of the world. You must not rely on the demons or the foreign races. Otherwise, you will definitely make them die without a burial place in the future!”","“Your Majesty, there’s no need to say anything. This is what I want to do!” Chu Yunfan said.","“Very good. The Grand Commandant recommended you to me. It seems that the Grand Commandant’s eyes are as sharp as ever. There’s no problem!” the human king said with satisfaction. “I won’t keep you any longer. I still have many things to deal with. You have to reorganize your External Army. I still have great use for you in the future!”","“Yes, Your Majesty!” Chu Yunfan nodded and quickly bid farewell to the human king.","However, not long after Chu Yunfan left the human king’s hall, he was stopped by a middle-aged man.","This middle-aged man was dressed in a purple robe and looked extremely noble. On his handsome face, there was an additional eye on his forehead.","He simply stood in front of Chu Yunfan, but he felt like he was facing a mountain.","No, Chu Yunfan was facing an archaic divine mountain.","That terrifying feeling almost made his hair stand on end.","“A King!” Chu Yunfan immediately had a realization.","Now, if there was anyone in the world who could make his hair stand on end, it would definitely be a King.","Ordinary people did not have such strength at all. Even those top figures who had cultivated 8,000, 9,000, or even close to 10,000 could not give him such a feeling.","However, he did not know many Kings, so he did not know who the person in front of him was.","But in the next moment, Chu Yunfan had already figured out the identity of the person who came.","Without a doubt, the person in front of him was none other than the sect master of the Destiny Sect.","There was a terrifying killing intent that was almost unconcealed on his body.","Ordinary people would be scared out of their wits just by sensing this killing intent. All their spiritual defenses would collapse, and no one would be able to resist his existence.","“The old sect leader of the Destiny Sect?” Chu Yunfan asked tentatively because he knew that the others would not target him in this way. Whether it was the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia, the human king, the old sect master of the Great Change Faith, or the old dean of the Virtuous Academy, he had more or less met them. Even if he had not met them, Chu Yunfan had not offended them.","The only person he had offended was the old sect master of the Destiny Sect.","This was an invincible existence who had led the Destiny Sect to sweep across the world in the previous generation.","Now that he had come out of seclusion, his cultivation was even more terrifying. It was said that he was already a King.","“Yes, I am!” The middle-aged man nodded.","His voice was hoarse and a little unpleasant, like an owl in the sky.","But at this moment, his words were filled with killing intent.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t worried at all because he knew where he was. It wasn’t far from the human king’s hall.","Unless the old sect master of the Destiny Sect was crazy, he would not harm him here.","“I didn’t expect you to recognize me. It seems like you’ve collected a lot of information!” The old sect master of the Destiny Sect nodded. He seemed to know a lot about Chu Yunfan.","“However, it’s useless. You’ll definitely die. Stop daydreaming if you want to deal with our Destiny Sect!” the old sect master of the Destiny Sect said slowly.","“Could it be that you want to make a move here? I think you will become the public enemy of the world!” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“Hehe, I’m not the only one who wants to kill you. Why should I do it myself?” the old sect master of the Destiny Sect said slowly with a mysterious smile on his face.","“Kid, you should cherish your last moments!”","After the old sect master finished speaking, he disappeared into thin air.","“It was a clone, not the main body!”","Chu Yunfan immediately judged that even if the old sect master of the Destiny Sect was a clone, it was far beyond the imagination of ordinary people.","Even Chu Yunfan could not see through it. If it was his real body, a single gaze would be enough to make a half-King break down and even doubt his own dao.","That was the most terrifying thing.","Such Kings were the most terrifying. It was impossible to imagine how strong they were.","However, just as Chu Yunfan was still reporting his work in the Imperial Capital, another huge thing happened in the world.","It was unknown when a terrifying beast had appeared in the depths of the grasslands. This beast had swept across the border army.","This ferocious beast rampaged about, and the army of Grand Xia could not stop it at all.","And after this beast broke through the blockade of the border army, it immediately began a massacre in the northern part of Grand Xia.","In just a few days, more than a billion people had died tragically at the hands of this ferocious beast.","For a moment, the entire world was shocked, especially the humans. They were burning with anger.","How many years had it been since someone dared to act so brazenly against Grand Xia? Not to mention, they had slaughtered their way into the heart of Grand Xia, killing billions of people.","However, everyone soon understood why this ferocious beast was so powerful.","This was actually a King beast.","Such a King beast swept across the entire way. There was no expert in the hinterland of the human race who could stop it.","Even the King humans were restrained. There was no way for them to stop this King beast.","It was as if all the races in the world had a tacit understanding to restrain the King humans and let this King beast wreak havoc.","“I’m here for revenge. Let Chu Yunfan come out and die!”","The roar of this monster shook the sky."]},{"number":2360,"title":"Chapter 2360: The Human Race’s Foundation","paragraphs":["Chapter 2360: The Human Race’s Foundation","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Soon, the origin of this King beast was dug out. It was a beast raised by the previous khan of the grasslands since he was a child.","The rise of the khan could be said to have been accompanied by a series of wars and meritorious deeds.","Later, it retired with the khan, but compared with human experts, beasts lived much longer.","The khan had retired when he was old, but for that King beast, his life had just reached its peak.","The khan had died at the hands of Chu Yunfan, and this King beast that had just broken through to the King Stage came to take revenge.","This King beast wanted revenge. Very soon, it was displayed and destroyed crazily in the north of Grand Xia.","A King could destroy a large city in a very short period of time.","In a large city, there were at least tens of millions of people. In just a few days, countless people had died tragically at the hands of this King beast.","For a time, the world was in an uproar and furious.","Ever since the establishment of Grand Xia, nothing like this had ever happened before. No one had ever dared to act so brazenly in Grand Xia.","If it was any other time, any king level expert in Grand Xia would be able to easily suppress this King beast who had just advanced to the king level.","“Impudent!”","The human king’s furious roar came from the Imperial City, but he could not make a move. He was restrained.","Not only the strongest demon lord among the demons, but also the Kings of the demons, Hus, barbarians, and marine folks all projected their powerful auras onto the Imperial City. This was a warning to the human king not to interfere.","Even the Kings of Grand Xia who were stationed in various places were restrained.","For a time, there was no one in the vast Grand Xia Dynasty who could restrain this King beast.","Compared to the slaughter of the ordinary demon army, this King beast was even more disastrous. This was because there was no one in Grand Xia who could even slightly resist him.","Compared to the half-King Stage, they were only at the half-King Stage after all, not the King Stage. Even if a group of half-Kings attacked together, they would definitely not be a match for a King.","“I will only kill Chu Yunfan. As long as Chu Yunfan is dead, I will retreat!” the King beast said after the massacre.","Many people gasped when they heard this. It was obvious that they were trying to force Chu Yunfan to his death.","If Chu Yunfan went out, he would die. But if he didn’t go out, he would face the criticism of countless people.","This was to force Chu Yunfan to death, to force this human who was currently the most likely to break through to the King Stage to death.","In fact, this was what the marine folks, Hus, barbarians, monsters, demons, and other races thought.","Chu Yunfan’s existence had become a huge threat to many.","Even though he was only at the half-King Stage at the moment, many thought that he would advance to the King Stage sooner or later.","When he advanced to the King Stage, there was no doubt that the strength of the human race would be greatly enhanced. This was something that many people did not want to see.","Sure enough, after the King beast said this, the entire world changed. There was a faint saying that Chu Yunfan should stop this King beast.","Because of him, countless lives in the northern region of Grand Xia were killed.","Many people seemed to have completely forgotten who Chu Yunfan had gone deep into the grasslands for!","“Too hateful. Didn’t they say that to force you to fight that King beast?”","Inside the Flying Celestials, Situ Xuan slapped the armrest of his throne, his anger rising.","“Chu Yunfan, don’t worry. Stay in the Flying Celestials and cultivate. Wait until you break through to the King Stage before coming out of seclusion. I don’t believe that the King beast can still come to the Flying Celestials!”","Situ Xuan was furious. Although the Flying Celestials’ external attack strength was insufficient, they had produced Kings before. Therefore, they were not afraid of a martial arts master who had just advanced to the King Stage like the King beast. They had more than enough to defend themselves.","Of course, he could see the sinister intentions of the person behind this.","Even the northern defense line had been broken through, allowing the King beast to run amok. One could even see the shadow of the old sect master of the Destiny Sect.","After all, the one who was ordered to guard the northern border was the old sect master of the Destiny Sect.","Wasn’t it obvious who was behind this?","Otherwise, with the old sect master’s strength, even if he was restrained by others, he could still stop the King beast from heading south.","“I’ll see who can’t hold it in first. Once that beast kills too much, he’ll become the public enemy of the humans. He’s dead!” Situ Xuan said with a livid expression.","As the top echelon of the human race, he naturally knew that the human race’s foundation was far more than what it seemed on the surface. It was just that it was not usually revealed.","Once this King beast went on a killing spree, it would attract the human race’s hidden forces to move out. At that time, this King beast would pay the price.","If a mere King beast who had just advanced to the King Stage could make the entire human race helpless, then the human race would have been destroyed long ago.","“But if that’s the case, the casualties will be too heavy. Every day of delay will be a huge loss!” Chu Yunfan said.","“I know that there are people behind this. There are people from the human race and people from outside the human race. I believe I know which from the human race did this. It’s none other than that old bag from the Destiny Sect and those villains led by him!”","Chu Yunfan said coldly, “They’ve wanted me dead for a long time. As for the future of the humans, I don’t think it’s within their consideration. As for the other foreign races, it’s even simpler. They also want to take this opportunity to see what the human’s heritage is!”","“Since you know, then it’s good. Don’t fall for it!” Situ Xuan quickly said.","“I’m sorry, Sect Master!” Chu Yunfan stood up and said, “There are times in the world where you can choose not to do certain things, but there are times when someone has to do certain things. I cannot allow the King beast to continue slaughtering!”","“You’re going to die!” Situ Xuan said with a pale face. The Flying Celestials had placed all their hopes on Chu Yunfan, so how could they just watch Chu Yunfan die like this?","Wouldn’t it be foolish to send yourself to your death knowing that this was a death trap?","“Don’t worry, I’ve already thought of this step!” Chu Yunfan said, “I won’t do anything that I’m not confident in. I’m not going to die this time, but to kill that beast!”"]},{"number":2361,"title":"Chapter 2361: Three Days Later, Slaying the King Beast","paragraphs":["Chapter 2361: Three Days Later, Slaying the King Beast","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan spoke in a sonorous and forceful voice. He had already made a plan in his heart. This King beast was clearly coming for him. In addition, countless people inside and outside the human race were adding fuel to the fire and wanted him dead.","This round, he already had no way to avoid it, and it was impossible for him to back down.","If he continued to back down, Chu Yunfan was even worried that his Dao heart would waver.","This was something more serious than anything else. Once his Dao heart wavered, he would probably never be able to become an Emperor. Even becoming a King might not be important at all.","At his level of cultivation, talent, bloodline, and inheritance were no longer the most important things. The most important thing was a Dao heart that was brave and invincible.","Once his Dao heart was shaken, it would be equivalent to a disaster that would cause the world to collapse.","Therefore, even if he knew that this was a trap, he had to go.","“Do you have any ideas?” Situ Xuan saw that Chu Yunfan seemed to be very confident, so he immediately asked.","“Help me announce that I will fight him in outer space three days from now,” Chu Yunfan said slowly. “If he’s still unwilling to let the matter rest, then we’ll invite the humans to kill him!”","“I don’t know what you’re planning, but since this is your decision, I’ll agree to it!” Situ Xuan paused for a moment and said.","Soon, the news that Chu Yunfan was going to challenge the King beast in three days spread like wildfire, and he soon became the focus of everyone’s attention.","Everyone was curious as to why Chu Yunfan would suggest a battle in three days.","“Can three days change anything?”","“Even if he advances immediately, three days is not enough for him to advance from the half-King Stage to the King Stage!”","“What is he planning to do? Are you going to use these three days to deal with your funeral?”","Many people were shocked and did not know what Chu Yunfan’s purpose was. All kinds of guesses were made.","Everyone in the Flying Celestials was shocked, especially after the news that Chu Yunfan was going to fight the King beast in three days spread. For a time, those who thought they meant something to Chu Yunfan all went to Startling Cloud Peak to see him.","“Chu Yunfan is the hope of our Flying Celestials’ rise. How could he fall for such an obvious scheme!”","“This is obviously a trap. Senior Chu, you can’t go!”","“Senior Chu, please think twice!”","However, those who wanted to see Chu Yunfan were all blocked outside.","In the outside world, what surprised everyone was that the King beast, who had went on a killing spree, actually agreed to the decisive battle in outer space three days later.","It was as if it was really for the sole purpose of avenging the khan.","However, those with discerning eyes could tell that the person behind this King beast had probably forced him to agree.","If he didn’t agree, Chu Yunfan might as well hide in the Flying Celestials and not come out. Then, those who wanted Chu Yunfan dead would be at a loss.","Once Chu Yunfan broke through to the King Stage, everything would be for naught.","Once he stepped into the King Stage, Chu Yunfan would become the top existence in the world and dominate the rise and fall of the world. No one would be able to kill him.","Now that Chu Yunfan had agreed to come out and fight in three days, this was the best result.","As for what Chu Yunfan could do in three days?","Everyone was doubtful.","How could he break through in three days?","For a time, the entire world was focused on this. The King beast retreated, and the world finally regained a few days of peace. This was especially so for the commoners of the northern side of Grand Xia. They took this opportunity to head south.","Although there were demons wreaking havoc in the south, compared to the King beast’s unreasonable slaughter, even the demons were not as fierce as him.","“After this battle, there will be no more Chu Yunfan in the world!”","“A Supreme Youth of the present age was schemed to death. The human heart is really the ugliest thing in the world!”","“But this is normal. It means that he doesn’t have luck. Luck is also a part of strength. He doesn’t have the luck to reach the top of the world. Even if he has that kind of talent, what’s the use?”","Even among the ancient prodigies, Chu Yunfan’s matter had caused a sensation.","However, most people felt that it was a pity. This existence that even they had once thought was incomparably dazzling was going to fall like a meteor not long from now.","Three days passed in the blink of an eye. Under everyone’s anticipation, three days later arrived.","In the depths of the grassland, a huge ferocious beast was crawling on the grassland. Every breath was like thunder. Its body was like an enormous mountain, and it looked extremely terrifying.","This was the King beast who had recently risen to fame and whose ferocious name had spread throughout the world.","In front of it, a man in a luxurious robe was bowing slightly.","“Your sect leader asked me to leave Grand Xia for three days, and I’ve already done so. Go back and tell your sect leader that I’ll tear Chu Yunfan into pieces even without him saying anything!” the King beast roared angrily, his voice like thunder.","The luxuriously robed man in front of him felt a chill run down his spine. Every moment in front of this King beast, he had to bear a huge spiritual pressure.","It was as if it could be swallowed by this King beast at any moment.","In fact, this was very possible!","This King beast had been incomparably tyrannical since he became famous countless years ago. Except for the previous khan, no one could subdue him.","“Thank you for your help, Mighty One!” The man in the luxurious robe bowed slightly and said.","“Tsk!” The King beast coldly glanced at the man in the luxurious robe and said, “So many years have passed, but you humans still love to fight among yourselves. There’s no change at all. No wonder you haven’t made any progress for so many years!”","“But it’s precisely because we love internal strife that we gave you a chance, right?” the man in the luxurious robe said with difficulty.","“Hahahahaha!” The King beast laughed loudly, and the entire grassland shook because of his laughter. “The more you humans like to fight among yourselves, the better. Get lost. I’m going to kill Chu Yunfan!”","The King beast shouted loudly. His huge eyes flashed with a shocking ferocity. He slowly stood up, and then he stepped on a shocking light and headed in the direction of the cosmos.","The man in the luxurious robe heaved a sigh of relief. The pressure of facing this King beast was too great. He was clearly at the peak Domain Stage, but he was still unable to withstand a single blow from a King.","At every moment, he could feel that he was like an ant and was not a match at all.","“Chu Yunfan, your good life is over. I want you to pay with your life for taking my son!”"]},{"number":2362,"title":"Chapter 2362: Fighting Against a King","paragraphs":["Chapter 2362: Fighting Against a King","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Three days was not enough to calm this matter down. Instead, it made countless people focus on this matter.","Everyone believed that Chu Yunfan had been planning something for the past three days, but no one believed that Chu Yunfan could change anything in these three days.","In the void of the universe, an incomparably huge ferocious beast was crawling in the void of the universe. It was like a small city, and its entire body was emitting a monstrous might.","“Three days are up. Chu Yunfan, come and die!”","Wherever this ferocious beast passed, all the demon camps in the void of the universe were uprooted, and countless demons were slaughtered.","Although this King beast and Chu Yunfan were not on good terms with the humans, it did not mean that he was on the side of the demons.","The demons were still the mortal enemies of the other races of the Central Plains.","This was because the demonic energy they needed for cultivation was a fatal poison to ordinary living beings.","The foreign races and demons had a tacit understanding to stop fighting and control the scope of the battle to a very small area. That did not mean that they would ally with each other.","The Hus, the marine folks, the barbarians, and the monsters only wanted to see the humans and the demons suffer heavy losses.","The demon army seemed to have received some order and retreated repeatedly, leaving a huge area for the upcoming battle.","“Too terrifying. Is this the might of a King beast?” Some felt their entire bodies tremble as if they had seen something unbelievable.","The roar of the King beast seeped into the Central Plains from the void.","What kind of terrifying power was this? In all of the Central Plains, apart from a few regions, everyone else could hear the King beast’s terrifying roar.","“Chu Yunfan, do you still dare to show up after seeing this?”","“I’m afraid he doesn’t dare to. Even if he has any trump cards, it’s meaningless when facing a true King!”","“Once Chu Yunfan appears, he will be sending himself to his death!”","Countless people were discussing animatedly. Seeing the King beast’s terrifying might, many people even wondered if Chu Yunfan could escape. This was very likely.","After all, no one was willing to die like this. It was not that no one among the humans could deal with the King beast. They were just tied down.","However, they were only restrained. If they became ruthless, it was very likely that they could kill the King beast.","“Hasn’t this King beast just advanced to the King Stage? How can he be so terrifying?” Many people looked at the void in the universe. That King beast was prostrating in the void, and the entire universe was trembling.","Immediately after, many figures flew into the void of the universe and watched the battle from afar.","Many people only felt a bone-piercing coldness and boundless killing intent.","Many people were trembling. They could not help but want to retreat and avoid the terrifying might of this King beast.","Suddenly, just as everyone was discussing, a terrifying aura broke through everything and rushed out from the Flying Celestials. It crossed the void of the universe and rushed in front of the King beast.","The entire void actually collapsed under his might.","It was a slender and muscular figure dressed in black with his hands behind his back. His eyes looked into the distance, incomparably deep as if the world was born and destroyed within them.","“Chu Yunfan, it’s really him. He didn’t run away!”","Many people were shocked, because in their opinion, the probability of Chu Yunfan not appearing was too high. Some people even tacitly agreed that Chu Yunfan might run away and avoid this battle.","Because no matter what the future was, if he died here, he might not even have a future.","Because of this, when they saw Chu Yunfan appear, everyone was shocked and even found it unbelievable.","“You’re here!” the King beast roared. His eyes flickered with a blood-red light as he stared at Chu Yunfan.","It was this man who had killed the khan. To him, the khan was simply its god. The two of them were supposed to break through to the King Stage together, but who would have thought that the khan would die at Chu Yunfan’s hands?","In the end, only he completed the transformation and became a King.","“That’s right, I’m here. I’m here to kill you!” Chu Yunfan sneered and looked at the King beast in front of him.","From afar, this King beast looked like a green wolf. Its entire body was covered with barbs, looking extremely ferocious and terrifying.","He did not know what kind of terrifying existence’s bloodline was mixed in his bloodline to create such an astonishing might.","Killing a King beast?","Many people trembled. How domineering was this? Who could say such words? One had to know that this was not an ordinary existence. This was an existence at the King Stage.","“You can’t. You want to kill me? Hahahahaha!” The King beast laughed loudly. At this moment, his aura was like an ocean breaking through a dam, or like a galaxy breaking apart, sweeping toward Chu Yunfan.","That terrifying pressure even made Chu Yunfan feel that it was difficult to breathe.","Even Chu Yunfan’s expression could not help but become solemn. Above his head, the Mountain River Diagram spun, helping him resist the terrifying power that came from all directions.","One had to know that when he wanted to kill a half-King, it was simply effortless. However, when he faced a true King, he realized that it was simply incomparable.","A half-King could only be a half-King. The terror of a true King was far from what a half-King could compare to.","The faces of many experts in the distance turned pale. Many of them were existences at the half-King Stage. Their faces were filled with fear, especially those who could cultivate to the half-King Stage. They were all outstanding people in the same realm.","Not everyone could finally take this step.","This was because the difficulty behind this was too great.","Therefore, they all had their own pride in their hearts. Now, their pride was almost shattered.","In front of a true King, they, these half-Kings, were simply a joke.","It was completely different.","Although they could support half a step and it seemed like the difference was not much, this half a step was like the difference between heaven and earth.","“Why can’t I kill you? If we were in the same realm, I could kill you effortlessly with one slap!”","Chu Yunfan’s expression was calm. He had the Mountain River Cauldron to help him resist the terrifying pressure of a King.","He was completely fearless as he fought head-on with this King beast."]},{"number":2363,"title":"Chapter 2363: You Might Die","paragraphs":["Chapter 2363: You Might Die","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone’s hearts skipped a beat. There was naturally no doubt about how terrifying this King beast was. Any living being that advanced to the King Stage would undergo earth-shattering changes.","The jump in the level of life would reach an astonishing level, and one would be able to pass down their tyrannical physique through one’s bloodline.","This was the origin of Emperor physiques. Their bloodline ancestors traced back to a certain generation, and there was once an Emperor.","And this King beast undoubtedly had the same ability. He could pass down his terrifying strength in his bloodline and pass it on to future generations.","“You’re right!” the King beast said slowly.","Everyone was a little stunned. They did not expect this King beast to admit it so directly.","“If you can kill me, it means that you are indeed close to being invincible in this domain!”","The King beast coldly glanced at Chu Yunfan as if he was praising him.","But Chu Yunfan knew that who the King beast really wanted to praise was the khan.","The khan was already the top existence in this stage, but Chu Yunfan could easily kill him. If this wasn’t invincible, then what was?","“But it’s useless. I’m stronger than you, so I’m stronger than you. At this moment, do you think it’s meaningful for you to talk to me about fighting someone of the same stage?” The King beast coldly glanced at Chu Yunfan.","His voice was extremely cold as if he was looking at a dead man. He did not deny that Chu Yunfan was powerful in the same stage, but no matter how powerful he was, it was only in the same stage.","Facing him, who had already become a King, Chu Yunfan had no chance of winning at all.","“This King beast actually didn’t object. How strong is Chu Yunfan?”","“Has Chu Yunfan really reached an invincible realm?”","“However, he’s only at the half-King Stage after all, and not a true King. Otherwise, the King beast might not be his match!” someone said.","However, his words received the approval of many people.","At least, it seemed that Chu Yunfan’s current power was astonishing.","“That’s why I said that he wouldn’t choose to come out and fight. It’s simply too stupid. He could have waited until he advanced to the King Stage before coming out to fight. As the saying goes, it’s never too late for a gentleman to take revenge!” There were also people who shook their heads, looking very regretful.","To many people, Chu Yunfan was the person who had the highest chance of becoming an Emperor. However, it was a pity that he was going to die here.","“However, this is his Dao heart. If he gives up, his Dao heart will collapse!” Some people saw the dilemma. If they didn’t go up, their Dao heart would collapse.","These people were all cultivators, so they naturally understood the terrifying consequences once their Dao hearts collapsed.","“Alright, enough nonsense!”","The King beast slowly stood up. From afar, its gigantic body looked like a mountain range rising up. It was extremely terrifying.","“If you want to blame someone, then blame yourself. You’re too outstanding. There are too many people who want you dead. There shouldn’t be someone like you in this era!”","The King beast spoke slowly, but his words revealed too much information that made people shocked.","Some people didn’t want Chu Yunfan to live. No, it should be said that many people didn’t want Chu Yunfan to live. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have let this King beast kill its way into the northern part of Grand Xia.","As a result, countless lives were lost. In the eyes of some people, as long as they could get rid of Chu Yunfan, everything was worth it.","Boom!","The King beast let out an angry roar and charged at Chu Yunfan. It was extremely terrifying, like Mars crashing into Earth. The terrifying scene made countless people hold their breaths.","No, it should be said that it was like the sun was about to hit the earth. The terrifying power was enough to shock countless people.","The King beast did not even use any terrifying divine arts. Just by relying on his powerful body, he was enough to sweep away all powerful enemies.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan finally collided with the King beast. All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it only took an instant. Chu Yunfan immediately made a decision. He grabbed the Mountain River Cauldron in his hand and suddenly smashed it against the King beast.","Clang!","After the intense collision, there was a terrifying sound like the sound of metal colliding. It turned into a flood of energy that swept in all directions. The universe around the place where the two sides fought collapsed, and it became a dilapidated land.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan’s figure flew out like a kite with a broken string.","“Victory has been decided!”","Many people couldn’t help but think of these words. Some people even felt that it was too sad.","Even if Chu Yunfan had prepared so many trump cards and methods, they were all meaningless in front of a true King.","Absolute strength crushed everything. Even if a half-King was hit by a King, it would be considered not bad if he did not turn into a bloody mist.","Basically, even if they didn’t die, they would be severely injured. Their internal organs would be blasted apart, their limbs would be fractured, and their entire body would bleed.","This was the terrifying scene that many people imagined.","However, to their disappointment, none of this happened.","The sky exploded, but Chu Yunfan’s figure stopped not long after he flew out.","Chu Yunfan’s face turned white and red. This was because the blood in his body was surging. In the collision just now, his blood surged and his hands went numb.","It was such a terrifying thing for a King to collide with it at full force.","However, he still stopped.","“A King is only so-so!” Chu Yunfan shouted loudly.","Everyone was shocked. At this moment, they all reacted. Under the terrifying impact that could smash an entire mountain range, Chu Yunfan was actually not as heavily injured as they thought.","“You didn’t die?” The King beast stared at Chu Yunfan with a hint of surprise in his huge eyes. It seemed that he did not expect that this attack would not only fail to kill Chu Yunfan, but also fail to seriously injure him.","“If it’s only to this extent, you might die today!” Chu Yunfan looked at the King beast and grabbed at the void. A golden pill appeared and he swallowed it.","In an instant, a powerful energy was spat out from every cell of his. He was like a volcano that was about to erupt, and a terrifying power was boiling in his body.","The energy crushed everything!"]},{"number":2364,"title":"Chapter 2364: Number One in History","paragraphs":["Chapter 2364: Number One in History","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“What is this?” The King beast stared at Chu Yunfan. He felt that the power surging out of Chu Yunfan’s body was extremely dangerous.","Even he could feel how dangerous the energy surging out of Chu Yunfan’s body was.","Chu Yunfan felt the power in his body boiling, almost bursting his body.","This was because his body was really powerful. If it was an ordinary half-King, they would not be able to withstand the ravaging of this power at all. Their body would explode on the spot.","“I’ll kill you today. I mean it!” Chu Yunfan said indifferently. All the power in his body was unprecedentedly powerful. Chu Yunfan, who had already condensed 10,000 laws, actually already had the foundation to become a King.","All he needed was to polish his own cultivation level and step into the King Stage.","This was his initial plan. He was originally not in a hurry. He would find a place with no one and enter seclusion to advance to the King Stage. The world was huge, and he could go anywhere.","However, now, it was obvious that the King beast and the people behind it were unwilling to give him that time. They wanted to kill him before he advanced to the King Stage.","What he swallowed was a medicinal pill called the Nine Heavens Blood Spirit Pill. This medicinal pill was refined from the blood essence of many experts. During this period of time, Chu Yunfan had slaughtered too many experts. The blood essence of these experts was enough to refine the Nine Heavens Blood Spirit Pill. Once, the Alchemy Emperor successfully broke through to the King Stage by relying on the Nine Heavens Blood Spirit Pill.","Originally, Chu Yunfan did not plan to rely on the Nine Heaven Blood Spirit Pill to break through, but he had no other choice but to give it his all.","Relying on the Nine Heavens Blood Spirit Pill to advance to the King Stage, he still had a chance of winning.","However, after breaking through, he would probably have to spend a longer time to consolidate his cultivation and wear away the trace of imperfection brought about by the breakthrough of the Nine Heavens Blood Spirit Pill.","Although for other people, the slightest imperfection was nothing, Chu Yunfan was different. His requirements to advance were too high.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","The aura on Chu Yunfan’s body kept rising. It was visible to the naked eye that the aura on Chu Yunfan’s body was growing crazily like a shocking tsunami.","“Oh no! He’s breaking through! Stop him!” someone in the Central Plains hurriedly called out.","More people immediately realized that the pill that Chu Yunfan had just taken must have helped him break through.","The King beast also reacted in an instant. A ferocious expression appeared on his face. He stared at Chu Yunfan and growled in a low voice, “You want to break through in front of me? You’re courting death!”","Boom!","In the next moment, the King beast had already rushed in front of Chu Yunfan. In an instant, its huge tail smashed down on Chu Yunfan like a hammer.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan was hit directly, but he was not sent flying. A huge cauldron had appeared above his head at some point, blocking this terrifying attack.","Chu Yunfan had become stronger!","The King beast could clearly feel that Chu Yunfan was getting stronger. If it was the Chu Yunfan from before, he definitely wouldn’t be able to stop him now.","Chu Yunfan opened his eyes and shouted, “I’ll kill you today!”","Chu Yunfan’s body was covered in golden light. These golden lights were burning crazily like flames. Eight dragons and eight gods appeared behind Chu Yunfan. They were almost alive. Then, they punched at the King beast.","This was a sign that Chu Yunfan was starting to counterattack.","Boom!","This punch landed on the King beast’s body. It did not effectively injure the King beast, but it still made the King beast bleed. This was something that had never happened before.","Chu Yunfan had injured the King beast.","Many people were shocked. They only felt their entire bodies turn cold, and their hair stood on end. This terrifying combat strength shocked many half-Kings.","The King beast was already in the King Stage, but Chu Yunfan had yet to enter the King Stage. He was only in the half-King Stage, but he was already so strong.","The light was too bright.","The light from Chu Yunfan’s body blotted out the sun and swept across everything.","Chu Yunfan and the King beast fought. Compared to the King beast’s huge body, Chu Yunfan’s body was too small, almost not even as tall as the fingernail of the King beast.","However, the terrifying power contained in his body and released shocked everyone.","Everyone found that the situation seemed to be gradually changing from before. From the beginning, Chu Yunfan was completely at a disadvantage and was not a match for the King beast at all. Later on, Chu Yunfan began to be on equal footing with the King beast.","Chu Yunfan’s power was still rising crazily, and it was not stopping.","“He’s breaking through. He’s actually using the strength of a King to temper himself!”","“It’s too crazy. He’s using the power of a King to synthesize the power brought by the medicinal pill. The two sides offset each other in order to control the power of the medicinal pill within the range that he can use. It’s too crazy!”","“This is what a madman is!”","Many people gradually understood Chu Yunfan’s plan.","However, they couldn’t accept it just because they understood it. Chu Yunfan’s madness still shocked them.","Now that they had fought until now, they naturally understood what Chu Yunfan’s trump card was. He had been preparing this pill for the past three days.","“Could it be that these three days have given him an opportunity to turn the tables?” Many people found it unbelievable. At that time, many people thought that Chu Yunfan’s three days of time was useless and that it was impossible to turn the tables.","However, it was different now. They had truly seen how powerful Chu Yunfan was.","Boom!","Just as everyone was in shock, two figures, one big and one small, collided fiercely in the sky. They crossed each other and rushed in different directions.","However, in everyone’s eyes, at the place where the two sides collided, other than the crazy surging energy, there was also blood spurting out.","The blood floated in the universe and looked especially dazzling.","Many people widened their eyes, wanting to see whose blood it was.","Chu Yunfan stood in the air. On his body, a huge wound torn by a sharp claw was so eye-catching that blood spurted out from his body.","“He’s still no match for the King beast?”","Some people only felt that it was a pity. It was really a pity. If he succeeded, he would be the first half-King in history to fight against a King. He would have a brilliant record of killing a King. It would be enough to shine in history."]},{"number":2365,"title":"Chapter 2365: Finally Reaching the King Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2365: Finally Reaching the King Stage","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, even if they had fought to this point, to many people, it was an unprecedented battle result since ancient times.","This was especially so since many of them were prodigies of various eras, spanning from the ancient era to the present. They had never heard of such a shocking battle record.","Everyone was very clear about the huge gap between the half-King Stage and the King Stage. Therefore, these Supreme Youths and ancient prodigies had been more and more obedient during this period of time. Even if they had advanced to the half-King Stage, no one dared to jump out.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan, who chose to jump out, became the target of everyone.","It was even impossible for him to resist Chu Yunfan for so long. The difference between the half-King Stage and the King Stage was all-rounded.","The half-King Stage was only close to the King Stage in some aspects, but that was only close in some aspects. The rest was still completely behind.","“Is the King Stage invincible?” a supreme youth said in a daze. Although their stance was different from Chu Yunfan’s, there were still some people who hoped that Chu Yunfan would win. At the very least, he would be able to contend with a King.","In that case, at least they would have more ability to protect themselves. Kings would not be able to do whatever they wanted to them.","However, reality seemed to tell him that what he was thinking was still a fantasy. At present, a King was still not someone a half-King could challenge.","Chu Yunfan was already the strongest!","Although no one had clearly said this yet, in everyone’s eyes, Chu Yunfan was already the number one person below the King Stage. Even if he was not the strongest, he was still one of the strongest people.","However, even Chu Yunfan couldn’t do it, let alone them!","“Wait, Chu Yunfan isn’t the only one injured?” someone suddenly exclaimed.","Only then did everyone notice that in another direction, a huge bloody hole had been blasted out of the chest of the King beast. Blood was also flowing out desperately.","The blood they saw just now belonged to two people, not just Chu Yunfan.","“He really did it?” Everyone thought of such an unbelievable thing.","Even though many people had hoped that Chu Yunfan would win, they felt that the possibility was too small. When they really saw Chu Yunfan win, everyone was stunned.","Chu Yunfan turned around. His injuries were recovering, and his body was smoking as if he was on fire.","“Just now was the only time you could have killed me. However, you obviously missed this opportunity!”","Chu Yunfan turned around coldly and looked at the King beast. A terrifying power was boiling in his body. It was even more terrifying than before.","Boom!","Countless laws gathered around his body and spiraled up, forming a terrifying storm around him. It grew bigger and bigger, almost turning into a terrifying silkworm cocoon.","“Roar!”","The King beast let out a loud roar, and his huge body rushed over in the universe.","Boom!","A terrifying wind-type law turned into a powerful wind blade that swept across the entire universe, almost cutting the universe space in half.","The terrifying power tore everything apart and instantly blasted into the cocoon formed by countless laws around Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","The collision produced a terrifying boom, but what shocked everyone was that the wind blade was shattered bit by bit, disappearing inch by inch before everyone’s eyes.","At this moment, the King beast had already rushed in front of Chu Yunfan, and a huge claw slammed down fiercely.","Stab!","The entire void of the universe was torn apart, and the cocoon was naturally torn apart.","However, what caught everyone’s attention was that a hand had already been raised and firmly caught the huge claw.","Boom!","A loud explosion sounded.","Chu Yunfan was unharmed. To be precise, he easily caught the King beast’s terrifying attack.","“What a pity, it’s too late for you!”","Chu Yunfan said indifferently. In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan clenched his fist and his entire body shone with golden light. Behind him, a golden shadow appeared. Then, this golden shadow fiercely attacked the King beast.","Bam!","For the first time, that King beast was sent flying. His huge body dragged in the void of the universe, smashing countless celestial bodies.","It was unknown how many wounds had been cut on his huge body at the same time.","This terrifying scene stunned many of the spectators in the Central Plains.","How did he do it?","But soon, everyone came to a realization.","Chu Yunfan’s sudden outburst of such terrifying combat strength was obviously not the effect of that pill. If that pill could have such amazing medicinal effects, then Chu Yunfan would have erupted with such terrifying combat strength earlier.","Therefore, there was only one explanation.","Chu Yunfan had also stepped into the King Stage!","“Not only did that medicinal pill just now increase his combat strength in a short period of time, but it also allowed his strength to have an astonishing increase. He actually broke into the King Stage just like that!”","“How is that possible? If breaking into the King Stage is so simple, then why are we still cultivating so painstakingly?”","“What kind of pill is this? I must get it!”","Many people’s eyes turned red. They thought of another point. If Chu Yunfan had broken through by relying on his own strength, then they had nothing to say because there was no way to replicate it.","However, that wasn’t the case. Chu Yunfan had relied on that pill to complete his advancement. In other words, it was possible for them to obtain the same pill and break through to the King Stage in one go.","It could even save countless years of bitter cultivation, especially for many top-notch martial arts experts who had been stuck in the half-King Stage for many years without any progress. They were about to go crazy.","Their eyes were about to go crazy, even though they knew that Chu Yunfan’s pill would not be so easy to make. They would have to pay a huge price.","However, it was better than having no hope at all.","For a time, Chu Yunfan, who was originally a thorn in many people’s eyes, became the hope in many people’s eyes.","“He must not die, absolutely not!”","“We must get the medicinal pill to advance to the King Stage from him!”","“From now on, Kings can be mass-produced!”","Countless people were cheering that an era where Kings could be mass-produced was about to arrive, but someone poured cold water on all of this.","“You dare to interrogate a King? Are you guys crazy?”"]},{"number":2366,"title":"Chapter 2366: The King Stage Cannot Be Humiliated","paragraphs":["Chapter 2366: The King Stage Cannot Be Humiliated","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone thought that Chu Yunfan was no longer in the half-King Stage. Many people could think of ways to force him if he was in the half-King Stage. They could even set up a trap like today to force Chu Yunfan into it.","However, once he truly advanced to the King Stage, all schemes would be useless.","A King was too strong. They could not be humiliated!","It might even cause a backlash from all the Kings!","Although they might not have put Chu Yunfan in their eyes before this, after Chu Yunfan had already stepped into the King Stage, to a certain extent, he was one of them.","What they were protecting was not Chu Yunfan, but the dignity of this class.","If anyone could think of ways to scheme against a King, even if it was not him, he would still be able to completely bring down the prestige of the King Stage to the mortal world.","Regardless of the outcome, when it became possible to scheme against a King, it was a humiliation to those Kings.","The King Stage could not be humiliated!","They were the true rulers of the world!","These people already did not have the courage to face Chu Yunfan head-on. Moreover, after Chu Yunfan successfully entered the King Stage, he was even more an existence that they could not compare to.","Wouldn’t it be a joke if they wanted to force Chu Yunfan to give them the pill formula?","When many people thought of this, they felt as if a bucket of cold water had been poured on them. They felt as if they had fallen into an ice cave. To scheme against a King, they really did not want to live anymore.","The King beast seemed to have gone completely crazy. He, a King, had come to hunt down a half-King Stage ant, but he had actually failed to kill it. The other party had even successfully advanced to the King Stage and become a King on par with him.","This was simply a great humiliation.","He had completely understood that he had become the stepping stone of the person in front of him.","All of this was within his opponent’s calculations, even his own arrival.","Thinking of this, the anger in his heart erupted like a volcano.","However, he did not act rashly. Things were different now. Chu Yunfan was already a King. Even if he had just entered the King Stage, he was still on equal footing with him.","After all, he had just stepped into the King Stage not long ago.","He immediately calmed down. The terrifying aura of Chu Yunfan was still rolling out crazily. Everything around him had been assimilated into his own domain.","Compared to the Domain Stage, the King Stage had completed a complete transformation. It was completely different.","The domain of a Domainian was too simple, and the domain evolved by a King already had the taste of a world.","He fused his martial will into it, almost elevating this place into his own divine kingdom.","The surrounding universe and void seemed to be about to collapse. It shattered inch by inch. It was torn apart by Chu Yunfan’s powerful and terrifying aura. Terrifying chaos was wreaking havoc.","It was different from a Domainian. A Domainian could only break through the world barrier in a special place like the ancient battlefield. However, a King was different. He could already break through the world barrier in the Origin World and could even see chaos pouring out from it.","“I have to admit that I underestimated you and gave you such a chance!” The King beast stared at Chu Yunfan. With a slight sway of his body, he turned into a muscular middle-aged man in his forties.","This middle-aged man had a ferocious expression. He was dressed in beast skin and had protruding fangs. He looked extremely terrifying.","Although the King beast had become much smaller after transforming into a human, it was clearly much more dangerous in the eyes of everyone.","“It doesn’t matter if you underestimate me or not. It’s meaningless because you can’t kill me!” Chu Yunfan said coldly. “You used such a despicable method to force me out. Aren’t you afraid that I’ll become a big problem for you when I grow up? Aren’t you trying to kill me before I grow up? Then I’ll tell you now. It’s too late. You’ll have to leave your life here today!”","“Arrogant!” the King beast said coldly, his expression extremely cold.","On the other hand, Chu Yunfan had already attacked mercilessly. His five fingers clenched into a fist, and dazzling golden light burst out from the gaps between his fingers. The fist force turned into a light that filled the sky. Eight gods appeared behind Chu Yunfan and suddenly punched at the King beast.","Compared to before, Chu Yunfan’s attack was at least ten times more terrifying.","This was the difference between those who had stepped into the King Stage and those who had not.","No matter how many half-Kings there were, it was meaningless when facing a King. It was impossible to win.","Even someone as powerful as Chu Yunfan would not be able to win. At most, he would be able to escape from the hands of a King.","That was already very stunning.","In fact, what those people thought was right. It was impossible for a half-King to defeat a King.","All their thoughts were wishful thinking.","This was something that Chu Yunfan had only realized after he had truly entered the King Stage. What was the King Stage? It meant that he was the king of heaven and earth. All the rules and elements had to be used by him.","In the heavens and the earth, he was the only one who reigned supreme.","This was the true King Stage.","At the end of the day, a half-King was still only at the Domain Stage. He was only a relatively powerful Domainian.","How could a Domainian fight against a King?","There was only one possibility of defeating a King. There was no other possibility.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s fist blasted out, and in an instant, eight gods swept out. The intense light even filled the entire universe, making the entire universe light up at once.","Immediately after, this terrifying light rushed toward the King beast at lightning speed.","The King beast roared loudly. The wounds on his body that Chu Yunfan had caused were still faintly hurting. The injuries of both sides were similar, and Chu Yunfan’s injuries were even more serious.","However, Chu Yunfan had almost recovered and could attack again. However, the King beast had not fully recovered yet.","He knew that this was a period of weakness for him, and also his weakest.","He was recovering.","Even though this time would not be very long, Chu Yunfan, who was also a King like the King beast, would not miss such an opportunity.","In an instant, it had already rushed in front of the King beast.","The eight gods were like gods from heaven, descending to the mortal world to slay demons.","Chu Yunfan was in the center of the eight gods, which was the central world. He personally led troops to descend to the mortal world to kill demons and devils.","Boom!","The fist force of this punch swept into the King beast’s chest.","A peerless collision erupted."]},{"number":2367,"title":"Chapter 2367: Slaying the King Beast","paragraphs":["Chapter 2367: Slaying the King Beast","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan’s punch was like a peerless weapon that tore through the sky. It tore through the universe space and shattered it inch by inch.","Chu Yunfan’s punch also took the opportunity to hit the King beast’s chest. This was a fatal blow.","Before the King beast had time to recover from the wound, Chu Yunfan seized this once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.","The difference between their physical bodies was already obvious.","Although Chu Yunfan had just entered the King Stage, the toughness of his body had already surpassed that of the King beast. Moreover, it would continue to strengthen as time passed.","The King beast roared in anger and was sent flying. The huge bloody hole in his chest had become even bigger. Blood splattered everywhere. It could be said that bones and blood flew everywhere.","His blood was burning. It was ignited by Chu Yunfan’s terrifying fist force and began to burn in the universe.","Everyone was dumbfounded!","In their imagination, even if Chu Yunfan had already entered the King Stage, the two sides should still be in a stalemate.","Both of them were new Kings who had just stepped into the King Stage not long ago. Their strength should be on par.","But now, Chu Yunfan was using the truth to slap their faces. It didn’t exist!","Chu Yunfan stood with his hands behind his back. He was like a golden god in the world, powerful to an unimaginable extent.","Chu Yunfan naturally wouldn’t let the King beast go after succeeding in his attack. He knew that Kings like them had very, very strong vitality.","It was simply impossible to kill a King with a single strike.","Sure enough, after the King beast destroyed countless planets, he roared again, shaking the entire universe.","He was burning the blood essence in his body crazily to speed up the recovery of his injuries, although this would hurt the foundation of his Great Dao and even affect his future breakthrough and his lifespan.","However, he was forced to the extreme and had no choice.","Seeing this, Chu Yunfan did not hesitate at all. He jumped up and grabbed at the void. In an instant, he had already grabbed a lightning sword. The sword light swept across the sky and almost cut the entire universe in half.","“Seven Violet Thunder Swords!”","Chu Yunfan slashed down with his sword, pressing forward. This sword contained Chu Yunfan’s understanding of sword techniques and thunder laws. It could be said that he had already brought this sword to the peak of perfection.","Even if the founder of the Violet Thunder Sword Sect, the legendary King, was still around, it was impossible for him to surpass Chu Yunfan.","It could be said that Chu Yunfan had already pushed this sword technique to its limits.","This sword was tens of thousands of feet long, and it directly swept into the King beast’s chest.","Slash!","The King beast let out a miserable cry. His entire body was almost cut open by Chu Yunfan’s sword.","All the light in the world was instantly blocked by this sword. There was no other light that was more dazzling than this sword light.","Chu Yunfan had the upper hand and was unforgiving. All kinds of terrifying attacks swept over like a storm.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Countless terrifying attacks fell on the King beast’s body like raindrops.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes were bloodshot. He was killing a King. Even with his strong state of mind, he could feel his blood boiling.","At the same time, the terrifying power of the Disaster Star Eyes swept through his eyes. The power of disaster turned into karmic flames that engulfed the King beast’s body and burned fiercely.","The Fire of Disaster was not an ordinary flame. It was a flame formed by the power of disasters in the world. There was no way to expel it completely unless there were no more disasters in the world.","However, that was impossible.","Even if a King was infected, it would take a very long time to expel it.","The King beast screamed miserably. He was sent flying by the heavy blows again and again. He only felt that his entire body was burning with surging fire of disaster. He even wished that he could shed his skin to avoid this Fire of Disaster that could not be extinguished.","He was in the most dangerous moment of his life. He had never encountered such a terrifying killing intent.","He was confident that he wouldn’t be like this even if he faced other Kings.","But who would have thought that he would be so weak after meeting Chu Yunfan?","Swoosh!","Chu Yunfan slashed down with his sword. Instantly, the King beast was cut into two halves, and blood spurted out.","‘Is it over?!’ Many people shouted in their hearts. This series of attacks dazzled them. They had never thought that a battle between Kings would be so one-sided.","It was completely different from what they had imagined.","They saw that the King beast, who had previously rampaged through the northern region of Grand Xia and killed countless living beings, was now beaten like a dog and was even split into two.","However, in the next moment, this King beast suddenly reassembled in the universe. The Fire of Disaster on the body of this reassembled King beast also disappeared, and some of the original remaining wounds also disappeared without a trace.","He seemed to have returned to its peak, but everyone could see that the aura of this King beast had clearly weakened a lot.","It was obvious that this rebirth had consumed a lot of his origin energy. He did not know how many future troubles he had left behind this time.","However, the King beast clearly could not care less. After all, if he was not careful, he might die.","“Chu Yunfan, I must kill you! Die!” the King beast roared angrily. His face was distorted, and he looked extremely terrifying.","Chu Yunfan just looked at the King beast coldly. The lightning wings on his back spread open, and in the next moment, he had already arrived in front of the King beast. It turned out that his actions just now were just an afterimage. When everyone saw Chu Yunfan’s actions just now, he had already charged in front of the King beast.","The sword formed by the power of lightning in his hand swept out.","Swoosh!","Swoosh!","Swoosh!","The sword was too fast. The King beast didn’t even have time to react before his head was sliced off. His eyes widened.","Just now, he was thinking about how to take revenge on Chu Yunfan. He did not expect to die in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","Chu Yunfan had become stronger. He was at least 50% stronger than when he had just broken through.","In a battle between experts, the slightest difference was enough to be fatal. Moreover, the difference was so great that Chu Yunfan could easily take the life of the King beast.","The King beast was dead!"]},{"number":2368,"title":"Chapter 2368: The Spiritual Leader of the Flying Celestials","paragraphs":["Chapter 2368: The Spiritual Leader of the Flying Celestials","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","One hit and he died!","The King beast died tragically!","Everyone who saw this scene could not help but be stunned. They were completely dumbfounded.","Many people were completely silent. Chu Yunfan had risen to power in such a way. It was rare since ancient times.","He announced his rise by killing another King.","What was peerless strength? This was peerless strength!","There was no hesitation. Chu Yunfan’s combat strength did not allow anyone to hesitate at all!","Chu Yunfan had announced the birth of a King with his shocking strength.","Chu Yunfan sat cross-legged in the void. Even if there was no air in the universe, it did not affect Chu Yunfan at all.","He was consolidating the gains from this battle. No one dared to attack him at this time. Wasn’t that courting death?","For a moment, all the Hus fell into a state of shock and panic.","The humans had one more King, while the Hus had one less King.","Every King was their own foundation. Losing one was a huge loss, much greater than losing a million soldiers.","Many people looked at Chu Yunfan with hatred, especially when Chu Yunfan really rose to power. He first killed his way into the grasslands and killed the khan.","Then, he killed the King beast. It could be said that he had stepped on the corpse of the Hus to rise to power.","How could the Hus be happy about this?","It could be said that they wanted nothing more than to kill Chu Yunfan.","However, killing a King was something impossible.","In front of Chu Yunfan, the corpse of the King beast floated in the void of the universe, but no one dared to collect it.","Chu Yunfan was too terrifying.","Suddenly, at this moment, the void was torn apart. Immediately after, a hand grabbed at the King beast’s corpse.","Although no one dared to target Chu Yunfan, they could still take the King beast’s corpse.","At the same time, several hands appeared. All of them were martial arts masters above the King Stage.","However, that was Chu Yunfan’s opponent. Chu Yunfan suddenly opened his eyes, which contained purple lightning. In an instant, the power of disaster spread out.","Ever since he advanced to the King Stage, the power of the Disaster Star Eyes had also increased by more than ten times compared to before. It was enough to heavily injure a King.","The huge hand that was grabbing down disintegrated and disappeared into the void.","The other hands were a step slower, but they didn’t escape the fate of being disintegrated.","It wasn’t a physical attack, but a destruction from the origin of laws.","This was an extremely terrifying technique, and it was an ability that only those who had cultivated the Disaster Star Eyes to an extremely high level would possess.","“A bunch of scoundrels!”","Chu Yunfan said coldly.","He didn’t continue to pursue because he knew it was useless. No one knew who the owner of those hands was.","Even with his cultivation, he did not notice who had attacked just now.","His understanding of Kings was too little.","However, even if he knew a lot, it was impossible for him to trace it. After all, these Kings had already taken precautions, so it was impossible for him to see through any flaws.","However, the confrontation just now made many people heave a sigh of relief in their hearts as if they had seen a ghost. This was because this was a very simple exchange, but there were so many Kings behind it.","There were other races behind them, and there might even be Supreme King humans among them.","In the King Stage, Chu Yunfan had only just stepped into it and was still a newcomer. Sometimes, he still felt that his strength was insufficient.","“From now on, the King beast will be removed from the list. Whoever dares to offend our humans again will have the same outcome as him!”","Chu Yunfan put away the King beast’s corpse. He had already thought about using the King beast’s corpse to make the Nine Heavens Blood Spirit Pill. With the corpse of a King, it was much better than Chu Yunfan collecting the blood essence of a half-King bit by bit.","At that time, he would be able to create many Kings, and that was the most fundamental reason for him to establish himself in the entire world.","The others were right. As long as Chu Yunfan was willing, he was confident that he could mass-produce this King Stage.","If Chu Yunfan had revealed such an ability before, he would have immediately attracted the covetous eyes of countless people. After all, this might be able to mass produce King Stage pills.","However, things were different now. Chu Yunfan already had the ability to protect himself.","A King, even if he had just become a King, everyone’s attitude toward him would change drastically.","Everything was only for his powerful strength.","Everyone in the humans was jubilant. With Chu Yunfan’s warning, it was believed that whether it was the demons, the Hus, the marine folks, the demons, or the barbarians, they had to carefully consider the terrifying consequences of angering a King.","Even though many people had wanted to start a massacre and set up a trap to kill Chu Yunfan, they no longer had any temper at this time. They did not dare to meet Chu Yunfan’s gaze.","After Chu Yunfan collected the King beast’s corpse, he silently returned to the Flying Celestials.","Immediately, the entire human race was in an uproar. The entire world’s situation was about to undergo an even greater change.","Many people came from thousands of miles away to pay their respects to Chu Yunfan.","It was unknown how many people had come, and the Flying Celestials’ gates was almost trampled through.","However, at this time, the Flying Celestials did not dare to make any decisions without Chu Yunfan’s permission.","At this moment, the Flying Celestials had already undergone some changes!","If it was said that the next generation of the Flying Celestials and the fight for the position of sect leader were originally there, then now, all the fights had disappeared when Chu Yunfan broke through to the King Stage.","No matter who the next sect leader of the Flying Celestials was, they had to admit that the sect leader was no longer the core of the Flying Celestials. Chu Yunfan was the core of the Flying Celestials.","He was the spiritual leader of the Flying Celestials.","This spiritual leader was a spontaneous one, not conferred by others.","In a sense, Chu Yunfan’s words were even more useful than the words of the Flying Celestials’ sect leader.","Situ Xuan had been in charge of the Flying Celestials for many years, so he could still maintain his authority and not be completely figure-headed.","However, if the next sect leader was not Chu Yunfan, the power of the entire Flying Celestials might be monopolized by Chu Yunfan.","The Flying Celestials’ sect leader’s words would not be as effective as Chu Yunfan’s.","Because everything was completely different when Chu Yunfan defeated the King beast."]},{"number":2369,"title":"Chapter 2369: Forced Abdication","paragraphs":["Chapter 2369: Forced Abdication","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The spiritual leader of the Flying Celestials had unknowingly changed to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan was the second top-notch expert to step into the King Stage after the founding ancestor of the Flying Celestials.","Although he had only just entered the King Stage, it was already enough to carry weight in the current world.","In the current Great Era, the various races were fighting for hegemony. To the various factions, it was a Great Era where the kings were fighting for hegemony.","Only when there was a King in the faction could they participate in the battle to dominate the world.","Without a King guarding the place, they were not even qualified to participate. To be precise, without a King guarding the place, all they could do was barely protect themselves.","Just like before, even though the Flying Celestials was one of the top ten forces, they could only protect themselves and not be attacked by the demon army.","This was already very difficult.","As for the other second-class forces, they were under the harassment and siege of the demons and other races, and were in a precarious situation.","Without a King, it was equivalent to a country that did not have nuclear weapons in the ancient era. No matter how well it developed, no matter how many martial arts masters there were in the sect, there was no way to truly protect their sect.","Now, Chu Yunfan’s significance to the Flying Celestials was no less than the nuclear weapons in the hands of the five hooligans. It could be said that he was a pillar supporting the sky.","The five hooligans who had nuclear weapons were the real five hooligans.","It was precisely because of this that the increase of every King would cause a huge change in the situation of the entire world, and it would enter a new round of reshuffling.","Especially after Chu Yunfan broke through many obstacles and reached the King Stage, it caused many more variables in the world.","There was one more person in the world who could stir up the world.","It was precisely because of this that so many people went to the Flying Celestials to see Chu Yunfan.","Everyone knew that Chu Yunfan had a pill that could help a half-King advance to the King Stage.","This was undoubtedly a huge stimulation for so many half-Kings in the world.","It was fine for those Supreme Youths. It could be said that it was only a matter of time for them to step into the King Stage in the future.","The King Stage was definitely not the end of their cultivation path. However, for many people, the half-King Stage was already the end. Without the help of external forces, they might not be able to reach the King Stage in their lifetime.","Under such circumstances, many people began to gather outside the Flying Celestials, especially many half-Kings, especially those on the Prospective Kings List. Many of them were only one step away. If they could obtain the Nine Heaven Blood Spirit Pill made by Chu Yunfan, they would definitely be able to break through to the King Stage.","These people were especially anxious.","“King Chu, please give us a chance to pay our respects!” someone shouted. Immediately after, the other half-Kings stood up one after another.","Any one of these people had a terrifying aura that could suppress an area.","Normally, any one of them would be enough to make the Flying Celestials deal with them as if they were facing a great enemy.","But now, the Flying Celestials was very relaxed, because there was a new king in the Flying Celestials.","There was no need to doubt the strength of a King.","“Everyone, it’s not convenient for King Chu to come out and see you now. Everyone, disperse!” However, with so many half-Kings descending at the same time, the Flying Celestials had no choice but to give an explanation.","Hence, the sect leader of the Flying Celestials, Situ Xuan, stood up. He was only at the peak of Domain Stage and was not even a half-King. Facing so many half-Kings, even though he had the entire Flying Celestials supporting him, he could not help but feel a headache.","If he were to face one or two of them, even if his cultivation base wasn’t as high as the other party, Situ Xuan wouldn’t be afraid at all. This was because he had the backing of one of the ten major powers of Grand Xia, the Flying Celestials.","However, at this moment, other than the demons, more than half of the half-Kings in the world had come.","Facing so many top experts at the same time, even though Situ Xuan was experienced and knowledgeable, he could not help but break out in cold sweat.","These old fellows were rarely seen. They were basically in seclusion. He had only seen a small portion of these people in the past. For most of the, he had only heard of their names but had never met them before.","There were even some people whose names he had never even heard of. Some were too low-key, and some were too old. Even he did not know the direct descendants of these people.","According to the normal pattern, it was almost certain that he would become one of these people in the future.","Now, with so many sects and so many half-Kings coming to visit, even if he used his toes to think, he knew what the reason was. It must have something to do with the pill that Chu Yunfan had consumed.","Not to mention outsiders, there were even many people in the Flying Celestials who were interested in that medicinal pill. After all, it was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to advance a half-King to the King Stage.","However, compared to the people outside, they were more restrained. In their eyes, Chu Yunfan was a member of the Flying Celestials. Sooner or later, they would get such an opportunity.","“When will King Chu be free to see us? I hope you can give us some time!”","At this moment, an old half-step King said.","“I don’t know about that. We’ll talk about it when King Chu comes out of seclusion!” Situ Xuan said. Everyone’s eyes fell on him.","Fortunately, he had Chu Yunfan behind him, so he was not too afraid of these people.","“It’s a chaotic world now. The humans are facing a fierce attack from the demons. For the sake of the humans, I hope that Lord Chu can contribute the recipe of that pill. As long as Lord Chu can contribute it, the humans will be eternally grateful!” At this moment, an old man stood up and slowly said.","Situ Xuan’s face darkened when he saw the old man. He had already recognized the old man’s identity. He was the former vice sect leader of the Destiny Sect.","He had met this old man before, and he could be considered an old senior.","At this time, he said such words. It was obvious that he had bad intentions. He hoped to use the righteousness of the entire human race to force Chu Yunfan to lower his head.","Obediently hand over the pill recipe. Otherwise, Chu Yunfan would be the sinner of the entire human race.","Although they didn’t say it explicitly, the other half-step Kings all agreed.","They didn’t have the guts to go against a King, but they still dared to make Chu Yunfan lower his head in the name of humankind."]},{"number":2370,"title":"Chapter 2370: Killing a Half-King With a Single Slap","paragraphs":["Chapter 2370: Killing a Half-King With a Single Slap","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Now that the demons are invading, the Central Plains is in imminent danger. Why would King Chu care about his sectarian-like views? If King Chu is willing to contribute the pill recipe, all of the races of the Central Plains will be grateful for his kindness!” At this moment, a half-King Stage demon said.","With this demon expert as an opportunity, the half-Kings of the other races also spoke.","Of course, they were unwilling to let the humans swallow all the benefits just like that.","If the humans obtained the pill recipe alone, then the humans would definitely have an endless stream of Kings in the future.","Not to mention an endless supply, even if another King appeared, it would be a huge threat to the various races.","Not to mention that they had already cultivated to the half-King Stage and were only a step away from the true King Stage. As long as there was a tiny chance, they would not let go of the final chance to reach the King Stage.","Even the other peak Domainians who had yet to step into the half-King Stage began to clamor.","They might not have the courage to do it alone, but they still had the courage to follow the crowd.","“Everyone, what do you want to do? Do you want to force the abdication?” Situ Xuan shouted, and all the protective formations of the Flying Celestials were activated.","The entire Flying Celestials had also entered a state of combat readiness in an instant. Under such circumstances, they would definitely not give up on Chu Yunfan and choose to support him.","At the same time, Huangfu Longhao, Chu Hongcai, and the other half-Kings also appeared outside the protective barrier and confronted the half-Kings who were forcing them to abdicate.","“King Chu, please come out!” the experts shouted.","“Hehe, since you invited me out, I’ll meet you!” Suddenly, a figure slowly appeared in midair.","Everyone looked at him. Wasn’t this Chu Yunfan?","Everyone who had been shouting loudly just now instantly fell silent. No one knew how much pressure they had to endure before they faced a King.","This was also the reason why no one thought Chu Yunfan would win against the King beast.","There was no chance of victory for a half-King against a King. It was a true miracle for Chu Yunfan to defeat a powerful opponent and kill a King beast in the end.","Moreover, in everyone’s opinion, the real reason why Chu Yunfan could kill the King beast was that he was also in the King Stage.","Even if he had broken through in battle.","In the end, when Chu Yunfan killed the King beast, it became a King killing a King. This also matched everyone’s understanding. If it was a half-King killing a King, that would be too shocking.","Those who could defeat a King could only be in the King Stage. At the very least, it was impossible for a half-King.","One could imagine how much pressure they felt when they faced Chu Yunfan.","“You want me to hand over the pill recipe? On what basis?” Chu Yunfan looked at everyone with a faint smile.","Even if the sky was filled with half-Kings, there were half-Kings that had been hidden for many years from various races. He did not take them seriously.","This was the power of a King. Before he broke through, even if Chu Yunfan could easily kill any of the half-Kings, he did not dare to underestimate so many of them.","But now, he could ignore so many top-notch experts!","However, among these half-Kings, there were no Supreme Youths. Even the ancient prodigies were few.","One could imagine that those Supreme Youths were definitely confident that they could advance to the King Stage. Moreover, the chances were not small, so they would not take the risk easily.","Only those veteran half-Kings who had exhausted all their potential and were not young would choose to take the risk.","“King Chu, I’m also thinking for the sake of us humans. Now that the humans is in a precarious situation, your pill recipe can help increase the number of Kings of our humans. Isn’t this what you should do, King Chu?”","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s gaze fall on him, the old man who was the first to speak, the former vice sect leader of the Destiny Sect, could not help but bite the bullet and speak.","Chu Yunfan’s gaze fell on him. It was as if he was facing the terrifying pressure of the old sect leader.","“Hahaha, what should I do? When did I become the one who should do these things?” Chu Yunfan burst into laughter. “How funny. The humans are in a precarious situation right now, and I don’t see your Destiny Sect sharing your inheritance selflessly. At this time, you’re talking about the righteousness of the humans. Isn’t that funny?”","Chu Yunfan saw through it at a glance. There was a mastermind behind this, trying to force Chu Yunfan to hand over the pill recipe with the righteousness of the race. Who would benefit the most from this?","Without a doubt, the Destiny Sect, which had the most half-Kings, would obtain the most benefits.","This pill recupe could not only increase their foundation, but it could increase their high-end King Stage combat strength.","Therefore, whoever had more half-Kings or even peak Domainians would obtain more benefits.","In this aspect, the Destiny Sect was naturally one of the best.","“King Chu, don’t be so unreasonable. This is also the intention of all the Kings!” the old man said arrogantly. At this moment, he remembered that there were so many Kings standing behind him.","This pill recipe was something that even the Kings were envious of. It could increase a sect’s high-end combat strength, and no one would complain about having too much.","“Kings? You’re using those Kings to suppress me?” Chu Yunfan sneered and slapped the old man.","Bam!","The former vice sect keader of the Destiny Sect only had time to scream before he was slapped into a bloody mist on the spot.","Everyone was shocked by Chu Yunfan’s sudden attack. They didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to be so ruthless.","“This...” Everyone was dumbfounded. They felt a chill run down their spines, as if they had fallen into an ice cave.","Everyone thought of the same phrase—the King Stage could not be humiliated.","However, they seemed to have forgotten that although Chu Yunfan had just entered the King Stage, he was still a true King. If they wanted to force Chu Yunfan to do something, wouldn’t they be courting death?","This was especially true for the former vice sect leader of the Destiny Sect. Although he was only at the half-King Stage, the person standing behind him was the old sect leader of the Destiny Sect, an old King.","However, Chu Yunfan had also killed him. For a moment, everyone was silent.","“If you want to use other Kings to pressure me, you have to see if you have the ability. They should come to me personally. With just you guys, you want to force me to abdicate?” Chu Yunfan sneered. He did not put anyone in his eyes at all. Even if he had just casually killed a half-King, it was nothing.","Many people gasped. This was the real difference between the King Stage and the half-King Stage. Chu Yunfan, who could fight against a King, was a rare monster."]},{"number":2371,"title":"Chapter 2371: No Scruples","paragraphs":["Chapter 2371: No Scruples","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","To a true King, no matter how strong a half-King was, they were all ants!","This was also a principle that everyone recognized. However, before this, Chu Yunfan had challenged a King and even won, which made everyone’s faith waver a little.","But now, with Chu Yunfan’s slap, everyone’s mind was clear.","The King Stage could not be humiliated, especially a top-notch existence like Chu Yunfan!","Many people began to regret their decision. Why had they suddenly lost their minds and wanted to force Chu Yunfan to abdicate?","This was simply unrealistic.","Just as Chu Yunfan had said, only other Kings would be able to stand on equal footing with him. How could ordinary people have such a possibility?","“Is this the true strength of the King Stage?”","“I’m afraid that existences at the half-King Stage like us are no different from others in their eyes. In any case, we’ll all be killed with a single slap. It’s just a matter of using a little more force or not using a little more force.”","“This is too scary!”","At this time, everyone had already decided to retreat, intimidated by Chu Yunfan alone.","“Chu Yunfan, how dare you kill the vice sect leader of my Destiny Sect!”","At this moment, a huge explosion came from the sky. Then, a figure took shape in the air.","Everyone focused their eyes and saw that this figure was none other than the old sect leader of the Destiny Sect.","Although he was in seclusion all year round and not many people had seen him, this did not prevent them from guessing his identity.","After Chu Yunfan killed one of his deputies, the old sect leader of the Destiny Sect finally couldn’t hold it in anymore and jumped out.","“So what if I killed him?” Chu Yunfan said with a cold smile. “Do you think I won’t dare to kill you?”","“The King Stage can’t be humiliated. Otherwise, wouldn’t any Tom, Dick, or Harry want to kill us in the future?” Chu Yunfan spoke in a sonorous and forceful manner, causing many people in the void to nod their heads. This was especially true for those Kings who had not come but had been paying attention. There was no other reason that could be more correct.","Although they were fearless, it was inevitable that they would be taken advantage of by villains. Moreover, even if there were no villains, if there were many people who wanted to scheme against them at all times, even if they were so powerful, it was inevitable that they would be successfully schemed against.","Therefore, the best way was to put an end to their wild thoughts. The King Stage could not be humiliated. This was a fundamental principle that could not be shaken.","“Besides, do you think I don’t know? You must be the one behind this!”","Chu Yunfan sneered as he looked at the old sect leader of the Destiny Sect.","It was also the old sect leader of the Destiny Sect who had forced Chu Yunfan to fight the King beast with his half-King Stage cultivation.","The old sect leader of the Destiny Sect looked at Chu Yunfan with a complicated expression.","There was no doubt that many things behind the scenes were his doing. Even he did not expect Chu Yunfan to be so difficult to deal with.","Forcing Chu Yunfan to fight the King beast was a drastic measure. Originally, this would definitely lead to death. No matter how powerful Chu Yunfan was, there was no way he would have a chance of survival.","As long as Chu Yunfan fought, he would definitely die at the hands of the King beast.","If Chu Yunfan chose to avoid the battle, then he would have a reason to intervene. He could force Chu Yunfan to commit suicide in the name of the humans and appease the King beast’s anger.","Although the reason was a little far-fetched, all he needed was an excuse. No matter how far-fetched the excuse was, as long as he could explain it to the human king, it was enough.","He believed that no matter how angry the human king was, he would not completely fall out with him because of a dead man.","In this precarious situation of the humans, the role of a King was unquestionable. He was like a stabilizing needle that guarded a region.","However, what he never expected was that when he thought that Chu Yunfan would definitely not be able to escape and would definitely die, Chu Yunfan actually killed his way out of the danger zone.","In the end, he even reached the King Stage!","He could only think that the King beast that he had high hopes for was simply trash.","He could not even kill a half-King!","Now, Chu Yunfan was no longer a threat to the Destiny Sect and had already become their mortal enemy. Chu Yunfan could completely destroy the many years of inheritance of the Destiny Sect.","Although he was absolutely confident that Chu Yunfan was no match for him, he was much older than Chu Yunfan. He was even several generations older than the current sect leader of the Flying Celestials.","Although the lifespan of a King was much longer than a Domainian, he had to admit that he was already old. However, Chu Yunfan was like the rising sun. Based on the shocking strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed, it was completely imaginable that the next 1,000 years, or even 2,000 years, would be Chu Yunfan’s world.","He would die of old age, but Chu Yunfan would gradually become stronger.","Especially Chu Yunfan, who was one of the best among the Supreme Youths. In the future, he might even become an Emperor, and the possibility was not small.","Once Chu Yunfan became an emperor, he would become a huge threat to the Destiny Sect.","To a sect, having an emperor thinking about revenge day and night was simply a dead end.","Unless the Destiny Sect also had an Emperor, they would not be able to compete with Chu Yunfan.","However, he wasn’t willing to place his hopes on the future of the Destiny Sect. He was already used to it. He had to suppress all those who were a threat to the Destiny Sect in their budding state.","At the thought of this, he looked at Chu Yunfan with fear and killing intent.","Of course, Chu Yunfan could see the killing intent in the sect leader’s eyes. He could even guess what he was thinking.","However, everything was different now. He could be on equal footing with the other party!","“You still dare to plot against me now? You’re quite bold. One day, I’ll kill you!”","Chu Yunfan said coldly.","If he wasn’t at the King Stage, even Chu Yunfan wouldn’t directly fall out with him. That was because if he did, he would attract the other party’s desperate attack. At that time, he would only be a dead person. Who would seek justice for him?","However, things were different now!","“Humph!”","Chu Yunfan waved his hand and grabbed out with his palm. In the sky, a large hand formed from energy and grabbed the old sect leader of the Destiny Sect.","Boom!","The old sect leader of the Destiny Sect was grabbed into the sky and turned into spirit energy that filled the sky.","However, in front of Chu Yunfan, he had no chance of winning."]},{"number":2372,"title":"Chapter 2372: The King-Acknowledgement Feast","paragraphs":["Chapter 2372: The King-Acknowledgement Feast","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Even the old sect leader of the Destiny Sect had died in Chu Yunfan’s hands. For a moment, those half-Kings turned around and ran, afraid that they would bump into Chu Yunfan and be slapped to death by him.","In many people’s hearts, Chu Yunfan’s danger level was immediately raised to the highest level. Even the old sect leader of the Destiny Sect was killed just like that.","He was simply a lunatic without any rationality.","He did not even care about the King Stage, let alone them, who were at the half-King Stage.","For a time, all the half-Kings disappeared without a trace in a very short period of time.","Many people could not help but sigh. A half-King was only a half-King. It was impossible to force a King to surrender just because there were many of them.","The difference between the King Stage and the half-King Stage was as big as the sky and the earth. There was no possibility of successfully forcing him to abdicate.","No King would allow themselves to be forced to abdicate by half-Kings. Otherwise, all kinds of trouble would appear endlessly.","Through this incident, everyone understood that there was another King in the world, known as King Chu.","This victory had undoubtedly caused the entire Flying Celestials to celebrate. From today onwards, the Flying Celestials would no longer have to worry about being destroyed in this chaotic world.","As long as Chu Yunfan was still around, the Flying Celestials would be as stable as Mount Tai.","Moreover, unlike the other Kings, Chu Yunfan was young. With Chu Yunfan’s existence, he could at least ensure the prosperity of the Flying Celestials for the next thousand years, or even two thousand years.","For a time, the Flying Celestials held a feast and invited all of the factions in the Central Plains that were on good terms with the Flying Celestials.","Chu Yunfan didn’t stop them. He knew that this was part of their demonstration. Through this ceremony, they would announce his existence to the whole world so that no one would offend him.","The feast was held in a grand manner. Countless forces and individuals who were on good terms with the Flying Celestials came one after another. The Flying Celestials was in a jubilant mood, and everyone was immersed in this jubilant atmosphere.","Among the top ten forces, other than the Destiny Sect, the other forces all sent their powerful figures to visit Chu Yunfan.","Even the Divine Talisman Sect, the Holy Puppets, Medicinal Kings Valley, and a few other forces that had been eliminated from the top ten forces had sent people to participate.","This time, the matter of the Flying Celestials had given them a huge reminder. Without a King to hold down the fort, everything was just a flower in the mirror and a moon in the water.","If there was a King guarding them when they were driven away, then who would dare to drive them away?","For example, the Destiny Sect, Great Change Faith, the Virtuous Academy, and the other factions, there was no doubt that no ancient faction would dare to challenge them.","It was fine if they just casually sent people to go through the motions. Otherwise, the Destiny Sect, the Virtuous Academy, Great Change Faith, and other forces occupied places with far more resources than the Flying Celestials. However, more people chose to attack the Flying Celestials, the Holy Puppets, and the Divine Talisman Sect, and other forces.","It was because there was no powerful expert guarding it.","Even before Chu Yunfan, the Flying Celestials did not even have a half-King. It was not without reason that they fell at the bottom of the top ten forces.","But now, everything had been turned around. With Chu Yunfan in charge, unless he accidentally died, the Flying Celestials’ situation was as stable as Mount Tai.","This was something that the Holy Puppets, Divine Talisman Sect, Medicine Kings Valley, and other forces were envious of.","However, there was no way to be envious. After all, their sect did not have a monstrous existence like Chu Yunfan.","He could practically drive the rise of the entire sect with his own strength.","However, these few factions had not completely given up. In fact, the world still divided them into one of the ten great factions because these ten factions’ foundations were too deep.","After the sect’s base was seized, they suffered heavy injuries. However, they were only severely injured and not enough to take their lives.","There were also Supreme Youths in their sects. It was only a matter of time before they broke through to become Kings.","Even if they weren’t as strong as Chu Yunfan, it was still very easy to ensure that they would return to one of the top ten forces.","Although those ancient legacies were very strong, things like foundations were accumulated from generation to generation. They had already missed out on many generations. They would not be able to catch up in a short period of time.","At the Flying Celestials’ King-acknowledgment feast, those who were able to come and personally meet Chu Yunfan were undoubtedly the most reputable existences in the various sects.","After they met Chu Yunfan one by one, the feast officially began.","“Greetings, King Chu!”","Everyone stood up in unison and bowed. Even though many of them were far older than Chu Yunfan, the one who reached the top was the first.","Since Chu Yunfan was the first to break through to the King Stage, all the previous generations were meaningless.","“Everyone, please take a seat. Relax todayl. There’s no need to be restrained!” Chu Yunfan nodded.","Although he was impatient with these things, he would not flare up casually.","Everyone was toasting each other and eating delicacies. However, those who could attend the banquet were all used to delicacies. They looked at Chu Yunfan from time to time.","This made Chu Yunfan the only focus of attention.","“King Chu, please help me!”","At this time, a person stood out from the crowd and bowed to Chu Yunfan.","“That’s the sect leader of the Star Chater Sect, a subsidiary sect of our Flying Celestials!”","Situ Xuan’s voice immediately rang in Chu Yunfan’s mind.","Chu Yunfan hadn’t had much contact with practical matters, so he didn’t know much about many people. He needed Situ Xuan to guide him one by one.","“What do you want me to help you with?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“King Chu,” the sect leader of Star Charters said immediately. “Our sect is still besieged by the demon army. We have been fighting day and night and have suffered heavy casualties. King Chu, please help us resolve this crisis!”","The sect leader of Star Charters looked at Chu Yunfan with great anticipation. Even the higher-ups of the other affiliated sects of the Flying Celestials were also looking forward to it.","After all, there were not many demons that had been eliminated.","If it weren’t for Chu Yunfan, the Flying Celestials wouldn’t have been able to wipe out the demon army.","In addition, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had improved greatly and he had become a King. The demon army did not dare to come and die.","Even the demon army was intelligent. As long as they were intelligent, they would inevitably bully the weak and fear the strong.","Everyone knew that besieging a sect with a King was a dead end.","However, the other sects did not have such a good life. Under the harassment of the demons, they almost collapsed."]},{"number":2373,"title":"Chapter 2373: The Might of a King, Sweeping Away the Demon Army","paragraphs":["Chapter 2373: The Might of a King, Sweeping Away the Demon Army","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The demons’ harassment was all-rounded, even an entire world invading another world.","Especially after the demons slowed down their attacks on the other races, they mobilized most of their forces to attack the humans.","For the various sects, that was a nightmare.","Even though they had sealed the entire mountain gate with the help of the mountain gate array, they could only be on the defensive against the demons’ attack.","The cities that were under their control were taken down one by one. Not only did Grand Xia suffer heavy losses, but even they suffered heavy losses as well.","Although they were cultivators, they could not just eat and drink. They needed the support of countless resources, and the supply of these wealth and resources depended on these cities.","However, as these cities were broken through one by one, countless people died at the hands of the demon army, and their vitality was greatly damaged.","Although they could still persist for a period of time by relying on the accumulation of the sect over the years, their fall was only a matter of time.","Unless a King appeared in their sect, they would not be able to escape such a fate.","Fortunately, although no King had appeared in their sect, such a martial arts master had appeared in the Flying Celestials.","Therefore, the sect leader of Star Charters could not help but ask for help.","The rest of the people also looked at Chu Yunfan because they were also facing the same problem.","If Chu Yunfan was willing to help them, then they could be free.","“Lord Chu, these are all forces under the Flying Celestials. If possible, we should save them. Otherwise, the hearts of the Flying Celestials will be scattered!” At this moment, Situ Xuan’s telepathic message entered Chu Yunfan’s ears.","Many of these subsidiary forces of the Flying Celestials were actually sects founded by the disciples of the Flying Celestials after they left for various reasons and spread their branches in various places.","Basically, most of them belonged to the Flying Celestials. This was also the reason why they were so loyal. It was not just because of their interests, but also because their origins were more or less related to the Flying Celestials.","This was also a common method used by the various large sects when they dealt with too many disciples. They did not put all their eggs in the same basket, lest the Flying Celestials was destroyed, and the entire Flying Celestials’ orthodoxy was finished.","Now, with these subsidiary sects, even if the Flying Celestials was destroyed, there would still be sects that could carry the legacy of the Flying Celestials and survive. This way, the legacy would not be completely destroyed.","Therefore, the Flying Celestials had to help them, both in terms of benefits and morality. However, Situ Xuan didn’t have the ability to do so before. It was already very difficult for him to defend the Flying Celestials.","But now, there was no doubt that Chu Yunfan had such strength.","Chu Yunfan nodded. Of course, he understood the pros and cons. With his cultivation, he didn’t have to worry too much, but he was still willing to help.","“In that case, I’ll help you destroy the demon army besieging Star Charters!”","Chu Yunfan nodded.","“Thank you, King Chu!”","The sect leader of Star Charters was surprised and delighted.","Then, everyone saw Chu Yunfan open his eyes and a terrifying aura burst out from his body.","In the next moment, he stretched out his hands and grabbed at the void, tearing it into two halves.","Immediately after, everyone saw that on the other side of the void was the gates of Star Charters.","At this moment, the barrier of Star Charters was operating crazily. The demon army was clamoring and attacking the barrier of Star Charters.","It could be said that they did not care about the price!","Countless behemoths and Star Destroyers surrounded the entire gate of Star Charters.","Other than Star Charters, the cities near Star Charters had been breached one by one. Their city protection barrier had been breached, and all the humans in the city had been killed. No living beings survived.","Corpses were strewn everywhere, and blood was flowing.","There were also many monsters wreaking havoc in it, devouring the corpses of the dead humans.","In addition, there were also demon armies sweeping toward the cities further away.","This scene played out in many cities at the same time, and it wasn’t just Star Charters.","“The power of the King Stage. This is the power of the King Stage!” someone exclaimed.","Compared to Domainians, the biggest difference between Kings was that they had already reached the initial level of comprehension of space.","They could tear through the void at any time and place, and they could also teleport.","Their speed was much faster than before.","To cultivators below the King Stage, the spatial barrier of the Central Plains was extremely powerful, to the point that it was impossible to break through.","But to Kings, the spatial barrier of the Central Plains was no longer that strong.","This was also why the great war that happened in ancient times would take place in the depths of the universe, forming an ancient battlefield.","If the battlefield was not in the depths of the universe, the aftermath of the battle between those ancient experts would probably be enough to destroy the entire world.","Entering the world’s destruction ahead of time.","The sect leader of Star Charters was very excited. As expected, that was their base.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look and directly grabbed out with his big hand.","The hand grew with the wind, and it was unknown how many miles it had grown, like a cloud that hung down from the sky.","It was completely golden in color, as if it was cast from gold.","Boom!","With a loud boom, this huge hand fiercely slapped down. The camp of the demon army besieging Star Charters was instantly smashed into pieces. The demon experts hiding inside didn’t even have time to escape before they were smashed into powder.","The demon experts were finally alarmed as well. Terrifying auras rose from the demon army. There were at least 200 Domainians, and there were even a few peak Domainians among them.","Such a lineup was far from enough to take down the Flying Celestials.","However, it was more than enough to besiege a third-rate sect like the Star Charters.","However, even if these experts reacted, it was useless.","The huge golden hand slapped across the sky.","It seemed slow, but it was actually fast. In an instant, it swept across the sky. Those devil experts did not have time to escape before they were slapped one after another. Then, they turned into balls of blood mist and completely disappeared in the sky.","Then, Chu Yunfan slapped out again. After a few rounds of clearing, the demon army that had originally besieged Star Charters was cleared out."]},{"number":2374,"title":"Chapter 2374: The King Demon’s Will Arrives","paragraphs":["Chapter 2374: The King Demon’s Will Arrives","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was simply a sweep!","When a King attacked, they were invincible!","If the original Chu Yunfan had wanted to take action, he would have been able to wipe out the demon army.","However, it was definitely not as easy as it was now. He did not move from his spot and swept the other party away.","After breaking through to the King Stage, Chu Yunfan could tear open space at will. It was very useful whether it was for traveling or for fighting enemies.","He did not need to fumble for a long time like an ordinary King.","With the memories of the Alchemy Emperor and the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, he didn’t need to use too many of these techniques.","With a casual strike, he could sweep away the demon army that had not yet stepped into the King Stage.","The terrifying shockwaves even startled Star Charters, and they immediately began to celebrate.","During this period of time, the demon army was like a sword hanging above their heads. It could fall at any time and break through their mountain gate at any time.","Now, that threat had finally been eliminated.","“It’s a King!”","“No, it’s King Chu!”","Some people saw Chu Yunfan on the other side of the crack, and some people saw their sect leader on the other side of the crack. There was no one who did not understand.","It must have been their sect leader who begged King Chu to help during the King-acknowledgement feast.","And King Chu had agreed. He acted swiftly and decisively. He did not wait for the feast to end before he attacked and killed all the demons outside their sect.","“Greetings, King Chu!”","At this moment, many disciples of Star Charters began to bow to Chu Yunfan.","It was Chu Yunfan who had given them a new life, and it was also Chu Yunfan who had allowed them to survive.","“Thank you, King Chu!” The sect leader of Star Charters was overjoyed.","These demons were truly too terrifying. With the Star Charters’ foundation, it was simply impossible to defeat them.","After all, he was only an ordinary Domainian. How could he fight against those powerful demons?","“It alright. You’re all subordinate sects of the Flying Celestials. Many years ago, your founder was also a disciple of the Flying Celestials. We’re of the same bloodline and come from the same sect. Naturally, there’s no reason for us to see the demons wreaking havoc near your sect!” Chu Yunfan waved his hand and said indifferently.","To him, there was nothing to be proud of. In any case, these were just some ordinary demons.","All of Star Charters was filled with jubilation. Their sense of belonging to the Flying Celestials had undoubtedly increased by a lot.","Although they were originally from the Flying Celestials, after so many generations, they no longer had a sense of belonging to the Flying Celestials.","But now, those who didn’t have a sense of belonging to the Flying Celestials had a greater sense of belonging.","“I won’t help you clean up the remaining demons. You’ll have to rely on yourself!” Chu Yunfan said. “This is also to train you. The future Great Era will definitely be a chaotic world. You have to train yourselves and increase your strength. Only then will it be convenient for you to be my vanguard in the future!”","Chu Yunfan said this without hesitation. There was only one reason for him to help these subsidiary forces, and that was to use them as his vanguard in the future.","“We’re willing to work for you, King Chu!” Everyone in Star Charters cheered.","The sect leader of Star Charters also understood Chu Yunfan’s meaning. Of course, he didn’t feel that there was anything wrong.","“King Chu, please help!”","With Star Charters’ leader as a living example, how could everyone hold back? They hurriedly spoke.","For a time, the entire King-acknowledgement feast was extremely noisy.","Everyone hoped that Chu Yunfan could help them deal with the demon army near their sect.","Chu Yunfan did not reject any of them. He tore open the space one by one and helped them deal with the demon army.","After all, these demon armies were wreaking havoc. In essence, they were also damaging the foundation of the Flying Celestials.","These sects relied on the supply of these cities to develop, and the Flying Celestials was also constantly absorbing the nutrients of those sects to continue to grow.","Many disciples of the Flying Celestials actually came from these sects. After they were nurtured to a certain extent, they were sent to the Flying Celestials for further study.","At this moment, he naturally couldn’t disappoint these people.","He dealt with the sects one by one. Chu Yunfan’s dignity quickly convinced the experts, let alone the affiliated sects of the Flying Celestials.","Even the sects that weren’t under the Flying Celestials were envious.","One had to know that they were also facing the invasion of the demons, but they did not have such an expert to help them resolve it.","Comparing people was infuriating.","Especially Medicine Kings Valley, the Holy Puppets, the Divine Talisman Sect, and other sects did not have any Kings guarding them at all. They were still facing the invasion of the demons.","Just like the Flying Celestials from before.","Especially now that their sect had been seized by the ancient inheritances, they were in a precarious situation. Their casualties were much, much greater than the Flying Celestials.","They were even tempted to ask Chu Yunfan to help them solve this problem.","Suddenly, just as Chu Yunfan was about to tear open another space and clear out the demons, a terrifying pressure swept down.","It was the terrifying pressure of the demons that directly crushed the Flying Celestials.","The Flying Celestials’ protective barrier instantly activated crazily to resist this terrifying pressure.","Then, a huge eye slowly appeared in the void.","It was the eye of a demon, which was filled with anger and desire to kill. It was extremely chaotic.","“King Human, are you trying to break the tacit understanding between the Kings and start a war with us demons?”","A dignified voice came from that eye.","This voice was filled with anger and fury.","Chu Yunfan attacked repeatedly and killed a large number of demon troops. Finally, he alarmed the King of the demons.","There were also Kings among the demons. Although they didn’t descend directly, they also descended with their consciousness to warn Chu Yunfan.","While the King Human was being held back by them, they were also being held back by the King Human and the other Kings.","The Kings of the various races restrained each other and did not attack directly.","This was also the reason why the entire battlefield was filled with half-Kings wreaking havoc.","However, Chu Yunfan, who had suddenly become a King, had broken this balance. No one could restrain him. Instead, he had become the biggest destroyer of the balance on the battlefield.","No matter how much damage a half-King could do, it was limited. However, Kings were different. In just a short period of time, Chu Yunfan had already swept through the millions of demon army.","Who knew how many experts had been killed or injured!","All of this finally alarmed the King Demon."]},{"number":2375,"title":"Chapter 2375: Killing All Enemies","paragraphs":["Chapter 2375: Killing All Enemies","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At this moment, the will of the King Demon descended, turning into a huge eye in the sky.","His eyes were filled with anger as he glared at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan looked at the eye coldly and said, “If you have the ability, then come down. Let me see what you are capable of!”","Chu Yunfan shouted and punched out. In an instant, the sky was torn apart and he punched the eye.","Boom!","A huge explosion occurred in the eye, and it was torn apart by a terrifying force in the air, completely turning into nothingness.","The entire Flying Celestials cheered. The humans were not afraid of the King Demon, and there was no need for the Flying Celestials to be angry anymore.","It was a battle between Kings!","Situ Xuan, who was beside him, was very worried because he knew that there were strong and weak Kings. Chu Yunfan had just broken through to the King Stage, so he naturally had the upper hand against new Kings like the King beast.","However, that was only for new Kings. They might not be able to gain the upper hand against the best of the Kings.","Chu Yunfan’s actions had undoubtedly broken the tacit understanding between the Kings.","It might even bring disaster to the Flying Celestials and become the first to stand out.","Chu Yunfan only smiled faintly and sent a telepathic message. “Sir, don’t worry. This is the territory of the Flying Celestials. There was once a backup plan left behind by the founder. If they come, I’m not afraid that they can fight them!”","If the founder had left a backup plan in the Flying Celestials’ territory, it wouldn’t be as simple as fighting against a King. If the Flying Celestials didn’t have a King, it would be able to fight against a King.","Once a King was present, the power within could even heavily injure a powerful King.","This was Chu Yunfan’s greatest confidence.","This was also what he felt after he advanced to the King Stage.","Those who had not reached the King Stage would not be able to sense the existence of this backup plan.","Therefore, there was nothing to be afraid of.","This place was enough to fight against those people.","All of a sudden, in the sky far away, a large number of devils gathered. They were like clouds that covered the sky as they flew toward the Flying Celestials.","“The demons ‘counterattack is here!” someone exclaimed.","Not long after Chu Yunfan made his move, the demons’ counterattack had already arrived. It could be said to be swift and decisive.","In other words, Chu Yunfan had already become a thorn in the side of the demons, so they had to kill him. Otherwise, it would be a serious blow to the dignity of the demons.","Boom!","A humanoid figure sat cross-legged on a small carriage in the middle of the demon army. Just by sitting down, he had a world-shaking might.","“Chu Yunfan broke the agreement between the Kings. Today, I’m here to take his head!” the humanoid figure shouted.","“Take Chu Yunfan’s head!”","“Take Chu Yunfan’s head!”","“Take Chu Yunfan’s head!”","Countless demons were roaring furiously. The mighty power caused the barrier of the Flying Celestials to be activated at once and operate crazily.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan made his move. He waved his hand, and a terrifying sword light that was more than a million feet long appeared out of thin air and slashed down.","Boom!","A single sword strike caused the heavens and earth to collapse. Countless demon armies were blasted into nothingness by this terrifying sword energy before they could get close. Even if they were not directly hit, they were only affected by the chaotic battle and were heavily injured.","“This is the might of a king!”","Many people sighed.","No wonder the gap between half-step Kings and Kings was so huge. The strength of Kings had reached a level that could shake the heavens and earth.","“You dare!”","Just as this sword swept through everything and headed straight for the demon on the small carriage, an even larger demonic claw appeared out of thin air and grabbed this sword light and crushed it inch by inch.","“Ignorant human, do you think you can defeat me with such tricks?” The humanoid creature in the carriage snorted coldly. He did not put Chu Yunfan in his eyes at all. “You’re not bad among the new Kings, but you’re still far from me. Today, I’ll use your blood to wash away your sins!”","A large number of demons flew over. They were all under the command of this King Demon, and there were even many half-Kings. It could be said that this time, the demons had come out in full force to completely pacify the Flying Celestials.","After all, it had been several years since the war began. The demon army seemed to have committed all kinds of crimes, but in reality, they had made no real progress. They had only destroyed a few small sects and had not truly taken down a behemoth like the Flying Celestials.","And all of this began today. From today onwards, the humans would be destroyed here!","The humanoid creature looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. At this moment, he looked pitch-black, like black jade. His entire body was transparent. He was an extremely terrifying King, a King born in the Demon Realm.","Among those of the same level, he was invincible. He did not belong to the ordinary demons. He did not have a large race, but his clansmen were all invincible, and he was the King among them.","The Flying Celestials, as well as the representatives who had come to pay their respects to Chu Yunfan, all tensed up. They were even prepared for battle.","At this moment, an earth-shattering battle was bound to happen.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan finally moved. He stood up from his throne and walked into the void step by step.","His gaze swept out, and the demons who had already flown to the outer area of the Flying Celestials screamed as they were swept into pieces by his gaze. The terrifying pressure made him look like a demon god in the human world.","Everyone was dumbfounded. They had never thought that Chu Yunfan could have such terrifying power. Even those crazy demons were frightened.","Chu Yunfan’s current state was too strong, like a god.","Even in ancient times, Kings were overlords!","In fact, under normal circumstances, a King would be the strongest person in an era.","As for Emperors, there might not even be one in an era. It was even normal for not one to appear in several eras.","The reason why there were Emperors in ancient times was that they all had a long period of slumber. During this period, they could reduce the consumption of their lifespan to the minimum.","This was the only way to show the ancient wonder of the Emperors standing side by side."]},{"number":2376,"title":"Chapter 2376: The Flying Celestials’ Dragon Vein","paragraphs":["Chapter 2376: The Flying Celestials’ Dragon Vein","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In other words, in a normal era, Kings were revered. Emperors did not appear in every era. Otherwise, no matter how long one’s lifespan was, they would not be able to withstand such consumption.","Most of the time, they were in a deep sleep!","A powerful King was enough to sweep through everything and suppress a domain!","And now, Chu Yunfan had finally revealed the most terrifying side of these Kings!","Normally, it was rare for people to see a King attack, let alone a full power attack. Only now did they realize how big the difference was.","For example, Chu Hongcai, Huangfu Longhao, and the others were almost all at the half-King Stage. They were even the best among them. However, when they faced Chu Yunfan, who had already stepped into the King Stage, they still did not have the slightest bit of resistance. They could sense that the distance between them was as vast as the galaxy.","That step, if they took it, it meant that they had taken it. If they hadn’t taken it, they hadn’t taken it.","Everything was too obvious.","Many people with weaker cultivation had even knelt down one after another as if they were worshipping a living god.","There was an indescribable and terrifying aura.","“Noisy!”","Chu Yunfan looked at the demons in front of him and immediately waved his hand. In an instant, the sky was filled with sword energy. The sword energy swept out like a storm. The mighty demon army suffered heavy losses in an instant, especially those demon experts who were blocking at the front. They were pierced through one after another.","Whether it was an Arcane, a Domainian, or even a half-King, there was no difference in the storm of sword light. They were all killed in one strike.","The number of people was meaningless to Chu Yunfan. As long as he wanted to, he could kill millions of soldiers at will.","“Roar!”","The King Demon in the carriage finally couldn’t hold it in any longer. After a loud roar, a black jade energy barrier appeared in front of the remaining demon army, blocking this terrifying attack for them.","“How dare you kill so many of my warriors! I’m going to exterminate your Flying Celestials!”","The King Demon’s dark jade-like eyes flashed with terrifying killing intent as he stared at Chu Yunfan.","“You? You can’t do it!”","Chu Yunfan looked at the King Demon calmly.","The King Demon stared at Chu Yunfan and laughed. “You really don’t know the immensity of heaven and earth. A newcomer like you dares to challenge me. I’ll let you know how big the gap between us is!”","Boom!","The King Demon took a step forward, causing the heavens and earth to shake. Everyone in the Flying Celestials could feel the great barrier trembling violently. Even they could feel the terrifying power from the bottom of their hearts.","At this moment, they truly felt what the demon army had felt just now. How terrifying was it to face a King? It was simply despairing.","At least they still had the protection of the Flying Celestials’ protective barrier. Just now, the demon army had faced Chu Yunfan’s might directly, and that feeling was simply terrifying.","The entire barrier was shaking, especially with every step the King Demon took. Everyone had no doubt that once the King Demon reached the Flying Celestials, the barrier would collapse on the spot.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan made his move. He took a step forward and stood in front of the King Demon. The terrifying power that was enough to shake the entire Flying Celestials’ protective array was dissolved by him.","“Today, I will slay the King Demon!”","Chu Yunfan shouted with a cold expression. Then, he grabbed at the air.","Rumble!","In an instant, the entire world trembled, and even the earth trembled and the mountains shook. It was as if something was about to drill out of the ground.","Countless spirit energy was approaching Chu Yunfan’s hand.","A terrifying scene happened. Under everyone’s gaze, an incomparably loud dragon’s roar sounded. Immediately after, everyone saw a huge divine dragon fly out from the ground.","The giant dragon roared in the sky and paced back and forth.","All the demons were sent flying by this huge dragon as if they were rejected by heaven and earth.","“That’s...The Dragon Vein of the Flying Celestials Prefecture!”","Someone recognized it. It was the Dragon Vein of the Flying Celestials Prefecture, where the Flying Celestial Sect was located.","The Dragon Vein was the manifestation of the power of the earth that suppressed all evil.","It could even be said that the Dragon Vein was very, very important to a place.","With the Dragon Vein, the weather in this place would be smooth and there would be no disasters. However, places without Dragon Veins would soon become barren mountains and rivers. The environment would be extremely harsh, and people born in such an environment would also be contaminated with hostility.","As the saying goes, poor mountains and bad waters produce unruly people. This was what it meant.","In places with powerful Dragon Veins, the creatures born were often intelligent and talented.","The reason why the Flying Celestials chose to settle down in the Flying Celestials Prefecture was naturally related to the powerful Dragon Vein here.","As expected, ever since the Flying Celestials settled down in the Flying Celestials Prefecture, all kinds of powerful disciples emerged one after another. Very soon, they stood out from the other forces and became one of the top ten sects in the world.","But now, Chu Yunfan had summoned the Dragon Vein.","The Dragon Vein hated evil things the most, especially foreign creatures.","Now that these demons represented both, they were naturally greatly rejected by the Dragon Vein.","The terrifying power contained in the Dragon Vein made even the King Demon feel immense pressure.","“How lucky I am. I couldn’t find the Flying Celestials’ Dragon Vein. Now that you’ve used it obediently, I’ll slaughter this Dragon Vein today and make your Flying Celestials fall completely!”","King Demon wasn’t afraid at all. On the contrary, his face revealed a rare expression of excitement.","Originally, the Dragon Vein was hidden under the ground and had become one with the entire earth. Unless the entire earth collapsed, the Dragon Vein could not be damaged at all.","The Dragon Vein was the key to locking the fate of the Flying Celestials.","However, it was different now. The Dragon Vein had appeared. To him, this was of course very dangerous, but at the same time, it was also a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.","As long as the Dragon Vein was destroyed, the Flying Celestials would never be able to turn the tables.","“You want to slay a dragon? It depends on whether you have the ability or not. Today, I’m going to slaughter demons!” Chu Yunfan was high and mighty, like a god. He grabbed with his big hand, and the Dragon Vein roared and turned into a long sword in his hand.","He would turn the entire Dragon Vein into his own.","Immediately after, Chu Yunfan slashed out with his sword. Instantly, the sky collapsed and the earth cracked!"]},{"number":2377,"title":"Chapter 2377: A Single Sword, All Vaporized","paragraphs":["Chapter 2377: A Single Sword, All Vaporized","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The moment the sword was unleashed, the heavens and earth shattered!","This sword pierced through the heavens and earth, sweeping in all directions. Even the defensive barrier that the King Demon had set up was broken by this sword.","Rumble!","Explosions were everywhere. In an instant, this sword shattered everything. Everyone’s eyes were enveloped by this sword. No matter what level of demons they were, they were all killed by this sword.","To be more precise, it was directly turned into nothingness under this sword!","With a swing of his sword, the million-strong demon army was reduced to nothingness. There were countless Domainian and even half-King demons among them.","Now, they had all turned into nothingness!","“What a terrifying sword. Is this the backup plan left behind by the founder?” At this moment, Situ Xuan remembered what Chu Yunfan had said just now, that the founder had left behind a backup.","He had been wondering what Chu Yunfan’s backup plan was, but he didn’t expect it to be such a terrifying move.","The demon army this time was at least a hundred times stronger than the army that had besieged the Flying Celestials. Just that King Demon alone was enough to increase the threat by a hundred times.","Now, he had been killed with a single strike!","With this sword, the Flying Celestials would be safe!","“The Flying Celestials actually has such a trump card!”","The participants were basically the best of the best among the various forces. Of course, they could see that this attack was definitely not launched by Chu Yunfan with his own strength, but by other means.","Chu Yunfan had just become a King, so it was impossible for him to have set this up in advance. Besides Chu Yunfan, there was only one other King in the Flying Celestials. There was no doubt who had set this up in advance.","The founder of the Flying Celestials!","Seeing this scene, many people were stunned. They stared at the shocking power with their mouths agape. Only now did they truly understand what a high-end player was.","Why could only Kings use the world as a chessboard? Those who were not in the King Stage did not even have the right to jump around.","Those half-Kings might look like they were dancing more and more happily now.","However, in reality, when facing a King, they were simply unable to withstand a single blow.","If not for the invasion of the demons, they would probably have to live in seclusion and do their best to advance to the King Stage. Otherwise, they would not dare to jump around casually.","After all, they had painstakingly cultivated to the half-King Stage. If thery were accidentally slapped to death, that would be too much of a loss.","The higher-ups of the Divine Talisman Sect and the other sects, which were ranked among the top ten powers like the Flying Celestials, were wondering if their sects had the same methods.","But now that even their base had been seized, what could they do?","‘We must take back the base!’ one of them clenched his fists and swore in his heart.","The entire Flying Celestials was silent. Even the disciples of the Flying Celestials were frightened by this scene.","Those demons were not even killed, but directly evaporated between heaven and earth.","After the aftershock dissipated, everyone saw a huge crack in the sky. It was the shocking result of this sword slash.","The laws of heaven and earth could not repair the damage caused by this sword for a while.","In the sky, Chu Yunfan’s face was also pale, which was rare. This attack had used up all his divine power and even burned more than half of his blood and energy to finally withstand the consumption of this attack.","To be precise, most of this attack was actually maintained by the earth energy of the Dragon Vein itself. He had only provided a small portion, but he was almost drained dry.","He was expressionless as he quickly recovered from his exhaustion. At this moment, he finally understood why the founder of the Flying Celestials had never mentioned such a backup plan.","This was because if there was no King among the younger generation, they would not be able to use the Dragon Vein Sword at all. It would be useless even if the founder had mentioned it.","If a King appeared, they would naturally be able to see the technique they had left behind. There was no need to doubt the difference between a King and a non-King.","Most importantly, Chu Yunfan could sense that after this sword was slashed out, the light of the Dragon Vein also weakened a little. This attack consumed a lot of the Dragon Vein.","The Dragon Vein suppressed the fate of the Flying Celestials. If he kept using it, it would probably affect the fate of the entire Flying Celestials.","This attack had already consumed the energy accumulated by the Dragon Vein for many years.","Chu Yunfan could feel the energy in the Dragon Vein dissipating. It turned into a divine dragon and disappeared from his hand.","“Ahhhhh, you actually dared to hurt me!”","A furious roar came from afar.","Everyone was shocked and immediately looked over. In the distance, the King Demon appeared in front of everyone in a sorry state.","The carriage he was riding in was split in half. Even half of his body was sent flying. One arm and half of his body were sent flying. Blood flowed everywhere. However, his blood was not an ordinary color. It was a dark jade color, just like his appearance.","If it was an ordinary being, they would have died long ago. However, he still survived.","The terrifying aura on his body was constantly exploding!","Ever since he had become a King, he had never been in such a sorry state. He had almost been killed by a single strike. If he hadn’t used all of his defensive magic artifacts at the critical moment to block to buy that instant of time and avoid the fatal blow. he would probably have died under that attack by now.","Ever since he became a King, this was the first time he was so close to death.","Thinking of this, he could no longer contain his anger.","“You’re actually still alive!”","Chu Yunfan looked at the King Demon coldly, but he didn’t take him to heart.","If the original King Demon’s strength was above Chu Yunfan’s, even if he had the geographical advantage, Chu Yunfan could at most guarantee that he could protect himself and not lose.","However, things were different now.","The other party had already been severely injured and his strength had been greatly reduced. He could completely underhanded!","“I’m going to kill you!”","The King Demon was burning with anger and had already lost his mind.","Behind him, countless streams of demonic energy soared into the sky like huge pillars of light. Each stream of demonic energy was like a divine mountain that soared into the sky.","Boom!","The battle was about to start. The demonic energy that erupted from this King Demon swept toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at him. He clenched his fist and threw a punch.","Boom!","This punch turned into eight gods and shielded Chu Yunfan. Those attacks were all turned into nothingness and destroyed by the eight gods.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan also moved!","In the next moment, he appeared before the King Demon. This was not because he was fast, but because he was teleporting."]},{"number":2378,"title":"Chapter 2378: Killing the King Demon","paragraphs":["Chapter 2378: Killing the King Demon","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan teleported in front of his opponent and punched out!","The fist force pierced through the sky, and the thick fist force tore a huge crack in the sky. Then, the fist landed in front of the King Demon.","The King Demon was even more furious. He waved his remaining arm and punched out as well.","Boom!","The collision between the two sides was like a nuclear explosion. A huge mushroom cloud slowly rose, but before the mushroom cloud could completely rise, it dissipated.","Because the two people in the mushroom cloud attacked at the same time. The previous attack was a draw.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Terrifying collisions occurred again and again, causing the earth to tremble and the mountains to shake.","“Now I finally understand why an era could be destroyed at the end of the Antiquity Era, when all the Emperors stood side by side. Just the battle between the Kings alone is already earth-shattering. How terrifying would the battle between the Emperors be?”","“When Emperors meet, the heavens will fall and the earth will shatter!”","Everyone discussed animatedly, sighing at Chu Yunfan’s strength.","However, at this moment, everyone discovered that many eyes had appeared in the sky.","It was just like the eye that had appeared above the Flying Celestials, except that they did not reveal such a great pressure.","“It’s the other Kings. They’re watching the battle as well!”","Some people immediately understood that the owners of those eyes were the other Kings in the battle for supremacy.","This battle was of great importance.","This was related to Chu Yunfan, the new King, being able to stand firm. After all, Chu Yunfan was the first among the younger generation to advance to the King Stage, so he would naturally be the center of attention.","If he was killed, it would be enough to suppress the auras of those prodigies and Supreme Youths. The current world was not the time for them to dominate.","However, if Chu Yunfan won, it would undoubtedly stimulate those ancient geniuses and Supreme Youths to cultivate crazily and advance to the King Stage.","It could be said that pulling one hair would affect the whole body.","Of course, Chu Yunfan also noticed the arrival of some Kings wills, but he did not care. He just wanted to establish his dignity in front of everyone.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Crazy battles were erupting one after another. As Kings, they had already abandoned all other fancy methods. They only used the most primitive and fundamental methods to defeat ten with their strength.","He would use his original strength to kill his opponent.","“Die!” Suddenly, the King Demon roared and a long spear appeared in his hand. The spear emitted waves of shocking demonic energy and turned into a shocking demonic dragon that rushed toward Chu Yunfan’s face.","He had been waiting for this moment. When Chu Yunfan thought that he had no other tricks up his sleeve, he suddenly used them to achieve such a shocking effect.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t look like that. He stretched out two fingers and caught the fatal blow.","When everyone saw this scene, their hair stood on end. In their opinion, an unimaginably powerful attack was actually so easily caught.","“How did you...” The King Demon was stunned and looked at Chu Yunfan.","“Haven’t you noticed? Your injuries are constantly worsening, and your strength is constantly weakening. As for me, I’m constantly recovering!” Chu Yunfan grinned. In an instant, a huge domain appeared around him and trapped the King Demon in it.","The King Demon suddenly realized that he had been controlled by the killing intent. He had a chance to leave, but he wanted to kill Chu Yunfan so badly that he lost his last chance.","No, to be precise, he was deceived by Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan made him think that he could kill Chu Yunfan.","However, this was all an illusion.","Chu Yunfan had never thought of letting him go.","Stop him and call it a draw?","That wasn’t Chu Yunfan!","If he wanted to kill, he would kill to his heart’s content. If he wanted to kill, he would kill them all!","“Do you still have one-tenth of your original strength?” Chu Yunfan sneered and grabbed the spear. The King Demon couldn’t hold it and fell to Chu Yunfan in terms of pure strength.","With the spear in hand, Chu Yunfan immediately transformed into a supreme general. In the next moment, he had already pierced through the King Demon.","The King Demon was affected by Chu Yunfan’s domain, so its speed was not as fast as before. It was also impossible for it to tear open space and escape from Chu Yunfan’s domain.","In Chu Yunfan’s domain, he was the king.","The spear pierced through the King Demon and nailed him to the ground.","The ground shook violently, and a terrifying pit hundreds of miles wide appeared.","The King Demon kept struggling in the pit, roaring and trying to get up.","He finally felt fear. The life force in his body was draining away at an alarming rate. If he couldn’t break free from the magic spear, he would be dead for sure.","This was the demonic spear that he had refined, and it could absorb the life force of those who were stabbed. He didn’t expect that the one who was hit was himself.","“I’ll send you on your way!” Chu Yunfan looked at the King Demon coldly. All the previous battles were just illusions. They were all set up. In fact, the real battle ended in one move.","Chu Yunfan was about to reach out his hand when a long sword formed by the power of lightning appeared in his hand. It spun and was about to slash down.","Suddenly, a terrifying pressure, several times more terrifying than this King Demon’s pressure, descended.","“Stop!”","This pressure was almost tangible, blocking Chu Yunfan’s path.","“Another King Demon?”","Chu Yunfan sensed that some big shot from the demons was about to descend.","The demons could contend against the entire Central Plains, so they naturally could not have just one King. Seeing a King die tragically, they could no longer sit still.","However, at the same time, a cold snort came from the void.","Following that, a golden dragon appeared in the sky. It was a golden dragon of fate. Wherever the golden dragon passed by, the demonic energy in the world would be scattered. The King Demon who was about to descend was stopped. Space was strengthened and he could not tear open space to come.","“The human king has made his move!”","Chu Yunfan immediately determined that the only person in the Grand Xia Dynasty who could mobilize the Luck Dragon was the human king.","Those demons had backup, and he was not fighting alone.","“Kill this b*stard, don’t worry!”","Chu Yunfan heard the human king’s voice.","He immediately nodded and slashed down with his sword.","Slice!","The King Demon’s head was sent flying. His eyes were wide open, he didn’t dare to believe that he would die here today in such a manner."]},{"number":2379,"title":"Chapter 2379: The World Was Shocked","paragraphs":["Chapter 2379: The World Was Shocked","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A powerful King Demon had fallen!","The news spread throughout the world overnight, and the world was shaken.","Unlike the King beast that Chu Yunfan had killed before, this King was a veteran King. In terms of strength, it might be several times stronger than the King beast.","He was the best among the Kings!","He had thought that he could easily defeat Chu Yunfan, the new King, with lightning speed.","Who would have thought that even such a veteran King Demon would suffer a great loss at Lu Xuan’s hands and even be killed?","“He has just become a King and he has already killed two veteran Kings. He is simply lawless!”","“I feel like I can already see the scene of those ancient prodigies and the Supreme Youngs stepping into the King Stage one after another!”","“What do you mean by domineering? This is domineering. Even though he knew that the King Demon was backed by the entire demons, he still killed him just like that!”","For a moment, the world seemed to have exploded, and everyone was boiling.","However, as time passed, more and more people learned about the details. They were even more shocked that the Flying Celestials actually had such a foundation.","“The top ten forces are still the top ten forces after all. They actually still have such a trump card. If King Chu hadn’t killed the King Demon with one sword strike today, I’m afraid none of us would have known!”","“Who dares to underestimate King Chu now? As long as he’s still in the Flying Celestials, I’m afraid that even a Supreme King wouldn’t dare to provoke him!”","This battle had established Chu Yunfan’s prestige, and at the same time, it had also established the Flying Celestials’ status.","It was enough to be compared to giants like the Destiny Sect.","In many people’s eyes, Chu Yunfan’s powerful title of King was also a sign that the next era of true kings was about to arrive.","At the current stage, there were still a few Kings who ruled the world. However, once those ancient prodigies and Supreme Youths who were still low-key stepped into the King Stage in the future, the entire world would be turned upside down.","After all, many of these people had already stepped into the half-King Stage. The weakest among them was at the peak of the Domain Stage. It was only a matter of time before they reached the King Stage.","These were like true dragons that were hibernating. Before they advanced to the King Stage, they were all hibernating.","Unlike other forces, in the past, even if these ancient prodigies and Supreme Youths were more high-profile, they would not be targeted on a large scale.","These Supreme Youths and the ancient geniuses belonged to different forces and races. It was impossible to target them all. Otherwise, they would be opposed by all forces.","However, these demons were different. They wanted to destroy the order of the entire world. Those hidden dragons that were about to mature were their hunting targets.","In the battle of the ancient battlefield, the Central Plains had already lost more than half of its accumulated essence. After years of constant besiegement, the total number was now only one-third of what it had been when they had first appeared.","Such a huge loss caused the entire world to look askance.","In the past, once such people appeared, they would be the treasures of various sects. They would do their best to nurture and protect them. However, ever since the prodigies came into being collectively, these people were akin to grass.","From time to time, a large number of them would die!","In the past, the number of casualties was enough to wipe out the geniuses of an era.","Countless people lamented the tragic deaths of these geniuses who were usually extremely dazzling. Even the number of Supreme Youths who had fallen was not in the minority.","Those were seeds with the potential to become Emperors!","However, more people quietly realized that after a large number of ancient prodigies and Supreme Youths died, the remaining ancient prodigies and Supreme Youths were growing at an astonishing speed.","It even far exceeded the growth speed of those ancient prodigies and Supreme Youths recorded in history.","They had only been born for a few years and were already close to the King Stage.","Before they were born, which of the current Kings was not a top prodigy? There were even Supreme Youths, but none of them could grow at such a shocking speed.","Many people thought of this. This was like raising a venomous insect. Although it was cruel, what was left in the end was undoubtedly the strongest and most powerful.","The resources that were originally shared by three people were now occupied by one person alone. How could their growth speed not be shocking? Coupled with their amazing talent, this was the key to these hibernating dragons about to soar.","Right now, the Central Plains was still unable to resist the invasion of the Demon Realm, and could only remain in a stalemate. The various races had even decided to let the humans wear down the strength of the Demon Realm. It would be best if both sides suffered heavy losses. At that time, not only would the Demon Realm be driven away, but the humans would also be exterminated.","However, once these prodigies matured, it was time for them to truly counterattack!","The battle between Chu Yunfan and the King Demon also made many people understand that before a King, those below the King Stage were all ants. Whether they existed or not, it was meaningless.","But now, Chu Yunfan’s powerful rise had attracted everyone’s attention, and he had become a thorn in the side of the demons.","“Just in time. We’ll let Chu Yunfan attract the attention of the demons and buy us some time!” a Supreme Youth muttered in a low voice in the place where he was in seclusion.","“When I become a King, the world will submit to me!”","“I will become a King, and the rest will die!”","Under normal circumstances, Chu Yunfan, who had become a King first, should have become a thorn in everyone’s eyes and become someone they wanted to get rid of.","However, under the strong pressure of the demons, everyone hoped that Chu Yunfan would attract the attention of the demons.","In a short period of time, this battle had become famous all over the world. Everyone knew about it.","“These people have a good idea. They want me to help them shelter from the wind and rain!” In the Flying Celestials, Chu Yunfan grinned.","Although these people were quite secretive, there were too many of them. In the end, they could not hide it from others.","“These people are too cunning!” Chu Hongcai clenched his fists and said.","This time, after Chu Yunfan was conferred the title of King, he called a group of his trusted friends, including Tang Siyu.","“This is nothing. The wind will destroy the tree that stands out in the forest. This saying is true, but it also depends on whether the demons has the ability to do so!” Chu Yunfan said lightly. He knew that he would definitely become a thorn in the side of the demons.","However, he was not afraid. He had already become a King. It would be a real joke if he still had to worry about such frivolous things.","“They want me to help them buy time. The following period will definitely not be peaceful. I hope that you guys can speed up and become Kings as soon as possible!” Chu Yunfan looked at Chu Hongcai and the others."]},{"number":2380,"title":"Chapter 2380: Three Years of Dao Lectures, Ten Years of Meditation","paragraphs":["Chapter 2380: Three Years of Dao Lectures, Ten Years of Meditation","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","These were Chu Yunfan’s most fundamental forces in the Central Plains, a group of people with him as the absolute core.","Even those from the Flying Celestials were separated by a layer.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t the sect leader of the Flying Celestials.","However, what was not his was not his, and he had no intention of becoming the sect leader of the Flying Celestials in the future.","He had a big heart, and the Flying Celestials couldn’t hold him back!","Including Chu Hongcai, there were also the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, the Golden Roc, the Sea Dragon, the Dragon-Headed Crocodile, and Tang Siyu.","If all of them were to become Kings, it would be a terrifying force.","After all, a dozen Kings could mature and become a dozen Emperors. Even if there were only half of them, it was still an extremely shocking power.","Even in the era of Emperors, this was still a very shocking power, not to mention now!","When everyone heard Chu Yunfan’s words, they immediately understood what he meant. Their expressions were also a little excited. No one didn’t want to be a King.","After all, Kings and non-Kings were two completely different things.","Without the title of King, they wouldn’t be able to interfere in such a battle. This was an era where Kings fought for supremacy. If one wasn’t a King, they wouldn’t even have the right to show themselves.","“I’ll tell you some tips and things to take note of. It should be able to help you advance to the King Stage in the shortest time possible!” Chu Yunfan said, “I’ll be in seclusion for the next ten years. For the first three years, I will be giving lectures on the King Stage. I hope that by the time I come out of seclusion, all of you will already be Kings!”","He knew that in the coming period of time, it would be an eventful period. The strength of the humans was continuing to weaken. There were battles everywhere at every moment. However, before these ancient prodigies and Supreme Youths could all advance to the King Stage, the humans’ counterattack would not come.","This was a confrontation with a world!","This time, even the human king was mobilized. What was the reason? He wanted to buy them enough time.","Chu Yunfan was the same. Since he was already a King, he should be at the front line. Sometimes, this was a responsibility he should bear.","Just like how the human king and the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia had helped him to resist the pressure.","“But my master wants me to return to Serene Immortal Mountain!” Tang Siyu said after a pause.","“Don’t worry. You can return to Serene Immortal Mountain three years from now. It shouldn’t be too late!” Chu Yunfan said directly.","“Mm, alright!” Tang Siyu nodded. She trusted Chu Yunfan’s judgment.","Ever since Chu Yunfan became a King, Tang Siyu’s master’s attitude had changed. It was completely different from before.","Previously, the Elder Princess did not care about Chu Yunfan at all.","Without reaching the King Stage, they did not even have the qualifications to be cared about.","Those were all fights between the younger generation. Even if Chu Yunfan had the potential to become a King, his potential was just potential. If he didn’t become a King, all his potential would be useless.","Now, after becoming a King, he had the right to talk to the Elder Princess, or even sit on equal footing.","After Chu Yunfan’s killing of the King Demon caused a huge uproar, everyone was looking forward to Chu Yunfan continuing to kill a few more King Demons.","Chu Yunfan stopped what he was doing and announced that he was going to give a lecture at the Flying Celestials.","For a lecture on the Dao of King Stage, Domainians who were related to the Flying Celestials and the Flying Celestials could come and listen.","As for those below the Domain Stage, they wouldn’t even be able to understand what he was saying. It would be a waste of time if they came.","However, even though it was only the benefits of the Flying Celestials and its affiliated sects, it was enough to make many people envious.","In particular, many people wanted Chu Yunfan to guide them. Of course, Chu Yunfan refused all of them, but they did not dare to find trouble with Chu Yunfan.","After all, the fact that Chu Yunfan had easily dealt with those half-Kings was still fresh in their minds. How could they send themselves to their deaths?","After all, threatening a King was courting death!","The weak coerced the strong. Did they really think that the law did not punish the masses?","Very soon, the experts who received the news arrived one after another. There were hundreds of them. These were the true foundations of the Flying Celestials, and they were also the foundations that supported one of the top ten forces of the Flying Celestials.","Chu Yunfan didn’t beat around the bush when he started lecturing. At the start, he was lecturing on the cultivation path of Domainians. After all, strictly speaking, a half-King was still within the realm of the Domain Stage.","Towards the end, he began to talk about the cultivation path of the King Stage.","At this point, only Chu Hongcai, Huangfu Longhao, and a few half-Kings could understand what he said. The Domainians and peak Domainians were completely dumbfounded.","They couldn’t understand what was being said.","The biggest difference between a half-King and a peak Domainian was that one had already stepped into the King Stage. It could be considered as opening a gap in the door. Although it was only a gap, one could still see what was inside the door clearly.","Hence, Chu Yunfan’s lecture wasn’t completely useless to them. The peak Domainians, on the other hand, were trying their best to remember some of the information. Even if they couldn’t use it now, they might be able to use it in the future.","As for ordinary Domainians, they did not have so many thoughts. They could think of a way to advance to the half-King Stage first.","As for the King Stage, it was too far away for them.","Even with Chu Yunfan’s lecture, they knew very well that it would be very difficult for them to enter the King Stage.","It could even be said that it was impossible!","Their innate talent was too limited!","In these three years, Tang Siyu, Chu Hongcai, Huangfu Longhao, and the others had all gained a lot. Chu Yunfan was especially different from ordinary Kings. He had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, so he looked down on Kings from a high vantage point.","Chu Yunfan could provide solutions to many problems as soon as they mentioned them. Many Daos could be difficult for others for a lifetime if they didn’t point them out.","Once it was exposed, it would be worthless.","Three years had passed, and the Flying Celestials had also sealed off the mountain following Chu Yunfan’s lectures. Apart from the troops and patrols that should have been sent out, the rest had been called back and were trying their best to break through.","Three years later, the first change happened. The sect leader of the Flying Celestials, Situ Xuan, who was already at the peak of the Domain Stage, successfully stepped into the half-King Stage.","Although in the current Great Era, a half-King was far inferior to a King, this was enough to increase the foundation and strength of the Flying Celestials."]},{"number":2381,"title":"Chapter 2381: The Flying Celestials’ Founder’s Great Deed","paragraphs":["Chapter 2381: The Flying Celestials’ Founder’s Great Deed","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Situ Xuan had been stuck at the peak Domain Stage for many years and had never been able to step into the half-King Stage. Now, with Chu Yunfan’s lectures, he had successfully stepped into the half-King Stage.","As for the others, even if they did not improve as much as Situ Xuan, they had more or less improved.","The entire Flying Celestials had entered a frenzy of secluded cultivation.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan finished his lecture and entered the depths of the Flying Celestials.","It was a place that only the sect leader could reach.","Now, Chu Yunfan had entered this mystic realm under Situ Xuan’s invitation.","“This is a place that only the sect leaders of the past generations can come to. However, although you are not the sect leader, you are more powerful than the sect leader. Therefore, I took the initiative to bring you here!” Situ Xuan explained.","As he spoke, he conjured a spell and a door appeared in the void. Inside the door was another world that he had never seen before.","It was a world of stars.","This world was like a miniature version of outer space. One could see stars moving according to special laws everywhere.","This feeling was very shocking. It was as if he was looking at outer space from the perspective of a god.","Chu Yunfan was very shocked, but he felt that the trajectory of the Great Dao was so obvious here. It could even be said that these celestial bodies that moved according to a certain law were actually the embodiment of the Great Dao.","The laws of the Great Dao were reflected here according to the laws of the universe’s stars.","“Who set this up? What a big move!” Chu Yunfan said in shock.","“This is the training ground set up by the founder. In the past, only the sect leaders of the past could enter here to comprehend!” Situ Xuan said.","“However, I feel that this is a little wasteful. This is because the strongest sect leader of our past generations is only at the half-King Stage and has yet to reach the King Stage. Every time I come, I can sense that I can’t completely comprehend many things!” Situ Xuan said. “Therefore, I guess that the founder thought that the future sect leaders who could reach the King Stage would be able to completely comprehend the laws within and comprehend the Great Dao they left behind. Unfortunately, our descendants were unworthy and were unable to advance to the King Stage. Instead, the comprehension mystic realm here was wasted!","“Fortunately, the founder has blessed us. A peerless genius like you was able to advance to the King Stage. That’s why I thought of bringing you here. I think this should be very helpful to your cultivation!” Situ Xuan looked at Chu Yunfan and said.","Chu Yunfan looked forward and saw a figure sitting on a throne in the middle of the universe. His face was lifelike as if he was alive.","It was an old man in a robe. Chu Yunfan recognized him at a glance. He was the founder of the Flying Celestials.","To be precise, the stars in the universe in this small world were all operating with him as the core. Or rather, he had already become the core of this small world. As long as there was an endless supply of energy, this small world could continue to operate.","“This...” Chu Yunfan was shocked.","The reason was simple. Kings couldn’t be truly immortal. Only gods could be immortal.","Not to mention a King, even an Emperor was the same. It was just a difference in time.","With the passage of time, they would slowly decay. It had been many years since the founder had arrived. Even if there were complete corpses, they would slowly decay with the passage of time.","But now, the appearance of the founder was lifelike. Chu Yunfan could even sense the surging energy contained in it.","He immediately understood that the founder of the Flying Celestials had transformed into the Dao of this small world, thus preserving his undying body.","As long as this world was not destroyed, his physical body would not be destroyed.","This was a ruthless person. To use such a method on him, it was like stripping away his own will. Only some memories were left, and there were no emotions.","However, in order for future generations to comprehend the Great Dao from it, the Flying Celestials’ founder had done so.","Even Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but admire this kind of sacrifice.","However, it was a pity that none of the many disciples of the Flying Celestials in the future could advance to the King Stage. The only hopeful one, Huangfu Longhao, chose to seal himself in the present world.","Therefore, this place had been left empty for nothing, and there was no way to truly make use of it.","Now, it was finally Chu Yunfan’s turn to use it!","“Here, the Great Dao will manifest into the great path of stars. As long as you can comprehend the Great Dao within, your strength will advance by leaps and bounds! Situ Xuan said to Chu Yunfan.","“I understand!” Chu Yunfan nodded.","“Okay, you can cultivate here first. I’ll leave first!” Situ Xuan said.","After sending Situ Xuan off, Chu Yunfan sat cross-legged in front of the Flying Celestials’ founder. He closed his eyes and felt the Great Dao of this small world.","To be precise, the true Dao had been replaced by the Flying Celestials’ founder. After the Flying Celestials’ founder completely stripped away his emotions and will, leaving only some memories, it was no different from the optical supercomputer of the Federation.","It was only purely responsible for the circulation of the Great Dao and not letting the Great Dao collapse.","Chu Yunfan was comprehending the Great Dao within. In just a moment, the way of the universe in the small world was imprinted into his mind.","The more he comprehended, the more Chu Yunfan could feel how vast the Great Dao was. This was a kind of star great path, and it was also a Great Dao that Chu Yunfan had never come into contact with before.","To be precise, this was a Great Dao that only martial arts masters above the King Stage could come into contact with. Those who had not reached the King Stage would not even be able to truly understand what space was, so how could they understand this star great path?","The different trajectories of each star contained unimaginable Great Dao.","Chu Yunfan, who came from the Federation, had a deeper understanding of the star great path. Slowly, his power began to rise.","One had to know that ever since he advanced to the King Stage in one go, his cultivation had not improved any further.","This was because he had already exhausted all of his previous accumulations. The reason why he could advance by leaps and bounds so quickly was naturally because of the foundation he had been laying down all this time and the foundation that was constantly increasing.","Now, he wanted to increase this foundation again, allowing him to advance rapidly like in the King Stage."]},{"number":2382,"title":"Chapter 2382: Borrowing the Dao Fruit","paragraphs":["Chapter 2382: Borrowing the Dao Fruit","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","There was not much time left for him, and he was only at the fledgling King Stage!","In the King Stage, there were a total of four levels: fledgling, intermediate, late, and peak.","For example, that King beast was an ordinary fledgling King.","As for Chu Yunfan, he was at the peak of the fledgling King Stage. He was only half a step away from entering the intermediate King Stage.","The King Demon that Chu Yunfan had killed earlier was a late King.","His strength was many times stronger than an ordinary fledgling King. He could even easily defeat a fledgling King.","If Chu Yunfan had not used the power of the Dragon Vein to severely injure him, leaving him with less than one-tenth of his peak strength, he would have been easily killed by Chu Yunfan in the end.","If Chu Yunfan hadn’t been careful and lured the other party in, it would have been very difficult to kill the other party, perhaps even impossible.","Now, if Chu Yunfan wanted to gain the right to speak among the Kings contending for hegemony, his current cultivation at the early level of the King Stage was far from enough.","With his current cultivation, he could even fight against an intermediate King and was not afraid of them.","However, he had never crossed it.","This was the most fundamental difference!","Chu Yunfan was slowly comprehending the star great path. Even the orbit of space could increase Chu Yunfan’s understanding of space.","Chu Yunfan could even feel that the Flying Celestials’ founder’s cultivation was indeed shocking. He might even have one foot in the Emperor Stage and was considered one of the best among the best.","It was impossible for ordinary people to contend with such an existence.","Under such circumstances, every time Chu Yunfan’s strength increased a little, his understanding of space would also increase a little. His strength was improving at a speed visible to the naked eye.","This was unbelievable among the many Kings.","After cultivating to the King Stage, it was absolutely extremely difficult to improve again.","Time passed day by day. In the blink of an eye, the remaining seven years of Chu Yunfan’s seclusion had passed.","In the special space, Chu Yunfan suddenly opened his eyes, and a terrifying light burst out from his eyes.","Everything around him was surging as if it had turned into nothingness under his Disaster Star Eyes","It had been seven years, and Chu Yunfan had finally completed his breakthrough. He had advanced from the peak of the fledgling King Stage to the intermediate King Stage in one fell swoop.","His combat strength had increased by several times. After breaking through the bottleneck, Chu Yunfan was obviously several times stronger.","His cultivation speed was no longer restricted.","In just a short period of time, he had already made a huge breakthrough.","If he were to fight with that King beast now, he might be able to kill the other party in a few moves.","This was a huge difference in strength. Originally, he was a little stronger than the King beast. Now, he was naturally much stronger than the King beast.","Even if he were to face that King Demon, he would still dare to fight him head-on. Even if he didn’t rely on the foundation of the Flying Celestials, he would still be able to tangle with the King Demon and retreat in one piece. He wouldn’t be killed.","He was naturally satisfied with such an increase in strength. Although it was not the fastest, he was not dissatisfied with his current situation.","In the past seven years, what surprised him the most was not that his strength had advanced to the intermediate King Stage. That was almost certain. With his physique and talent, advancing to the intermediate King Stage was almost a matter of course.","What truly made him overjoyed was that he actually discovered the true mystery hidden within the small world transformed by the Flying Celestials’ founder.","It was also the true trump card of the Flying Celestials.","He discovered that he could actually borrow the Flying Celestials’ founder’s Dao Fruit from the world—from the river of time.","In other words, in a short period of time, he would have the cultivation of the Flying Celestials’ founder.","However, this was the same as the Dragon Vein from before. It could not last long. He could only borrow the power of the founder’s Dao Fruit for a short period of time and obtain cultivation that could shock the world and make gods cry.","This was the life-saving method left behind by the Flying Celestials’ founder. He had originally planned to use it when the sect was in danger in the future. Who knew that the descendants would be so disappointing? None of them had even broken through to the King Stage. Naturally, they wouldn’t be able to discover the trump card left behind by the founder.","Therefore, no one knew that there was such a method!","It wasn’t until Chu Yunfan broke through to the King Stage that he discovered the secret hidden here.","One could imagine how powerful Chu Yunfan was. With the help of the founder’s Dao Fruit, Chu Yunfan could become so powerful that he could do whatever he wanted in the world.","However, the Dao Fruit also consumed countless amounts of energy. After so many years of slow replenishment, it was in a state of full energy.","And once it was borrowed, it would immediately erupt with a power that would shock the world and make gods cry.","“With such a method, what else do I have to be afraid of in this world!” Chu Yunfan laughed out loud. This was different from the Dragon Vein Sword from before.","Although the Dragon Vein Sword was more powerful, it could only be used near the Flying Celestials. Once one left the Flying Celestials, it would be impossible to use that earth-shattering sword.","However, this method of borrowing the Dao Fruit could be used all day and anywhere.","Under such circumstances, even if he was targeted by the old sect leader of the Destiny Sect, there was nothing to be afraid of. He could completely fight with the other party and even win.","At this moment, he had absolute confidence even if he were to face the heroes of the world.","“Thank you for the gift, Founder. I will use this power to help the Flying Celestials rise to the top of the world!” Chu Yunfan immediately cupped his hands.","He could even feel a faint light flowing in the skeletal body before him as if it had heard Chu Yunfan’s promise.","However, Chu Yunfan did not think too much about it. He immediately chose to come out of seclusion. As soon as he came out of seclusion, he was noticed by people in the world.","Very soon, someone came knocking on his door.","This person was none other than the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia.","However, the Grand Xia Grand Commandant looked a little tired. In the past ten years, he had been fighting continuously. There was almost no pause. Moreover, there was no one like Chu Yunfan who could attract attention. The pressure on him was too great.","“Greetings, Grand Commandant!” Chu Yunfan cupped his hands and said.","“King Chu, there’s no need for such formalities!” the Grand Commandant said politely."]},{"number":2383,"title":"Chapter 2383: Risky Move, No Other Choice","paragraphs":["Chapter 2383: Risky Move, No Other Choice","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“May I know why you have come, Grand Commandant?” Chu Yunfan said slowly.","“I’ll get straight to the point. I’m here for one thing, and that is to get your cooperation, King Chu!” the Grand Commandant said.","“Just say it. As long as I can do it, I won’t refuse!” Chu Yunfan said.","“It’s very simple. In 30 years, we will have a big operation to hunt down the King demons!” the Grand Commandant said casually.","Once this news spread, it would definitely cause a sensation throughout the world. However, in the Grand Commandant’s words, it was like a trivial matter.","“Why thirty years later?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Because we need time to set up a trap!” the Grand Commandant said, “30 years is the estimated time. At that time, we hope that you will help us, King Chu!”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with shock because he knew that this meant that the humans had reached an unbearable level.","How could it be that easy for one realm to conquer another realm?","Even if the powerful demons wanted to defeat humans, they couldn’t use their full strength and had to guard against the counterattacks of the other races. Under normal circumstances, it was normal for the war between demons and humans to continue for another hundred years.","Considering the lifespan of many cultivators, a hundred years was not a particularly long time.","Only when the foundation of the humans was completely exhausted would the demons be able to defeat the humans with lightning speed and occupy the Central Plains.","However, it seemed that there were no such signs.","The humans seemed to have realized that if they continued to drag this out, the ones who would be dragged to death would be the humans.","In terms of foundation, the strength of the humans was only stronger than that of the other races. However, this was, after all, a fight against the entire Demon Realm. Naturally, their strength was insufficient.","Therefore, the demons were neither fast nor slow, while the humans were starting to get anxious. They could only take the risk.","“Aren’t you planning to wait until those ancient prodigies and Supreme Youths become Kings before launching a counterattack?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“That may be the case, but that’s still the worst possible solution. When that happens, how much of the humans’ reserves will be depleted? It’s unknown whether we can still defend the Central Plains in the future!” the Grand Commandant said.","“Moreover, I’ve personally been to the Demon Realm. In the Demon Realm, there’s also a group of young prodigies growing up. They’re not inferior to our prodigies and Supreme Youths!”","Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but be stunned by the Grand Commandant’s words. If this news were to spread, it would probably make all the races in the world restless.","The reason why the various races could still calmly watch the demons invade the humans in an all-out manner and not be afraid of the loss was precisely because of those ancient prodigies and Supreme Youths who had yet to mature.","Once they fully grew up, just the strength of those Kings would be enough to chase them out.","However, once they knew that there was also a group of young prodigies and Supreme Youths growing in the Demon Realm, they would probably immediately explode.","“Moreover, it’s precisely because everyone thinks so that we have to catch them off guard!” the Grand Commandant said. “We have no choice but to take a risk. We can’t wait for those prodigies of the Demon Realm to advance to the King Stage. Otherwise, what awaits us is the end of our species being wiped out!”","“No problem!” Chu Yunfan thought about it seriously and said, “Anytime is fine!”","Thirty years was enough time for him to improve.","“In that case, I’ll take my leave first!” the Grand Commandant said.","After sending off the Grand Commandant, Chu Yunfan went into seclusion again, trying to seize all the time he had to make a breakthrough.","He was only at the intermediate King Stage now, and it was far from enough.","However, when the news reached the Flying Celestials, even though Chu Yunfan was still in seclusion, he had no choice but to take action.","The demons besieged Serene Immortal Mountain, and it was said that there were even top King marine folks among them. Their powerful auras shook the Eastern Sea.","More and more news came. The human king was stopped outside the capital by a powerful King demon.","A shocking battle erupted between the two sides. Even with the strength of a King, the human king was unable to break through the obstruction of this King demon.","Soon after, the Grand Commandant personally made his move. However, he was stopped by a demon magnate outside Zhenyao City.","It was yet another joint operation with tacit understanding from all parties, and their target was Serene Immortal Mountain.","“The Elder Princess is too domineering. She killed millions of our clan’s experts back then. Now, it’s time to pay the price!” an expert of the marine folks declared.","The entire human race was burning with anger. Chu Yunfan had only just raised their spirits after killing two Kings in a row, and now someone wanted to attack their pride.","This was especially true among the higher-ups of the various forces. There were many people who were filled with righteous indignation.","After all, the Elder Princess had countless followers and admirers from all over the world.","Now that the demons were about to pacify Serene Immortal Mountain, these people were shocked.","However, they wanted to attack, but they were all stopped by the demons. They did not have the ability to attack even if they wanted to.","At the Flying Celestials within Startling Cloud Peak.","Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu’s conversation.","“I want to go back and help my master!” Tang Siyu looked at Chu Yunfan and said seriously.","“Nonsense! What can you do if you go back now?” Chu Yunfan scolded. “There is more than one King demon there right now. Although you are already at the peak of the half-King Stage, you are not enough to be slapped by a true king!”","Chu Yunfan was a King, so he knew how terrifying a King was. Not everyone could replicate his miracles. If others wanted to replicate his miracles, they could only die.","“Although that’s the case, my master is currently trapped in Serene Immortal Mountain. I can’t just watch them attack her and ignore everything!” Tang Siyu said seriously.","“You can’t go, but I can,” Chu Yunfan said seriously. “Only I can save your master!”","“You’re going?” Tang Siyu said.","“Yes!” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Do you think they are targeting just your master?”","“What?” Tang Siyu immediately thought of something after hearing Chu Yunfan’s words. “Could it be that they’re targeting you too?!”","Chu Yunfan nodded lightly. “It’s normal. They surrounded Serene Immortal Mountain but didn’t attack. It’s clear that they’re just fishing? I thought they wanted to force the human king out of the Imperial Capital, but now I realize that’s not the case. The person they want to catch is probably me!”"]},{"number":2384,"title":"Chapter 2384: A Killing Trap Appears, Ignore It!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2384: A Killing Trap Appears, Ignore It!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan had thought that they were trying to lure out the king. After all, the Elder Princess was part of the imperial family. If the Elder Princess was surrounded, how could the king not save her?","However, the king was blocked outside the capital. Clearly, someone did not want him to rescue her!","The Grand Commandant, the old principal of Virtuous Academy, and other powers that had close ties with the royal family of Grand Xia were all stopped.","Other than the human king, there was only one person who had to be saved, and that was Chu Yunfan.","After all, everyone knew that Chu Yunfan was the son-in-law of Serene Immortal Mountain.","Even Chu Yunfan could see that this was clearly aimed at him.","This was a trap, forcing Chu Yunfan to go and rescue them.","In the past ten years, Chu Yunfan had been in seclusion in the Flying Celestials, making many people who wanted to target Chu Yunfan helpless. It seemed that they could only use this move.","And if Chu Yunfan chose to watch from the sidelines and not go to the rescue, then they could also make the show real and uproot Serene Immortal Mountain.","Serene Immortal Mountain was the core of Grand Xia’s power in the Eastern Sea. It was also like a divine needle that stabilized the situation in the Eastern Sea.","The removal of Serene Immortal Mountain was extremely beneficial to both the demons and the marine folks.","This was killing two birds with one stone!","“Then all the more you can’t go. It’s too dangerous!”","Tang Siyu immediately rejected this idea. Although she was worried about her master, she couldn’t just watch Chu Yunfan die.","Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but smile. “Don’t worry. This is their plan. It doesn’t mean that I have to follow their plan, right? If they want to kill me, we’ll have to see how strong they are!”","“Are you confident?” Tang Siyu asked in confusion.","“That’s right. Do you think I’ve wasted these ten years?” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly. “So don’t worry. I’ll save the Elder Princess. You should do your best to advance to the King Stage. Otherwise, you won’t be able to help at all in such a battle!”","Tang Siyu thought about it and finally decided to believe Chu Yunfan. At the same time, she also felt that her cultivation was weak. A half-King was only a half-King. If she wanted to truly participate in the world’s hegemony, she had to be a King. It was meaningless if she was not a King.","Tang Siyu immediately decided to go into seclusion.","With a thought, Chu Yunfan tore through space and appeared ten million miles away. He then tore through space again and appeared another ten million miles away. A moment later, he had arrived at the periphery of Serene Immortal Mountain.","It was completely different from the first time Chu Yunfan saw it, when it was like a paradise on earth. At this time, the outer area of Serene Immortal Mountain was surrounded by an endless demon army, desperately attacking the outer boundary of Serene Immortal Mountain.","In the endless waves further away, the army of the marine folks was gathering. Among them, terrifying auras were lurking. There were actually quite a number of fledgling Kings.","Clearly, the marine folks wanted to be the third party to benefit from the fight between the snipe and clam.","Even further away, there were spies from various races and factions. Everyone wanted to obtain first-hand information about the battle on Serene Immortal Mountain.","“Humph!”","Chu Yunfan snorted coldly and stretched out his hand. It expanded with the wind and instantly turned into a huge golden hand that grabbed at the demons that filled the sky.","Boom!","In an instant, 100,000 demons were captured and killed.","It was just a simple attack.","“How dare you, Chu Yunfan!”","Suddenly, a loud shout was heard. Then, a big foot stomped down on Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan only looked coldly at the foot that was stomping down. He activated his Disaster Star Eyes and activated a special disaster domain around him. The foot was unable to stomp on Chu Yunfan’s body.","The foot was directly shifted to the side and stepped into the marine folks’ army.","This stomp killed hundreds of thousands of soldiers of the marine folks.","For a moment, the entire marine folk army was in an uproar. They all roared and wanted to fight that demon.","“Chu Yunfan, are you doing this to start a war with the marine folks?” a rational King marine folk asked.","“Didn’t you want to make a move long ago?” Chu Yunfan grinned. Why don’t we attack together? I’ll take care of you too!”","The King marine folk fell silent. It wasn’t that he was afraid of Chu Yunfan, but that he wasn’t willing to be the spear for the demons. He wouldn’t be angered by Chu Yunfan.","The scouts from the various factions were dumbfounded.","“Is this the power of a King? What kind of terrifying strength is this? He can actually easily kill an elite army of 100,000!”","“Everyone says that Chu Yunfan is a new King, but I can tell that he’s not any weaker than the old Kings. In fact, he’s even stronger!”","“If the demons want to achieve their goal in this battle, I don’t think it’s that easy!”","Just as everyone was discussing, the person who had attacked Chu Yunfan finally revealed his true appearance.","It was actually a behemoth that was as huge as a divine mountain.","The Troll Demon Tribe.","However, Chu Yunfan had just killed a King Troll Demon, and now a true King had appeared. As expected, these powerful demons had powerful Kings behind them.","Otherwise, how could they survive in the demon world where the strong preyed on the weak?","“Are you a King Troll Demon?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“That’s right, I’m the previous King Troll Demon. You killed my designated successor, and now I’m going to kill you!” the King Troll Demon slowly said.","“Hahaha, so you want to avenge that trash!” Chu Yunfan laughed out loud. “However, I’m afraid that you alone are far from enough!”","“You set up this trap. Don’t tell me you’re the only one? I’m afraid you’re not enough for me to kill you!”","Facing the King Troll Demon, Chu Yunfan was at ease, as if he didn’t put the King Troll Demon in his eyes.","The King Troll Demon’s huge face revealed an angry expression. He had roamed the Demon Realm all his life and had never met an opponent. When had he been underestimated to this extent? It was simply preposterous.","“Chu Yunfan, you should have expected this day to come when you killed my king!”","Suddenly, at this moment, a demonic dragon that blotted out the sky appeared in front of everyone.","This demonic dragon was completely black. From afar, it was unknown how many tens of thousands of feet long it was. It had a ferocious face and its eyes were red as blood. Its huge head was fixed on Chu Yunfan.","“A King Demon Dragon?” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly. It seemed like enemies were really on a narrow road.","He thought of the Demon Dragon he had killed before. It was really far inferior to the one in front of him. It was not even one percent."]},{"number":2385,"title":"Chapter 2385: I Just Want to See How Many Will Come to Die","paragraphs":["Chapter 2385: I Just Want to See How Many Will Come to Die","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The appearance of the world-shaking King demons made many people in the surroundings involuntarily suck in a breath of cold air.","Although these King demons had been unknown in the past, their battles in the Central Plains over the past dozen years had made them extremely famous. They were no less famous than the native Kings.","In fact, many people were able to tell the origins of each King as if they were family treasures. However, no one knew their strength. After all, any battle between experts of that level was like reading a book. They could not tell who was stronger or weaker.","However, although they didn’t know the difference in strength between the Kings, they could see that this was a deadly trap. There were already two King demons appearing, and there were even Kings of the marine folks in the distance who were ready to make a move.","“That’s right, I’m going to swallow you alive today!”","The King Demon Dragon stared at Chu Yunfan.","“Swallow me? I don’t think you’re qualified enough. Is there anyone else?” Chu Yunfan said loudly. “I heard that there are many Kings among the demons. There shouldn’t be only these two, right?”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with a terrifying light. Since he wanted to fight, he would fight to his heart’s content and bury these people in one fell swoop.","“King Chu, you truly are one of the most courageous humans!”","In the distance, a figure arrived in front of everyone at lightning speed. It was a demon with thunder wings, a pitch-black body covered in black scales.","It was a King Winged Demon of the Winged Demon Clan!","He was the King of another powerful demons, a true King, not a half-King who controlled the race!","“It’s not enough. Since you’re here, come out. I’m afraid these three people aren’t my match!” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“How overbearing, King Chu. It’s indeed impressive to have a figure like you among the humans. However, you must die today!”","At this moment, a figure flew out of the sea and stepped on the waves.","Different from ordinary demons, although he was in human form, he had four arms. His entire body was blue-black, and his body also had an extremely terrifying pressure.","“That’s the King Sea Demon of the Sea Demon Tribe!”","In the distance, some of the scouts of various factions recognized this figure. Wasn’t he the King of the Sea Demons in the Demon Realm?","In the Demon Realm, there was also a sea, and in the sea of the Demon Realm, there was another race, the Sea Demons.","The Sea Demon Tribe was famous among the demons. According to rumors, there was more than one King Sea Demon.","In truth, every race in the Demon Realm had more than one King demon. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have been able to completely suppress the Central Plains.","This was a confrontation between one world and another.","“Is this the entire lineup?” Chu Yunfan stood with his hands behind his back and paced back and forth.","“You don’t have to count on the Elder Princess to save you, because she can’t even protect herself now. She’s been refined by our Demon Refining Formation, and it won’t be long before she’ll be refined into a pool of blood!” the King Troll Demon slowly said.","Chu Yunfan looked over. Indeed, there was such a large array outside Serene Immortal Mountain. It was constantly operating among the layers of the demon army.","“What a great move. You actually want to refine the entire Serene Immortal Mountain!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“It’s fine if you don’t come today, but if you do, you won’t be able to escape!” the King Demon Dragon said in a muffled voice.","“I originally thought that you wouldn’t dare to come today, but you didn’t let down your reputation as the number one of the younger generation of the Central Plains. You have guts!” The King Winged Demon grinned, revealing a row of sharp teeth and a cruel expression.","“I love to tear such courageous people into pieces!” The King Sea Demon laughed uproariously.","“Looks like you guys are going to eat me up!” Chu Yunfan grinned. “You don’t dare to suppress the Flying Celestials because you’re afraid that I’ll use the Dragon Vein as a sword to kill you? Where is your courage and dignity as Kings?”","Chu Yunfan saw through their plan at a glance and seemed to understand what they were afraid of.","The group of King demons remained silent. Apparently, they had tacitly agreed that Chu Yunfan had severely injured a senior King with one sword strike and killed him.","In the end, he killed that King demon!","That scene had shocked them. Even now, they were still very afraid!","But now that Chu Yunfan had left the Flying Celestials’ territory, there was nothing to be afraid of.","It was like a lion that had lost its claws!","Although Chu Yunfan was still not easy to deal with, he did not have the ability to threaten them.","Because of this, they were not in a hurry to attack Chu Yunfan!","Because they knew that Chu Yunfan would not be able to wait for reinforcements, and all the reinforcements would be blocked outside. How could they not plan for ten years just to kill Chu Yunfan?","“King Chu, what are you waiting for? Are you waiting for your reinforcements? Unfortunately, you won’t be able to find any reinforcements!” The King Winged Demon grinned. “Even if your reinforcements appear, do you think they will be a match for us?”","The King Winged Demon was extremely confident in himself. He didn’t believe that Chu Yunfan could turn the tables.","Obviously, the other King demons had the same thoughts.","“You think I’m waiting for reinforcements?” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly.","“Aren’t you?” The King Sea Demon laughed.","“I just want to see how many will come to die!” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","“Die? Are you saying that we’re going to die?”","The King Sea Demon laughed loudly. In an instant, he made his move. The spear in his hand rode the waves and rushed over. In an instant, a terrifying aura shook the heavens and the earth. The entire world rumbled and blood energy trembled.","The terrifying light that erupted from this spear was like a long dragon. It swept over like mercury pouring down from the ground. It was peerless, sharp, and extremely terrifying.","Chu Yunfan clenched his fist and threw a punch.","Boom!","In an instant, the sky collapsed and the earth cracked. The world trembled as his fist smashed into the spear.","The collision between the two sides erupted with a hundred million multicolored lights that covered the sky and earth. From afar, it was extremely terrifying and soul-stirring.","Chu Yunfan was fighting against the King Sea Demon. The King Sea Demon was indeed very strong, at least at the late King Stage. However, Chu Yunfan could fight him barehanded.","Although he was suppressed in an instant, he did not have the upper hand.","However, there were no signs of defeat!","“You’re actually not at the fledgling King Stage?” The King Sea Demon finally noticed that Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was not at the early stage of the King Stage as rumored. In just a short period of ten years, he had actually entered the intermediate King Stage."]},{"number":2386,"title":"Chapter 2386: Instantly Killing the King Sea Demon","paragraphs":["Chapter 2386: Instantly Killing the King Sea Demon","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This progress was fast!","Especially after they stepped into the King Stage, which one of them did not spend decades or even hundreds of years to advance?","However, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation speed soared like a rocket.","This was not something that could be built up with just resources.","At the thought of this, the eyes of the Kings flashed with a fierce light. The stronger Chu Yunfan was, the more they couldn’t let him grow.","Chu Yunfan’s talent was so strong that it was enough to threaten the next generation of demons. If he had more time, the next generation of demons would be beaten up by Chu Yunfan.","They were probably going to be beaten up by Chu Yunfan.","Otherwise, they wouldn’t have tried so hard to lure Chu Yunfan out.","They wanted to completely eradicate Chu Yunfan!","“Is the intermediate King Stage your trump card?” The King Sea Demon laughed, feeling that he had completely grasped Chu Yunfan’s lifeline.","Now that he knew Chu Yunfan’s trump card, there was nothing to be afraid of.","He was only at the intermediate King Stage. It was not a big deal to bully the King Lone Wolf, who had just advanced to the King Stage. Wouldn’t fighting them be courting death?","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","The battle between Chu Yunfan and the King Sea Demon was almost indistinguishable. Although he did not have the advantage, he did not lose at all.","“Is he really only at the intermediate King Stage? He’s a little too strong!”","The King Winged Demon grinned, revealing his sharp teeth.","Judging from the strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed, he could actually fight against the King Sea Demon. Such strength was really too strong for them. It was so strong that it was a little too strong.","Although they hadn’t made a move yet, they had already joined in the encirclement. They formed a triangle and surrounded Chu Yunfan. Even if Chu Yunfan wanted to escape, he would have to face the encirclement of the three of them. It was impossible for him to escape.","“However, he’s only at the intermediate King Stage after all. Such a battle is indeed very exhausting for him. It’s not something he can withstand at all!” King Demon Dragon spoke with a voice that was as loud as a bell. The entire battlefield and even the people within a thousand miles heard his voice.","He knew that there were many scouts from various factions nearby investigating the situation, but he didn’t care at all. Instead, he intended to use their mouths to spread the news further.","If not for these people, how would the world know how powerful the demons was?","Chu Yunfan, whom they regarded as their hope, had also fallen at the hands of the demons. No matter what methods they had, it was meaningless in the face of absolute strength.","Surrounded, the battle between Chu Yunfan and the King Sea Demon had reached a white-hot stage. The King Sea Demon kept attacking, and the water law that filled the sky turned into water dragons that suppressed the heavens.","Around Chu Yunfan, eight gods protected him. His entire body was emitting golden light as if he was a god cast from gold.","It had a holy and brilliant light that suppressed the water laws.","Chu Yunfan circulated the ancient scriptures and swept away all the powerful enemies. His expression was invincible. Every attack was earth-shattering and unprecedented. Even the Kings were shocked by his terrifying attack.","At the same time, the Mountain River Cauldron flew out from above his head. It spun above his head and protected him.","This was the key to him being able to fight against the King Sea Demon and not fall into a disadvantage.","No matter what kind of attack the King Sea Demon unleashed, it could be easily intercepted, while his attacks could hit the King Sea Demon without any fear.","The sky collapsed, but the two of them fought directly into the chaos without stopping.","Only now did many people in the distance truly see the battle between the Kings. The truly terrifying battle was not a battle between newcomers who had just entered the King Stage.","He killed until he went crazy, until the world fell silent!","At this moment, everyone was stunned and dumbfounded. They did not expect Chu Yunfan to be able to persist until now and fight against a late King at the intermediate King Stage.","“I am the king, and the world must bow down to me!” Chu Yunfan shouted, and the world rumbled. He was already a King and was no longer just a half-King.","Everything was completely different!","“King Sea Demon, today, I will send you on your way!”","Chu Yunfan roared. Suddenly, he formed a seal and a terrifying aura was released from his body.","His domain spread out for thousands of miles and enveloped the King Sea Demon in an instant.","“What? You still have energy left?” The King Sea Demon never expected Chu Yunfan to still have the strength to pull him in. He immediately unleashed his water domain to fight against Chu Yunfan’s domain.","But at that moment, he saw Chu Yunfan’s domain transform into stars that filled the sky.","Chu Yunfan sat in the universe and became the master of this universe.","However, in the next moment, Chu Yunfan grabbed a ball of lightning energy in his hand. The energy turned into a long sword and pierced through him.","His domain was easily cut open by Chu Yunfan, who rushed in front of him and pierced him with a sword.","In an instant, blood rained down and fell into the sea.","There were many ferocious beasts in the sea that were fighting to devour the blood essence of these King demon. Many of them who were not strong enough were directly smashed to death. Every drop of blood weighed more than 1,000 jin, as heavy as a mountain range.","There were even more who had swallowed the King demon blood essences and exploded. The rest who could endure were also infected by the demon blood and turned into sea monsters.","For a time, countless fierce beasts fought for food on the sea surface.","The King Sea Demon’s eyes widened. He didn’t expect himself to be so vulnerable in front of Chu Yunfan.","“You’re the first!” Chu Yunfan pulled out his sword and looked at King Sea Demon coldly.","The King Sea Demon was dead!","Everyone was stunned. This change was too sudden. It was so sudden that even the other three King demons didn’t have time to react. No one knew how Chu Yunfan’s combat strength suddenly increased and killed the King Sea Demon with one sword.","Chu Yunfan didn’t care about everyone’s shock. He just put the King Sea Demon’s corpse into the Mountain River Diagram.","Then, he swept his gaze over the other three King demons.","Boom!","The terrifying power in Chu Yunfan’s body suddenly erupted and instantly rose to an unimaginable level.","Everyone saw that Chu Yunfan was no longer as calm as before. There was a terrifying power raging in his body. It even boiled from every pore of his body, forming a terrifying cyclone around him.","At the center of the vortex, Chu Yunfan was like a god!"]},{"number":2387,"title":"Chapter 2387: Borrowing the Dao Fruit and Surpassing the Peak King Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2387: Borrowing the Dao Fruit and Surpassing the Peak King Stage","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The cyclone on Chu Yunfan’s body became stronger and stronger. In just a moment, it formed a terrifying storm.","On the surface of the sea, this terrifying storm rushed into the sky, making Chu Yunfan look like a god and a demon.","Everyone was stunned because this sudden change had completely exceeded everyone’s imagination.","Especially when Chu Yunfan killed the King Sea Demon in seconds and displayed his powerful strength, it made people feel shocked and hopeless.","That kind of invincible power that looked down on the world almost made people tremble.","“How did King Chu’s strength suddenly increase so much?” Some people didn’t understand the reason. They only felt that Chu Yunfan’s sudden burst of strength was very sudden.","At this moment, he was too strong, to an unimaginable extent.","He could actually instantly kill the King Sea Demon, who was already at the late King Stage!","There was no difficulty at all!","Boom!","At this moment, Chu Yunfan took a step forward, and the vortex that filled the sky disappeared. At this moment, Chu Yunfan was like a god, his black hair fluttering in the wind, looking down on the three Kings demons.","Heaven and earth cracked under this kick!","Chu Yunfan’s aura also rose to the extreme.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan no longer looked like a human. His eyes turned golden. To be precise, he was no longer himself.","In the unseen world, he had borrowed the Dao Fruit that belonged to the Flying Celestial Founder. In that instant, his strength had increased to the peak of the King Stage, even surpassing the peak of the King Stage.","It was just like the revival of the Flying Celestials’ founder.","He was a true top-notch expert who ruled the world. He was an invincible existence who had pacified the chaotic world together with the Grand Xia founder.","This was a trump card that he had forcefully borrowed, and it could not be used many times!","He had never thought of using it at this time!","If it was possible, he would rather not use this trump card. Even if he had to use it, he would use it on Destiny Sect’s leader who had been plotting against him.","However, Destiny Sect’s leader didn’t come, but these King demons did.","“There’s no other way. There’s no difference anyway. Since you want to kill me, then be prepared to be killed by me!”","Chu Yunfan smiled coldly. Around him, countless flames, lightning, sword light, and so on transformed into endless laws, forming a shocking phenomenon behind him.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s strength made even these people feel a little terrified. Although they still didn’t know what method Chu Yunfan used to have such amazing strength, they also knew that this state definitely couldn’t last long.","In fact, as long as he could buy enough time, Chu Yunfan would definitely die.","That was why the few of them did not move and did not rashly attack!","The main reason was that Chu Yunfan’s strength had suddenly increased too much. Just now, he had killed the King Sea Demon with a bit of trickery. Therefore, they did not know what Chu Yunfan’s current strength had reached. They were not willing to become a stepping stone for others to test Chu Yunfan’s current strength.","However, just because they didn’t do anything didn’t mean that Chu Yunfan wouldn’t do anything. Chu Yunfan was also very clear about the drawbacks of borrowing the Dao Fruit. He didn’t have much time left.","He had to end the battle quickly.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan stomped the ground and disappeared. The next moment, he reappeared behind the King Winged Demon.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!”","Chu Yunfan’s punch turned into eight shocking gods around him.","Among the eight divine artifacts, he was immune to all laws and karma.","In the next moment, he had already attacked the back of the King Winged Demon.","Swoosh!","The King Winged Demon’s figure disappeared from where he stood, and Chu Yunfan’s punch missed.","The King Winged Demon appeared more than a hundred miles away, a sinister smile on his face.","Speed was the specialty of the Winged Demons. Even the law he mastered was the law of speed.","One word—quick!","They were extremely fast!","Although Chu Yunfan had attacked first, the King Winged Demon was able to dodge this shocking attack at the critical moment.","However, in the next second, he spat out a mouthful of blood. His eyes widened because Chu Yunfan’s punch, which should have missed just now, actually appeared in his chest.","This punch was like a spear, directly piercing through his chest.","His body was beaten into pieces, and blood rained down.","Below him, the blood essence of the King demon fell. Countless ferocious beasts in the sea fought over the food, and a fierce battle broke out. Many ferocious beasts exploded, and even more ferocious beasts were transformed into sea monsters.","Chu Yunfan then appeared behind him.","He thought that he had avoided Chu Yunfan, but little did he know that Chu Yunfan was right behind him. The moment he left, Chu Yunfan had already caught up with him.","The punch landed on his body.","“How is this possible?” The King Winged Demon couldn’t believe it. The speed that he was most proud of couldn’t even withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan.","In front of Chu Yunfan’s punch, his body was like paper, unable to withstand a single blow.","“Your speed is too slow!”","Chu Yunfan said coldly. Behind him, a pair of lightning wings were flapping.","Chu Yunfan, who cultivated the lightning wings, was not slower than the King Winged Demon. Even before he borrowed the Dao Fruit of the Flying Celestial Founder, his speed was not slower than the King Winged Demon’s.","Not to mention now, his cultivation had soared, and he had fused with the cultivation memories of the Flying Celestial Founder. His speed was even faster.","Chu Yunfan slowly withdrew his fist. Opposite him, the King Winged Demon kept making hand seals, trying to stop the blood from flowing out of his body. However, he found that Chu Yunfan’s powerful divine power was still attached to his wound, preventing it from healing.","If it was during normal times, he could still rely on the power of everyone else to expel Chu Yunfan’s divine power.","But now, where would he find the time and energy?","Moreover, the other two were not reliable. Once they showed signs of being unable to hold on, they could be killed by them.","The law of the jungle in the Demon Realm was just so terrifying!","There was still Chu Yunfan eyeing them like a tiger eyeing its prey!","Thinking of this, he immediately went all out. A terrifying light burst out from his eyes. He had no choice but to compete with Chu Yunfan in speed.","In an instant, he had circled behind Chu Yunfan, and his hands were like sharp claws, directly smashing toward Chu Yunfan’s head.","But who would have thought that Chu Yunfan’s reaction was faster. He turned around and punched.","Boom!","With a loud explosion, the King Winged Demon’s arm was torn apart inch by inch because of the collision with Chu Yunfan’s fist. Half of his body was broken.","For a moment, blood rained down!"]},{"number":2388,"title":"Chapter 2388: Full Combat Power, Instant Kill","paragraphs":["Chapter 2388: Full Combat Power, Instant Kill","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Even a peerless King was blown up by half of his body. One could imagine how terrifying Chu Yunfan’s punch was.","The power of one punch could destroy the world and cause the world to collapse.","Everyone was shocked by Chu Yunfan’s astonishing strength!","The King Winged Demon finally realized how terrifying Chu Yunfan was in this state. He was simply invincible.","They came prepared, but didn’t Chu Yunfan come prepared?","They had always wanted to scheme against Chu Yunfan. Wasn’t Chu Yunfan plotting against them too?","At this moment, they thought of such an extremely terrifying fact!","It was because they had swept across the world recently and did not encounter any opponents at all. The humans was struggling to hold on under the invasion of the demons. The other races also withdrew their claws and teeth and resisted with all their might. During this period of time, the strength of the demons could be said to be invincible.","Therefore, they had never thought that someone would target them.","Especially when he knew that they had set up such a trap, he still dared to come so brazenly. He indeed had enough capital.","The King Winged Demon flapped its wings desperately, trying to dodge Chu Yunfan’s next attack.","However, since Chu Yunfan had made a move, how could he let him off so easily?","There wasn’t much time left for Chu Yunfan. The King Winged Demon was locked onto by Chu Yunfan’s divine will. No matter how fast he was, he couldn’t keep up with Chu Yunfan’s speed.","Swoosh!","Chu Yunfan caught up with the King Winged Demon almost instantly. In terms of speed, Chu Yunfan had never been afraid of anyone.","“Stop!”","At this time, the King Troll Demon and the other King demon also caught up, but neither of them was good at speed. They couldn’t keep up with Chu Yunfan and the King Winged Demon’s speed at all.","They could only watch helplessly as Chu Yunfan caught up to the King Winged Demon.","The King Winged Demon was going all out. He knew that if he didn’t fight now, he might not have another chance in the future because he would die in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","His entire body was burning. It was his life force burning. At the same time, his body was recovering at an even more shocking speed.","He was burning his lifespan to increase his combat strength and avoid being killed by Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, he finally understood how terrifying Chu Yunfan was. If he didn’t do this, he might really fail like the King Sea Demon.","However, it was useless. Chu Yunfan was overbearing and surrounded by countless star laws. This was the nomological domain of the Flying Celestial Founder. Now that he had borrowed the Dao Fruit, he could temporarily use it.","His big hand was like a long spear as it pierced through the chest of the King Winged Demon, shattering his heart into pieces.","The King Winged Demon screamed. Even with his cultivation, his heart was smashed into pieces, but he was still severely injured.","Black light surrounded his body, but he could not block Chu Yunfan’s punch.","He kept retreating, but Chu Yunfan was even faster. Endless stars bloomed in his hand and turned into the Flying Celestial Seal.","This was the most fundamental Flying Celestial Seal, and it was also the first and most primitive version developed by the Flying Celestial Founder.","The people who came later only weakened its power after countless years. They were not stupid, but they simply could not use the true power of the Flying Celestial Seal. If they did not improve and weaken it, they would not be able to use it at all.","The Flying Celestial Founder had passed away too early, so there was no time for improvements. They could only be improved by future generations.","This was originally a divine ability unique skill meant for Kings, and it was only at this moment that Chu Yunfan’s hand erupted with its true power.","Boom!","The attack landed on the King Winged Demon’s body, and countless stars exploded, setting off a terrifying tide. Then, a series of explosions occurred.","The King Winged Demon’s body exploded in the air and was blown into pieces. However, Chu Yunfan quickly grabbed him into the Mountain River Diagram, squeezed him into a ball of blood, and poured it on the Brahma Tree, which was getting stronger.","All of this happened too quickly, to the point that King Demon Dragon and the others could not stop it in time.","“The second one!” Chu Yunfan said slowly. Then, he looked at the King Troll Demon and the King Demon Dragon, especially at the King Demon Dragon’s huge body that covered the sky.","“Roar!”","Seeing Chu Yunfan looking at him as if he was looking at a dead man, the King Demon Dragon could not help but roar angrily.","Immediately after, his body shrunk to only a hundred feet in size. Then, he opened his bloody mouth and spat out a terrifying demonic wind. It was like a crescent blade tearing through the sky with endless power.","Boom!","The attack was aimed at Chu Yunfan, intending to split him in half.","Chu Yunfan spread out his right hand. Countless stars were born and destroyed in it, containing the Great Dao of the universe.","Boom!","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan’s palm landed and split the long saber in half.","“Flying Celestial Seal!”","Chu Yunfan’s Flying Celestial Seal didn’t lose its momentum and directly hit King Demon Dragon’s body.","The speed was too fast, so fast that the King Demon Dragon did not even have time to react. He did not even have time to escape. Half of his body was smashed into pieces, and blood spurted out. All the defensive artifacts were completely shattered under this attack.","“Peak of the King Stage. No, it has surpassed the strength of the peak of the King Stage!”","The King Troll Demon’s voice was muffled as if he had seen a ghost. When he saw Chu Yunfan suddenly erupt with such a level of combat strength, he was scared out of his wits.","However, he had no other choice. Even if Chu Yunfan killed the King Demon Dragon, he would still die.","He didn’t believe that Chu Yunfan would let him go.","The only way out was to stall for time. Only when Chu Yunfan’s state was over would he have a chance of winning or at least escape.","However, it was obvious that he had underestimated Chu Yunfan’s current state.","The current Chu Yunfan was simply killing anyone who stood in his way.","Facing the King Troll Demon who was blocking his way, Chu Yunfan pointed out with his finger. Wherever this finger passed, it seemed to have sealed the world. The King Troll Demon could not dodge at all.","This was a finger technique recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. It was called the Heavenly Imprisonment Finger. As the name suggested, when it was used, even the world would be imprisoned and unable to move.","The King Troll Demon wanted to break free. Perhaps he could do it if he had some time, but he clearly did not have the time now.","Chu Yunfan’s finger pierced through the King Troll Demon’s head in an instant.","Bam!","The King Troll Demon’s head exploded like a watermelon, shattering on the spot and dying in Chu Yunfan’s hands."]},{"number":2389,"title":"Chapter 2389: Killing the King Marine Folk","paragraphs":["Chapter 2389: Killing the King Marine Folk","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At this moment, there was only one King Demon Dragon left on the battlefield, but he was also severely injured. How could he be Chu Yunfan’s match?","Originally, they wanted to hold out until Chu Yunfan could not hold out any longer. Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would be so powerful after borrowing the Dao Fruit of the Flying Celestial founder?","This was the final method left behind by the Flying Celestial founder for the Flying Celestials. However, in the past, the Flying Celestials had never had an existence who could step into the King Stage.","Therefore, until now, no one knew that there was such a method.","Once it was used, its power was truly astonishing.","The King Demon Dragon was almost scared out of his wits as he frantically wanted to escape!","But how could he escape from Chu Yunfan’s grasp?","“You want to leave? Can you leave?” Chu Yunfan sneered. He took a step forward, seemingly slow but actually fast. The lightning wings on his back flapped, and he caught up with the King Demon Dragon in a flash.","“Flying Celestial Seal!”","Chu Yunfan slapped his palm out, which turned into a huge seal and fell fiercely.","Bam!","The Flying Celestial Seal fell like a huge planet. In an instant, it hit the King Demon Dragon.","The King Demon Dragon was already severely injured by Chu Yunfan, so this attack hit him directly. In an instant, the King Demon Dragon’s body was torn into pieces on the spot and he was killed.","Chu Yunfan’s power had reached its peak.","The spectators in the distance saw this scene. When they looked at Chu Yunfan again, it was as if they were looking at a god. What kind of terrifying strength and power was this?","Killing a King was so easy for him.","One had to know that these Kings were the true chess players on the chessboard. They weren’t something others could compare to.","It was almost solved in a matter of seconds!","Not to mention the crowd, even the Kings that Chu Yunfan had killed did not expect this.","They were killed so easily. It was too simple, too easy!","“Both sides came prepared, but it’s obvious that the King demons aren’t as well-prepared as King Chu!” Someone sighed.","The scouts from the various factions nodded in agreement.","Chu Yunfan could feel the faint sense of spying between heaven and earth receding. Obviously, the Kings who were watching the battle had dispersed.","However, he didn’t care. This battle would definitely be watched by everyone. It was impossible to hide from the spying of those Kings.","Suddenly, at this moment, a big hand grabbed at the King Demon Dragon’s corpse in front of Chu Yunfan!","Obviously, they were here for the corpse of the King Demon Dragon. One had to know that the corpse of the King Demon Dragon clearly had astonishing value, which was why someone had intervened.","“Trying to snatch it from my hands?” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly. Countless lightning dragons surrounded him and instantly blew up the big hand in the air.","In the depths of the ocean, a faint snort of a King came from the sea. It was obvious that a King of the marine folks had attacked just now, but he had failed and was discovered by Chu Yunfan.","However, he never expected Chu Yunfan to tear open the space and appear in front of him in the next moment.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan finally saw who was in front of him.","It was a man who looked like a typical member of the marine folks. He was holding a trident and standing on the head of a huge ferocious beast in the sea. He was looking at Chu Yunfan in shock.","He didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to charge over.","Chu Yunfan immediately attacked!","He clenched his fist and turned it into an eight-part fist, which instantly smashed toward the King marine folk.","Boom!","The marine folk was hit and was sent flying.","He did not expect Chu Yunfan to suddenly make a move.","Even when he was sent flying, he still looked completely incredulous.","How could he dare to attack!","Especially at this time, the humans was being attacked by the demons and was on the verge of collapse. How could he dare to attack!","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t think too much about it. After his attack succeeded, he almost immediately pounced forward and stomped down with the Nine Netherworld Steps.","Endless netherworld water spread out, covering the sky and covering the earth, drowning everything.","With Chu Yunfan’s current cultivation, the power of the Netherworld Nine Steps was naturally not the same as before.","With a stomp, the King marine folk was stomped on the spot, and he spat out blood as he retreated. Meanwhile, his subordinates were stomped into a pile of flesh and blood.","“You dare to kill me? Aren’t you afraid of starting a war between the humans and the marine folks?” the King marine folk roared.","“So what if I kill you?” Chu Yunfan said coldly. “If the marine folks dares to attack, I’ll kill as many as they come!”","Chu Yunfan laughed coldly. He didn’t believe that the marine folks would rashly mobilize their troops for the King marine folk. No matter how angry the marine folks was, they wouldn’t attack.","As long as they still had the idea of letting the humans and demons consume each other and benefit from the loser, they would not send troops rashly at this moment.","That was why Chu Yunfan did not care at all!","His movements were extremely fast, like a bolt of lightning. To be more precise, Chu Yunfan was like a bolt of lightning. In an instant, he had already caught up to the King marine folk, holding a spear made of lightning.","Swoosh","The long spear was thrown out. In an instant, it pierced through the sky and nailed the King marine folk to the bottom of the sea.","He still wanted to struggle, but in just a moment, he had already lost his breath, and his corpse was grabbed by Chu Yunfan.","After Chu Yunfan left, the vacuum created by their battle was gradually replenished by seawater.","Chu Yunfan’s lightning-fast attack not only shocked the scouts of the various forces, but also the marine folk army.","Their King had led them out to pick up a bargain, but who would have thought that they would die before they could do so?","He was killed by that King human with lightning speed.","Chu Yunfan nodded in satisfaction. In this battle, he had killed several Kings. Their flesh and blood could be refined into the Nine Heavens Blood Spirit Pill, which could help Tang Siyu break through. Even Chu Hongcai and the others could use the Nine Heavens Blood Spirit Pill to break through.","At that time, the Flying Celestials would have a group of Kings to guard it, and it would be considered to have completely escaped from the current crisis.","Chu Yunfan turned his gaze back to the demon army besieging Serene Immortal Mountain. Before they could attack, the demon army had already collapsed. Several Kings had all been killed. How could they dare to stay?","Under the leadership of many half-Kings, they had long escaped. Even the blood sacrifice array had collapsed because no one was maintaining it.","Chu Yunfan chased after them for a while. After killing a million demons, the remaining demons fled without a trace.","“King Chu, please come in!”","Suddenly, a cold female voice came from Serene Immortal Mountain."]},{"number":2390,"title":"Chapter 2390: Sitting Down and Talking About Dao, a Huge Harvest","paragraphs":["Chapter 2390: Sitting Down and Talking About Dao, a Huge Harvest","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan was stunned when he heard this. He immediately knew that this voice belonged to the Elder Princess. He had come here to save the Elder Princess.","When Chu Yunfan arrived at the entrance of Serene Immortal Mountain, a rainbow bridge immediately appeared under his feet. He stepped on the rainbow bridge and appeared in the depths of Serene Immortal Mountain in the next second.","In a courtyard with a small bridge and flowing water, opposite him was the Elder Princess, whom he had not seen for a long time.","Compared to the past, the Elder Princess had not changed much. Time did not effect cultivators much.","“Greetings, Elder Princess!” Chu Yunfan cupped his hands.","Although he was now on equal footing with the Elder Princess, she was still Tang Siyu’s master, and Chu Yunfan was still a junior.","The Elder Princess nodded in satisfaction. She looked at Chu Yunfan with some emotion. Back then, she had never taken Chu Yunfan seriously.","In her eyes, Tang Siyu was the most talented person among the younger generation. She was the most likely person to break through to become a King.","That was why she felt that Chu Yunfan was not worthy of Tang Siyu.","In her opinion, Tang Siyu was a King, so her future husband should also be a King.","However, Tang Siyu insisted that she did not want to be forced.","However, it was also stipulated that she had to put all her attention on cultivation and not on love.","In addition, Chu Yunfan also showed amazing talent later, so she slowly stopped opposing.","However, what she really did not expect was that Tang Siyu, who she had high hopes for, had not yet entered the King Stage. Chu Yunfan, who she did not think so highly of, had already entered the King Stage.","She knew that Chu Yunfan’s situation in the Flying Celestials could only be considered ordinary. He was not even the sect leader’s direct disciple. According to common sense, such a person could not enter the King Stage no matter how talented he was.","However, Chu Yunfan had broken too many rules ever since his debut, and this time was no exception.","Chu Yunfan’s rise was too quick. Before she could react, he was already on equal footing with her.","“I didn’t expect you to be the person to come,” the Elder Princess said straightforwardly. “I thought it was the king, but when I saw you, I understood that they weren’t just targeting me, they were targeting you. In fact, if you didn’t come, they wouldn’t have been able to break through the mountain gate in eight to ten years!”","The Elder Princess spoke calmly. She was extremely confident in herself. She had set up Serene Immortal Mountain for countless years. Of course, it would not be easily broken through.","However, Chu Yunfan’s willingness to come to support her made her truly acknowledge Chu Yunfan from the bottom of her heart.","“Siyu wanted to come, but I persuaded her not to!” Chu Yunfan said.","“You did the right thing. This is a battle between Kings. She’s not a King, so what’s the use of her coming? Only by stepping into the King Stage can she be of some help!”","The Elder Princess nodded. She agreed with Chu Yunfan’s arrangement. If the person wasn’t a King, they would just be courting death.","Why bother?","“However, it’s almost time. When I refine the King Demon Dragon’s corpse into a medicinal pill, I can help her and she can step into the King Stage within ten years! Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“You can make King Stage medicinal pills?” The Elder Princess’ eyes widened in shock.","She could make ordinary medicinal pills. At her level of cultivation, of course, she could understand everything, but it could only be those below the King Stage.","The only one in the world who really had the ability to make King Stage pills was Medicinal Kings Valley. However, in fact, this was only a theoretical existence.","Although Medicinal Kings Valley had the pill recipe for King Stage pills, there was no King in The Valley itself, so it was impossible to make them.","Therefore, the medicinal pills taken by Kings in the world were basically passed down from ancient times.","For example, in Medicinal Kings Valley, there were pills left behind by the founder for Kings to take. She had also visited them in the early years and asked for one.","However, no one in the current world had heard of anyone being able to make it. Perhaps some of those ancient prodigies had obtained the inheritance. In the future, after advancing to the King Stage, they might have such an ability.","But in the short term, it was still not possible. Chu Yunfan’s ability was unique!","“Yes, and I’m proficient in it,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently. In fact, with the memory of the Alchemy Emperor, he could not only make King pills, but he could also make Emperor-level pills.","Indeed, he did not just know how to do it. To say that he was proficient in it would be considered modest!","Alchemy Emperors were existences who verified their Dao with the Dao of Alchemy.","The Elder Princess looked at Chu Yunfan meaningfully. She was certain that Chu Yunfan had another inheritance. The Flying Celestials’ alchemy inheritance could only make Domain pills at most. That was already the limit.","And this inheritance was absolutely extraordinary.","However, she didn’t investigate further. This was a big taboo.","“That is fantastic!” The Elder Princess immediately nodded.","She was delighted. According to Chu Yunfan’s words, it was only a matter of time before Tang Siyu entered the King Stage.","Moreover, she would soon step into the King Stage, much faster than the others.","In this world of great competition, being a step faster meant taking the lead step by step, let alone being a step faster.","This way, the inheritance she had created would finally have a successor.","“So, Elder Princess, don’t worry. Siyu will advance to the King Stage in a while!”","Chu Yunfan knew what the Elder Princess was worried about and immediately said.","After saying what they wanted to say, both sides were silent for a moment. The Elder Princess proposed to discuss the Dao with Chu Yunfan.","Ever since she became a King, the number of people who could sit and discuss the Dao with her could be counted on one hand.","Although there were many Kings, not all of them could coexist peacefully. She did not have many choices.","Chu Yunfan thought for a moment and nodded.","The two sides began to sit down and discuss the Dao, exchanging their insights on the Great Dao. In the blink of an eye, a year had passed.","Only then did the two sides end their conversation!","This exchange was extremely beneficial for both parties.","This was especially true for the Elder Princess. She had reached the late King Stage and was only half a step away from reaching the peak King Stage, but she had no way to advance.","At this point, no one could guide her, she could only fumble forward on her own.","However, Chu Yunfan’s appearance was like a bright light that gave her a direction to move forward.","Especially the problems she encountered in her cultivation, Chu Yunfan could easily solve them.","The Elder Princess’ Great Dao also made Chu Yunfan feel that there were thousands of Great Daos, each with its own wonders.","Although they weren’t at a higher level than Chu Yunfan, they were both extremely ingenious.","Both sides had gained a lot and felt that they were not far from breaking through.","Especially the Elder Princess. She couldn’t wait to start her seclusion and prepare to break through to the peak King Stage.","Chu Yunfan said goodbye and returned to the Flying Celestials."]},{"number":2391,"title":"Chapter 2391: The Eve Before the Mass Birth of Kings","paragraphs":["Chapter 2391: The Eve Before the Mass Birth of Kings","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This battle was earth-shattering!","Including the King marine folk, a total of five Kings had died. Moreover, they were not ordinary people. They were not new Kings like the King Lone Wolf who had just entered the King Stage. They were true veteran Kings, and there were even some who were well-known among the late King Stage.","However, in front of Chu Yunfan, they were so fragile that it could almost be said to be unable to withstand a single blow.","They were easily killed!","At this point, the demons had suffered a great loss. A million demon elites had been killed, and four Kings had also been killed. Such a loss could not be considered small.","All the demons were shocked. Many of the higher-ups of the demons knew about this trap. In fact, it could not even be considered a plot, but a blatant trap.","If Chu Yunfan didn’t come, they would uproot the entire Serene Immortal Mountain. If Chu Yunfan came, they would wipe out both Chu Yunfan and Serene Immortal Mountain.","Who would have thought that in the end, their plan would backfire and cause the four Kings who had ambushed Chu Yunfan to all die in Chu Yunfan’s hands? None of them could escape.","For a moment, the world was in an uproar. In just a short time, seven Kings had already died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. Five of them were King demons.","The Hus and the marine folks had suffered great losses at Chu Yunfan’s hands, and some of their Kings had fallen.","There was no need to mention the demons. They were already in the midst of a war with the humans. The war between the two sides had never stopped. Not to mention the demons falling at the hands of the humans, even the humans had also fallen at the hands of the demons.","Since the collective death of the Kings, they were naturally planning how to deal with Chu Yunfan.","The Hus and the marine folks were clamoring to fight the humans to avenge their Kings.","However, the entire human race was united in this regard. The two races had hit the humans when it was in trouble, which made the humans extremely indignant.","“Let’s start a war then. If you have the ability, then send people from the two races to die!”","The humans clamored for war, which made the two races hesitate to attack. They had originally wanted to wait for the humans and the demons to start a war. Only after both sides suffered heavy losses would they enter the battlefield.","Wouldn’t the monsters and barbarians benefit from them entering the battlefield earlier?","For a moment, the situation was just as Chu Yunfan had expected. It did not develop to the point of a war.","On the contrary, the two races even retracted their claws and teeth, afraid of disturbing the two races that were in the middle of a war.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, had shocked the world with one battle, and his reputation was catching up to those old experts.","Chu Yunfan’s explosive strength in this battle had also attracted the attention of many people. There were no secrets under the sun.","Soon, Chu Yunfan’s methods were analyzed.","So he had borrowed the Dao Fruit!","Although this kind of technique was rare in the world today, it was definitely not unique. Many people knew the reason.","Everyone understood that Chu Yunfan didn’t have such strength, but he had relied on other methods.","Even so, no one dared to underestimate Chu Yunfan.","First, he had the Dragon Vein Sword, and then he could borrow the Dao Fruit of the Flying Celestial Founder. Chu Yunfan had too many tricks up his sleeve. Who knew what else he could do?","Many people were shocked at the same time. As one of the ten great sects, the Flying Celestials had left behind too many methods, all of which were enough to kill Kings.","Back when Grand Xia Founder had pacified the world, there were far more than ten Kings among the various factions. However, the founders of the ten great factions were able to stand out and establish the ten great factions. They were naturally the best among them.","It far exceeded the ordinary King Stage.","Many of these methods were extremely intimidating to the current Kings.","This could be seen from the fact that Chu Yunfan had killed many Kings just as he advanced to the King Stage.","Chu Yunfan was in charge of the Flying Celestials. Even though his cultivation was still shallow in the eyes of many Kings, he still was a terrifying threat in the eyes of many.","At least in the Flying Celestials’ territory, many people did not dare to be impudent anymore. After all, no one knew how many more slashes the Dragon Vein Sword could make.","Even if it could only slash out one more time, it would be enough to take the life of a King. No one wanted to die.","Moreover, Chu Yunfan was a King, so it was not too difficult for him to activate the Dragon Vein Sword. Chu Yunfan’s own strength was enough to make many people fear him.","In this situation of mutual fear, Chu Yunfan returned to the Flying Celestials. As soon as he returned to the Flying Celestials, he immediately announced that he would enter seclusion.","After three years, Chu Yunfan finally came out of seclusion.","As soon as he came out of seclusion, Chu Yunfan summoned Chu Hongcai, Tang Siyu, and the others who were still cultivating bitterly. He even found Situ Xuan, who was in seclusion to consolidate his cultivation.","“Brother Fan, why are you looking for us?” Chu Hongcai looked at Chu Yunfan with some doubt.","“I’ve called all of you here for one thing, and that is to help you break through to the King Stage!” Chu Yunfan said.","“The King Stage?” When everyone heard this, even with their state of mind, cultivation, and status, they could not help but breathe rapidly.","Up until now, they were almost all just one step away, but this one step stopped them. Under normal circumstances, it was already very fast to be able to break through within 20 years.","But now, Chu Yunfan actually had a way to help them!","“This is the Nine Heavens Blood Spirit Pill. Each of you can take one. Back then, I relied on the Nine Heavens Blood Spirit Pill to advance to the King Stage!” Chu Yunfan took out small porcelain bottles, each containing a Nine Heaven Blood Spirit Pill.","There was a total of 20 Nine Heavens Blood Spirit Pills. All of them were refined by the Kings he had killed over the years. The effect was even more shocking than the one he had consumed back then.","It was more than enough to help them break through.","Apart from Situ Xuan, Chu Hongcai, Tang Siyu, Huangfu Longhao, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, the Golden Roc, and the Dragon-headed Crocodile, there were three left.","Chu Yunfan planned to keep it so that he could use it in the future. In the future, if anyone in the Flying Celestials broke through to the half-King Stage, they could take the Nine Heavens Blood Spirit Pill to accelerate their breakthrough to the King Stage.","In this case, the Flying Celestials’ power would expand to an unprecedented level.","Everyone received their Nine Heavens Blood Spirit Pills with excitement. Everyone understood what this meant.","After becoming a King, he would be able to jump out of the fate of becoming a chess piece and become a true chess player.","After Chu Yunfan sent everyone away, he immediately announced that he would enter seclusion.","For a time, all the higher-ups of the Flying Celestials had entered a state of seclusion. This also caused many people to speculate.","However, soon, everyone’s attention was attracted by the various battles between the humans and the demons."]},{"number":2392,"title":"Chapter 2392: Late King Stage, an Explosion of Kings","paragraphs":["Chapter 2392: Late King Stage, an Explosion of Kings","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After announcing that he was going into seclusion, Chu Yunfan immediately entered the Mountain River Diagram.","Inside the Mountain River Diagram, on top of the herb mountain, on the Brahma Tree that had already grown into a towering tree that was tens of thousands of feet tall, the beautiful and glistening Brahma Fruits had already entered the ripening stage.","They emitted a rich medicinal fragrance.","Chu Yunfan plucked a Brahma Fruit and swallowed it.","The effects of the Brahma Fruit watered with the blood of countless experts were naturally unprecedentedly powerful. Almost instantly, Chu Yunfan felt that his body was filled with an extremely surging power.","This force pushed him to a higher stage.","The late King Stage!","Now, Chu Yunfan was already in the intermediate King Stage, but if he wanted to advance to the late stage, he still needed to work hard.","But now, it had increased at an astonishing speed.","Bit by bit, he charged toward the peak of the intermediate King Stage.","After five years of seclusion, Chu Yunfan officially stepped into the peak of the intermediate King Stage.","Five years later, Chu Yunfan began to rush to the late King Stage.","Time passed in cultivation. In the blink of an eye, another fifteen years passed.","In the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan suddenly opened his eyes. In an instant, a terrifying divine power in his body instantly boiled. The entire Mountain River Diagram boiled, and all the laws were rejoicing.","Behind him, the shadow of a huge god appeared. That god was none other than Chu Yunfan himself.","This was the reflection of his heart. He only believed in himself and no one else.","After 20 years of bitter cultivation, Chu Yunfan finally pushed his cultivation to the late King Stage.","Previously, when he had just entered the intermediate King Stage, Chu Yunfan could already show off the King Sea Demon and was almost at a disadvantage. Now, he had broken through to the peak of the intermediate King Stage and entered the late King Stage.","With his current cultivation, even if he did not borrow the Dao Fruit of the Flying Celestial Founder, it would not be difficult for him to destroy those late King demons.","With Chu Yunfan’s current cultivation, he could already be considered the top in the world.","According to what Chu Yunfan had learned during this period of time, he had been able to find out about the situation.","Among the King Stage, the fledgling, intermediate, and late King Stage were the most common. Among them, the peak of the King Stage were most few in number.","Among the humans, there were many Kings. However, in reality, only the human king was at the peak of the King Stage.","The others, including Destiny Sect’s leader, the Grand Commandant, and the others, were at the late King Stage.","Even the Elder Princess, who was originally known as the number one expert of the Grand Xia royal family, was only at the late King Stage.","The peak of the King Stage represented the perfection of this realm and was also the first step towards the Emperor Stage.","If one could not reach the peak of the King Stage, then no matter how many years one cultivated, it was impossible for one to advance to the Emperor Stage.","It could be said that the peak of the King Stage was the foundation of the Emperor Stage, which meant that one had completely comprehended this realm.","Even the Elder Princess had only hoped to reach the peak of the King Stage through Chu Yunfan’s guidance.","It was impossible for others. It wasn’t that the human king didn’t want to give pointers, but to reach this step, everyone’s Dao was unique.","The human king, who was already at the peak of the King Stage, walked a little further than everyone else, but it was only a little further. It was not high enough.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, so he could see many things far more clearly than ordinary people.","In these twenty years, the world had undergone earth-shaking changes.","In the past 20 years, the human forces had shrunk further. Under the suppression of demons, the human forces’ sphere of influence was less than two-thirds of the original.","About one-third of the territory was occupied by the demons.","The demons were far more powerful than the humans in all aspects. Perhaps the combined might of the Central Plains could contend against them, but the humans alone were not enough.","Under the pressure of the demon army, the humans resisted desperately, but still one-third of the territory fell in the past 20 years.","The balance of victory and defeat in the war between the two races was tilting more and more in the direction of the demons.","However, the bloody battle of the humans was not without effect. It also brought huge casualties to the demons. The demons’ blood also flowed like a river, and countless were killed or injured.","The two races were fighting in the direction that everyone was looking forward to. In the end, they would suffer heavy losses.","All the races were secretly happy, so they didn’t rush to intervene. They only maintained a huge pressure on the two races, forcing them to fight with all their strength to buy time.","Everything was similar to Chu Yunfan’s previous estimation. The humans was at a complete disadvantage in terms of absolute strength.","As time passed, the gap between the two sides would only grow bigger and bigger.","Everyone knew this, which was why the Grand Commandant came up with a plan. If they didn’t give it their all, the humans would have no hope at all.","Within the Flying Celestials, the situation had also undergone a huge change after Chu Yunfan went into seclusion. After receiving the Nine Heaven Blood Spirit Pill from Chu Yunfan, the strength of the half-Kings had undergone a world-shaking change.","They began to advance to the King Stage one after another. The first one to advance was Tang Siyu.","After Chu Yunfan went into seclusion, Tang Siyu advanced to the King Stage in less than five years.","The aura of breaking through to the King Stage shook the heavens and the earth. Fortunately, she had already set up an barrier before she entered seclusion. In addition, the barrier of the Flying Celestials concealed her.","The outside world did not know that another King had appeared in the world.","After Tang Siyu broke through, she was immediately called back to Serene Immortal Mountain by the Elder Princess. It seemed that she had other arrangements.","A year after Tang Siyu broke through, the second person to break through was actually Chu Hongcai, whose cultivation had always been behind everyone else.","Chu Hongcai had unexpectedly advanced to the King Stage after Tang Siyu.","Compared to Tang Siyu, Chu Hongcai’s breakthrough made the Flying Celestials even more ecstatic.","After all, Tang Siyu belonged to Serene Immortal Mountain while Chu Hongcai was the real disciple of the Flying Celestials.","Now, other than Chu Yunfan, there was actually a second King in the Flying Celestials. This would undoubtedly have a huge effect on the Flying Celestials’ strength.","After Chu Hongcai, the third King appeared. It was Situ Xuan, who had just advanced to the half-King Stage.","Although Situ Xuan was the latest to advance to the fledgling King Stage, his accumulation over the years far surpassed everyone else. It was just that he had not been able to advance before, so he could not turn it into an advantage.","Now, he had finally turned it into an advantage. He had broken through to the King Stage in one go and became the third King in the Flying Celestials after Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai.","For a time, the King Stage welcomed an explosion."]},{"number":2393,"title":"Chapter 2393: The Hus’ New King","paragraphs":["Chapter 2393: The Hus’ New King","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After Situ Xuan, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow was the first to break through its barrier and advance to the King Stage.","Following that, the Golden Roc and the Sea Dragon also advanced to the King Stage one after another.","Only the Dragon-Headed Fierce Crocodile and the others were clearly weaker in terms of strength and foundation. They only broke through to the King Stage five years ago.","Even so, their speed was still shockingly fast!","That was because other than those who had been secretly supported by Chu Yunfan to advance to the King Stage, those former geniuses and Supreme Youths were still holding their breaths and preparing to advance.","But up until now, they had not heard of anyone who had already advanced to the King Stage.","On the surface, Chu Yunfan was the only young master in the world who had already stepped into the King Stage.","Since he was the first, he naturally became the benchmark!","In the past few years, rumors had begun to spread among the humans. Chu Yunfan was the King of the humans, but he only guarded a small area of the Flying Celestials and did not contribute to the humans.","All kinds of rumors were secretly pointing at Chu Yunfan!","However, it was still not a big deal and could only be spread in the dark. There were only a few people in the world who dared to face a King directly. Unless other Kings appeared, no one would dare to stand in front of a King and say such things.","Secondly, Chu Yunfan had killed seven outsider Kings in a row over the years. This battle record could be said to be earth-shattering. Even the other Kings of the humans did not have such a valiant battle record.","As for the non-humankind and demon armies that had died in his hands, there were tens of millions of them. If this was considered a waste of time, then the other Kings were also wasting time.","Everyone’s eyes were bright. Naturally, they would not be easily led away by a few rumors.","No one in the outside world knew that the Flying Celestials already contained such a huge force. With nearly 20 Kings overseeing it, it was enough to laugh at any faction.","Although most of them were at the fledgling King Stage now, it was still an extremely huge force.","However, this force was suppressed by Chu Yunfan in the Flying Celestials.","Not long after Chu Yunfan quietly came out of seclusion, the Hus sent a shocking piece of news.","A Supreme Youth of the Hus had completed his breakthrough and became the first King of the Hu Clan.","For a time, the entire world was in an uproar. Without knowing that Chu Hongcai had broken through long ago, this Supreme Youth of the Hus was the second King of the Hus after Chu Yunfan.","All the Hus were jubilant. At the same time, the entire world fell into silence.","Chu Yunfan’s previous breakthrough could only be considered a coincidence in many people’s eyes.","However, as time passed, no one broke through. It was like a lonely case.","Everyone knew that the era of the Kings was coming, but when it would come was something that countless people could not imagine.","Now, with a Supreme Youth of the Hus breaking through to the King Stage, it seemed to announce that the other Supreme Youths were about to break through as well.","This day would not last long.","All the races sent people to congratulate him. Except for the demons and humans who were still fighting, everyone else sent people to congratulate him.","From a certain perspective, both the humans and the demons were the great enemies of the Hus. The humans had always been suppressing the other races.","They could be considered the common enemy of the four races, and the newly invaded demons were also the same. They were also the mortal enemies of the four races.","In fact, they were even more afraid of the humans, because the humans were only suppressing them, while the demons were going to sweep through the Central Plains and wipe out all the other races.","For a time, the Hus organized a grand ceremony that was comparable to Chu Yunfan’s ascension to the throne. There were even several Kings of the Hus present to celebrate the new King.","After all, the Hus were still relatively peaceful. Although Chu Yunfan had swept through them once before, they had not really hurt the Hus’ vitality. They did not need to fight against the King demons all the time like the humans. They could go and congratulate them.","King Hu-Wolf!","Soon, the title of this King Hu was confirmed. He was a powerful King who stood out from the Blood Wolf Tribe.","Just as everyone was looking forward to the other Supreme Youths breaking through one after another, King Hu-Wolf arrived in Grand Xia. To be more precise, he had arrived outside the Flying Celestials.","For a time, the world was stirred up by King Hu-Wolf.","“Chu Yunfan, come out and fight me!”","On this day, a muscular young man with a huge wolf riding on him pointed a spear at the Flying Celestials and shouted.","The King’s fury caused the earth to shake, the mountains to shake, and the sky to collapse. From afar, one could see the clouds in the sky churning.","“King Hu-Wolf and King Chu are going to fight!”","A piece of news spread throughout the Central Plains.","The experts of the various races began to watch the battle through various means.","“Is King Hu-Wolf crazy? King Chu has killed so many Kings. His strength is unfathomable!”","“That’s right. Any one of them is no weaker than the current King Hu-Wolf. In fact, they are far stronger than the current King Hu-Wolf. In the end, didn’t they still die at Lord Chu’s hands?”","“That’s not necessarily true. Lord Chu has killed many Kings, but he’s always taken advantage of the situation. We all know that. But this time, it’s different. Lord Hu-Wolf is outside the Flying Celestials. Even Lord Chu’s Dragon Vein Sword can’t do anything to him!”","Many people quickly saw through the clues because King Hu-Wolf’s location was far beyond the Flying Celestials. He was probably afraid that Chu Yunfan would use the Dragon Vein Sword to attack him.","After all, it was no secret that Chu Yunfan had severely injured a King demon with the Dragon Vein Sword and killed him in the end.","On the contrary, it had become a topic of discussion for countless people.","That battle could be said to have become a classic, a classic of the weak defeating the strong.","In many people’s eyes, Chu Yunfan was just a new King without the various methods left behind by the Flying Celestial Founder.","Although he had become a King several decades earlier than King Hu-Wolf, to a King, a few decades was nothing.","“Brother Fan, let me go out and beat him up!”","Chu Hongcai quickly came to meet Chu Yunfan.","“What’s the rush? It’s not the time for you to show up yet. You can’t let the world know!” Chu Yunfan said. “At least, you have to wait until you break through to the intermediate King Stage!”","Chu Yunfan said calmly. He could imagine that if the outside world knew that there were so many Kings in the Flying Celestials, they would immediately face a disaster.","The demons would definitely gather all their strength to destroy the Flying Celestials."]},{"number":2394,"title":"Chapter 2394: Destroying King Hu-Wolf","paragraphs":["Chapter 2394: Destroying King Hu-Wolf","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After all, no matter how strong Chu Yunfan was, no matter how amazing his performance was, he was only strong by himself.","However, if the Flying Celestials had a group of experts and a nest of Kings, it would be enough to pose a huge threat to the entire world.","The secret that Chu Yunfan had the method to produce Kings in batches would naturally be kept. At that time, the pressure from all sides would be overwhelming.","The demons would definitely not let Chu Yunfan continue to produce Kings in batches. In fact, the other races would not let him continue to produce Kings in batches.","Even to many factions within the humans, the Flying Celestials, which could mass-produce Kings, was terrifying.","Because they had broken the balance and made everyone feel fear!","At that time, they would become the target of public criticism, and there would be no place for them in the world.","Therefore, before Chu Yunfan’s strength was strong enough, he had to endure it. Chu Hongcai and the others had to lie low for the time being and not appear in front of anyone.","“Alright then!” Chu Hongcai nodded.","Only then did Chu Hongcai give up. The others also came over, wanting to fight.","Lord Hu-Wolf was only a newly ascended King. Even the weakest Dragon-Headed Crocodile and the others were much stronger than him. It was just that no one in the outside world knew.","“The great Chu Yunfan is only so-so!”","“Hahaha!” King Hu-Wolf laughed out loud, but his expression was a little sinister.","“It’s said that King Hu-Wolf had a very good relationship with the King Lone Wolf that Chu Yunfan had killed. He was raised by the previous generation’s old khan. Now, the two most important people to him have been killed by Chu Yunfan. He must want to tear Chu Yunfan into pieces!”","Soon, everyone understood why King Hu-Wolf had rushed to their doorstep not long after he had ascended the throne.","Obviously, his hatred for Chu Yunfan had made him want to tear Chu Yunfan into pieces at all costs.","However, it was clear that he still had the last bit of rationality left in him. He did not recklessly charge into the Flying Celestials’ territory.","At the same time, many people also noticed that more than one King Hu had arrived at the border. For a moment, the northern defense line of the humans felt immense pressure.","Clearly, these Hu Kings were here to defend King Hu-Wolf. At the same time, they were forcing the King humans to head to the northern border, unable to help Chu Yunfan encircle King Hu-Wolf.","King Hu-Wolf had come prepared. He was not only here for revenge, but also to use this battle to settle the world. He wanted everyone to know that he was the number one person among the younger generation.","“Since you want to die, I have no reason not to fulfill your wish!”","Chu Yunfan’s voice came from the Flying Celestials. Then, he took a step forward and stepped out of the rainbow bridge that filled the sky, directly entering the depths of the universe.","“Since you want to fight, then come!”","King Hu-Wolf was overjoyed. This battle had finally forced Chu Yunfan out of the Flying Celestials. Without the Dragon Vein Sword, Chu Yunfan would no longer be so terrifying.","As for borrowing the Dao Fruit of the Flying Celestial Founder, that could not happen again. Even the Dao Fruit left behind by the Flying Celestial Founder could not be used frequently. Every time it was used, it would take countless years of accumulation to be of use again.","Just as Chu Yunfan stood firm in the universe, a long spear swept across the void like a mountain range.","Whoosh!","The spear broke the silence in the void of the universe and shattered the vacuum. From there, one could actually see the birth and death of the universe, as if the real world was reopening.","King Hu-Wolf had already made his move impatiently. Before Chu Yunfan even arrived, his attack had already swept across the area.","Countless divine wills appeared in the surroundings. There were many half-Kings, and there were even many Kings who wanted to observe this battle.","Many people wanted to know what Chu Yunfan’s true combat strength was.","This was also related to the future actions of many people.","Chu Yunfan sneered and opened his palm. Suddenly, a universe rotated in it and turned into the Flying Celestial Seal. Then, he slapped it down.","Boom!","The collision of two peerless Kings shook the entire universe. Dazzling sparks flew everywhere, causing the entire universe to start burning.","At this moment, the two youngest Kings clashed.","Any one of them was enough to shake the current situation.","Everyone was immersed in shock, especially those half-Kings. They had a better understanding of the might of a King. It was indeed far beyond what ordinary people could imagine.","“Die!”","“Kill!” King Hu-Wolf roared as he swung his spear. It was like a black dragon that tore through the sky and devoured everything.","On the other side, Chu Yunfan conjured a cosmic void with one hand and casually swept across. All of King Hu-Wolf’s attacks were easily blocked.","What kind of shocking peerless combat strength was this? It far exceeded everyone’s imagination!","“King Chu is actually this strong? He can actually suppress all of King Hu-Wolf’s attacks with one hand. He seems to be doing it with ease!”","“It’s only been a few decades since he reached the King Stage, but he actually made such a huge improvement. Unbelievable!”","“The battle between the two Kings seems to have decided who will be the number one person among the younger generation in the world!”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. The scene had already undergone a huge change compared to before.","Chu Yunfan conjured the void of the universe with one hand and casually conjured the Flying Celestial Palm Strike, forcing King Hu-Wolf to retreat.","Every strike was like a huge divine mountain smashing down on him.","Spurt!","King Hu-Wolf spat out blood. He had suffered a huge loss in a pure battle of strength. The giant wolf he was riding on was only at the half-King Stage. Now, its limbs were broken and its entire body exploded.","“How dare you! I’m going to kill you!”","“Arghhh!” Lord Hu-Wolf roared in rage. All the power in his body was boiling, and he was burning with rage. The spear in his hand shot out, and in an instant, the entire universe was blasted apart.","There was nothing that could resist his spear.","Clang!","With a crisp sound, Chu Yunfan extended two fingers and easily caught the spear.","This attack that could destroy the world just now was actually easily received.","“Impossible!” King Hu-Wolf said in disbelief.","At this moment, even if he was stupid, he could sense that something was wrong.","“Do you still not understand? I was just testing you just now. Now that I’ve tested you enough, it’s time to send you on your way!”","Chu Yunfan took a step forward and instantly appeared in front of King Hu-Wolf. The lightning saber in his hand flew up and King Hu-Wolf’s head was cut off."]},{"number":2395,"title":"Chapter 2395: Killing One King Hu After Another, Ranked at the Top","paragraphs":["Chapter 2395: Killing One King Hu After Another, Ranked at the Top","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He sent him on his way after testing him out?","Many people gasped when they heard this. Chu Yunfan’s ferocity was far beyond their imagination.","In Chu Yunfan’s eyes, a King was just a mere pawn.","Daring to be impudent in front of him was undoubtedly courting death.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was too strong for many people, far beyond their imagination.","“Chu Yunfan only broke through to the King Stage a few decades ago. How can he be so strong?”","Many people gasped.","They realized that Chu Yunfan’s strength was far beyond their expectations. Most importantly, they had no idea how strong Chu Yunfan was. They couldn’t even tell how strong Chu Yunfan was from his attack just now.","“Could it be that he has already stepped into the intermediate King Stage?”","Many people were guessing, but so far, no one could guess what stage Chu Yunfan had reached.","However, the intermediate King Stage was already the limit that they could guess. The late King Stage was something that they did not dare to think about at all.","That was the peak of many Kings.","As for the peak Kings, they were the rarest rulers of the world. There were too few of them. With Chu Yunfan’s current cultivation years, it was impossible for him to reach the peak King Stage.","However, even if he had only stepped into the intermediate King Stage, it was still an unimaginable cultivation speed for many people.","Compared to the Kings of the older generation, he was much faster.","It was as if this chaotic world was urging these young experts who were growing at an astonishing speed.","“How dare you!”","Chu Yunfan’s shocking actions had infuriated the other King Hus.","Chu Yunfan had killed a new King of the Hus, King Lone Wolf, and now he had killed their new King, King Hu-Wolf.","Killing two new Kings of the Hus was equivalent to cutting off the future of the Hus.","This made the top experts of the Hus furious.","“You’re courting death!”","Waves of terrifying aura swept through the starry sky of the universe.","The void was torn apart, and a terrifying aura was released from it.","At the same time, the terrifying auras of King Humans swept out and blocked the auras of the King Hus.","A terrifying wave of energy swept out from the Imperial Capital and attacked the main bodies of the King Hus in the air.","They had no choice but to give up on tearing open space and turn around to defend.","Chu Yunfan didn’t stay idle either. He tore open the space with his hands and rushed to the side of a King Hu, dragging him out of the spatial crack.","It was a muscular middle-aged man dressed in animal skin. He was holding a blood-colored long saber. He was about to attack Chu Yunfan when he was stopped. When he was about to retreat, he was captured by Chu Yunfan.","He was instantly furious.","“How dare you!”","The King Hu was burning with anger. Chu Yunfan still dared to capture him at this time. It was obvious that he didn’t put him in his eyes. He was extremely detestable.","His entire body burst out with waves of light, presenting a terrifying phenomenon. It was an incomparably huge mammoth. This mammoth trampled on the entire void, and the stars in the distance trembled violently.","The intermediate King Stage!","This was a terrifying existence at the intermediate King Stage. That terrifying feeling swept out in an instant.","Chu Yunfan’s temperament was rising. He glanced at the Hu King, and his entire body burst out with a terrifying golden light. It was as if his entire body was cast from gold.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!”","Chu Yunfan’s fist blasted out, and in an instant, eight powerful gods rose around him. The gods and the mammoth collided fiercely, and the sky collapsed and the earth cracked.","It was a phenomenon that filled the sky. Everyone saw Chu Yunfan tear the terrifying mammoth that was as huge as a star into pieces in the air. Eight huge gods charged toward this King Hu.","Boom!","The King Hu was struck on the spot and he was sent flying. His entire body was on the verge of bursting apart.","This attack was too terrifying!","The power of Chu Yunfan’s attack was earth-shattering.","Because he was far away from the Central Plains, Chu Yunfan could attack as he pleased. The terrifying strength of the late King Stage completely erupted at that moment.","Everyone was shocked. They didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to be so fierce. Not only did he kill King Hu-Wolf, he even wanted to kill the other King Hus on the spot.","That King Hu no longer had the ferocious aura from before. At this moment, he was scared out of his wits and hurriedly tried to retreated.","He wanted to flee back to the Central Plains.","In the Central Plains, the other King Hus once again tore through the void, wanting to reinforce the King Hu that was being attacked.","However, there was no time. Chu Yunfan was bathed in golden light. A ball of lightning origin energy was circulating in his hand, and in an instant, it turned into a long sword.","The longsword instantly slashed out a terrifying sword light that was hundreds of thousands of feet long.","The sword light tore the universe apart, almost tearing the stars in half. It cut the King Hu into two on the spot.","Fresh blood splattered across the void. Another King Hu had died!","Everyone was shocked by Chu Yunfan’s astonishing strength. No one dared to imagine that he could kill two Kings so easily.","It was too fast and too smooth. No one could stop him at all.","This battle was a battle to establish his might. Everyone knew that another top-notch King had appeared in the world.","Even if Chu Yunfan did not rely on the various methods left behind by the Flying Celestial Founder, he was already a top existence in the world.","He was an invincible existence!","Chu Yunfan stood with his hands behind his back, proudly standing in the void of the universe.","“This is the King of humanity, the hope of humanity’s future!”","“If King Chu can become an Emperor, he can sweep through the demon army alone!”","“King Chu is mighty!”","Countless humans were filled with tears. They seemed to see the hope of the humans rising again. Chu Yunfan was too powerful. If he only became a King, it would add a top-notch combat strength to the human side.","But now, the potential that Chu Yunfan had shown was so great that he could even reach the Emperor Stage. Once he reached the Emperor Stage, the demons would be nothing.","This was the hope of the humans’ revival.","“Chu Yunfan, you will definitely die!”","A King Hu roared angrily, but he did not continue to attack. This was because they knew that it was impossible to kill Chu Yunfan today."]},{"number":2396,"title":"Chapter 2396: Ten Years, the Explosion of Kings","paragraphs":["Chapter 2396: Ten Years, the Explosion of Kings","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The strength that Chu Yunfan displayed could be said to be invincible. Even among the many Kings, he was already standing at the top. Other than those peak Kings, he was already invincible.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was something that some people were happy about, while others were worried about. The ordinary people rejoiced. Chu Yunfan’s strength represented the hope of the humans.","Currently, the humans was suppressed by the demons, and the foundation that they had accumulated over the years was being consumed at every moment.","However, there was no end to such days. Everyone placed their hopes on those ancient prodigies and Supreme Youths.","However, that was only hope. At least for now, there was no possibility of success.","However, Chu Yunfan’s strength proved to them that this path was the right one. As long as they persevered, they might be able to see the scene of Kings standing side by side.","At that time, the humans might be able to drive the demons out.","However, for some of Chu Yunfan’s enemies, the shocking strength that Chu Yunfan suddenly displayed at this time undoubtedly caught them off guard.","They had never expected Chu Yunfan to suddenly burst out with such strength.","“I didn’t expect this kid to have such shocking strength. I have to think long and hard about how to kill him!”","In a secret realm, a King said in a low voice.","Chu Yunfan’s strength had stimulated those ancient prodigies and Supreme Youths. No one thought that they were inferior to Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan’s strength naturally stimulated them to want to advance to the King Stage even more.","On the road to the King Stage, there was no doubt that Chu Yunfan had completely left them behind.","Before they had even stepped into the King Stage, Chu Yunfan had already walked very far in the King Stage.","In addition, there was also the influence of the breakthrough of King Hu-Wolf. This also made those Supreme Youths who were closest to breaking through start to break through with all their might.","Not long after, among the monsters, a Nine-Tails Sacred Fox from the Green Fox Tribe, a monster Supreme Youth, completed a breakthrough and entered the King Stage. He was known as King Sacred Nine-Tails.","For a moment, the world was in an uproar. It was as if everyone could sense that there was another opportunity for an oil spill.","The accumulation of these Supreme Youths had already arrived. They were all only one step away from advancing to the King Stage.","Everyone finally shifted their attention from Chu Yunfan to the new King Sacred Nine-Tails.","Some people even joked that Chu Yunfan was the nemesis of new Kings.","As far as they knew, there were only four new Kings recently. Other than himself, two had already died in his hands.","If the remaining King Sacred Nine-Tails also died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, then the title of the nemesis of the new Kings would be more worthy of its name.","Some people even incited the King Sacred Nine-Tails to challenge Chu Yunfan and seize the title of number one among the younger generation.","However, the King Sacred Nine-Tails killed the person who instigated them.","“He actually dared to provoke a King. He’s really courting death!”","King Sacred Nine-Tails announced that he would not find trouble with Chu Yunfan.","In fact, with the precedent of King Hu-Wolf, who would be so blind as to find trouble with Chu Yunfan? Wasn’t that just courting death?","At least for now, King Sacred Nine-Tails didn’t think that he was much stronger than King Hu-Wolf. They were both new Kings and Supreme Youths. They were all the same. King Hu-Wolf had been easily killed by Chu Yunfan, so how could he be any better?","These instigators were all bad people. Their consciences were greatly damaged. They were all going to die.","Chu Yunfan only smiled faintly. Since King Sacred Nine-Tails was tactful, he would let him go.","Chu Yunfan had also thought of killing King Sacred Nine-Tails and using his King’s blood to water his Brahma Tree.","However, he had already killed nine Kings recently, and it was really too eye-catching. If he took the initiative to kill more Kings, it would seem a little overbearing.","Although he was powerful now, he had not reached the point of invincibility.","At the very least, he had not cultivated to the peak of the late King Stage.","The current him did not have much of a problem facing an ordinary late King. However, facing a peak King, he basically had no chance of winning.","That was an existence that had cultivated to the peak of the King Stage. It was an existence that he currently had no way of resisting.","Before reaching the peak of the King Stage, he still needed to restrain his limelight.","However, even if he could not advance to the peak of the King Stage in a short period of time, Chu Yunfan still had to obtain the strength to fight against the peak of the King Stage and not be easily killed.","Chu Yunfan quickly made up his mind to push his cultivation to the peak of the late King Stage.","At that time, even a late King would be able to defeat him. When facing a peak King, he would not be defeated and could retreat calmly.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan immediately went into seclusion. He urged the Brahma Fruits on the Brahma Tree to ripen to shorten the time he spent cultivating.","In the blink of an eye, another ten years had passed. Gradually, it began to disappear from everyone’s minds.","After the birth of King Sacred Nine-Tails, Supreme Youths from the marine folks, the barbarians, the Hus, and the humans successively advanced to the King Stage.","In these ten years, on average, a King was born every year. It could be said that many factions had lost their legs from running around. Just the congratulatory gifts they sent made many people’s hearts ache.","However, they could not offend any of these Kings. Even if they did not go to meet the Kings of the other races, there were at least a few Kings of their own race. However, there was more than one King among the various races.","What made them feel the most despair was that other than these ten Kings, there was also a large group of Supreme Youths and ancient prodigies who were holding their breaths and preparing to break through. In the next ten or twenty years, there would probably be dozens of Kings born.","It was likely that they would truly enter an era where all Kings would stand side by side.","In these ten years, the demons had not done nothing. Although the Kings of the demons had been held back by the Kings of the various races, their half-Kings had all attacked one by one. In the past few years, they had obtained a list of Supreme Youths and ancient prodigies of the Central Plains.","The people on the list were assassinated one by one. Many Supreme Youths were cultivating in secret in the mystic realm. Before they could react, they were attacked in the mystic realm and killed on the spot.","As these Supreme Youths hid themselves very well, no one even noticed them until they died.","In the past ten years, more than 20 Supreme Youths and hundreds of ancient prodigies had been assassinated one after another.","For a moment, the crowd was in an uproar."]},{"number":2397,"title":"Chapter 2397: The Hunting Begins, the Emperor’s Tomb","paragraphs":["Chapter 2397: The Hunting Begins, the Emperor’s Tomb","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Supreme Youths and ancient prodigies were all furious!","They were clearly treated like prey. What kind of existences were they? When had they ever been treated like this?","They had always been the ones hunting others. When had they ever been hunted like this?","This was especially so when the demons were openly targeting them. To be precise, they were targeting all the major races of the Central Plains, not just the humans.","In truth, to the demons, the various races of the Central Plains were basically the most important targets for their extermination.","It was just that the order in which these targets had to be eliminated was not quite the same.","At the moment, the humans were of course the priority, but the other races were also within the scope of the elimination target. Their Supreme Youths and ancient prodigies had a chance to advance to the King Stage.","This was a huge problem for the demons. They could not be allowed to continue growing like this.","These enraged Supreme Youths and ancient prodigies spontaneously organized a counter-hunt. Instead, they began to hunt down the top experts of the demons.","Both sides were top-notch existences. Although they were not in the King Stage, the battle situation was very, very tragic.","It could even be said that it was far more tragic than the battle of the King Stage.","Under such circumstances, the demons suffered heavy losses. Many of the casualties were even the leaders of the demon race.","However, the demons did not stop. This was because the demons that were killed were all existences who had no hope of breaking through to the King Stage, and the people they had killed were all experts of the various races of the Central Plains who had hope of breaking through to the King Stage.","Even two for one was a very cost-effective ratio.","Everything was to buy enough time for the true Supreme Youths demons to eliminate the opponents they had to face.","In these ten years, the war situation was extremely tragic.","Another piece of news began to spread throughout the Central Plains.","In a secret realm of the Central Plains, there was an Emperor’s inheritance. Whoever could obtain this Emperor’s inheritance would have a chance of breaking through to become the first Emperor.","For a time, the world was in an uproar.","This was especially true for those Kings. Everyone had cultivated to this stage, so they naturally hoped to have the chance to become Emperors.","They were unwilling to give up halfway.","For a moment, the entire world seemed to be covered up by this news.","On this day, in the skies above the Central Plains, an enormous tomb appeared before everyone.","This tomb was hidden in a special space, and it would only appear in the Central Plains at specific times.","“There’s the aura of an Emperor in it!”","Some Kings could sense the aura of an Emperor from it, and it instantly attracted the attention of countless Kings.","This tomb was very vast, but everyone could see that the tomb was not man-made, but naturally formed.","This was a true tomb of an Emperor because only Emperors could seize the fortune of heaven and earth. They were loved by heaven and earth. Only when they died would the laws of heaven and earth automatically form a tomb for them.","This tomb, which was obviously evolved from the Heavenly Dao, clearly had an Emperor buried in it.","For a moment, many Kings began to move. Even many half-Kings made their moves.","Chu Yunfan also received this news and finally came out of seclusion.","After ten years of seclusion, Chu Yunfan’s strength had increased by another level. After consuming the Brahma Fruits again, his strength had soared again. There was a world-shaking change, and he smoothly broke through to the peak of the late King Stage.","With his current strength, even if he encountered a peak King, there was nothing to be afraid of. Even if he could not defeat the other party, he could still retreat.","He could be considered to have the ability to protect himself!","“The hunt is finally about to begin,” Chu Yunfan muttered to himself.","He had also received news from the Grand Commandant before this.","Without a doubt, this was the beginning of the hunt that the Grand Commandant had mentioned.","Finally, after many years of planning, the humans’ counterattack and revenge were finally about to begin.","Chu Yunfan finally understood why this plan took decades.","This was because it involved the tomb of an Emperor.","That was the burial ground of an Emperor. Many of the laws and Heavenly Dao involved were not something that a King could understand.","It was naturally not easy to use this tomb to set up a killing array. Perhaps for the past few decades, the humans had been in a passive state of being beaten up. The King humans rarely made a move, so they set up this killing array.","“It’s time to end this!” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","After receiving this news, Chu Hongcai and the others were eager to go to the Emperor’s tomb, but they were stopped by Chu Yunfan.","He knew what this tomb meant. It was a deadly trap.","Although their cultivation progress was very fast and they had already reached the peak of the early King Stage in the past 20 to 30 years, they were half a step away from reaching the intermediate stage. However, they had not reached it in the end.","Only Tang Siyu had reached the intermediate King Stage. However, at that moment, Tang Siyu had already gone to Serene Immortal Mountain to guard it. She was not in the Flying Celestials.","Chu Yunfan did not let them go with him because he had another purpose. He wanted to leave some seeds for the humans.","After all, this battle was abnormally dangerous. Even with the killing trap set up by this tomb, it was unknown how many difficulties they would encounter if they wanted to kill all the demon experts.","Not to mention, there were also experts from other races eyeing them covetously.","It was even possible that he would encounter an accident.","Naturally, he could not let the entire humans’ strength be buried in this killing trap.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan left behind some backup plans like the Flying Celestial Founder. Then, he rushed straight to the looming Emperor’s tomb above the Central Plains.","In just a moment, he had already arrived at the Emperor’s tomb. Just as Chu Yunfan had expected, this was an alternate dimension.","It was an alternate dimension formed naturally by the Heavenly Dao. It would only appear in front of people at specific times. Most of the time, it would drift in the spatial turbulence and would only appear in front of everyone once in countless years.","At this moment, the entire Emperor’s tomb was extremely lively.","Chu Yunfan saw that the Emperor’s tomb was surrounded by endless white bones. These white bones piled up into mountains. From afar, it looked like a confluence of white bones.","It was a shocking sight.","These white bones faintly emitted an astonishing pressure. They were actually the bones of many experts who had died."]},{"number":2398,"title":"Chapter 2398: The Top King Demon, King Purple-Robe Demon","paragraphs":["Chapter 2398: The Top King Demon, King Purple-Robe Demon","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","These skeletons should have been experts when they were alive. The weakest of them was at the Domain Stage.","However, they must have been killed by the Emperor on this battlefield. After the Emperor died, the laws of heaven and earth formed a tomb, burying the Emperor and these bones together.","Chu Yunfan could see from afar that the demon army was searching the long river of bones at an astonishing speed.","It was obvious that they were looking for the entrance to the Emperor’s tomb.","Other than the demons, there were also experts from various races watching from afar. The weakest of them were Domains. Many of them were even half-Kings. Many of them were experts who were originally on the Prospective Kings List.","However, they didn’t dare to get close. They weren’t Kings. If they were surrounded by these demon armies, they might really be unable to escape death.","They could not even stop a single charge from the demon army.","From afar, Chu Yunfan could even see the auras of Supreme Kings hidden in the void.","However, they had yet to enter the Emperor’s tomb. They seemed to be worried that there was a trap in the Emperor’s tomb. After all, it suddenly appeared. No matter how they looked at it, it didn’t seem right.","Therefore, they allowed those Domains and fledgling Kings to enter and investigate the checkpoints first.","If there really was an entrance and there really was an Emperor’s inheritance inside, they would still be able to rush in in time. It was impossible for those half-Kings and Domains to fight with them.","‘It seems that everyone is very careful. Only the demons rely on their powerful strength and don’t take the danger to heart at all!’ Chu Yunfan thought.","To many people, this place might be extremely dangerous, and it might even become a forbidden land. However, to him, it was not the case.","He could hide in the Mountain River Diagram. Even if the King humans activated a killing formation, it would not affect him at all.","The item in his hand was an Emperor-level artifact, so its power was unquestionable.","Therefore, he could enter the Emperor’s tomb without any scruples.","Chu Yunfan looked into the distance and saw the Kings of the demons hiding in the army of the demons, searching the space of the Emperor’s tomb inch by inch.","Among them, Chu Yunfan saw a man dressed in purple. He was the leader of many King demons, and his strength was also the strongest among them. It could be said that he was world-shaking.","“King Purple-Robe Demon!” Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes at the true leader of the countless armies of the Demon Realm this time.","It was said that the King Purple-Robe Demon was the current number one King of the demons. His strength was unfathomable and not inferior to a King human. It was even said that he was already half a step into the Emperor Stage.","According to the information Chu Yunfan had received, King Purple-Robe Demon’s strength was indeed shocking.","The King humans were the number one experts of the humans. Their strength was close to the peak of the King Stage, but they still had to rely on the Luck Dragon of Grand Xia to fight against the other party in the capital.","The King Purple-Robe Demon probably was half a step into the Emperor Stage and could be said to be a peerless talent of the era.","When Chu Yunfan saw the King Purple-Robe Demon, the latter also sensed it and looked in Chu Yunfan’s direction. However, Chu Yunfan was not afraid and just looked at him.","King Purple-Robe Demon transformed into a handsome middle-aged man. When he saw Chu Yunfan looking over, he just smiled faintly and didn’t take it to heart.","However, Chu Yunfan could still feel the immense pressure from that glance.","“King Chu, quickly gather!”","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan heard the words of the Grand Commandant.","His figure disappeared in the air. At the next moment, he had already arrived outside the Emperor’s tomb. At this moment, there were a few Emperors standing there. They were the few veteran experts of the humans.","Other than the human king, there was also the Grand Commandant, the old principal of Virtuous Academy, the old sect leader of Destiny Sect, and the previous sect leader of Great Change Faith.","In addition, there were a few old martial arts masters that Chu Yunfan did not know. Although their strength was much weaker than the others, they were still in the intermediate King Stage. However, they all stood behind the human king.","Obviously, they were all experts of the imperial family. Among the humans, the ten major forces were above the other major forces, and the imperial family was above the ten major forces.","Naturally, they had a shocking foundation. There was more than one King. The other major factions, even the Destiny Sect, could not be compared to the foundation of the imperial family.","“Greetings, everyone!” Chu Yunfan said.","Everyone returned the greeting. Chu Yunfan was indeed on equal footing with them.","“Everyone, I believe you all know what happened this time. The rise and fall of the humans depends on this!” the human king said indifferently. “I’ll leave all of this to you. When the killing array is activated, it will be time for you to show your skills!”","Everyone’s expression was solemn. Even Destiny Sect’s leader, who was completely at odds with Chu Yunfan, looked solemn.","At this moment, in the Emperor’s tomb, the demon army seemed to have finally found something. They began to crazily sacrifice blood. After countless creatures were killed, the powerful resentment that was formed from the sacrifices rushed into the sky and broke through the defensive law automatically formed by the Heavenly Dao.","For a moment, a huge tomb appeared in front of everyone.","Everyone was shocked. Apparently, everyone knew that the door to the Emperor’s tomb had been opened.","Everyone could not help but fly into it.","At this moment, the demon army also rose into the air under the command of various commanders and began to block them.","However, how could they stop them now?","The Domains were unable to break through the defenses. They crashed into the demon army’s defensive line almost instantly, and many of them died on the spot.","Even many half-Kings couldn’t break through the defense line and were killed by the demon experts on the defense line.","Only a small number of half-Kings rushed into the cave before the demon army could form a defense.","However, although they were fast, there was a group of people who were faster than them. They were the Kings who had been waiting for an opportunity.","Although they were the furthest away, they were the fastest. They rushed into the entrance of the Emperor’s tomb almost immediately.","They practically tore through space and entered.","Because the laws of this Emperor’s tomb had been broken through by the demons through a blood sacrifice, they were able to tear open space. Otherwise, even if they wanted to fly, they would be greatly restrained.","Chu Yunfan also entered the Emperor’s tomb almost immediately."]},{"number":2399,"title":"Chapter 2399: Demon Tempering Gourd","paragraphs":["Chapter 2399: Demon Tempering Gourd","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the Emperor’s tomb, there was a huge suppression of the Emperor’s law. All the Kings would be greatly suppressed.","Fortunately, this was the suppression of the imperial law formed by the heavens and the earth. Otherwise, the Kings wouldn’t have been able to break through the suppression of the imperial law.","The entire tomb seemed to be in a different dimension, completely isolated from the outside world.","To be precise, it was isolated by the laws of the Heavenly Dao.","There was no way to gather them together.","Chu Yunfan hurried all the way to the core area of the tomb. There would be a real fierce battle there, and it was also the true purpose of everyone’s treasure hunt.","The thing left behind by the deceased Emperor was real, not fake.","If it was fake, how could it attract so many demon experts?","Of course, it couldn’t be fake.","It was just that although the item was real, it was not so easy for those demon experts to seize the Emperor’s inheritance.","During this process, the human king had already set up layers of traps.","It was specially targeted at those demon experts.","However, just as Chu Yunfan was about to meet up with the human king, his vision blurred. He had entered another space of the Emperor’s tomb.","Chu Yunfan immediately realized that this was a spatial magic treasure. He was actually put into a spatial magic treasure.","“Humph!” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly and his body expanded. In an instant, he was so tall that he wanted to open up the entire spatial magic treasure.","Although spatial treasures were very large, they often had a limit. It was impossible for them to grow indefinitely.","“You don’t have to waste your energy. This is the legendary Demon Tempering Gourd. You can’t escape!”","Suddenly, a cold voice was heard.","Chu Yunfan raised his head and saw Destiny Sect’s leader. He slowly walked out from the dark.","“This is an Emperor-based artifact that I accidentally obtained. Although it’s incomplete, you can’t open it with your strength!” Destiny Sect’s leader slowly said.","Chu Yunfan’s expression changed slightly. An Emperor-based artifact. Of course, he knew what an Emperor artifact was, just like how his Mountain River Diagram was an Emperor artifact.","It was an artifact refined by an Emperor after attaining Dao. It was often the most powerful tool of an Emperor.","However, Emperors were nowhere to be seen nowadays, and even incomplete Emperor artifacts were extremely rare.","“So it’s the Demon Tempering Gourd!” Chu Yunfan slowly said, “If I remember correctly, the Demon Tempering Gourd should be an Emperor artifact that belonged to one of the Emperors of the demons. You really went all out to kill me!”","“You actually know about the Demon Tempering Gourd. Your background is not that simple. I’m afraid it’s not as simple as obtaining the inheritance of the Violet Thunder Swords!” Destiny Sect’s leader said slowly.","Many people had investigated Chu Yunfan’s background, but they could only investigate the Chu clan in the Violet Thunder Prefecture.","However, within the Violet Thunder Prefecture, the greatest inheritance was the Violet Thunder Sword Sect.","Therefore, many people guessed that Chu Yunfan was able to rise so quickly because he had obtained the inheritance of the Violet Thunder Swords, which was once comparable to the ten great forces.","In addition, the martial arts that Chu Yunfan displayed often contained the power of lightning and the way of the sword, which made many people even more certain of this statement.","In addition, they really couldn’t find the possible source of Chu Yunfan’s inheritance, so everyone was sure of this.","However, Destiny Sect’s leader was now certain that Chu Yunfan had not only obtained the inheritance of the Violet Thunder Sword Sect.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have displayed such shocking strength. This wasn’t the strength and foundation that the Violet Thunder Swords should have.","“What does it matter what inheritance it is?” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“You’re right. What does it matter what inheritance it is? You’re going to die here soon anyway!” Destiny Sect’s leader said indifferently with a cold expression.","“You are too conceited. You actually dare to appear in front of me alone. Do you really think that I can’t kill you?” Chu Yunfan said with a smile. “The Demon Tempering Gourd is indeed difficult to break. Even if I wanted to break it, it would take a lot of time. However, you, its master, appeared in front of me. After killing you, the Demon Tempering Gourd will naturally break!”","Chu Yunfan had heard many legends about the Demon Tempering Gourd. It was rumored that an Emperor Demon refined the blood of all the demons in the world. He wanted to refine a supreme bloodline from it and specially refined it.","It was said to be able to contain everything in the world. Chu Yunfan was caught off guard because of this However, it was impossible for the broken Demon Tempering Gourd to refine him. Chu Yunfan returned to the Mountain River Diagram and used the power of the Mountain River Diagram to break the Demon Tempering Gourd.","After all, they were both Emperor artifacts, and the Mountain River Diagram was perfectly preserved. Naturally, it could break the Demon Tempering Gourd.","However, that would require a certain amount of time.","However, this was his trump card. No one knew that Chu Yunfan had a good thing like the Mountain River Diagram.","It was precisely because of this that Destiny Sect’s leader was caught off guard and appeared in front of Chu Yunfan. He thought that he had the upper hand.","“Kill me? Hahahaha!” Destiny Sect’s leader laughed. “I know that you have amazing talent. If you were given another few decades, you would probably be able to surpass me. However, you don’t have that kind of time now. Besides, where do you think this is? In the Demon Tempering Gourd, I am the king, and you are just a prisoner!”","“You’re comparing me to a prisoner? Do you have the strength to do so?” Chu Yunfan looked at Destiny Sect’s leader and said.","He could tell that Destiny Sect’s leader would not let him off easily. It was obvious that he could see the huge threat he posed to the Destiny Sect.","Chu Yunfan had already left his peers behind. If his progress did not change, this gap would not shrink, but would instead become bigger and bigger.","Because of this, many people wanted to get rid of Chu Yunfan.","If you shot a bird with a gun, the trees in the forest would be destroyed by the wind.","Therefore, Destiny Sect’s leader wanted to kill Chu Yunfan even if he might be exposed.","Of course, with his strength, he was absolutely confident that he could kill all powerful enemies in the Demon Tempering Gourd.","“Let’s cut the crap. I still have to rush to meet up with the human king!” Destiny Sect’s leader said indifferently.","In an instant, he made his move. A long saber appeared in his hand. The long saber cut through eternity and chilled the entire world of the Demon Tempering Gourd.","This was the Destiny Saber of the Destiny Sect!","Chu Yunfan was no stranger to the Destiny Saber. Many of his enemies knew it, but none of them were as terrifying."]},{"number":2400,"title":"Chapter 2400: Killing the Old Sect Leader of the Destiny Sect","paragraphs":["Chapter 2400: Killing the Old Sect Leader of the Destiny Sect","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In other words, the Destiny Saber was the same as the Flying Celestial Seal. They were both King Stage martial arts techniques and truly belonged to Kings. If one had to learn it before reaching the King Stage, it would only be a reduced version and not the complete version.","When Destiny Sect’s leader used it, the Destiny Saber was the true ultimate technique of the world.","To be able to shake the heavens for so many years, it was naturally not that simple.","One saber slashed the heavens, one saber slashed the earth.","As this saber slashed down, the laws of the Great Dao fused into it, turning into an extremely stunning saber light.","This was the strongest King Stage saber!","Destiny Sect’s leader was indeed very powerful. He was only half a step away from the peak of the King Stage.","There was not much difference at all!","He was not much worse than the Elder Princess.","Although there were not many Emperors among the humans, each one was stronger than the other. They were all existences that were close to the peak of the King Stage.","Otherwise, they wouldn’t have been able to hold back more King demons.","At this point, Chu Yunfan no longer had any need to hold back. The Mountain River Cauldron appeared above his head, emitting a shocking light that suppressed the void of the universe and space, blocking the descending saber.","Clang!","A loud sound of metal clashing rang out.","If this attack had been used in the outside world, it would have been enough to shock the entire Central Plains.","The effects of the battle between Kings were simply too widespread. They used the laws of heaven and earth to form all sorts of heaven and earth phenomena.","However, no one knew about it in the Demon Tempering Gourd, and the aura of the battle would not leak out.","The eyes of Destiny Sect’s leader were filled with splendor because he had not held back at all.","He wanted to kill Chu Yunfan with one strike.","However, the reality was that he couldn’t kill Chu Yunfan with one strike.","Chu Yunfan’s Mountain River Cauldron completely blocked his attack. This made him frown slightly because he had already realized that things were not looking good for him.","After blocking the old sect leader’s attack, Chu Yunfan’s attack had already been brewed. His five fingers clenched into fists, and eight gods appeared behind Chu Yunfan.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!”","Chu Yunfan punched out and shattered the vacuum. The space inside the Demon Tempering Gourd was also shattered by his punch.","Bam!","This attack directly hit Destiny Sect’s leader. A flag appeared on his body, and this flag directly blocked Chu Yunfan’s fist.","“You’ve actually also stepped into the late King Stage. Then, we can’t let you live!”","After blocking Chu Yunfan’s counterattack, Destiny Sect’s leader had an extremely cold expression. His eyes were filled with fear.","He did not expect Chu Yunfan to actually enter the late King Stage. Compared to his peers, Chu Yunfan’s improvement was really too fast.","As long as such a person continued to grow, it was very likely that he would be able to reach the peak of the King Stage. It was even possible for him to become an Emperor in the future.","The more it was like this, the more he had to nip the danger in the bud.","“Destiny Saber, Divide Destiny!”","Destiny Sect’s leader roared. In an instant, the mana on his body froze, and the world froze as well.","To be precise, the Demon Tempering Gourd had made its move. This was an independent small world that was under the control of the owner of the Demon Tempering Gourd.","This was also the most terrifying part of the Demon Tempering Gourd. With this move, Destiny Sect’s leader had once tricked several Kings and slowly strengthened himself.","And now, he was going to use the same method to deal with Chu Yunfan.","However, just when he thought that this saber could directly kill Chu Yunfan","A diagram suddenly appeared above Chu Yunfan’s head. The diagram grew bigger and bigger, and it actually broke through the Demon Tempering Gourd’s confinement.","The two terrifying Emperor artifacts started to clash.","“What is it? How is this possible?” Destiny Sect’s leader was shocked.","After he used the Demon Tempering Gourd, he thought that he would be able to take down Chu Yunfan.","Who knew that Chu Yunfan would also have an Emperor artifact that could contend with the Demon Tempering Gourd?","This made him uncomfortable.","After all, he knew very well that the Demon Tempering Gourd was incomplete and might not be able to gain the upper hand.","“Let’s end this quickly! Die!” The sect leader of the Destiny Sect roared, and the light of the Destiny Saber in his hand became even brighter.","“Just what I wanted!”","Chu Yunfan also chased after him. He was not afraid at all. He clenched his fist and punched out.","Boom!","The terrifying light brought by the Destiny Saber collided with the eight gods in the air.","Spurt!","Destiny Sect’s leader was sent flying and spat out a mouthful of blood. He had clearly suffered a huge loss in the previous confrontation.","“How is that possible? How many years have you only stepped into the King Stage? How can your cultivation be deeper than mine?” Destiny Sect’s leader couldn’t believe it.","He had attained the Dao for hundreds of years, while Chu Yunfan had only reached the King Stage for a few years, let alone breaking through to the late King Stage.","Logically speaking, he should have the upper hand in terms of cultivation.","However, the truth was that he had suffered a huge loss.","“Summer insects can’t talk about ice. Do you think that just because we’re both Kings, you’re on equal footing with me and can be compared to me?”","Chu Yunfan shouted and took advantage of the victory to pursue. He ignited his divine power to the extreme and arrived in an instant, killing Destiny Sect’s leader.","With this punch, Destiny Sect’s leader was sent flying again. Even if he had a defensive flag on him, it was useless. It shattered on the spot.","Spurt!","Destiny Sect’s leader coughed out another mouthful of blood. His expression was extremely ugly, and in an instant, he looked much older.","This attack had injured his origin.","No matter how strong he was, he was old and weak. Usually, it was not obvious, but now that he was punched by the young and strong Chu Yunfan, his true nature was revealed.","“Flying Celestial Seal!”","Chu Yunfan chased after him again, and he almost severely injured him with one blow. A Flying Celestial Seal shattered his body.","Destiny Sect’s leader retreated repeatedly. The more intense the battle was, the greater his disadvantage. If he recovered 10%, Chu Yunfan could recover 10%. He was dragged to death by Chu Yunfan.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan wasn’t afraid of exchanging injury for injury.","In the shortest amount of time, he was severely injured and even forced into a blind spot. The punch pierced through his chest, causing a huge bloody hole.","“I never thought that I would die in your hands!” Destiny Sect’s leader said unwillingly.","“This is destiny!”","The lightning power in Chu Yunfan’s hand turned into a long sword. The sword light slashed down, and the head of the sect leader of the Destiny Sect was cut off. He died instantly."]}]);
